<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JER" style="id">RRK24.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">YEREMIA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Kya Nabi Yeremia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yeremia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yer</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKITABO KYA NABI</para>
  <para style="mt1">YEREMIA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JER 1" />
  <para style="s1">Okwetwa kwa Yeremia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 29:27">Yer 29:27</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 21:18">Yos 21:18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 1:3">Ezk 1:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebigambo bya Yeremia, mwene Hilikia, ow'omu banyamurwa abaabaire batwire Anatoosi omu ishaza rya Benyamiini. <verse eid="JER 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:3">Yer 25:3</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 22:1-20">2 Bag 22:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:1-30">23:1-30</ref>. </char></note> Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikamwijaho omu butegyeki bwa Yosia mwene Amoni omugabe wa Yuda, omu mwaka gwa ikumi n'eshatu ogw'omu butegyeki bwe; <verse eid="JER 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:1">Yer 25:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 39:2">39:2</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:34-24:6">2 Bag 23:34—24:6</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:17-25:11">24:17—25:11</ref>. </char></note> kandi kyagaruka kyaija omu butegyeki bwa Yehoyakimu mwene Yosia omugabe wa Yuda, okuhitsya aha muheru gw'omwaka gwa ikumi na gumwe ogwa Zedekia mwene Yosia ogwo, omugabe wa Yuda, obu Yerusaalemu yaakwatwa omu kwezi kwa kataano kw'ogwo mwaka.<verse eid="JER 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 1:4" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikanyijaho nikigira kiti:<verse eid="JER 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 1:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 25:15-29">Yer 25:15-29</ref>; <ref loc="JER 46-51">46—51</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:2">Isa 44:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku naabaire ntakakuhangire mu nda ya nyoko, nkakumanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:5">Naakweza otakazairwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:5">Naakutaho kuba nabi w'amahanga.<verse eid="JER 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 4:10">Kur 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 3:7">1 Bag 3:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naanye nikwo kugira nti: Ai bambe, Mukama RUHANGA, reeba, tindikumanya kugamba; ahabw'okuba nkiri muto. <verse eid="JER 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 1:7" />Kwonka MUKAMA yangira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:7">Reka kugira oti: Ndi muto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:7">Ahabw'okuba abu ndikutumaho boona nibo orizamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:7">Kandi eki ndikuragiira kyona nikyo origamba.<verse eid="JER 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 1:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 15:20">Yer 15:20</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 3:12">Kur 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 2:6-9">Ezk 2:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 3:9">3:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otaribatiina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:8">Ahabw'okuba ndi hamwe naiwe kukujuna;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:8">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 1:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:14">Yer 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 6:7">Isa 6:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima MUKAMA yaagorora omukono gwe, yaakora aha minwa yangye, yangira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:9">Reeba, naata ebigambo byangye omu kanwa kaawe;<verse eid="JER 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 1:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 18:7">Yer 18:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:38">31:38</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 10:4">2 Kor 10:4</ref>, <ref loc="2CO 10:5">5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omanye ku eri izooba naakutaho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:10">Kutegyeka amahanga n'ensi z'abagabe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:10">Kurandura n'okusheenya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:10">Kucwekyereza n'okujuumika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:10">Kwombeka n'okubyara.<verse eid="JER 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 1:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 7:8">Amo 7:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: Yeremia, nooreeba ki? Naagira nti: Nindeeba enkoni y'omuti gw'endozi. <verse eid="JER 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 1:12" />MUKAMA yangira ati: Waareeba gye; ahabw'okuba ntaire omutima aha kigambo kyangye kukihikiiriza.<verse eid="JER 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 1:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 3:12">Yer 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 4:6">4:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 4:15">4:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 6:1">6:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 6:22">6:22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 10:22">10:22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 24:3">Ezk 24:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyanyijaho obwa kabiri nikigira kiti: Nooreba ki? Naagira nti: Nindeeba enyungu erikubira etaire ekibunu aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho. <verse eid="JER 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 1:14" />MUKAMA nikwo kungira ati: Akabi karyagwa aha batuuzi b'omu nsi egi boona nikaruga aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho. <verse eid="JER 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 1:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:9">Yer 25:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 39:3">39:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 43:10">43:10</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, ndyayeta enganda zoona ez'omu nsi z'abagabe b'omu bukiizi-bwa-bumosho baije, buri omwe ate ekitebe kye ky'obugabe aha marembo ga Yerusaalemu, n'aha ngo zaayo zoona ezigyehinguririize, n'aha ndembo zoona eza Yuda; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 1:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:12">Yer 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:9">7:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 19:4">19:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:9">22:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:6">25:6</ref>, <ref loc="JER 25:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:3">44:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 2:8">Isa 2:8</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 22:17">2 Bag 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:41">Byak 7:41</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abantu baamwo ndyabacwera orubanja, rubasingye, ahabw'obubi bwabo boona obwabantsusigiiseho, bakooterera baaruhanga abandi obubaane, bakaramya ebi emikono yaabo yaakozire. <verse eid="JER 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 1:17" />Kwonka iwe, yezirikye, oimukye, obagambire ebi ndaakuragiire byona. Batakuhahaaza omutima, ntakaahahaaza ogwawe omu maisho gaabo. <verse eid="JER 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 1:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 50:7">Isa 50:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 3:9">Ezk 3:9</ref>. </char></note> Kandi reeba, eri izooba naakugira orurembo orwehinguririziibwe ebigo, enyomyo y'ekyoma n'engo z'emiringa, kurwanisa ensi egi yoona, abagabe ba Yuda, abanyiginya baayo, abanyamurwa baayo n'abantu baayo. <verse eid="JER 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 1:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:27">Yer 6:27</ref>; <ref loc="JER 15:20">15:20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:9">Byak 18:9</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 18:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Baryakurwanisa, kwonka tibarikubaasa; ahabw'okuba ndi hamwe naiwe kukujuna; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 1:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JER 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okutonganisa Abaisraeli ahabw'okugaruka enyima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 2:1" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:4">Yer 3:4</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 2:7">Bir 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 8:2">8:2</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 8:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 16:8">Ezk 16:8</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 16:43">43</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 16:60">60</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:4">Kush 2:4</ref>. </char></note> Irooko orangye, aba Yerusaalemu bakuhuriire, noogira oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:2">Niinyijuka okwehayo kw'omu buhangare bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:2">Na rukundo yaawe y'omu bugore,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:2">Oku wankuratiire omu ihamba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:2">Omu nsi etakahingwamuga.<verse eid="JER 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 2:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 12:14">Yer 12:14</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 12:3">Kut 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 4:22">Kur 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 19:5">19:5</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 19:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 28:36">28:36</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:18">Yak 1:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Israeli akaba ari oshororeirwe MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:3">Omuganuro gwe gw'okubanza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:3">Abaaguriireho boona bakagiibwaho orubanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:3">Akabi kaabahikaho; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 2:4" />Imwe ab'enju ya Yakobo, naimwe enganda zoona ez'enju ya Israeli, muhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA. <verse eid="JER 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 2:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:31">Yer 2:31</ref>; <ref loc="JER 14:22">14:22</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:3">Mik 6:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 5:4">Isa 5:4</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:15">2 Bag 17:15</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:5">Ni kibi ki, eki baashwenkuriimwe bandeebireho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:5">Kikabareetera kuunyimuura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:5">N'okukuratira ebitaine buryo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:5">Bakahinduka abataine mugasho?<verse eid="JER 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 2:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 8:15">Bir 8:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:10">32:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:11-13">Isa 63:11-13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Haza batabuuze bati: MUKAMA ari nkahi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">Owaatwihire omu nsi ya Misri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">Akaturabya omu ihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">Omu nsi y'amarungu n'ebiina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">Omu nsi eyomire, kandi ey'ekibunda kya rufu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">Ensi etarabwamu bantu, kandi etatuurwamu?<verse eid="JER 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 2:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:24">Lev 18:24</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 18:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 8:7-10">Bir 8:7-10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:38">Zab 106:38</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi nkabahitsya omu nsi y'omweru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:7">Kurya ebijuma byayo n'ebindi birungi byamwo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:7">Kwonka ku mwahikireyo, mwansiisira ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:7">Obuhunguzi bwangye mwabuhindura ekihagaro.<verse eid="JER 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 2:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:5">Yer 5:5</ref>, <ref loc="JER 5:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:13">23:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 2:7">Mal 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:20">Rom 2:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abanyamurwa tibaagira bati: Beitu MUKAMA arahi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:8">N'abanyabiragiro tibammanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:8">Abategyeki bancumuraho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:8">Na baanabi baaragura ebya Baali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:8">Baakuratira ebitaine muhoho.<verse eid="JER 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 2:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:5">Kur 20:5</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 20:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 17:20">Ezk 17:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo ndikubatonganisiza hati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:9">Kandi na baijukuru baanyu ndyabatonganisa.<verse eid="JER 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 2:10" />Mwambukye muhikye aha birwa bya Kitimu, mureebe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:10">Mutume Kedari, mwetegyereze munonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:10">Mureebe ku haraabe harabaireho ekigambo nk'ekyo.<verse eid="JER 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 2:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 16:20">Yer 16:20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 18:13-15">18:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 37:19">Isa 37:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:20">Zab 106:20</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 4:8">Gal 4:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hariho eihanga erirahingiise baaruhanga baaryo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:11">N'obu baraabe batari baaruhanga buzima?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:11">Kwonka abantu bangye bahingiise ekitiinisa kyabo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:11">Ebitaine mugasho.<verse eid="JER 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 2:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:2">Isa 1:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe iguru 'we, kwata aha munwa ahabw'ekyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:12">Ogire obwoba bwingi, oshoberwe munonga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:12">Nikwo MUKAMA arikugira;<verse eid="JER 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 2:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 17:13">Yer 17:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 36:9">Zab 36:9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:10">Yoh 4:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba abantu bangye bakozire ebibi bibiri–</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:13">Baanyimwire, nyowe enshuro y'amaizi g'amagara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:13">Baayetimbira ebiziba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:13">Ebiziba bifumukire, ebitarikubaasa kugumwamu maizi.<verse eid="JER 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 2:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 4:22">Kur 4:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Israeli n'omuhuuku? N'omuhuuku owaazairwe omuka?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:14">Ahabw'enki ahindukire omunyago?<verse eid="JER 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 2:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 9:11">Yer 9:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 5:29">Isa 5:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Entare zimutontomeire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:15">Zaatsinda munonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:15">Zaahindura ensi ye amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:15">Endembo ze zihiire, tizikiine bantu.<verse eid="JER 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 2:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 43:7-9">Yer 43:7-9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:1">44:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 19:13">Isa 19:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Noofu na Tahapenesi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:16">Baakwata eigufa ry'akazingiro k'omutwe.<verse eid="JER 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 2:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:18">Yer 4:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Beitu tiiwe waayereeteire ebyo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:17">Ahabw'okwimuura MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:17">Obu yaakwebembera omu muhanda?<verse eid="JER 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 2:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:36">Yer 2:36</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 31:21">Kut 31:21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 7:20">Isa 7:20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:9">8:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 23:3">23:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:1">30:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 30:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 31:1">31:1</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 7:11">Hos 7:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu okuza Misri okanywa amaizi ga Nailo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:18">Nikikugasira ki?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:18">Nari shi, nikikugasira ki okuza Asiria</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:18">Kunywa amaizi ga Furaati?<verse eid="JER 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 2:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 3:22">Yer 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:6">5:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 14:7">14:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 3:9">Isa 3:9</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 5:5">Hos 5:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obubi bwawe buryakwehanira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">N'okugaruka enyima kwawe kukuteise;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">Omanye, kandi oreebe ku kiri ekintu kibi kandi ekirikushaarira</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">Kuunyimuura, nyowe MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, otantiine;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">Nikwo Mukama RUHANGA ow'amahe arikugira.<verse eid="JER 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 2:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 3:2">Yer 3:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:5">5:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:2">17:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 30:8">30:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:21">Isa 1:21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 57:5">57:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba ira okahenda omugamba gwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:20">Waacwa ebyabaire bikubohire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:20">Kandi waagira oti: Tindigaruka kuheereza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:20">Haza waaramiza aha mutwe gwa buri kibungo kiraingwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:20">N'ahansi ya buri kiti kibisi ekyetwa omurinzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:20">Nka maraaya.<verse eid="JER 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 2:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:32">Bir 32:32</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 80:8">Zab 80:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 5:2">Isa 5:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Haza naabaire nkugizire omuzaabibu murungi munonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:21">Gw'embibo etoorainwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:21">Mbwenu kikaruga hi waaza kusiisikara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:21">Okaba omuzaabibu ogw'omu ishwa?<verse eid="JER 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 2:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 17:1">Yer 17:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 9:30">Yob 9:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu waakwoga ota n'eiju ry'akashenda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:22">Okagaruka okooga na sabuuni nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:22">Kwonka eibara ry'ekibi kyawe rikiri omu maisho gangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:22">Nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 2:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:35">Yer 2:35</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:31">7:31</ref>, <ref loc="JER 7:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="JER 19:2">19:2</ref>, <ref loc="JER 19:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Noobaasa ota kugira oti: Tinsiisikaire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">Kandi tinkuratiire Baabaali.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">Reeba omuhanda gwawe omu ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">Omanye ebi okozire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">Ori nk'engamira erikukina neekora oku n'oku;<verse eid="JER 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 2:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 14:6">Yer 14:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ori nk'enturegye emanyiire eihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:24">Erikukagiiriza omuyaga erinzire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:24">N'oha owaakubaasa kugizibira?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:24">Tihariho n'emwe eruha neegisherura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:24">Ahakuba egibona omu kwezi kwayo.<verse eid="JER 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 2:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 3:13">Yer 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 29:5">Bir 29:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otaikiriza ebigyere byawe kugyenda bitajwaire nkaito,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:25">N'omumiro gwawe kugyenda gwine ekyaka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:25">Kwonka okagira oti: Nooyeruhiza busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:25">Ahabw'okuba nkunzire abanyamahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:25">Kandi nibo ndikwija kukuratira.<verse eid="JER 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 2:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 8:1">Yer 8:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:32">32:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nk'oku omushuma ahemuka yaakwatwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:26">Nikwo enju ya Israeli erihemuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:26">Bo n'abagabe baabo, abategyeki baabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:26">Abanyamurwa baabo na baanabi baabo,<verse eid="JER 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 2:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 10:9">Bar 10:9</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 10:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 26:16">Isa 26:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abagira ekiti, buri omwe ati: Niiwe tata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:27">N'eibaare ati: Niiwe wanzaire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:27">Ahabw'okuba banteire amabega,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:27">Baanyima amaisho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:27">Kwonka omu biro by'okureeba enaku</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:27">Baryataka bati: Imuka otujune.<verse eid="JER 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 2:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 11:13">Yer 11:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:20">Isa 45:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:37">Bir 32:37</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 32:38">38</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu baaruhanga baawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:28">Abu waayeteereireho barahi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:28">Ku baraabe nibabaasa kukujuna</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:28">Omu biro by'enaku zaawe, nibaimukye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:28">Ahabw'okuba, nk'oku endembo zaawe zirikwingana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:28">Na baaruhanga baawe nikwo bari, iwe Yuda.<verse eid="JER 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 2:29" />Ahabw'enki noonyetomboitera?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:29">Manya mwena mungomeire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:29">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 2:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:3">Yer 5:3</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 2:15">1 Tes 2:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyeruhiize busha kuteera abaana baanyu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:30">Tibaikiriza kuhanwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:30">Rurara yaanyu niyo emazireho baanabi baanyu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:30">Nk'entare esheegire.<verse eid="JER 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 2:31" />Naimwe ab'obusingye obu, mute omutima aha kigambo kya MUKAMA.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:31">Ndabeereire Israeli eihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:31">Nari ensi y'omwirima ndindindi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:31">Mbwenu abantu bangye nibagirira ki bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:31">Nitwetegyeka; titurikugarukaho bundi?<verse eid="JER 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 2:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:18">Bir 32:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:21">Zab 106:21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:10">Isa 61:10</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 8:14">Hos 8:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimugira ngu empangare neebaasa kwebwa eby'okwetiiba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:32">Nari omugore kwebwa ekyetwekyerero kye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:32">Kwonka abantu bangye banyebirwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:32">Ebiro bingi ebitarikubarwa.<verse eid="JER 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 2:33" />Eshi omanya kusherura nkunzi zaawe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:33">Nangwa n'abakazi babi obeegyeise emize yaawe.<verse eid="JER 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 2:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:2">Kur 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 21:16">2 Bag 21:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:38">Zab 106:38</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi aha kipumpuriya kyawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:34">Hareebekireho eshagama y'abanaku abu waatuzire busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:34">Abu otakashangaga nibafumura enju.<verse eid="JER 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 2:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 143:2">Zab 143:2</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 28:13">Enf 28:13</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 1:8">1 Yoh 1:8</ref>, <ref loc="1JN 1:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Haza ebyo byona obyogaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:35">Ogira oti: Tiinyine rubanja;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:35">Buzimazima takiinyiniire kiniga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:35">Reeba, ndyakutonganisa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:35">Ahabw'okugira oti: Tincumwire.<verse eid="JER 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 2:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:22">Yer 31:22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:3">Isa 30:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'enki orahuka kukora oku n'oku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:36">N'okuhindura emitwarize yaawe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:36">Misri neija kukuhemura</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:36">Nk'oku Asiria yaakugizire.<verse eid="JER 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 2:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 13:19">2 Sam 13:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naiwe oryarugayo oyekoreire emikono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:37">Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA ayangire abu oyesiga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:37">Kandi tibaine ki barikugasira.<verse eid="JER 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JER 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okweshengyereza Yuda na Israeli kumugarukira</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Bir 24:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:38">Zab 106:38</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omushaija ku ashenda omukazi we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:1">Ogwo mukazi yaamurugaho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:1">Yaaba muka ondiijo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:1">Iba aryagaruka amushwere?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:1">Egyo nsi tekaasiisikara munonga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:1">Iwe okaraaya na bashambane baawe baingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:1">Ebyo nookingarukira? Nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 3:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 23:3">Kub 23:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 16:25">Ezk 16:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naga amaisho gaawe aha bibungo by'emparamaata, oreebe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:2">Ahu otarashambaniire ni nkahi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:2">Okaba oshutama aha rubaju rw'omuhanda, otegyereize bashambane baawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:2">Nk'Omuharabu omu ihamba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:2">Oshiisha ensi n'ebihagaro by'obwamaraaya bwawe.<verse eid="JER 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 3:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:15">Yer 6:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 9:12">9:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 14:22">14:22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:24">Bir 28:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo kyazibiire enjura kugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:3">Enjura ya katumba ekabura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:3">N'obu kiraabe kyabaire kityo, okaguma oyomire aha maisho nka maraaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:3">Tiwaagira kashoni.<verse eid="JER 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 3:4" />Na hati tokantakiire, oti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:4">Taata, niiwe mugyenzi wangye omu buhangare bwangye;<verse eid="JER 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 3:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 103:9">Zab 103:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi oti: Aryaguma n'ekiniga ebiro byona?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:5">Aryaguubwa kubi okuhitsya aha muheru?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:5">Reeba okwo nikwo waagizire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:5">Kwonka okakora ebibi byona nk'oku orikwenda.<verse eid="JER 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 3:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:20">Yer 2:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omu biro by'omugabe Yosia, MUKAMA akangira ati: Oreebire eki Israeli owaagarukire enyima yaakozire? Akatemba ekibungo kyona ekiraingwa, yaaza ahansi ya buri kiti kibisi ekyetwa omurinzi, yaashambanirayo. <verse eid="JER 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 3:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:46">Ezk 16:46</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 23:4">23:4</ref>. </char></note> Naateekateeka nti: Bwanyima y'okukora ebyo byona, naija kungarukira. Kwonka tiyaagaruka; kandi omurumuna Yuda endeebya yaakireeba. <verse eid="JER 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:18">2 Bag 17:18</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 1:6">Hos 1:6</ref>, <ref loc="HOS 1:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:7">Mat 19:7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi egyo ndeebya Yuda, n'obu araabe yaareebire oku naabinga mukuru we Israeli, nkamuha ebaruha y'okumushenda nimmutura obushambani bwe bwona, taratiinire, kureka nawe akagyenda, yaaza kuraaya. <verse eid="JER 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:27">Yer 2:27</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okwo kuraaya kumurahukira, yaashiisha ensi, naashambana n'amabaare n'ebiti. <verse eid="JER 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 3:10" />Ebyo byona n'obu biraabe byabaire bityo, egyo ndeebya Yuda tarangarukiire n'omutima gwe gwona, kureka omu kuryarya; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 3:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 16:51">Ezk 16:51</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 16:52">52</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi MUKAMA yaagaruka yangira ati: Israeli owaagarukire enyima, ayeyorekire ku ataine rubanja nk'orwa Yuda endeebya. <verse eid="JER 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:18">Yer 2:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 86:5">Zab 86:5</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 86:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:9">103:9</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 30:1-10">Bir 30:1-10</ref>. </char></note> Irooko, orangire ebi bigambo aharikureeba aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho noogira oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:12">Garuka, iwe Israeli owaagarukire enyima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:12">Tindikwija kukureebesa kiniga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:12">Ahabw'okuba ndi ow'embabazi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:12">Tindiguma na kiniga ebiro byona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:12">Nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 3:13" />Kwonka oyemere ekibi kyawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:13">Ku waagomeire MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:13">Okayabatikana n'abanyamahanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:13">Ahansi ya buri kiti kibisi ekyetwa omurinzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:13">Kandi otoorobere iraka ryangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:13">Nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 3:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 54:5">Isa 54:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 62:5">62:5</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 14:1">Hos 14:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 2:11">Mal 2:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe baana abaagarukire enyima 'mwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:14">Nimugarukye; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:14">Ahabw'okuba niinye mukama waanyu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:14">Ndyabatwara niinyiha omwe-omwe omu rurembo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:14">Babiri-babiri omu ruganda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:14">Mbahitsye Saayuuni.<verse eid="JER 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 3:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 23:4">Yer 23:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:23">Ezk 34:23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:11">Yoh 10:11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:28">Byak 20:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ndyabaha abariisa abarikunshusha omutima, babariise n'obwengye n'okwetegyereza. <verse eid="JER 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 3:16" />Omu biro ebyo ku muriheza kukanya, mwaba baingi omu nsi, tibarigaruka kugamba ha by'eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA; teriteekateekwaho, teriijukwa, kandi tibarigyefuuza n'obu kwakuba okugaruka kugikora. <verse eid="JER 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:24">Yer 7:24</ref>; <ref loc="JER 9:14">9:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 11:8">11:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 2:2">Isa 2:2</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 2:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:9">60:9</ref>. </char></note> Omu bunaku obwo Yerusaalemu eryayetwa ekitebe kya MUKAMA eky'obukama, amahanga goona garyakiteeraniraho, ei MUKAMA ari omuri Yerusaalemu, kandi tibarigaruka kukuratira obugangaazi bw'emitima yaabo emibi. <verse eid="JER 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 3:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 16:15">Yer 16:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:8">23:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:8">31:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:4">50:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:13">Isa 11:13</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:21">Ezk 37:21</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 37:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 1:11">Hos 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 9:15">Amo 9:15</ref>. </char></note> Omuri ebyo biro enju ya Yuda eryakwatanisa n'eya Israeli, bombi barugye omu nsi y'omu bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, bataahe omu nsi ei naahaire baashwenkuriimwe kuba obuhunguzi bwabo.<verse eid="JER 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 3:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 63:16">Isa 63:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkagira nti: Ka nkubarire omuri batabani bangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:19">Nkuhe ensi nungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:19">Obuhunguzi burungi munonga okukira obw'amahanga goona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:19">Kandi naagira nti: Oryanyeta Sho, torindugaho.<verse eid="JER 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 3:20" />Kwonka iwe nju ya Israeli 'we, otuura nondeebya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:20">Nk'oku omukazi endeebya atsigaho iba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:20">Nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 3:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:9">Yer 31:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eiraka nirihuririrwa omu bibungo by'emparamaata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:21">Okurira n'okweshengyereza kw'abaana ba Israeli</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:21">Ahabw'okushiisha emitwarize yaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:21">Bakeebwa MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo.<verse eid="JER 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 3:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 30:17">Yer 30:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe baana baagarukire enyima 'mwe, nimugarukye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:22">Niinyija kubatambira okugaruka enyima kwanyu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:22">Reeba, twaija ahariiwe, Ahabw'okuba ori MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu.<verse eid="JER 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 3:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 3:8">Zab 3:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 121:1">121:1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 121:2">2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Buzimazima okuteerera omuhira aha bibungo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:23">N'okubandirwa aha nshozi n'ebya busha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:23">Buzimazima okujunwa kwa Israeli</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:23">Kuri omuri MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu.<verse eid="JER 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 3:24" />Kwonka okwiha omu buto bwaitu ekirikwitsa enshoni kimazireho byona ebi baatatenkuriitwe baahendekyeire, amasyo gaabo ag'entaama n'ag'ente, kandi n'abatabani baabo na bahara baabo. <verse eid="JER 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 3:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:6">Ezr 9:6</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 9:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 2:3">Ezk 2:3</ref>. </char></note> Ka tubyame n'enshoni zaitu, okuhemuka kwaitu kutushwekye, ahabw'okuba tukacumura ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu, itwe na baatatenkuriitwe, okwiha omu buto bwaitu n'okuhitsya eri izooba, kandi titukooroberaga iraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu.<verse eid="JER 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JER 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okumanyisa Abayuda ebifubiro ebiribabaho</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:12">Yoel 2:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:1">Iwe Israeli, ku oraikirize kugaruka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:1">Obe niinye waagarukira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:1">Kandi ku oraiheho ebihagaro byawe, byanduga omumaisho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:1">Otarikubangaanisa,<verse eid="JER 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 4:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:13">Bir 6:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 72:17">Zab 72:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:16">Isa 65:16</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:31">1 Kor 1:31</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 10:17">2 Kor 10:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku oraarahire oti: Nindahira MUKAMA ohuriire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:2">Waarahira omu mazima, omu buryo n'omu kuhikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:2">Obwo amahanga garyayeshabira omugisha omuriwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:2">Kandi omuriwe nimwo garyesiimira.<verse eid="JER 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 4:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 10:12">Hos 10:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:7">Mat 13:7</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 13:22">22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugambira abantu ba Yuda n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu, ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:3">Mutabire endaara zaanyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:3">Kandi mutabiba omu mahwa;<verse eid="JER 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 4:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 9:26">Yer 9:26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:16">Bir 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:20">28:20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:28">Rom 2:28</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 2:29">29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mweshare, mube aba MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:4">Mwiheho ekishushu ekiri aha mitima yaanyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:4">Imwe aba Yuda n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:4">Ekiniga kyangye kitakaija nk'omuriro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:4">Kikabuguma, hakabura owaakiraaza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:4">Ahabw'obubi bw'ebi murikukora.<verse eid="JER 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 4:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:1">Yer 6:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 8:14">8:14</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 5:8">Hos 5:8</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:1">Yoel 2:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mukimanyise omuri Yuda, mukirangye omuri Yerusaalemu nimugira muti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:5">Muteere enzamba omu nsi yoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:5">Mugambe n'eiraka rihango nimugira muti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:5">Muteerane, tuze omu ndembo ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare;<verse eid="JER 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 4:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 1:13">Yer 1:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mwimutsye orurango, nimureeba Saayuuni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:6">Muhungye, musherure obukiriro muteeziringa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:6">Ahabw'okuba naaza kureeta akabi karugye aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:6">Ndeete n'okucwekyerera kw'amaani.<verse eid="JER 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 4:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:15">Yer 2:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:10">33:10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:5">Zef 2:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 5:9">Isa 5:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Entare erugire omu kishaka kyayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:7">Omuhwerekyerezi w'amahanga ari omu muhanda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:7">Arugire owe, naija kucwekyereza ensi yaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:7">Endembo zaawe zibe amatongo, zibure ab'okuzituuramu.<verse eid="JER 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 4:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 78:49">Zab 78:49</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:9-13">Isa 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 22:12">22:12</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 2:10">Tonz 2:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo mwezirikye ebiguniya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:8">Mucure, muboroogye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:8">Ahabw'okuba ekiniga kya MUKAMA tikikaturugireho.<verse eid="JER 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 4:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 48:4">Zab 48:4</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 48:5">5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi MUKAMA yaagira ati: Ahari eryo izooba omutima gw'omugabe, n'ey'abategyeki, eryayehwa amatsiko; abanyamurwa baryayekwata aha munwa, na baanabi bashoberwe. <verse eid="JER 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:22">1 Bag 22:22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 14:9">Ezk 14:9</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima naagira nti: Ai bambe, Mukama RUHANGA, buzimazima obeiheire kimwe eri ihanga n'aba Yerusaalemu, noogira oti: Muryaba gye; haza kunu rurara ehikiire kimwe aha magara gaabo.<verse eid="JER 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 4:11" />Omu biro ebyo baryagira eri ihanga n'aba Yerusaalemu bati: Omuyaga ogurikwotsya kuhuuha abantu bangye, ogurireetwa omu bibungo by'emparamaata eby'omu ihamba, gutari gw'okuheheeza nari okushemeza, <verse eid="JER 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:16">Yer 1:16</ref>. </char></note> kureka ogw'amaani okukira aho, niinye gurikwizira. Mbwenu niinye ndikugamba nimbacwera orubanja.<verse eid="JER 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 4:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:28">Isa 5:28</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 4:19">Tonz 4:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, naija nk'ebicu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:13">Ebigaari bye by'orugamba biri nk'akasoorora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:13">N'embaraasi ze nizirahuka okukira amashamba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:13">Tutoore hi? Ka twaza kuhwaho!<verse eid="JER 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 4:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 9:19">Yer 9:19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:16">Isa 1:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 51:2">Zab 51:2</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 51:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 4:8">Yak 4:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe Yerusaalemu, yoozya obubi aha mutima gwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:14">Obone kujunwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:14">Ebiteekateeko byawe bibi biryahitsya hi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:14">Kuguma omuriiwe!<verse eid="JER 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 4:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 8:16">Yer 8:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba eiraka eririkuruga Daani nirigamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:15">Niriranga obubi niryema omu bibungo bya Efuraimu.<verse eid="JER 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 4:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:15">Yer 5:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mugambire amahanga, ku arikwija;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:16">Mumanyise aba Yerusaalemu nimugira muti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:16">Abagotsi nibaija nibaruga omu nsi ya hare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:16">Nibateerera endembo za Yuda orwari.<verse eid="JER 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 4:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:3">Yer 6:3</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:1-4">2 Bag 25:1-4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bagyehinguririize nk'abarinzi b'omusiri kugiteera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:17">Ahabw'okuba ekangomera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:17">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 4:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:19">Yer 2:19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 50:1">Isa 50:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Emitwarize yaawe n'ebi orikukora</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:18">Nibyo bikureeteire ebyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:18">Ekyo nikyo kifubiro kyawe, kandi nikishaarira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:18">Ahabw'okuba kikuhikiire kimwe aha mutima.<verse eid="JER 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia okusaasibwa Abayuda ahabw'okwanga kweteisa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 4:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 9:1">Yer 9:1</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 3:16">Hab 3:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai bambe! Ai bambe! Nyine obusaasi bwingi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:19">Omutima gwangye tigwine buhuumure.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:19">Tindikubaasa kuhunama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:19">Ahabw'okuba nimpurira eiraka ry'enzamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:19">N'enduuru y'orugamba.<verse eid="JER 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 4:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 10:20">Yer 10:20</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 7:26">Ezk 7:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebihikiirizi nibiihaihana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:20">Ensi yoona ehindwirwe amatongo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:20">Amahema gangye nigacwekyerezibwa kitaraariirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:20">Emikingo yangye neecwekyerezibwa omu kaanya kakye.<verse eid="JER 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 4:21" />Niinyija kuheerera hi n'okureeba orurango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:21">N'okuhurira eiraka ry'enzamba?<verse eid="JER 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 4:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 36:3">Zab 36:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:3">Isa 1:3</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 1:16">16</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 1:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:19">Rom 16:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba abantu bangye n'abashema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:22">Tibarikummanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:22">N'abaana bataine bwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:22">Kandi abatarikwetegyereza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:22">Omu kukora ebibi n'abanyabwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:22">Kwonka omu kukora ebirungi tibaine ki barikumanya.<verse eid="JER 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 4:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:2">Kut 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 5:30">Isa 5:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku naayetegyereize ensi, naareeba eri amatongo, kandi erimu busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:23">N'eiguru ritarimu kashana.<verse eid="JER 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 4:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NAM 1:5">Nah 1:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku naayetegyereize enshozi, naareeba nizitengyeta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:24">N'ebibungo byona nibizonga.<verse eid="JER 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 4:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEP 1:3">Zef 1:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku naayetegyereize, naareeba hatariho muntu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:25">N'ebirikuguruka omu mwanya byona byahungire.<verse eid="JER 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 4:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 107:34">Zab 107:34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku naayetegyereize, naareeba ensi, eyaabaire eyeza, yaabaire eihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:26">N'endembo zaayo zoona zaasheenyeirwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:26">omu maisho ga MUKAMA, omu maisho g'ekiniga kye kingi.<verse eid="JER 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 4:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 46:28">Yer 46:28</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:31">Neh 9:31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Ensi yoona eryaba amatongo; kwonka tindigimariraho kimwe.<verse eid="JER 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 4:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 23:19">Kub 23:19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 50:3">Isa 50:3</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 4:3">Hos 4:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo ensi ericurira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:28">N'eiguru rikairagura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:28">Ahabw'okuba nkakigamba, naakimariirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:28">Tindikyefuuza, kandi tindikireka.<verse eid="JER 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 4:29" />Ab'omuri buri rurembo baryahunga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:29">Ahabw'okuhurira endigito y'ab'aha mbaraasi n'ab'amata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:29">Bashenshere omu bishaka, bataahe omu nkiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:29">Endembo zoona zitsigweho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:29">Habure owaazituuramu.<verse eid="JER 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 4:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 9:30">2 Bag 9:30</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 1:2">Tonz 1:2</ref>, <ref loc="LAM 1:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 23:22">Ezk 23:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu iwe nshoberwa 'we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:30">N'enki ekirikukujwaza karari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:30">Okeehunda eby'ezaabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:30">Okahangusya amaisho gaawe n'erangi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:30">Nooyeshemereza busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:30">Nkunzi zaawe nizikugaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:30">Kandi nizihiiga amagara gaawe.<verse eid="JER 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 4:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:15">Isa 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:8">13:8</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 1:17">Tonz 1:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba mpuriire eiraka nk'ery'omukazi orikurumwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:31">Obusaasi nk'obw'omukazi orikujigaija,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:31">Eiraka rya Saayuuni orikusheemeeka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:31">Akanaga emikono, naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:31">Ai bambe! Naagwa omu maisho g'abaitsi.<verse eid="JER 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JER 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okumanyisa Yerusaalemu ebifubiro byayo ahabw'ebibi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:7">Yer 5:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 18:23-32">Kut 18:23-32</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 16:9">2 Bus 16:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimwirukye, mukore oku n'oku omu nguuto za Yerusaalemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:1">Mureebe, kandi mwetegyereze!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:1">Musherure omu nteeraniro zaayo z'emihanda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:1">Ku muraabe nimubaasa kubonayo omuntu n'omwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:1">Orikukora eby'oburyo, akasherura amazima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:1">Mbone kugisaasira.<verse eid="JER 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 5:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="TIT 1:16">Tit 1:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu baraabe nibagira bati: Niturahira MUKAMA ohuriire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:2">Kwonka nibarahira ebishuba.<verse eid="JER 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 5:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:30">Yer 2:30</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:28">7:28</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 3:8">Ezk 3:8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 3:2">Zef 3:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai MUKAMA, amaisho gaawe tigarikusherura amazima?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:3">Okabateera, kwonka tibaahurira busaasi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:3">Waabamaraho, kwonka baayanga kuhanwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:3">Baagumya aha maisho gaabo okukira eibaare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:3">Baayanga kweteisa.<verse eid="JER 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 5:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 3:1">Mik 3:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima naagira nti: Abantu aba ni busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:4">tibaine bwengye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:4">Ahabw'okuba tibarikumanya muhanda gwa MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:4">N'obu byakuba ebiragiro bya Ruhanga waabo.<verse eid="JER 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 5:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:20">Yer 2:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:3">Zab 2:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ka nyegiire aha bakuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:5">Mbe nibo naagamba nabo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:5">Ahabw'okuba bo nibamanya omuhanda gwa MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:5">N'ebiragiro bya Ruhanga waabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:5">Kwonka naashanga nabo boona baahenzire omugamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:5">Baacwire ebyabaire bibakomire.<verse eid="JER 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 5:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:7">Yer 4:7</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 1:8">Hab 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 3:3">Zef 3:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo entare erikuruga omu kibira eribaitira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:6">N'omushega gurikuruga omu ihamba gukabacwekyereza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:6">Kandi engwe eryagwera aha ndembo zaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:6">Buri muntu orizirugamu aryataagataagurwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:6">Ahabw'okuba ebicumuro byabo ni bingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:6">N'okugaruka enyima kwabo kukanyire.<verse eid="JER 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 5:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:1">Yer 5:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 9:2">9:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:10">23:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:15">Bir 32:15</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 23:7">Yos 23:7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 13:9">2 Bus 13:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimbaasa nta kukusaasira?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:7">Abaana baawe banyimwire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:7">Baarahira abo abatari baaruhanga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:7">Ku naabagaburiire, naabahaazya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:7">Baashambana, baayerunda aha maju ga baamaraaya.<verse eid="JER 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 5:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 13:27">Yer 13:27</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 22:11">Ezk 22:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bakaba nibashusha enimi y'embaraasi eriisibwe gye, erikushiija,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:8">Buri muntu naashiija muka mutaahi we.<verse eid="JER 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 5:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 2:2">Rom 2:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimugira ngu tindibafubira ahabw'ebyo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:9">Tindihoora enzigu eihanga nk'eri?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:9">Nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 5:10" />Mwinamukye, murabe omu mishorongo y'emizaabibu yaayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:10">Mugicwekyereze;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:10">Kwonka mutagimariraho kimwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:10">Mugikonkoboreho amataagi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:10">Ahabw'okuba ti ga MUKAMA.<verse eid="JER 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 5:11" />Ahakuba enju ya Israeli n'eya Yuda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:11">Zindeebeize kimwe; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 5:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 14:13">Yer 14:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 28:15">Isa 28:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 3:4">Kut 3:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Babeihereire MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:12">Nibagira bati: Taine ki arikora;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:12">Tihariho kabi koona akarituhikaho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:12">Tituriitwa rurara, n'obu kwakuba okuteerwa enjara.<verse eid="JER 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 5:13" />Baanabi abo baryahinduka omuyaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:13">Ahabw'okuba ekigambo ky'amazima tikibarimu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:13">Okwo nikwo barikorwa.<verse eid="JER 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 5:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 1:9">Yer 1:9</ref>, <ref loc="JER 1:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:6">Zek 12:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:5">Kush 11:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo MUKAMA Ruhanga ow'amahe arikugirira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:14">Ahabw'okugamba ekyo kigambo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:14">Reeba, naaza kuhindura ebigambo byangye eby'omu kanwa kaawe omuriro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:14">N'abo bantu mbahindure enku, omuriro gubamareho.<verse eid="JER 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 5:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 34:21">Yer 34:21</ref>, <ref loc="JER 34:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:49">Bir 28:49</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 33:19">Isa 33:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe nju ya Israeli 'we, reeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:15">Niinyija kukuteeza eihanga erya ira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:15">Eihanga eri otarikumanya rurimi rwaryo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:15">N'obu kwakuba okwetegyereza eki barikugamba.<verse eid="JER 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 5:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:28">Isa 5:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omutana gwabo ni nk'ekituuro kyashami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:16">Boona n'amamanzi.<verse eid="JER 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 5:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 26:16">Lev 26:16</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 8:14">Hos 8:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryarya emyaka yaawe n'eby'okurya byawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:17">Barye batabani baawe na bahara baawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:17">Barye amasyo gaawe g'entaama n'ag'ente,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:17">Barye emizaabibu yaawe n'emitiini yaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:17">Kandi endembo zaanyu ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:17">Ezi murikwesiga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:17">Baryazicwekyereza na rurara.<verse eid="JER 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 5:18" />Kandi hoona n'omu biro ebyo tindibamariraho kimwe, nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 5:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 16:10">Yer 16:10</ref>, <ref loc="JER 16:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 9:8">1 Bag 9:8</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 9:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:47">Bir 28:47</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 28:48">48</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 28:68">68</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 29:24">29:24</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 29:28">28</ref>. </char></note> Abantu baawe ku barigira bati: Ahabw'enki MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu atukozireho ebyo byona? Oryabagira oti: Nk'oku mwanyimwire, mukaheereza baaruhanga b'abanyamahanga muri omu nsi yaanyu, nikwo muriheereza abanyamahanga muri omu nsi etari yaanyu.<verse eid="JER 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 5:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:6">Bir 32:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 6:9">Isa 6:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mukigambe omu nju ya Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:20">Mukirangye omuri Yuda, nimugira muti:<verse eid="JER 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 5:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:14">Mat 13:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muhurire eki, imwe abashema, kandi abataine bwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:21">Abaine amaisho, kwonka batarikureeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:21">Abaine amatu, kwonka batarikuhurira;<verse eid="JER 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 5:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 10:7">Yer 10:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 46:3">Zab 46:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:9">104:9</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 26:10">Yob 26:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:22">Timurikutiina? Timurikutetemera omu maisho gangye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:22">Nkataho omusheenyi kuba omwatano gw'enyanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:22">Omucungiro gw'ebiro byona, ogu etarikubaasa kurengyeraho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:22">Ebingozi n'obu byakwecunda bita, tibikaabaasa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:22">Kandi n'obu byakuhoorera bita, tibikaagurengyeraho.<verse eid="JER 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 5:23" />Kwonka eri ihanga riine omutima gugangaire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:23">Bagomire, baayegyendera.<verse eid="JER 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 5:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 14:22">Yer 14:22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 11:14">Bir 11:14</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 8:22">Kut 8:22</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:45">Mat 5:45</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:17">Byak 14:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tibarikugira mu mitima yaabo bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:24">Ka tutiine MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:24">Otuha enjura omu bunaku bwayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:24">Enjura y'eibiba n'eya katumba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:24">Akaturindira saabiiti ezateereirweho amagyesha.<verse eid="JER 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 5:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 3:3">Yer 3:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eby'okushiisha byanyu nibyo biihireho ebyo byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:25">Kandi ebibi byanyu bibazibiire kutunga ebirungi;<verse eid="JER 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 5:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 10:9">Zab 10:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 124:7">124:7</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:11">Enf 1:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba abantu babi nibashangwa omu bantu bangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:26">Nibagwera nk'abategi b'enyonyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:26">Batega emitego, bakwata abantu.<verse eid="JER 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 5:27" />Amaju gaabo gaijwire obugobya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:27">nk'ekitukuru kiijwire enyonyi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:27">n'ahabw'ekyo bahindukire bakuru n'abatungi,<verse eid="JER 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 5:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 7:6">Yer 7:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:23">Isa 1:23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:15">Bir 32:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bagomokire, baasiigiriza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:28">Omu kukora kubi tibaine bugarukiro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:28">Emanja z'efuuzi tibazicwa mu bwinganisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:28">Ngu ezo fuuzi zibe gye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:28">Kandi tibatonganira bakyene.<verse eid="JER 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 5:29" />Nimugira ngu tindibafubira ahabw'ebyo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:29">Tindihoora enzigu eihanga nk'eri?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:29">Nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 5:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 23:14">Yer 23:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekintu ky'eihano kandi ekirikutiinisa munonga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:30">Kigwire omu nsi egi,<verse eid="JER 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 5:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:13">Yer 6:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 14:14">14:14</ref>, <ref loc="JER 14:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 20:6">20:6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 13:6">Ezk 13:6</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 2:11">Mik 2:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baanabi nibahanuura ebishuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:31">Abanyamurwa nibategyeka nibagyendera aha bya baanabi abo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:31">Kandi abantu bangye nibasiima ku biba bityo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:31">Mbwenu muheru ku erihika, muryagira muta?<verse eid="JER 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JER 6" />
  <para style="s1">Abayuda okuheebwa ekifubiro, bakanga kweteisa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 1:14">Yer 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 19:21">2 Bag 19:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe bantu ba Benyamiini 'mwe, nimuhungye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:1">Murugye omuri Yerusaalemu, musherure obukiriro!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:1">Muteere enzamba omuri Tekoa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:1">Mwimutsye orurango ahari Besi-hakeremu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:1">Ahabw'okuba akabi kaareetana nikareetwa aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:1">N'okucwekyerera kuhango.<verse eid="JER 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 6:2" />Saayuuni omurungi kandi owaayoroirwe gye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:2">Naaza kumucwekyereza.<verse eid="JER 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 6:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:17">Yer 4:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:1">23:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abariisa nibaija kumurwanisa baine amasyo gaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:3">Bateere amahema gaabo, bamwehinguririze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:3">Buri omwe ariise ahakwe.<verse eid="JER 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 6:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 15:8">Yer 15:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:7">22:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:27">51:27</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:9">Yoel 3:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mweteekateekye kuza kumurwanisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:4">Mwimukye mumuteere omu ihangwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:4">Mbwenu ho twahitsya! Ahabw'okuba bwaza kwira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:4">Ebicuucu by'omu mwabazyo nibigyenda nibiba biraingwa.<verse eid="JER 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 6:5" />Mwimukye, tumuteere nyekiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:5">Tucwekyereze ebikaari bye.<verse eid="JER 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 6:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 20:20">Bir 20:20</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 19:32">2 Bag 19:32</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:8">Ezk 26:8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:44">Luk 19:44</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:6">Muhonde ebiti bya Yerusaalemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:6">Mugirundeho eby'okutemberaho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:6">Oru nirwo rurembo orushemereire kufubirwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:6">Orutarimu kindi kureka okuhatana.<verse eid="JER 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 6:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 57:20">Isa 57:20</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 7:11">Ezk 7:11</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 7:23">23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nk'oku enshuro eguma neereeta amaizi gaayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:7">Narwo nikwo ruguma nirureeta obubi bwarwo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:7">Obubisha n'okucwekyereza nibiruhurirwamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:7">Obutoosha nindeeba endwara n'okuhutaazana.<verse eid="JER 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 6:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 23:18">Ezk 23:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe Yerusaalemu, ikiriza okuhaburwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:8">Ntakaataanira kimwe naiwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:8">Nkakugira amatongo, n'ensi etatuurwamu.<verse eid="JER 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 6:9" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:9">Humbira kimwe Abaisraeli abatsigaireho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:9">Nk'oku bahumba omuzaabibu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:9">Garuka omu mataagi gaagwo, ohumbe n'engaro zaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:9">Nk'oku omucwi w'ebijuma by'emizaabibu agira.<verse eid="JER 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 6:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 7:26">Yer 7:26</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:57">Byak 7:57</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 28:9">Isa 28:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 53:1">53:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu n'oha ou naakugambira nkahana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:10">Bakahurira?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:10">Reeba, amatu gaabo gaigaire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:10">Tibarikubaasa kuhurira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:10">Reeba, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kibahindukiire ekirikugaywa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:10">Tibarikukishemerererwa.<verse eid="JER 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 6:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 9:21">Yer 9:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 20:9">20:9</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 2:21">Tonz 2:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo nyijuriire ekiniga kya MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:11">Nkaremwa kugumisiriza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:11">Kishukye aha baana abari omu muhanda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:11">N'omu nteerane z'abatsigazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:11">Ahabw'okuba omushaija n'omukazi we bombi baryatwarwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:11">Abagurusi n'empwitsi nabo batwarwe.<verse eid="JER 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 6:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:12-15">Yer 6:12-15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 8:10-12">8:10-12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amaju gaabo garyaba ag'abandi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:12">N'emisiri yaabo hamwe n'abakazi baabo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:12">Ahabw'okuba ndyabangira abatwire omu nsi omukono;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:12">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 6:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:31">Yer 5:31</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:34">31:34</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:12">44:12</ref>; <ref loc="JON 3:5">Yon 3:5</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 3:11">Mik 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 56:11">Isa 56:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okuruga aha muto okuhika aha mukuru omuribo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:13">Buri muntu aine omururu gw'amagoba gatahikire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:13">Okuruga ahari nabi okuhika aha munyamurwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:13">Buri muntu naakora eby'obugobya.<verse eid="JER 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 6:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:10">Yer 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 14:13">14:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:17">23:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:22">Isa 48:22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 13:10">Ezk 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 3:5">Mik 3:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obuhuta bw'abantu bangye babutambire eruguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:14">Nibagira bati: N'obusingye! N'obusingye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:14">Haza obusingye butariho.<verse eid="JER 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 6:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 3:3">Yer 3:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 8:12">8:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Beitu ku baaherize kukora ebihagaro, baagira enshoni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:15">Ngaaha! Tibarazigizire na kakye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:15">N'obu kwakuba okubwerabwera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:15">N'ahabw'ekyo baryagwa omuri abo abagwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:15">Omu bunaku obu ndibafubiriramu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:15">Baryakumbagazibwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:15">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 6:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 18:15">Yer 18:15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:20">Isa 8:20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:29">Luk 16:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:16">Mwemerere aha mihanda, mureebe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:16">Mubuuririze otuhanda otwa ira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:16">Ahu omuhanda murungi guri, mube nigwo mwatoora.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:16">Nimwo muribonera emitima yaanyu oburuhuukiro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:16">Kwonka baagira bati: Titurikwija kugugyenderamu.<verse eid="JER 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 6:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:19">Yer 4:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:16">44:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 58:1">Isa 58:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi nkataho ab'okubarinda ningira nti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:17">Mute omutima aha iraka ry'enzamba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:17">Kwonka baagira bati: Titurikwija kuguritaho.<verse eid="JER 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 6:18" />N'ahabw'ekyo, iwe iguru 'we, hurira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:18">Omanye ekiribabaho;<verse eid="JER 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 6:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 1:31">Enf 1:31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naiwe nsi 'we, hurira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:19">Reeba, niinyija kureeta akabi ahari abo bantu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:19">Nibyo byana ebirikuruga omu naama zaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:19">Ahabw'okuba tibarataire mutima ha bigambo byangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:19">N'ebiragiro byangye bakabyanga.<verse eid="JER 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 6:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 10:1">1 Bag 10:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:6">Zab 40:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:11">Isa 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 5:21">Amo 5:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'enki nibandeetera obubaane oburikuruga Sheeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:20">N'emigaju erikuruga omu nsi ya hare?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:20">Ebitambo byanyu ebyokize tibirikwikirizibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:20">N'empongano zaanyu tizirikunshemeza.<verse eid="JER 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 6:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 3:20">Ezk 3:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo MUKAMA arikugirira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:21">Reeba, ndyata enkongi omu maisho g'abo bantu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:21">Ezi abaana na baishebo bariteeraho entsibo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:21">Bataahi baabo na bagyenzi baabo bakahwerekyerera.<verse eid="JER 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 6:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:22-24">Yer 6:22-24</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:32">25:32</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:8">31:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:41-43">50:41-43</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:22">Reeba, eihanga niriija niriruga omu nsi ey'omu bukiizi-bwa-bumosho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:22">Eihanga rikuru niriimuka kuruga aha muheru gw'ensi,<verse eid="JER 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 6:23" />Rikwaitse amata n'amacumu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:23">N'abantu enshaarizi abataine saasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:23">Endigito yaabo ni nk'enyanja erikuhoorera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:23">Nibagyendera aha mbaraasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:23">Batengire orugamba nk'abarikurwana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:23">Kukurwansia iwe Saayuuni.<verse eid="JER 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 6:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 38:4">Yer 38:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:8">Isa 13:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 17:17">Ezk 17:17</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 21:7">21:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku tuhuriire enkuru yaabyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:24">Emikono yaatentebuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:24">Twagira obusaasi bwingi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:24">Nk'obw'omukazi orikurumwa kuzaara.<verse eid="JER 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 6:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 20:3">Yer 20:3</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 2:22">Tonz 2:22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 31:13">Zab 31:13</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 18:11">Yob 18:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otashohora aheeru kuza omu ishwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:25">N'obu kwakuba okuraba omu muhanda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:25">Ahabw'okuba omuzigu aine rurara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:25">N'okutiinisa kuri embaju zoona.<verse eid="JER 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 6:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:8">Yer 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:34">25:34</ref>; <ref loc="EST 4:1">Est 4:1</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 3:16">Tonz 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 8:10">Amo 8:10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zek 12:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe ihanga ry'abantu bangye 'we, yezirikye ebiguniya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:26">Oyekuringye omu iju;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:26">Ocure nk'ofiisize omwana omwe nyamunegyere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:26">otonzye n'obusaasi bwingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:26">Ahabw'okuba omuhwerekyerezi aryatuteera kitaraariire.<verse eid="JER 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 6:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 1:18">Yer 1:18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 9:7">9:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkuhindwire orikugyeza abantu bangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:27">Ngu omanye emitwarize yaabo, ogicondooze.<verse eid="JER 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 6:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:16">Lev 19:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 22:18">Ezk 22:18</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 22:26">26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Boona n'abagomi kandi enteegi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:28">Nibagyenda nibabeiherera abandi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:28">Bagumire nk'omuringa nari nk'ekyoma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:28">Boona nibakora ebitahikire.<verse eid="JER 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 6:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:22">Isa 1:22</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 1:25">25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Emijuba yaabo neejugutirirwa n'amaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:29">Risasi ehwereziibwe omuriro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:29">Nibeeruhiza busha kugumizamu nibashemeza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:29">Ahabw'okuba ababi tibarikwihwamu.<verse eid="JER 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 6:30" />Abantu nibabeeta efeeza y'enkamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:30">ahabw'okuba MUKAMA abangire.<verse eid="JER 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JER 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okuragaansia abarikweteisa obusingye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 7:1" />Ekigambo kikaija ahari Yeremia nikiruga ahari MUKAMA; kyagira kiti: <verse eid="JER 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 7:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 18:11">Yer 18:11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 26:2">26:2</ref>, <ref loc="JER 26:13">13</ref>. </char></note> Yemerera omu irembo ry'enju ya MUKAMA, orangireyo ekigambo eki, noogira oti: Nimuhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA, imwe mwena Abayuda abarikuraba omuri aga marembo nimuza kuramya MUKAMA. <verse eid="JER 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 7:3" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Mushemeze emitwarize yaanyu n'ebi murikukora, mbone kubaikiriza kutuura omuri ogu mwanya. <verse eid="JER 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 7:4" />Murekye kwesiga ebigambo ebi ebirikuhabisa nimugira muti: Hekalu ya MUKAMA, hekalu ya MUKAMA, hekalu ya MUKAMA niyo egi! <verse eid="JER 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 7:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:3">Yer 22:3</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu, ku muraashemereze kimwe emitwarize yaanyu n'ebi muri kukoa, mwakorerana eby'oburyo omu mazima, <verse eid="JER 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 7:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:14">Bir 6:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:14">24:14</ref>. </char></note> mwareka kwita kubi omunyaihanga, efuuzi n'omufaakazi, n'okusheesha eshagama y'abataine rubanja omuri ogu mwanya, mwareka n'okukuratira baaruhanga abandi kwereetaho akabi, <verse eid="JER 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 7:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:40">Bir 4:40</ref>. </char></note> obwo ndyabaikiriza kutuura omuri ogu mwanya, omu nsi ei naahaire baashwenkuriimwe ira kuba eyaabo ebiro byona.<verse eid="JER 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 7:8" />Reeba, nimweruhiza busha kwesiga ebigambo ebirikuhabisa. <verse eid="JER 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 7:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 4:1">Hos 4:1</ref>, <ref loc="HOS 4:2">2</ref>. </char></note> Nimwija kwiba, kwita, kushambana, kurahira ebishuba, kwoterera Baali obubaane, n'okukuratira baaruhanga abandi abu mutakamanyaga, <verse eid="JER 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 7:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:34">Yer 32:34</ref>; <ref loc="JER 34:15">34:15</ref>. </char></note>haza mwije muunyemerere omu maisho omuri egi nju erikwetererwa eiziina ryangye, mugire muti: Tujunirwe! Haza kuri okugumizamu nimukora ebyo bihagaro byona? <verse eid="JER 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 7:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 7:22">Ezk 7:22</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:13">Mat 21:13</ref>. </char></note> Egi nju erikwetererwa eiziina ryangye ebahindukiire enyanga y'abambuzi? Reeba, nyowe ahabwangye nkireebire; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 7:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 26:6">Yer 26:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:66">Zab 78:66</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 1:3">1 Sam 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 4:3-12">4:3-12</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 18:31">Bar 18:31</ref>. </char></note> Nimwirooko muze omu mwanya gwangye ogwabaire guri Shiilo, ei naabandize kutuuza eiziina ryangye, mureebe oku naagugizire ningitura obubi bw'abantu bangye Israeli. <verse eid="JER 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 7:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:15">2 Bus 36:15</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:24">Enf 1:24</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 50:2">Isa 50:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:12">65:12</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu, ahabw'okukora ebyo byona, mukanga kuhurira n'obu ndaabe naagumiizemu nimbagambira, kandi nkibeeta mutaanyetabe, <verse eid="JER 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 7:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 5:12">Bir 5:12</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 9:7">1 Bag 9:7</ref>. </char></note> nikyo ndigirira kubi enju erikwetererwa eiziina ryangye ei murikwesiga, n'omwanya ogu naabahaire na baashwenkuriimwe, nk'oku naagizire Shiilo. <verse eid="JER 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 7:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:6">2 Bag 17:6</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 17:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 5:3">Hos 5:3</ref>, <ref loc="HOS 5:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:4">6:4</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyabacwa mundugye omu maisho, nk'oku naacwire beene waanyu boona oruzaaro rwona orwa Efuraimu; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okworobera Ruhanga oku kurikukira ebitambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 7:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 11:14">Yer 11:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 14:11">14:11</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 32:10">Kur 32:10</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 5:16">1 Yoh 5:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo otashabira aba bantu, n'obu kwakuba okwimutsya eiraka kubeeshengyerereza; kandi otanyeshengyereza, ahabw'okuba tindikwija kukuhurira. <verse eid="JER 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 7:17" />Torikureeba ebi barikukora omu ndembo za Yuda n'omu nguuto za Yerusaalemu? <verse eid="JER 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 7:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:16">Bir 32:16</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 32:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 14:9">1 Bag 14:9</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 16:2">16:2</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:13">2 Bag 23:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 11:17">Yer 11:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 19:13">19:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:17">44:17</ref>, <ref loc="JER 44:19">19</ref>. </char></note> Abaana ni batorotoora enku, baishebo nibahemba omuriro, abakazi nibabumbabumba eisyanga, kuteekyera omugabekazi w'eiguru otukeeki, kandi bashukira baaruhanga abandi empongano z'eby'okunywa kuunyitsa ekiniga. <verse eid="JER 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 7:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:51">Yer 51:51</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 35:6">Yob 35:6</ref>. </char></note> Nimugira ngu niinye barikwitsa ekiniga? Nikwo MUKAMA arikugira; tibo barikukyeitsa, bakeereetera okubwerabwera? <verse eid="JER 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 7:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:27">Yer 17:27</ref>; <ref loc="JER 42:18">42:18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:6">44:6</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 34:25">2 Bus 34:25</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo Mukama RUHANGA arikugirira ati: Reeba, okuguubwa kubi kwangye n'ekiniga kyangye biryashukwa aha mwanya ogu, aha bantu n'amatungo, aha biti by'omu ishwa n'aha myaka y'omu misiri, kyakye, kireme kuraaza.<verse eid="JER 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 7:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:20">Yer 6:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Mwongyere ebitambo byanyu eby'okwotsya aha bindi bitambo; <verse eid="JER 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 7:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hos 6:6</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba aha izooba eri naihiireho baashwenkuriimwe omu nsi ya Misri, tindabagambiire, kandi tindabaragiire by'ebitambo by'okwotsya n'ebindi bitambo; <verse eid="JER 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 7:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 11:4">Yer 11:4</ref>, <ref loc="JER 11:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 42:6">42:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:40">Bir 4:40</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:33">5:33</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:3">6:3</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:12">Lev 26:12</ref>. </char></note> kureka eki nikyo kiragiro ki naabahaire, ningira nti: Mworobere eiraka ryangye, naanye ndyaba Ruhanga waanyu, naimwe mube abantu bangye, kandi mugyendere omu mitwarize yoona ei ndikubaragiira, mubone kuba gye. <verse eid="JER 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 7:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:19">Yer 2:19</ref>, <ref loc="JER 2:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="JER 15:6">15:6</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 4:16">Hos 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 81:11">Zab 81:11</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 81:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka baayanga kworoba, n'obu kwakuba okutega amatu, kureka baaguma nibagyendera omu naama zaabo n'omu buteegi bw'emitima yaabo emibi; omu mwanya gw'okugyenda omu maisho, baagaruka enyima. <verse eid="JER 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 7:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:15">2 Bus 36:15</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 36:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Okwiha aha izooba eri baashwenkuriimwe baarugiireho omu nsi ya Misri n'okuhitsya eri izooba nkaguma nimbooherereza abairu bangye boona baanabi ntarikwosha; <verse eid="JER 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 7:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 16:12">Yer 16:12</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 30:8">2 Bus 30:8</ref>. </char></note> kwonka hoona tibaraanyorobeire n'obu kwakuba okutega amatu, kureka bakagangaaza ebitsya, baakora kubi okukira baishenkurubo.<verse eid="JER 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 7:27" />Mbwenu obagambire ebigambo ebyo byona, kwonka tibarikwija kukuhurira; noija kubeeta, kwonka tibarikwija kukwetaba; <verse eid="JER 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 7:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:3">Yer 9:3</ref>. </char></note> kandi obagire oti: Eri n'eihanga eritaroorobeire iraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waaryo, rikanga kutegyekwa; amazima gahwerekyereire, tigakiri mu kanwa kaabo.<verse eid="JER 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 7:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 1:20">Yob 1:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Shara eishokye ryawe, orinagye hare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 7:29">Ocurire aha bibungo by'emparamaata;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 7:29">Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA ayangire abantu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 7:29">Abu ainiire ekiniga, yabatsigaho.<verse eid="JER 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 7:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 7:10">Yer 7:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:34">32:34</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 21:4">2 Bag 21:4</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 21:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:10">23:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 5:11">Ezk 5:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Aba Yuda bakozire kubi nimbareeba, baata ebihagaro byabo omu nju erikwetererwa eiziina ryangye kugihagara. <verse eid="JER 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 7:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:21">Yer 7:21</ref>, <ref loc="JER 7:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:40">31:40</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:38">Zab 106:38</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 18:16">Yos 18:16</ref>. </char></note> Kandi bombekyeire Tofeti omwanya mukuru gw'okuramizamu omu ruhanga rwa mwene Hinoomu, kurabya abaana baabo b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki omu muriro, eki ntarabaragiire, kandi ekitakaijaga mu biteekateeko byangye. <verse eid="JER 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 7:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 19:6">Yer 19:6</ref>, <ref loc="JER 19:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 6:5">Ezk 6:5</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo mumanye ngu ebiro biryaija, obu ogwo mwanya gutarigaruka kwetwa ogwa Tofeti nari oruhanga rwa mwene Hinoomu, kureka guryayetwa oruhanga rw'eriitiro; ahabw'okuba omuri Tofeti nimwo bariziika ahabw'okubura ahandi hoona. <verse eid="JER 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 7:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 12:9">Yer 12:9</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:26">Bir 28:26</ref>. </char></note> Emitumbi y'aba bantu eryariibwa amahungu g'omu mwanya n'enyamaishwa z'omu nsi, habure ow'okubikanga. <verse eid="JER 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 7:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:31">Lev 26:31</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 26:33">33</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:63">Zab 78:63</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 24:7">Isa 24:7</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 24:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 16:9">Yer 16:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 27:17">27:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:2">44:2</ref>, <ref loc="JER 44:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:13">Ezk 26:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:22">Kush 18:22</ref>, <ref loc="REV 18:23">23</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyahamya eiraka ry'okushemererwa n'ery'okwesiima, n'eiraka rya kishwera na kishwerwa ngamare omu ndembo za Yuda n'omu nguuto za Yerusaalemu, ahabw'okuba ensi eryaba amatongo.<verse eid="JER 7:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JER 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okwomesereza abarikutamba ebibi aharuguru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 8:1" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Omu biro ebyo amagufa g'abagabe ba Yuda, ag'abanyiginya baayo, ag'abanyamurwa, aga baanabi, n'ag'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu, garyaihwa omu bituuro byabo, <verse eid="JER 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 8:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:22">Yer 9:22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:19">Bir 4:19</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 21:3">2 Bag 21:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 8:16">Ezk 8:16</ref>. </char></note> bagaanikye omu maisho g'eizooba, omu maisho g'okwezi n'omu maisho g'eihe ryona ery'omu iguru, ebi baabaire bakunda bakabiheereza, bakabikuratira, bakabisherura kubiramya; tigarishanguruzibwa n'obu kwakuba okuziikwa, kureka garyaba nk'amasha aha itaka <verse eid="JER 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 8:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:3">Yer 23:3</ref>, <ref loc="JER 23:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 3:21">Yob 3:21</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 3:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:7">Dan 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 9:6">Kush 9:6</ref>. </char></note> Abaritsigaraho omuri orwo ruganda rubi, ei ndiba mbataataanisiize yoona, okufa kuryabakirira okugumaho; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira.<verse eid="JER 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 8:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 11:11">Rom 11:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi oryabagira oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:4">Beitu abantu ku bagwa, tibaimuka?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:4">Omuntu ku ahaba, tahabuuka?<verse eid="JER 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 8:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 7:24">Yer 7:24</ref>; <ref loc="JER 9:6">9:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu shi, ahabw'enki aba bantu bagarukire enyima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:5">Bakagumizamu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:5">Bahamiire omu bugobya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:5">Baayanga kugaruka.<verse eid="JER 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 8:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 39:19-25">Yob 39:19-25</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:9">2 Pet 3:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ntaireho omutima kutega okutu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:6">Naahurira nibagamba ebitahikire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:6">Tihariho n'omwe orikweteisa ebibi bye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:6">Akagira ati: Mbwenu eki naakora ki?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:6">Buri muntu naatoora omuhanda gwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:6">Nk'oku embaraasi eturumbuza neeza aha rugamba.<verse eid="JER 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 8:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:4">Yer 5:4</ref>, <ref loc="JER 5:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="SNG 2:12">Kyesh 2:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:3">Isa 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 38:14">38:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Buzimazima enkongoro ez'omu mwanya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:7">Zimanya obunaku bwazo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:7">Enkombe, entaratambi n'entuuha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:7">Bimanya obunaku bwabyo bw'okwiziramu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:7">Beitu abantu bangye bo tibarikumanya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:7">Ekiragiro kya MUKAMA?<verse eid="JER 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 8:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 2:17">Rom 2:17</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 2:18">18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimubaasa muta kugira muti; Turi abanyabwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:8">Kandi ebiragiro bya MUKAMA niitwe tubiine?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:8">Haza kunu ekaraamu y'abahandiiki embeihi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:8">Ebihindwire eby'ebishuba.<verse eid="JER 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 8:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 1:19">1 Kor 1:19</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 1:20">20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abanyabwengye baryahemurwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:9">Bahahaaze emitima, bakwatwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:9">Reeba, beehakaine ekigambo kya MUKAMA;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:9">Mbwenu ni bwengye ki obu baine?<verse eid="JER 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 8:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:10-12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:12-15">Yer 6:12-15</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo abakazi baabo ndyabaha abandi bashaija,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:10">N'emisiri yaabo ngihe abaribasingura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:10">Ahabw'okuba okuruga aha muto okuhika aha mukuru</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:10">Boona baine omururu gw'amagoba gatahikire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:10">Okuruga ahari nabi okuhika aha munyamurwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:10">Boona nibakora eby'obugobya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:11">Isa 56:11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JER 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 8:11" />Obuhuta bw'abantu bangye babutambire aharuguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:11">Nibagira bati: N'obusingye! N'obusingye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:11">Haza obusingye butariho.<verse eid="JER 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 8:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 3:3">Yer 3:3</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 4:5">Hos 4:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Beitu, ku baaherize kukora ebihagaro, bakagira enshoni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:12">Ngaaha! Tibarazigizire na kakye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:12">N'obu kwakuba okubwerabwera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:12">N'ahabw'ekyo baryagwa omuri abo abagwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:12">Omu bunaku obu ndibafubiririramu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:12">Baryakumbagazibwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:12">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 8:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 1:7">Yoel 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 1:2">Zef 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:19">Mat 21:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:6">Luk 13:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyabamariraho kimwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:13">Ebijuma tibiriboneka ha mizaabibu nari aha mitiini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:13">Kandi n'amababi gaayo garyahotoka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:13">N'ebi naabahaire biryabaihwaho.<verse eid="JER 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 8:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:5">Yer 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 9:15">9:15</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 3:15">Tonz 3:15</ref>, <ref loc="LAM 3:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="REV 8:11">Kush 8:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu nitugumibwa ki aha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:14">Muteerane, tutaahe omu ndembo ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:14">Tube niyo twacwekyererera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:14">Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu atucwereire orubanja rw'okucwekyerera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:14">Yaatuha amaizi agarikwita kuganywa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:14">Ahabw'okuba tucumwire ahari MUKAMA.<verse eid="JER 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 8:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 14:19">Yer 14:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 30:26">Yob 30:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tutegyereize obusingye, kwonka titwine karungi aku tureebire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:15">Tutegyereize obunaku bw'okutambirirwamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:15">Mbwenu reeba, haija ebirikutiinisa.<verse eid="JER 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 8:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:15">Yer 4:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 10:25">10:25</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:21">49:21</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 5:22">Bar 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 60:2">Zab 60:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okufuureeka okububura kw'embaraasi zaabo nikuhuririrwa omuri Daani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:16">Eiraka ry'okububura kw'enimi zaazo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:16">Nirireetera ensi yoona kutengyeta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:16">Ahabw'okuba baizire, baamaraho ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:16">N'ebigirimu byona, orurembo n'abarutwiremu.<verse eid="JER 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 8:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 26:22">Lev 26:22</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 21:6">Kub 21:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 58:4">Zab 58:4</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 58:5">5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, naaza kubooherereza enjoka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:17">N'empiri ezitarikubaasa kurogwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:17">Zibarume;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:17">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 8:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:21">Bir 32:21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 39:3">Isa 39:3</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 5:17">Tonz 5:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obusaasi bwangye burengyesereize, tiburikubaasa kutambwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:18">Omutima gwangye gugwire enshazi.<verse eid="JER 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 8:19" />Muhurire eiraka ry'eihanga ry'abantu bangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">Eririkureetwa oku n'oku omu nsi yoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">nibagira bati: MUKAMA tari omuri Saayuuni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">Omugabe waayo timwo ari?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">Ahabw'enki bangwisize kubi n'ebishushani byabo ebibaizire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">N'ebirikuramibwa eby'enduga-mahanga?<verse eid="JER 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 8:20" />Eigyesha rihweire, n'ekyanda kyahwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:20">Kandi titukajunirwe.<verse eid="JER 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 8:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 14:17">Yer 14:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 22:4">Isa 22:4</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 30:30">Yob 30:30</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 4:8">Tonz 4:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omutima gwangye nigusaasibwa obuhuta bw'abantu bangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:21">Ndi omu rufu, nshobeirwe.<verse eid="JER 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 8:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 46:11">Yer 46:11</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 37:25">Kut 37:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuri Gileadi tihakibamu omubazi gw'okwomoora?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:22">Tihaakibayo omufumu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:22">Ahabw'enki abantu bangye batakakizire?<verse eid="JER 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JER 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia okutongyeza aba Yuda n'aba Yerusaalemu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 9:1" />Nkaabaasibwa ki, omutwe gwangye gwijura amaizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:1">N'amaisho gangye gaba enshuro y'amarira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:1">Ncura nyomushana na nyekiro</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:1">Ahabw'abantu bangye abaitsirwe!<verse eid="JER 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 9:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:7">Yer 5:7</ref>, <ref loc="JER 5:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 7:4">Hos 7:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkaabaasibwa ki, ngira eicumbi ry'abagyenzi omu ihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:2">Mbona kutsigaho abantu bangye, nza hare yaabo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:2">Ahabw'okuba boona n'enshambani</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:2">N'omutwe gw'abantu endeebya.<verse eid="JER 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 9:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 2:10">Bar 2:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 64:3">Zab 64:3</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 4:1">Hos 4:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bananuura orurimi rwabo nk'obuta, rurekura ebishuba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:3">Bahinduka ab'amaani omu nsi, kwonka kutarikurwanira mazima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:3">Kureka ku baheza kukora ekibi, bagaruka bakora ekindi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:3">Kandi tibarikummanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:3">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 9:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:28">Yer 6:28</ref>; <ref loc="JER 12:6">12:6</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:5">Mik 7:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 41:9">Zab 41:9</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 27:36">Kut 27:36</ref>. </char>
    </note> Buri muntu agume ayerinde mutaahi we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:4">Arekye kugira mwene ishe weena ou yaayesiga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:4">Ahabw'okuba buri w'eishe-emwe n'engobya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:4">Na buri mutaahi naagyenda naabeiherera abandi.<verse eid="JER 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 9:5" />Buri muntu naagobeza mutaahi we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:5">Tihaine orikugamba amazima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:5">Beegyeise endimi zaabo kubeiha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:5">Kandi nibakora ebibi, babura agabyeteisa.<verse eid="JER 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 9:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:25">Isa 1:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nibatungika okuhata aha kundi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:6">n'obugobya aha bundi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:6">Banga kummanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:6">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 9:7" />Nikyo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugirira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:7">Reeba, ndyabashemeza, mbagyeze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:7">Mbwenu ekindi eki naakukorera abantu bangye niki?<verse eid="JER 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 9:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 28:3">Zab 28:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 57:4">57:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 120:3">120:3</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 7:6">Hos 7:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orurimi rwabo n'omwambi ogurikugwisaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:8">Nirugamba eby'obugobya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:8">Buri muntu naagamba gye na mugyenzi we aha rurimi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:8">Kwonka omu mutima gwe ari omu naama y'okumugiira omu kyetindo.<verse eid="JER 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 9:9" />Nimugira ngu tindibafubira ahabw'ekyo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:9">Tindihoora enzigu eihanga nk'eri?</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JER 9:9">Nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 9:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:25">Yer 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="JER 12:4">12:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimucure, muboroogyere ebibungo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">Mutongyeze amariisizo g'omu ihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">Ahabw'okuba bihindukire amarungu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">Tihaine orikubirabamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">Kandi n'okujuga kw'ente tikurikuhurirwayo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">Enyonyi z'omu mwanya n'enyamaishwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">Bihungire, byagyenda.<verse eid="JER 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 9:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 10:22">Yer 10:22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 34:22">34:22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 25:2">Isa 25:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyahindura Yerusaalemu emituumo y'ebisheenyukire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:11">N'eikoobaniro rya zaamuha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:11">N'endembo za Yuda nzigire amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:11">Zibure ow'okuzituuramu.<verse eid="JER 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 9:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 107:43">Zab 107:43</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:18">Yer 23:18</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 14:9">Hos 14:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ni muntu ki oine obwengye bwingi orikubaasa kumanya ebyo? N'oha oyegambiriirwe MUKAMA, ngu abone kubimanyisa? Ahabw'enki ensi ehwerekyereziibwe, ekahinduka amatongo, ekaba nk'eihamba, ekabura owaagirabamu? <verse eid="JER 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 9:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:30-32">Zab 89:30-32</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA naagira ati: Ahabw'okureka ebiragiro byangye ebi naabahaire, batoorobere iraka ryangye, nari okutwaza nk'oku ririkubaragiira, <verse eid="JER 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 9:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:17">Yer 3:17</ref>. </char></note> kureka bakakuratira ebi emitima yaabo egangaire erikwenda, hamwe na Baabaali, nk'oku baishenkurubo baabeegyeise. <verse eid="JER 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 9:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 8:14">Yer 8:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 80:5">Zab 80:5</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugirira ati: Reeba, eri ihanga ndyarigaburira apusinto, ndinywaise amaizi agarikwita; <verse eid="JER 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 9:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:12">Yer 14:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 15:14">15:14</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:33">Lev 26:33</ref>. </char></note> ndyabataataanisiza omu mahanga agu bo na baishenkurubo batakamanyaga, mbakuratse rurara, okuhitsya obu ndibamaraho.<verse eid="JER 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 9:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 14:17">Yer 14:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 35:25">2 Bus 35:25</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 5:16">Amo 5:16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:23">Mat 9:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:17">Muteekateekye, mwete abakazi abarikumanya kucura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:17">Mutume aha bakazi abahangu, baije;<verse eid="JER 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 9:18" />Barahukye, batucurire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:18">Amarira gatufukunkukye omu maisho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:18">n'ebitsigye byaitu bihimintikye amaizi;<verse eid="JER 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 9:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:13">Yer 4:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba eiraka ry'okuborooga nirihurirwa nirireetwa Saayuuni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:19">Nirigira riti: Eshi tucwekyereziibwe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:19">Tuhemuriirwe kimwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:19">Ahabw'okuba tutsigireho ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:19">Amaka gaitu baagasheenya.<verse eid="JER 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 9:20" />Imwe bakazi 'mwe, nimuhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:20">Kandi amatu gaanyu gaakiire ekigambo ekirikuruga omu kanwa ke;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:20">Mwegyese bahara baanyu okucura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:20">Kandi buri muntu ayegyese mutaahi we okutonzya;<verse eid="JER 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 9:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:11">Yer 6:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba rufu etembire omu madirisa gaitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:21">Yaataaha omu bikaari byaitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:21">Yaamara abaana omu nguuto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:21">N'abatsigazi omu nteeraniro z'emihanda.<verse eid="JER 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 9:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 8:2">Yer 8:2</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:22">Lev 23:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Gira oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:22">Emitumbi y'abantu eryagwa omu ishwa nk'amasha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:22">Nk'enganda zitsigaire enyima y'omugyesi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:22">Ezitaine kishanguruza.<verse eid="JER 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 9:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 9:11">Mub 9:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Omunyabwengye arekye kwehimbisa ahabw'obwengye bwe, n'ow'amaani arekye kwehimbisa ahabw'amaani ge, n'omutungi arekye kwehimbisa ahabw'eitungo rye; <verse eid="JER 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 9:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:2">Zab 34:2</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:8">Mik 6:8</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:18">7:18</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:31">1 Kor 1:31</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 10:17">2 Kor 10:17</ref>. </char></note> kureka orikwehimbisa ayehimbise ahabw'ebi, ahabw'okuunyetegyereza n'ahabw'okummanya, ku ndi MUKAMA okora omu nsi eby'embabazi, eby'oburyo n'eby'okuhikiirira; ahabw'okuba ebyo nibyo nshemerererwa; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 9:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 25:19-21">Yer 25:19-21</ref>, <ref loc="JER 25:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 24:21">Isa 24:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba ebiro nibiija obu ndifubira abashazirwe boona, haza kunu batashazirwe mu mazima <verse eid="JER 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 9:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:27">Lev 19:27</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:41">26:41</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:16">Bir 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 44:7">Ezk 44:7</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:28">Rom 2:28</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 2:29">29</ref>. </char></note> Misri, Yuda, Edomu, beene Amoni, Moabu n'abatwire omu ihamba boona, abatega ebyeyera; ahabw'okuba amahanga ago goona tigashazirwe; kandi n'enju ya Israeli teshazirwe mu mutima.<verse eid="JER 9:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JER 10" />
  <para style="s1">Baaruhanga b'abanyamahanga okuba busha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 10:1" />Imwe b'enju ya Israeli 'mwe, nimuhurire ekigambo eki MUKAMA arikubagambira. <verse eid="JER 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 10:2" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:2">Mutaritooreza emicwe y'abanyamahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:2">Nari okuhahaaza emitima ahabw'obumanyiso bw'omu iguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:2">Ahabw'okuba amahanga gabuhahaariize emitima.<verse eid="JER 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 10:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:19">Isa 40:19</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 40:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 41:7">41:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mumanye ngu emigyenzo y'amahanga ni busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:3">Ahakuba abantu batema ekiti omu kibira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:3">Omunyamwoga akibaija n'embaijo,<verse eid="JER 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 10:4" />Abantu bakihunda efeeza n'ezaabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:4">Bakihamisa emisumaari n'enyondo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:4">Ngu kitajegajega.<verse eid="JER 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 10:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 115:5">Zab 115:5</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 115:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 135:16">135:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 41:23">Isa 41:23</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 46:7">46:7</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 2:18">Hab 2:18</ref>, <ref loc="HAB 2:19">19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebishushani byabo ni nk'eby'okurindisa enyonyi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">Omu musiri gw'ekihambo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">Tibigamba, biba eby'okuheekwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">Ahabw'okuba tibibaasa kugyenda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">Mutaribitiina, ahakuba tibiine ki birikubaasa kukora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">Yaaba kibi, yaaba kirungi.<verse eid="JER 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 10:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:11">Kur 15:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 86:8">Zab 86:8</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 86:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai MUKAMA, tihariho orikushushana naiwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:6">Ori mukuru, n'eiziina ryawe ni rikuru kandi ery'amaani.<verse eid="JER 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 10:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:22">Yer 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="REV 15:4">Kush 15:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai MUKAMA ow'amahanga, n'oha otakaakutiina?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:7">Manya ekyo nikyo oshemereire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:7">Ahabw'okuba omu banyabwengye boona ab'omu mahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:7">N'omu nsi z'abagabe baago zoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:7">Tihaine orikushushana naiwe.<verse eid="JER 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 10:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 41:29">Isa 41:29</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 10:2">Zek 10:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Boona oku baingana ni nk'enyamaishwa, kandi ebifeera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:8">Ebi ebishushani byegyesa n'ebiti nkabyo.<verse eid="JER 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 10:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 10:22">1 Bag 10:22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 115:4">Zab 115:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:19">Isa 40:19</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 10:5">Dan 10:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bareeta ebibaati by'efeeza ebi baihire Tarushiishi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:9">N'ezaabu eya Ufaazi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:9">Ebyo bishushani n'omurimo gw'abanyamyoga n'abaheesi b'ezaabu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:9">Ebijwaro byabo n'ebya bururu na bujwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:9">Byona bikorwa abahangu.<verse eid="JER 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 10:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:4">Bir 32:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka MUKAMA niwe Ruhanga Nyamuhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:10">Ruhanga ohuriire, kandi Omukama otahwaho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:10">Ku agira ekiniga, ensi etengyeta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:10">Kandi amahanga tigarikubaasa kwemera kuguubwa kubi kwe.<verse eid="JER 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 10:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 96:5">Zab 96:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 2:18">Isa 2:18</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 13:2">Zek 13:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo muribagambira muti: Baaruhanga abatarahangire eiguru n'ensi baryahwerekyerera, bahwe omu nsi n'ahansi y'eiguru.<verse eid="JER 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 10:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:12-16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:15-19">Yer 51:15-19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niwe yaahangire ensi n'obushoboorozi bwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:12">Akagihamya n'obwengye bwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:12">N'okwetegyereza kwe nikwo yaabambiise eiguru.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:1">Kut 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:5">Zab 104:5</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:19">Enf 3:19</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JER 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 10:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 14:22">Yer 14:22</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 5:10">Yob 5:10</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 38:22">38:22</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 38:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:6">Zab 104:6</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 104:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 135:7">135:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku agamba n'eiraka rye, omu iguru habamu okuhoorera kw'amaizi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:13">Ainamura oruho okuruga aha mperu z'ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:13">Ataho emirabyo kugwisa enjura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:13">Kandi areeta omuyaga naagwiha omu mabiikiro ge.<verse eid="JER 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 10:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:17">Isa 42:17</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:22">Rom 1:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Buri muntu ni nk'enyamaishwa, taine bwengye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:14">Buri muheesi w'ezaabu ahemwirwe ebishushani bye ebirikuramibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:14">Ahabw'okuba ebishushani bye n'eby'ebishuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:14">Kandi tibiine mwityso.<verse eid="JER 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 10:15" />Tibiine mugasho; n'omurimo gw'okubeihabeiha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:15">Omu biro by'okufubirwa kwabyo biryahwerekyerera.<verse eid="JER 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 10:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:35">Yer 31:35</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 47:4">Isa 47:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 16:5">Zab 16:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:9">Bir 32:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka Otuura ari omugabo gwa Yakobo ti nkabyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:16">Ahabw'okuba niwe yaahangire ebintu byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:16">Kandi Israeli n'oruganda rw'obuhunguzi bwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:16">MUKAMA ow'amahe niryo iziina rye.<verse eid="JER 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia okuragura aha by'okutwarwa omu bukwatwa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 10:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:1">Yer 6:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 12:3">Ezk 12:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe otuura omu rurembo rugotsirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:17">Iha ebintu byawe ahansi;<verse eid="JER 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 10:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 28:20">Bir 28:20</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 25:29">1 Sam 25:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:18">Reeba, naaza kunaga hare abatuuzi b'omuri egi nsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:18">Nk'orikurekyera enjungu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:18">Mbareetere obusaasi, babuhurire.<verse eid="JER 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 10:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 14:17">Yer 14:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai bambe, obusaasi bwanyita!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:19">Obuhuta bwangye nibumpurura.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:19">Kwonka naagira nti: Buzimazima oku n'okubonabona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:19">Nshemereire kukwemera.<verse eid="JER 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 10:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:20">Yer 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:15">31:15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 54:2">Isa 54:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eihema ryangye ricwekyereziibwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:20">Emirunga yangye yoona ecwekire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:20">Abaana bangye bantsigireho, tibakiriho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:20">Tihariho w'okugaruka kunteerera eihema</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:20">n'okumpanikira emikingo.<verse eid="JER 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 10:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 23:1">Yer 23:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:2">Ezk 34:2</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 34:5">5</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 34:6">6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba abariisa bahindukire nk'enyamaishwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:21">tibarikwehanuuza ahari MUKAMA;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:21">Nikyo kibazibiire kuba gye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:21">N'obusyo bwona butaataine.<verse eid="JER 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 10:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 1:13">Yer 1:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimuhurire enkuru! Reeba neija;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:22">Hariho okujagarara kwingi okurikuruga omu nsi y'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:22">okurihindura endembo za Yuda amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:22">N'eikoobaniro rya zaamuha.<verse eid="JER 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 10:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 10:24">Enf 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 5:23">Dan 5:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai MUKAMA, nimmanya ngu omuhanda gw'omuntu tiguba mu bushoboorozi bwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:23">Kandi omuntu weena ogyenda tabaasa kwehabura mu rugyendo rwe ahu yaahika hoona.<verse eid="JER 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 10:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 30:11">Yer 30:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 6:1">Zab 6:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai MUKAMA, ompane, kwonka ompane nombarira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:24">Otampanisa ekiniga, okancwekyereza.<verse eid="JER 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 10:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 8:6">Yer 8:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 30:16">30:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 79:6">Zab 79:6</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 79:7">7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Shuka ekiniga kyawe aha mahanga agatarikukumanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:25">Aha nganda ezitatakira iziina ryawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:25">Ahabw'okuba bashonshomeire Yakobo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:25">Bamushonshomeire, baamumaraho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:25">N'ahu atwire baahahindura amatongo.<verse eid="JER 10:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JER 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda na Yerusaalemu okufubirwa ahabw'okwita endagaano ya MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 11:1" />Ekigambo kikaruga ahari MUKAMA, kyaija ahari Yeremia nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 11:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:3">2 Bag 23:3</ref>. </char></note> Hurira ebigambo byendagaano egi, ogambire Abayuda n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu oti: <verse eid="JER 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 11:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:26">Bir 27:26</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:10">Gal 3:10</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba naagira ati: Omuntu otarikuta mutima ha bigambo by'endagaano egi, akyeenwe; <verse eid="JER 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 11:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:22">Yer 7:22</ref>, <ref loc="JER 7:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Bir 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:3">Lev 26:3</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 26:12">12</ref>. </char></note> niyo ndagaano ei naaragiire baashwenkuriimwe, obu naabaiha omu nsi ya Misri, omu iziiko ry'ekyoma, ningira nti: Mugume muhurire eiraka ryangye, mukore ebi ndikubaragiira byona. Obwo nibwo muriba abantu bangye, naanye nkaba Ruhanga waanyu, <verse eid="JER 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 11:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:8">Kur 3:8</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:12">Bir 7:12</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 7:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 105:9">Zab 105:9</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 105:10">10</ref>. </char></note> mukabona kuhikiiriza endahiro ei naarahiire baashwenkuriimwe kubaha ensi y'amate n'obwoki, nk'oku kiri hati. Ntyo naamugarukamu nti: MUKAMA, kibe nikwo kyaba.<verse eid="JER 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 11:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 19:2">Yer 19:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi MUKAMA yangira ati: Ebigambo ebi byona obirangye omu ndembo za Yuda n'omu nguuto za Yerusaalemu, noogira oti: Muhurire ebigambo by'egi ndagaano, mubihikiirize; <verse eid="JER 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 11:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:25">Yer 7:25</ref>, <ref loc="JER 7:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:15">2 Bus 36:15</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba, obu naiha baashwenkuriimwe omu nsi ya Misri, nkabeehanangiriza munonga, naaguma nimbateisa obutoosha n'okuhitsya hati, nti: Muhurire eiraka ryangye. <verse eid="JER 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 11:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:17">Yer 3:17</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka tibaanyorobera n'obu kwakuba okutega amatu, kureka buri muntu yaakuratira obugangaazi bw'omutima gwe omubi. Nikyo naabareeteireho ebigambo byona eby'egi ndagaano, ebi naabaragiire kukora, kwonka batabikore.<verse eid="JER 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 11:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 22:15">Ezk 22:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA yaagaruka yangira ati: Omu bashaija ba Yuda n'omu batuuzi ba Yerusaalemu hareebekiremu obugomi. <verse eid="JER 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 11:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:16">Bir 31:16</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 31:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:8">Zab 78:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 79:8">79:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:18">Ezk 20:18</ref>. </char></note> Bagarukire enyima omu by'okushiisha bya baishenkurubo abaayangire kuhurira ebigambo byangye; mbwenu bakuratiire baaruhanga abandi kubaheereza; enju ya Israeli n'eya Yuda baitsire endagaano yangye, ei naaragaine na baishenkurubo. <verse eid="JER 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 11:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 1:28">Enf 1:28</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:15">Isa 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 8:18">Ezk 8:18</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo MUKAMA arikugirira ati: Reeba, naaza kubareetaho akabi, aku batarikubaasa kukira; n'obu barintakira, tindibahurira. <verse eid="JER 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 11:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:28">Yer 2:28</ref>. </char></note> Obwo ab'omu ndembo za Yuda n'abatwire omuri Yerusaalemu baryaza kutakira baaruhanga abu booterera obubaane; kwonka tibaribaasa kubajuna mu biro by'obusaasi bwabo. <verse eid="JER 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 11:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 9:10">Hos 9:10</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba iwe Yuda, nk'oku endembo zaawe zirikwingana, na baaruhanga baawe nikwo bari; kandi nk'oku enguuto za Yerusaalemu zirikwingana, nikwo n'amatambiro gaanyu gari, agu mwayombekyeire ekirikwitsa enshoni, nigo g'okwotereraho Baali obubaane.<verse eid="JER 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 11:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 7:16">Yer 7:16</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:26">Heb 10:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo otashabira aba bantu, n'obu kwakuba okwimutsya eiraka kubeeshengyerereza; ahabw'okuba ku barintakira omu biro by'obusaasi bwabo, tindibahurira. <verse eid="JER 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 11:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 2:14">Enf 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 16:25">Ezk 16:25</ref>. </char></note> Nkunzi yangye naakireetwa ki omu nju yangye, yaakozire n'abaingi ebihagaro? Noogira ngu eby'okuragaanisa noorahira n'enyama z'ebitambo nibibaasa kwihaho ekifubiro kyawe? Mbwenu noobaasa kwehimbisa, haza okozire ekibi? <verse eid="JER 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 11:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 52:8">Zab 52:8</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 14:6">Hos 14:6</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:17">Rom 11:17</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 11:20">20</ref>. </char></note> Ira MUKAMA akaba akwetsire omuzeituuni murungi oguyumbize, kandi ogwine ebijuma birungi, mbwenu ahabw'okuhoorera kw'omuyaga mwingi aryagwotsya, amataagi gaagwo gasiriire. <verse eid="JER 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 11:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:21">Yer 2:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:18">7:18</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA ow'amahe owaakubyaire, akucwereire orubanja rw'okuhikwaho akabi, naakutura ebibi ebi enju ya Israeli n'eya Yuda baakozire, bakangwisa kubi ahabw'okwoterera Baali obubaane.<verse eid="JER 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enaama y'aba Anatoosi y'okwita Yeremia, n'okufubirwa kwabo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 11:18" />MUKAMA akakimmanyisa, naakimanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:18">Bwanyima waanyoreka ebibi byabo, ebi barikukora.<verse eid="JER 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 11:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 18:18">Yer 18:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 83:4">Zab 83:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 53:7">Isa 53:7</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 53:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 3:60">Tonz 3:60</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka nkaba ndi nk'omwana gw'entaama omucureezi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:19">Ogurikutwarwa kwitwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:19">Tindamanyire ku niinye barikurwanisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:19">Nibangiira omu naama, nibagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:19">Ka tucwekyereze omuti n'ebijuma byagwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:19">Ka tumumareho omu nsi y'abahuriire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:19">Eiziina rye ritariijukwa obundi.<verse eid="JER 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 11:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 12:6">Yer 12:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 15:15">15:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:10">17:10</ref>, <ref loc="JER 17:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 20:12">20:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:57">Mat 13:57</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:23">Kush 2:23</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 21:18">Yos 21:18</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:7">1 Sam 16:7</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 30:10">30:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 7:9">Zab 7:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka ai MUKAMA ow'amahe, iwe ocwa emanja z'oburyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:20">Okagyeza emitima n'ebiteekateeko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:20">Bahoore nindeeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:20">Ahabw'okuba niiwe nyegyekyereire ebyangye.<verse eid="JER 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 11:21" />Nikyo MUKAMA arikugambira aha bantu ba Anatoosi abarikwenda kukwita, nibagira bati: Reka kuhanuura omu iziina rya MUKAMA, tutakaakwita, <verse eid="JER 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 11:22" />kandi nikyo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugirira ati: Reeba, ndyabafubira; abatsigazi baitwe rurara, abaana baabo b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki baitwe enjara, <verse eid="JER 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 11:23" />habure owaarokokaho; ahabw'okuba ndyareeta akabi ahari abo bantu b'omuri Anatoosi omu mwaka ogu barifubirirwamu.<verse eid="JER 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JER 12" />
  <para style="s1">Okwetonganira kw'abahikiriire ahabw'okureeba ababi nibahiirwa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 9:15">Ezr 9:15</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:6">Yob 12:6</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 21:7-15">21:7-15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 73:3-12">Zab 73:3-12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 92:7">92:7</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 1:13">Hab 1:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:15">Mal 3:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai MUKAMA, n'obu ndikukwetomboitera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:1">Ori ohikiriire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:1">Kwonka nkaayenzire kwetonganira omu maisho gaawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:1">Ahabw'enki ababi bahiirwa omu mihanda yaabo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:1">Ahabw'enki endeebya zoona ziba gye?<verse eid="JER 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 12:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 29:13">Isa 29:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niiwe obabyara, bakatsimba emizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:2">Bakakura, bakaana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:2">Tobaruga ha rurimi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:2">Haza emitima yaabo ekuri hare.<verse eid="JER 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 12:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 17:3">Zab 17:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 139:1">139:1</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:12">2 Pet 2:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka iwe MUKAMA, nommanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:3">Ondeeba kandi omanya oku omutima gwangye gwemi ahariiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:3">Bahuruutureyo nk'entaama ezirikuza kubaagwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:3">Obabiikire eizooba ry'okwitirwaho.<verse eid="JER 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 12:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:25">Yer 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="JER 9:10">9:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:16">23:16</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 4:3">Hos 4:3</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:22">Rom 8:22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:34">Zab 107:34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu ensi eryahitsya hi n'okucura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">N'obunyaatsi bw'omuri buri ishwa kuhotoka?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">Amatungo n'ebirikuguruka biryamarwaho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">Ahabw'obubi bw'abagitwiremu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">Ahabw'okuba abantu bakagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">Tarireeba muheru gwaitu.<verse eid="JER 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 12:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 49:19">Yer 49:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 3:15">Yos 3:15</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 11:3">Zek 11:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku oraabe wairukire n'ab'amaguru, bakakurusya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:5">Noobaasa ota kuhakana n'embaraasi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:5">Ku oraabe nooremwa ori omu nsi y'obusingye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:5">Oryagira ota omu bishaka bya Yorudani ebikwataine.<verse eid="JER 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 12:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 9:4">Yer 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 11:19">11:19</ref>, <ref loc="JER 11:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 26:25">Enf 26:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba beene sho n'ab'enju ya sho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:6">Nabo bakureebize;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:6">Nibakuyombera enyima, bakubingire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:6">N'obu barikugambira gye, otaribeesiga.<verse eid="JER 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 12:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 11:15">Yer 11:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ntsigireho eka yangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:7">N'obuhunguzi bwangye naabureka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:7">Nkunzi yangye y'aha mara</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:7">Naamuhayo omu mikono y'abazigu be.<verse eid="JER 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 12:8" />Obuhunguzi bwangye bumpindukiire entare y'omu kibira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:8">Bwaimutsya eiraka ryabwo, bwantontomera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:8">Nikyo ndikubwangira.<verse eid="JER 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 12:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 7:33">Yer 7:33</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 56:9">Isa 56:9</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 39:17">Ezk 39:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Beitu shi, obuhunguzi bwangye bumbeereire empungu y'amabara?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:9">Agandi mahanga agabwehinguririize nigaburwanisa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:9">Mugyende, muteerane enyamaishwa zoona ez'omu ishwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:9">Muzireete, zishonshomere.<verse eid="JER 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 12:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:8">Yer 2:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 6:3">6:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:18">Isa 63:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abariisa baingi basiisire omusiri gwangye gw'emizaabibu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:10">Baaribatiirira omugabo gwangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:10">Omugabo gwangye murungi baagugira eihamba eritatuurwamu.<verse eid="JER 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 12:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:25">Isa 42:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baguhindwire amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:11">Niguntakira ahabw'okushoberwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:11">Ensi yoona ehindwirwe amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:11">Kwonka tihariho muntu n'omwe okyetaireho.<verse eid="JER 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 12:12" />Abahwerekyerezi baizire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:12">Aha bibungo by'emparamaata eby'omu ihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:12">Ahabw'okuba rurara ya MUKAMA neerya busha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:12">Okuruga aha rubaju rumwe rw'ensi okuhika aha rundi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:12">Tihariho kiine omubiri kyona ekiine obusingye.<verse eid="JER 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 12:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:8">Yer 4:8</ref>, <ref loc="JER 4:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 55:2">Isa 55:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:38">Bir 28:38</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 1:12">Tonz 1:12</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 4:11">4:11</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:15">Mik 6:15</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 2:13">Hab 2:13</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 1:6">Hag 1:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Babiba engano, bashaaruura amahwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:13">Beerusya, babura eki baihamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:13">Ebi basharwire biryabakwatsa enshoni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:13">Ahabw'ekiniga kingi kya MUKAMA.<verse eid="JER 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekifubiro ky'abarikushiisha obuhunguzi bwa Mukama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 12:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 137:7">Zab 137:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:1-17">Ezk 25:1-17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba ahari bataahi bangye boona ababi, abarikukora aha buhunguzi obu naahaire abantu bangye Israeli kuba obwabo, naagira ati: Reeba, ndyabarandura omu nsi yaabo, n'enju ya Yuda nayo ngibaranduremu. <verse eid="JER 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 12:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 48:47">Yer 48:47</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:6">49:6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku ndiheza kubarandura, ndyagaruka mbagirire esaasi, mbagarure, buri muntu agarukye omu buhunguzi bwe n'omu butaka bwe. <verse eid="JER 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 12:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:2">Yer 4:2</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:5">1 Pet 2:5</ref>. </char></note> Kandi obunaku ku burihika, baayezirika kutooreza emicwe y'abantu bangye okurahira eiziina ryangye bati: Nindahira MUKAMA ohuriire, nk'oku baayegyeise abantu bangye kurahira Baali, obwo baryahamibwa omu bantu bangye. <verse eid="JER 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 12:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:12">Isa 60:12</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka eihanga ryona ku riryanga kuhurira, ndyarirandurira kimwe, ndicwekyereze; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 12:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JER 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia okuheebwa akamanyiso k'orukoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 13:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 21:11">Byak 21:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA yangambiire naagira ati: Irooko ogure orukoba rwa kitaani, orwezirikise, kwonka otarujabika omu maizi. <verse eid="JER 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 13:2" />Ntyo naagura orukoba, naarwezirikisa nk'ekigambo kya MUKAMA oku kyabaire kiri. <verse eid="JER 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 13:3" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyanyijaho obwa kabiri nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 13:4" />Twara orwo rukoba oru oguzire, oru oyezirikiise, oimukye oze Para, orusherekye omu nonko y'orukiri. <verse eid="JER 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 13:5" />Ntyo naagyenda, naarushereka haihi na Para, nk'oku MUKAMA yandagiira. <verse eid="JER 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 13:6" />Ebiro bingi ku byahingwireho, MUKAMA yangira ati: Imuka ogarukye Para, oiheyo orukoba oru naakuragiire kusherekayo. <verse eid="JER 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 13:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 18:4">Yer 18:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 15:4">Ezk 15:4</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 15:5">5</ref>. </char></note> Naanye nikwo kugaruka Para, nkacukura, nkaiha orwo rukoba ahu naabaire ndusherekire. Kandi reeba, orwo rukoba rukaba rusiisikaire, rutakiine mugasho.<verse eid="JER 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 13:8" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 13:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:19">Lev 26:19</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Okwo nikwo ndishiisha amaryo ga Yuda n'amaryo ga Yerusaalemu agarengyesereize. <verse eid="JER 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 13:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:17">Yer 3:17</ref>. </char></note> Eihanga eri eribi eririkwanga kuhurira ebigambo byangye, abantu abarikukuratira ebi emitima yaabo egangaire erikwenda, bakakuratira baaruhanga abandi kubaheereza n'okubaramya, baryaba nk'orwo rukoba orutakiine mugasho. <verse eid="JER 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 13:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 33:9">Yer 33:9</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 19:5">Kur 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 3:20">Zef 3:20</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba nk'oku orukoba ruhamira omuntu omu bwezirikiro, nikwo naayehamiizeho enju ya Israeli yoona n'eya Yuda yoona, ngu bambeere eihanga, eiziina ery'okumpimbisisa, n'okumpaisa ekitiinisa; kwonka baayanga kuhurira.<verse eid="JER 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 13:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 48:12">Yer 48:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo oraabagambirire eki kigambo noogira oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba naagira ati: Buri njoga neija kwijuzibwa viinyo; kandi nabo nibaija kukugira bati: Noogira ngu itwe titurikumanya ku buri njoga erikwija kwijuzibwa viinyo? <verse eid="JER 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 13:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:20">Yer 17:20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 18:18">18:18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 19:3">19:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:2">22:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 23:33">Ezk 23:33</ref>. </char></note> Naiwe obagire oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, niinyija kusindiza kimwe abatwire omu nsi egi boona, abagabe abashutami aha kitebe kya Daudi, abanyamurwa, baanabi n'abatuuzi b'omuri Yerusaalemu boona, <verse eid="JER 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 13:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 19:10">Yer 19:10</ref>, <ref loc="JER 19:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:9">Zab 2:9</ref>. </char></note> mbahondanise, buri muntu na mugyenzi we, abaana na baishebo. Tindikwija kubasaasira, nari okubareka, n'obu kwakuba okubagirira esaasi, ngu ntabahwerekyereza; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 13:15" />Muhurire, kandi mutegye amatu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:15">Murekye amaryo, ahabw'okuba MUKAMA niwe yaagamba.<verse eid="JER 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 13:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 7:19">Yos 7:19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 5:30">Isa 5:30</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:22">8:22</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:10">Yoh 11:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muhe MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu ekitiinisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">Atakareetsire mwirima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">Ebigyere byanyu bitakateereire ntsibo aha bibungo omu rwita-waabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">Kandi, mukiba nimusherura okuhweza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">Akakuhindura ekicuucu kya rufu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">Kukaba omwirima ndindindi.<verse eid="JER 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 13:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 9:1">Yer 9:1</ref>, <ref loc="JER 9:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 14:17">14:17</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 1:16">Tonz 1:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka ku muraayangye kuhurira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:17">Omutima gwangye nigwija kuririra omu mubonano</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:17">Nindizibwa amaryo gaanyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:17">Niinyija kurira munonga, amarira nigampimintika omu maisho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:17">Ahabw'okuba obusyo bwa MUKAMA bunyagirwe.<verse eid="JER 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 13:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 22:26">Yer 22:26</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:12">2 Bag 24:12</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 5:16">Tonz 5:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Gambira omugabe na nyina, noogira oti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:18">Mwecureeze, mushutame ahansi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:18">Ahabw'okuba ebirunga byanyu ebirungi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:18">Bibarugire aha mitwe.<verse eid="JER 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 13:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 6:1">Yos 6:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Endembo z'omuri Negebu zikingirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:19">Tihariho w'okuziigura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:19">Abayuda batwairwe omu bukwatwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:19">Baatwarirwa kimwe.<verse eid="JER 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 13:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 1:13">Yer 1:13</ref>, <ref loc="JER 1:14">14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Munagye amaisho, mureebe abareetwa aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:20">obusyo bwawe buri oburungi, obu waabaire ohairwe, burahi?<verse eid="JER 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 13:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:18">Isa 13:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oryagamba ki ku barikutegyekyesa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:21">Abu waayegyeise, bakaba banywani baawe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:21">Torikwatwa obusaasi, nk'obw'omukazi orikurumwa kuzaara?<verse eid="JER 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 13:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:19">Yer 5:19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 3:17">Isa 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 1:8">Tonz 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 3:5">Nah 3:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ku oraagire omu mutima gwawe oti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:22">Ahabw'enki ebi byona bimpikireho?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:22">Eby'okushiisha byawe ebirengyesereize</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:22">Nibyo bireeteire ekipumpuriya kyawe kuhenuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:22">okufa kubi, obubisha bukakubonabonesa.<verse eid="JER 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 13:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 19:26">Mat 19:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omunyesiopia naabaasa kuhindura omubiri gwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:23">Nari engwe kuhindura amabara gaayo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:23">Kuri ekyo nikibaasika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:23">Naimwe abamanyiire kukora kubi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:23">Mukaabaasize kukora kurungi.<verse eid="JER 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 13:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 1:4">Zab 1:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo ndibataataanisiza nk'ebishushunga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:24">Ebirikutwarwa omuyaga gw'omu ihamba.<verse eid="JER 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 13:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:32">Yer 2:32</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 20:29">Yob 20:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebyo nigwo mugabo gwawe ogu naakuteekateekyeire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:25">Ahabw'okuunyebwa, okeesiga ebishuba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:25">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 13:26" />Nyowe nyenka nikyo ndihenurira ekipumpuriya kyawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:26">Nkakikuhitsya aha buso, enshoni zaawe zikareebwa.<verse eid="JER 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 13:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:20">Yer 2:20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:8">5:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:16">Isa 1:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 24:13">Ezk 24:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndeebire ebihagaro byawe, obushambani bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:27">N'eiraka ry'obwamaraaya bwawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:27">Ebi okoreire omu ishwa aha bibungo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:27">Oryakareeba, iwe Yerusaalemu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:27">Oryahitsya hi n'okwanga kwezibwa?<verse eid="JER 13:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JER 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia okuragura aha njara, n'okweshengyerereza Abayuda ahari Mukama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 14:1" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikaija ahari Yeremia ahabw'omushana mwingi gw'ekyanda, nikigira kiti:<verse eid="JER 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 14:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 3:26">Isa 3:26</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 1:4">Tonz 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 2:8">2:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yuda neecura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:2">Omu marembo gaayo abantu nibagwa enshazi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:2">Abantu baayo nibatongyeza ahansi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:2">N'okuborooga kwa Yerusaalemu kuhikire ahaiguru.<verse eid="JER 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 14:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 15:30">2 Sam 15:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abakungu baayo nibatuma abambari baabo amaizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:3">Bakihika aha maziba, bashanga amaizi gatarimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:3">Bagaruka enyungu zaabo zirimu busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:3">Baine enshoni bashobeirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:3">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">14:3 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Omu Ruheburaayo, bashwekire emitwe. </char>
    </note>Beekoreire emikono.<verse eid="JER 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 14:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 3:3">Yer 3:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abahingi baine enshoni, beekoreire emikono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:4">Ahabw'ensi kugangabuka, ebuzire enjura.<verse eid="JER 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 14:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 29:9">Zab 29:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'empara neetsiga abaana baayo omu ishwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:5">Yaaheza kubazaara, ahabw'okubura obunyaatsi.<verse eid="JER 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 14:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:24">Yer 2:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enturegye nizeemerera aha bibungo by'emparamaata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:6">Zihaahagira nk'emishega;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:6">Amaisho gazigwire omunda ahabw'okubura obunyaatsi.<verse eid="JER 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 14:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 14:21">Yer 14:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 25:11">Zab 25:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu eby'okushiisha byaitu biraabe nibitushinja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:7">Ai MUKAMA, kora ahabw'eiziina ryawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:7">Ahabw'okuba okugaruka enyima kwaitu ni kwingi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:7">Tukakucumuraho.<verse eid="JER 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 14:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 17:13">Yer 17:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:7">50:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 71:5">Zab 71:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe matsiko ga Israeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:8">Omujuna omu biro by'enaku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:8">Okaahindukiire ki nk'omunyaihanga omu nsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:8">Nk'omugyenzi okiikama kuraara bwaira?<verse eid="JER 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 14:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:121">Zab 119:121</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:1">Isa 59:1</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:18">Dan 9:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okaahindukiire ki nk'omuntu oshobeirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:9">Nk'emanzi eremirwe kujuna?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:9">Ai MUKAMA, n'obu kiraabe kiri kityo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:9">Ori omuriitwe, nitwetererwa eiziina ryawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:9">Otatutsigaho.<verse eid="JER 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 14:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 8:13">Hos 8:13</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 9:9">9:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba ahari aba bantu naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:10">Okwo nikwo baayenzire kurara</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:10">Batabandame hamwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:10">Nikyo MUKAMA atarikubaikiririza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:10">Aryaijuka eby'okushiisha byabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:10">Abafubire ahabw'ebibi byabo.<verse eid="JER 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 14:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 7:16">Yer 7:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi MUKAMA yangira ati: Reka kushabira abo bantu ebirungi. <verse eid="JER 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 14:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:20">Yer 6:20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 16:4">16:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 24:10">24:10</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:28">Enf 1:28</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 8:18">Ezk 8:18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 14:21">14:21</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 3:4">Mik 3:4</ref>. </char></note> N'obu baraayesiibyekwo, tindikwija kuhurira kutaka kwabo; kandi n'obu barampongyere ebitambo by'okwotsya n'empongano z'esaano, tindikwija kubyakiira; kureka ndyabamaraho na rurara n'enjara n'orufu.<verse eid="JER 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 14:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:10">Yer 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 6:14">6:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima naagira nti: Ai bambe, Mukama RUHANGA, reeba, baanabi nibabagira bati: Timurikwija kwitwa rurara, n'obu kwakuba okuteerwa enjara; kureka ndyabaheera obusingye obwa nyamazima omuri ogu mwanya. <verse eid="JER 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 14:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:31">Yer 5:31</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:21">23:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 27:9">27:9</ref>, <ref loc="JER 27:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:20">Bir 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 13:6">Ezk 13:6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:15">Mat 7:15</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yangira ati: Baanabi abo nibahanuura ebishuba omu iziina ryangye; tiinye mbatumire, tiinye mbaragiire, n'obu kwakuba okubagambira. Nibabahanuurira okworekwa kw'ebishuba, baragura ebitaine mutambo, n'obugobya bw'omu mitima yaabo. <verse eid="JER 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 14:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:34">Yer 23:34</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo MUKAMA arikugambira aha bya baanabi abarikuhanuura omu iziina ryangye, haza ntabatumire, bakagira bati: Rurara n'enjara tibiriteera egi nsi; naagira ati: Baanabi abo nibaija kumarwaho rurara n'ejara; <verse eid="JER 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 14:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 79:3">Zab 79:3</ref>. </char></note> n'abantu abu baanabi barikuhanuurira baryanagwa omu nguuto za Yerusaalemu, nibaitwa enjara na rurara, babure kiziika, bo n'abakazi baabo n'abatabani baabo kandi na bahara baabo; ahabw'okuba ndyabashukaho obubi bwabo.<verse eid="JER 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 14:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 8:21">Yer 8:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 10:19">10:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 13:17">13:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:31">Yer 5:31</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 7:15">Ezk 7:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi oryabagambira ekigambo eki, noogira oti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:17">K'amaisho gangye gahimintikye amarira</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:17">Nyomushana na nyekiro, garekye kwoma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:17">Ahabw'okuba abantu bangye bateirwe munonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:17">Baahutaazibwa obuhuta buhango.<verse eid="JER 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 14:18" />Ku ndikuza omu ishwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">Nshangayo abaitsirwe rurara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">Ku ndikuza omu rurembo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">Nshangamu abarembiibwe enjara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">Ahabw'okuba baanabi n'abanyamurwa nibazengyerera omu nsi egi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">Bataine ki barikumanya.<verse eid="JER 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 14:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 8:15">Yer 8:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 15:18">15:18</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 5:22">Tonz 5:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Beitu oyangiire kimwe Yuda?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">Omutima gwawe gutamirwe Saayuuni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">Otuteereire ki, tukabura kutambirwa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">Tukategyereza obusingye, titwabona karungi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">Twategyereza okutambirwa, haija okushoberwa.<verse eid="JER 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 14:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 106:6">Zab 106:6</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:5">Dan 9:5</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 9:8">8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai MUKAMA, twemeire obubi bwaitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:20">N'eby'okushiisha bya baatatenkuriitwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:20">Ahabw'okuba tukakucumuraho.<verse eid="JER 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 14:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 10:15">Yer 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:45">Zab 106:45</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otatutamirwa kimwe, ahabw'eiziina ryawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:21">Otakwatsa enshoni ekitebe kyawe ky'ekitiinisa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:21">Ijuka endagaano ei waaragaine naitwe, otagiita.<verse eid="JER 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 14:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:9">Yob 12:9</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 38:26">38:26</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 38:28">28</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:2">Isa 66:2</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 10:1">Zek 10:1</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 10:2">2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuri baaruhanga b'abanyamahanga b'ebishuba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:22">Harimu owaakubaasa kugwisa enjura?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:22">Nari eiguru ahabwaryo niribaasa kugwisa enjura y'orutoonyerera?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:22">Tiiwe MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:22">Niiwe twineho amatsiko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:22">Ahabw'okuba ebyo byona niiwe obikora.<verse eid="JER 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JER 15" />
  <para style="s1">Abayuda okuhanuurirwa ebifubiro ebiribahikaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 15:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 15:19">Yer 15:19</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 7:9">1 Sam 7:9</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 8:6">8:6</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 12:23">12:23</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:11">15:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 99:6">Zab 99:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:23">106:23</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 14:14">Ezk 14:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima MUKAMA yangira ati: N'obu Musa na Samueli baakuunyemerera omu maisho, omutima gwangye tigukaagaruka hari aba bantu. Obaanyihe omu maisho, bagyende! <verse eid="JER 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 15:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:12">Yer 14:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 5:12">Ezk 5:12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku baraakubuuze bati: Tuze hi? Obagire oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">Ab'okwitwa rufu, baitwe rufu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:2">Ab'okwitwa rurara, baitwe rurara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">Ab'okwitwa enjara, baitwe enjara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:2">N'ab'okutwarwa omu bukwatwa, batwarwe.<verse eid="JER 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 15:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 28:26">Bir 28:26</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:16-22">Lev 26:16-22</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:8">Kush 6:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi MUKAMA yaagira ati: Niinyija kubateeraho okucwekyerezibwa omu miringo ena, rurara y'okubaita, embwa z'okubataanyagura, amahungu g'omu mwanya n'enyamaishwa z'omu ihamba by'okugaashuura n'okubamaraho. <verse eid="JER 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 15:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 24:9">Yer 24:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:18">29:18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 34:17">34:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:25">Bir 28:25</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 21:11">2 Bag 21:11</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyabahindura eky'okutiinisa amahanga g'abagabe boona ab'omu nsi nimbatura ebi Manaase mwene Hezekia omugabe wa Yuda yaakoreire Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="JER 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 15:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 51:19">Isa 51:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe Yerusaalemu, n'oha oraakugirire esaasi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:5">Nari shi, n'oha oraakucurire?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:5">N'oha oraayerusye kukiikama</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:5">kukubuuza oku oraire?<verse eid="JER 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 15:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 7:24">Yer 7:24</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:15">Bir 32:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati: Okanyanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:6">Waaguma noogaruka enyima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:6">Nikyo nkubangiriire omukono, nkakumaraho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:6">Ahabw'okuba okugumisiriza kunduhize.<verse eid="JER 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 15:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:3">Yer 5:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:13">Isa 9:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:24">30:24</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 4:6">Amo 4:6</ref>, <ref loc="AMO 4:8-11">8-11</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:12">Mat 3:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkabeeresa orugari omu marembo g'ensi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:7">Naabamaraho abaana, naacwekyereza abantu bangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:7">Kwonka tibaareka mitwarize yaabo mibi.<verse eid="JER 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 15:8" />Naabakanyisamu abafaakazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:8">Baaba baingi okukira omusheenyi gw'aha nyanja.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:8">Ndeeteire baanyina b'abatsigazi omuhwerekyerezi omu ihangwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:8">Naabareetera obusaasi n'obwoba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:8">Naabibagwisaho kitaraariire.<verse eid="JER 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 15:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 2:5">1 Sam 2:5</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 8:9">Amo 8:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Owaazaire mushanju ayehweire amatsiko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">Yaagwa enshazi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">Eizooba rye ryarenga butakaizire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">Akwatsirwe enshoni, yaabwerabwera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">Kandi abahonokireho ndyabacwekyerereza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">Omu maisho g'abazigu baabo na rurara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okuraganisa Yeremia okurindwa abazigu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 15:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 20:14">Yer 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 22:25">Kur 22:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai bambe maawe, okanzaarira ki ndi omushaija w'empaka n'entongane aha b'omu nsi egi boona! Tihariho u ndagurize, kandi tihariho u ndeegurizeho; kwonka boona nibanjuma. <verse eid="JER 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 15:11" />Ai MUKAMA, nkaashemereire kujunwa, kuri ntarakweshengyereize kubakorera ebirungi, nari kukweshengyereza kubakiza abazigu omu biro by'enkaku n'omu biro by'obusaasi! <verse eid="JER 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 15:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:13">Yer 1:13</ref>. </char></note> Hariho omuntu owaakubaasa kuhenda ekyoma, ekyoma ekirikuruga aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, akahenda n'omuringa?<verse eid="JER 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 15:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 17:3">Yer 17:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 44:12">Zab 44:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebintu byawe n'obutungi bwawe ndyabihayo kuba eminyago, bitaine ki biguzirwe, babimare omu nsi yaawe yoona, ninkutura ebibi byawe byona. <verse eid="JER 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 15:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:16">Yer 9:16</ref>; <ref loc="JER 16:3">16:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:4">17:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:28">22:28</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:22">Bir 32:22</ref>. </char></note> Ndyabareetera kuheerereza abazigu baawe omu nsi i otarikumanya; ahabw'okuba omuriro ogwakiibwe ekiniga kyangye guryaguma nigwaka ebiro byona.<verse eid="JER 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 15:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 11:20">Yer 11:20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 12:3">12:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:7">Zab 69:7</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 16:28">Bar 16:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai MUKAMA, niiwe orikumanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:15">Onyijukye, ontaayaayire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:15">Ompoorere enzigu abarikumpiiga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:15">Ahabw'okugumisiriza kwawe otaanyihaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:15">Omanye ku ndikujumwa ninturwa iwe ahabwawe.<verse eid="JER 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 15:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 14:9">Yer 14:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:11">Zab 119:11</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 119:162">162</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 3:1">Ezk 3:1</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 3:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="REV 10:9">Kush 10:9</ref>, <ref loc="REV 10:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebigambo byawe bikaboneka, naabirya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:16">Byambeera okushemererwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:16">N'okunanuka kw'omu mutima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:16">Ahabw'okuba niinyetererwa eiziina ryawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:16">MUKAMA Ruhanga ow'amahe.<verse eid="JER 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 15:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 102:7">Zab 102:7</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 3:28">Tonz 3:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tindashutamire mu mutwe gw'abantu abarikwesiima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:17">Kandi naanye tindashemereirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:17">Kureka nkashutama nyenka ahabw'omukono gwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:17">Ahabw'okuba okanyijuza okuguubwa kubi.<verse eid="JER 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 15:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 30:15">Yer 30:15</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 34:6">Yob 34:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'enki obusaasi bwangye butatuuza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:18">N'obuhuta bwangye butatambwa, bukanga kukira?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:18">Noija kumbeera nk'akagyera akarikubeiha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:18">N'amaizi agarikwoma?<verse eid="JER 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 15:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 3:14">Yer 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 15:1">15:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo MUKAMA arikugirira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">Ku oraagarukye, niinyija kukugarura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">Obone kuunyemerera omu maisho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">Ku oraataanise eby'omugasho n'ebitagwine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">Oryaba nk'akanwa kangye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">Baryakugarukira, kwonka iwe toribagarukira.<verse eid="JER 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 15:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 1:8">Yer 1:8</ref>, <ref loc="JER 1:18">18</ref>, <ref loc="JER 1:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 20:11">20:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahari abo bantu ndyakugira orugo orwombekyeise emiringa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:20">Baryakurwanisa, kwonka tibarikubaasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:20">Ahabw'okuba ndi hamwe naiwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:20">Kukukiza n'okukwiha omu mikono yaabo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:20">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 15:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 29:5">Yer 29:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyakujuna nkwihe omu mikono y'ababi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:21">Nkucungure, orugye omu mikono y'abarikutiinisa.<verse eid="JER 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JER 16" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia okumanyisa okuhana kwa Mukama n'embabazi ze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 16:1" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 16:2" />Otarishwera omukazi, kandi otarizaarira abaana b'aboojo n'aba'abaishiki omu mwanya ogu. <verse eid="JER 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 16:3" />Ahabw'okuba oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba aha baana ba'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki abarizaarirwa omu mwanya ogu, n'ahari baanyinabo na baishebo abaabazaariire omu nsi egi, naagira ati: <verse eid="JER 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 16:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:33">Yer 7:33</ref>; <ref loc="JER 8:2">8:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 14:12">14:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 15:2">15:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:18">22:18</ref>, <ref loc="JER 22:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:33">25:33</ref>. </char></note> Baryafa baitwe endwara ezirikwita. Tihariho oribacurira nari oribaziika; emitumbi yaabo eryaba nka'amasha aha itaka. Baryahwerekyerezibwa rurara n'enjara; kandi emitumbi yaabo eryaba egabo y'amahungu g'omu mwanya n'enyamaishwa z'omu ihamba.<verse eid="JER 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 16:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 24:16-23">Ezk 24:16-23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Otaritaaha omu nju omu barikucurira, otariza kubatongyeza, n'obu kwakuba okubaririra; ahabw'okuba obusingye bwangye n'embabazi n'esaasi mbiihire ahari abo bantu; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 16:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:20">Yob 1:20</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:28">Lev 19:28</ref>. </char></note> Abakuru n'abato baryafeera omuri egi nsi hatariho mutaano; tibariziikwa, kandi tihariho oribacurira n'obu kwakuba okweshara nari okumwa enkomborora ahabwabo. <verse eid="JER 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 16:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 26:14">Bir 26:14</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 9:4">Hos 9:4</ref>. </char></note> Tihariho baribegyera ori omu rufu omugaati kumuyaagira ahabw'okufeerwa; kandi tibariha ofeereirwe ishe nari nyina ekikopo ky'amaizi kumugwisa gye. <verse eid="JER 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 16:8" />Kandi otaritaaha omu nju omu barikuriira obugyenyi kushutama nabo kurya n'okunywa; <verse eid="JER 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 16:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:34">Yer 7:34</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, ndyahunamya amaraka gw'okwesiima n'okushemererwa, erya kishwera n'erya kishwerwa omu mwanya ogu, mukiriho nimureeba.<verse eid="JER 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 16:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:19">Yer 5:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 13:10">13:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ku origambira abantu aba ebigambo ebyo byona, nabo baakubuuza bati: N'enki ekireeteire MUKAMA kutugambaho obubi obwo bwona obuhango oburitubaho? Naatutura ki? Ni kibi ki eki twacumwire ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu? <verse eid="JER 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 16:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 22:17">2 Bag 22:17</ref>. </char></note> Naiwe oryabagarukamu oti: Kireetsirwe baashwenkuriimwe abaanyimwire, bakakuratira baaruhanga abandi, bakabaheereza, bakabaramya, bakantsigaho, batoorobere biragiro byangye; <verse eid="JER 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 16:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:17">Yer 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:26">7:26</ref>. </char></note> kandi naimwe mukirize baashwenkuriimwe abo kukora kubi, ahabw'okuba buri muntu weena omuriimwe naakuratira ebibi by'omu mutima gwe gw'obugangaazi naayanga kumpurira. <verse eid="JER 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 16:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:14">Yer 15:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:26">22:26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:26-28">Bir 4:26-28</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:36">28:36</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 28:64">64</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 28:65">65</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo ndibabingira omuri egi nsi, mukaza omu nsi ei mutakamanyaga n'obu baakuba baashwenkuriimwe, kandi okwo niyo muriheererereza baaruhanga abandi nyomushana na nyekiro; ahabw'okuba tindibagirira mbabazi.<verse eid="JER 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 16:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:2">Yer 4:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:7">23:7</ref>, <ref loc="JER 23:8">8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi MUKAMA nagira ati: Reeba, obunaku buryahika, obu batarigaruka kugira bati: Nindahira MUKAMA ohuriire owaihire Abaisraeli omu nsi ya Misri; <verse eid="JER 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 16:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:18">Yer 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 24:6">24:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 30:3">30:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:37">32:37</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:5">Isa 43:5</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 43:6">6</ref>. </char></note> kureka bagira bati: Nindahira MUKAMA ohuriire owaihire Abaisraeli omu nsi y'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho n'omu nsi zoona ei yaabaire ababingiire; ahabw'okuba ndyabagarura omu nsi yaabo y'obuzaarwa ei naahaire baishenkurubo.<verse eid="JER 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 16:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 12:13">Ezk 12:13</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 4:2">Amo 4:2</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 1:15">Hab 1:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi MUKAMA naagira ati: Reeba, naaza kutuma abajubi baingi baije babajube, bwanyima y'ebyo ndyatuma abahiigi baingi, baije babahiigye ahari buri rushozi n'ahari buri kibungo n'omu nyanga z'amabaare. <verse eid="JER 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 16:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:19">Yer 32:19</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 16:9">2 Bus 16:9</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 34:21">Yob 34:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 51:9">Zab 51:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 90:8">90:8</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba amaisho gangye ngataire aha mitwarize yaabo yoona; tensherekirwe, n'eby'okushiisha byabo tibisherekirwe, ngu ntabireeba. <verse eid="JER 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 16:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:2">Isa 40:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:4">65:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 43:7-9">Ezk 43:7-9</ref>. </char></note> Eby'okushiisha byabo n'ekibi kyabo ndyabibazimuurira kabiri, ahabw'okuba bakahagaza ensi yangye emitumbi y'ebishushani byabo ebirikunugwa, obuhunguzi bwangye baabwijuzamu ebihagaro byabo.<verse eid="JER 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 16:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 17:17">Yer 17:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 18:15">18:15</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 22:33">2 Sam 22:33</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Isa 9:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 25:4">25:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 49:22">22</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 49:23">23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai MUKAMA, maani gangye, ekigo kyangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">Kandi obuhungiro bwangye omu biro by'okubonabonesezibwamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">Amahanga garyakwijaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">Nigaruga aha mperu z'ensi, gagire gati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">Ebi baatatenkuriitwe baahungwire n'ebishuba bisha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">Ni busha, n'ebintu bitaine mugasho.<verse eid="JER 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 16:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:11">Yer 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 8:4">1 Kor 8:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimugira ngu omuntu akaayekorera baaruhanga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:20">Baaruhanga nk'abo ti baaruhanga!<verse eid="JER 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 16:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 33:2">Yer 33:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo reeba, ndyabamanyisa; aha murundi ogu niinyija kubamanyisa obushoboorozi bwangye n'amaani gangye, nabo bamanye ku eiziina ryangye ndi Yehova.<verse eid="JER 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JER 17" />
  <para style="s1">Omugisha gw'orikwesiga MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 17:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 27:2">Kur 27:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:21">Bir 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 19:24">Yob 19:24</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:27">Zab 118:27</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:3">Enf 3:3</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 7:3">7:3</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 3:3">2 Kor 3:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekibi kya Yuda kihandiikirwe n'ekaraamu y'ekyoma, n'akabaare k'arimaasi akashongoize; kyasharurwa aha kishate ky'omutima gwabo n'aha mahembe g'amatambiro gaabo, <verse eid="JER 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 17:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:20">Yer 2:20</ref>. </char></note> n'abaana baabo nibakiijuka amatambiro gaabo n'ebishushani byabo bya Ashera ebyabaire biba haihi na buri kiti kibisi ekyetwa omurinzi aha bibungo biraingwa, <verse eid="JER 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 17:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:3">Isa 2:3</ref>. </char></note> n'aha nshozi omu nsi z'obwerere. Obutungi bwawe n'ebintu byawe byona ebirungi ndyabihayo kuba eminyago omu nsi yaawe yoona nooturwa ekibi kyawe. <verse eid="JER 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 17:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:13">Yer 15:13</ref>, <ref loc="JER 15:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:22">Bir 32:22</ref>. </char></note> Naiwe wenka toriguma mu buhunguzi bwawe obu naakuhaire, kureka oryaheerereza abazigu baawe omu nsi ei otarikumanya; ahabw'okuba omuriro ogwakiibwe ekiniga kyangye guryaguma nigwaka ebiro byona.<verse eid="JER 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 17:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 32:8">2 Bus 32:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:3">Zab 146:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:5">Orikwesiga ondiijo muntu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:5">Akahindura omuntu-buntu eky'okumurinda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:5">Akaimuura MUKAMA omu mutima gwe, akyeenirwe.<verse eid="JER 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 17:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 29:32">Yer 29:32</ref>; <ref loc="JER 48:6">48:6</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 20:17">Yob 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 39:6">39:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 29:23">Bir 29:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ari nk'akashaka k'omu ihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:6">Kandi ekirungi kyona ekiriija tarikireeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:6">Kureka aryatuura omu myanya y'omu ihamba ekarangataine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:6">Omu nsi y'omwonyo etatuurwamu bantu.<verse eid="JER 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 17:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:12">Zab 2:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 71:5">71:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 125:1">125:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orikwesiga MUKAMA, kandi ou MUKAMA aba amatsiko ge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:7">Ahiiriirwe;<verse eid="JER 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 17:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 1:3">Zab 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 47:12">Ezk 47:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba ni nk'omuti ogubyairwe aha rubaju rw'amaizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">Ogurikutsimba emizi yaagwo haihi n'omugyera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">Tigutiina mushana gw'ekyanda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">Kureka amababi gaagwo gaguma nigabengyeya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">N'omu mwaka gw'omushana mwingi tigwemereza mutima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">Ahabw'okuba tigureka kwera bijuma.<verse eid="JER 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 17:9" />Omutima n'engobya okukira ebintu byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:9">Gwine endwara etarikutambwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:9">N'oha owaakubaasa kugumanya?<verse eid="JER 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 17:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 11:20">Yer 11:20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:19">32:19</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:7">1 Sam 16:7</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 28:9">1 Bus 28:9</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 34:11">Yob 34:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 139:23">Zab 139:23</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:27">Rom 8:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyowe MUKAMA niinye ncaaka ebiteekateeko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:10">Nkagyeza omutima</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:10">Nkazimuurira omuntu weena nk'emitwarize ye oku eri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:10">Nk'ebyana ebirugire omu bi akozire oku biri.<verse eid="JER 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 17:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 39:6">Zab 39:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 55:23">55:23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:20">Luk 12:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu weena atunga obutungi omu muringo gutari gw'amazima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:11">ni nk'endahi erikubumbatira abaana abu etazaire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:11">Obwo butungi buryamuhwaho akiri rwagati y'amagara ge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:11">Bwanyima aha muheru gwe abe omushema.<verse eid="JER 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 17:12" />Omwanya gwaitu ogurikwera n'ekitebe ky'obukama bw'ekitiinisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:12">Kikateebwa ahaiguru okuruga aha kutandika.<verse eid="JER 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 17:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 1:16">Yer 1:16</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:13">2:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 14:8">14:8</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:20">Yos 24:20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:28">Isa 1:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:20">Luk 10:20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:10">Yoh 4:10</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 4:14">14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai MUKAMA, matsiko ga Israeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:13">Abarikukwimuura boona baryakwatwa enshoni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:13">Abarikukurugaho baryahandiikwa omu nsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:13">ahabw'okuba baimwire MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:13">Enshuro y'amaizi g'amagara.<verse eid="JER 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 17:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 10:21">Bir 10:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 6:2">Zab 6:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ntambira, ai MUKAMA, nibwo ndaatambirwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:14">Njuna, nibwo ndaajunwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:14">Ahabw'okuba niiwe ky'okutiinisa kyangye.<verse eid="JER 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 17:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:19">Isa 5:19</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:4">2 Pet 3:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, nibangira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:15">Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kirahi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:15">Mbwenu nu nikiije!<verse eid="JER 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 17:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 40:9">Zab 40:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 139:4">139:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tindakugyemire kwohereza obubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:16">N'obu kwakuba okwetenga eizooba ry'akabi kwija,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:16">Noobimanya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:16">Ekyarugire omu kanwa kangye kikaba nikireetwa butunu omu maisho gaawe.<verse eid="JER 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 17:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 16:19">Yer 16:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otambeera eky'okutiinisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:17">Ori obuhungiro bwangye aha izooba ry'enaku.<verse eid="JER 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 17:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 11:20">Yer 11:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 35:4">Zab 35:4</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 35:8">8</ref>. </char>
    </note> K'abarikumpiiga bakwatwe enshoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">Kwonka nyowe zirekye kunkwata;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">Bo bahahaare omutima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">Kwonka ogwangye gurekye kuhahaara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">Obahitsyeho eizooba ry'akabi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">Obahwerekyereze kabiri.<verse eid="JER 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukama okwijutsya Abayuda ebya sabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 17:19" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA yangambiire naagira ati: Irooko oyemerere omu irembo rya Benyamiini, ahu abagabe ba Yuda bataahira n'ahu bashohorera, n'omu marembo goona aga Yerusaalemu, <verse eid="JER 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 17:20" />obagire oti: Imwe bagabe ba Yuda 'mwe, na Yuda yoona, n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu mwena abaraba omuri aga marembo, nimuhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA. <verse eid="JER 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 17:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:15-19">Neh 3:15-19</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Mwerinde, muteekorera omutwaro gwona aha izooba rya sabato, n'obu kwakuba okugurabya omu marembo ga Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="JER 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 17:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:12">Kur 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 31:13">31:13</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 15:32-36">Kub 15:32-36</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 56:2">Isa 56:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 58:13">58:13</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:12">Ezk 20:12</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 20:20">20</ref>. </char></note> Kandi mutashohoza omutwaro omu maka gaanyu aha izooba rya sabato, n'obu kwakuba okurikoreraho omurimo gwona, kureka mugume murinde eryo izooba kuba eririkwera, nk'oku naaragiire baashwenkuriimwe. <verse eid="JER 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 17:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:3">Yer 5:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:24">7:24</ref>, <ref loc="JER 7:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:51">Byak 7:51</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka tibarahuriire n'obu kwakuba okutega amatu, kureka bakagangaaza ebitsya, ngu barekye kuhurira n'obu kwakuba okwikiriza kwegyesibwa.<verse eid="JER 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 17:24" />Kandi MUKAMA naagira ati: Kwonka ku murampurire, mutaarabya mutwaro gwona omu marembo g'oru rurembo aha izooba rya sabato, kureka mwaririnda kuba eririkwera, mutaagira murimo gwona ogu mwarikoreraho, <verse eid="JER 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 17:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:4">Yer 22:4</ref>. </char></note> obwo abagabe abari aha ngoma ya Daudi baryataaha omu marembo g'oru rurembo bari omu bigaari by'orugamba n'aha mbaraasi, hamwe n'abanyiginya baabo n'abantu ba Yuda, n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu; kandi oru rurembo ruryagumaho ebiro byona. <verse eid="JER 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 17:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:1">Kut 13:1</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:12">Lev 7:12</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 22:29">22:29</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 33:16">2 Bus 33:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:22">Zab 107:22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 116:17">116:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:13">Yer 33:13</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 7:7">Zek 7:7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abantu baryaguma nibaruga omu ndembo za Yuda, n'omu myanya yoona eyehinguririize Yerusaalemu, omu ishaza rya Benyamiini omu mpita, omu nsi y'ebibungo, n'omuri Negebu, nibareeta ebitambo by'okwotsya n'ebindi bitambo, n'empongano z'esaano n'obubaane, kandi nibareeta empongano z'okusiima omu nju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="JER 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 17:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:20">Yer 7:20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:21">17:21</ref>, <ref loc="JER 17:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 21:14">21:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:13">52:13</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 4:11">Tonz 4:11</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:8">2 Bag 25:8</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 25:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku muraayangye kumpurira n'okurinda eizooba rya sabato riri eririkwera, mwaraba omu marembo ga Yerusaalemu aha izooba rya sabato mwekoreire emitwaro, obwo ndyatweka omuriro omu marembo gaayo, gwotsye zaanyaruju za Yerusaalemu, kandi tiguriraazibwa.<verse eid="JER 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JER 18" />
  <para style="s1">Enfumu y'omubumbi n'eki abumbire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 18:1" />Ekigambo ekyarugire ahari MUKAMA kikaija ahari Yeremia nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 18:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 19:1">Yer 19:1</ref>. </char></note> Imuka oshuume, oze ow'omubumbi, kandi okwo niyo ndaakugambirire ebigambo byangye. <verse eid="JER 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 18:3" />Ntyo naashuuma, naaza ow'omubumbi, naashanga naabumbisa enziga ye. <verse eid="JER 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 18:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 13:7">Yer 13:7</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:20-24">Rom 9:20-24</ref>. </char></note>Eki yaabaire naabumba omu ibumba kyasiisikarira omu ngaro ze; yaagaruka yaaribumbamu ekindi, nk'oku yaabaire naayenda. <verse eid="JER 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 18:5" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 18:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 10:9">Yob 10:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:9">Isa 45:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 64:8">64:8</ref>. </char></note> Imwe b'enju ya Israeli 'mwe, nimugira ngu tinkaabaasa kubagira nk'oku ogwo mubumbi yaagira eibumba? Reeba, nk'oku eibumba riri omu ngaro z'omubumbi, naimwe nikwo muri omu ngaro zangye, imwe nju ya Israeli 'mwe. <verse eid="JER 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 18:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:6">Yer 1:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 42:10">42:10</ref>. </char></note> Omu bunaku bwona obu ndigambiramu aha ihanga nari aha bugabe kurirandura, kurisheenya n'okuricwekyereza, <verse eid="JER 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 18:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 26:3">Yer 26:3</ref>, <ref loc="JER 26:13">13</ref>, <ref loc="JER 26:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 2:18">Bar 2:18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 18:21">Ezk 18:21</ref>; <ref loc="JON 3:10">Yon 3:10</ref>. </char></note> eryo ihanga eri ndiba naagambireho, ku ririhinduka, ryareka ebibi byaryo, naanye ndyayegarukamu, ndekye akabi aku mbaire niinyenda kurireetaho. <verse eid="JER 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 18:9" />Kandi omu bunaku obu ndigambiramu aha ihanga nari aha bugabe kuryombeka n'okuribyara, <verse eid="JER 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 18:10" />eryo ihanga kuririkora ebirikwangwa omu maisho gangye, ryayanga kuhurira eiraka ryangye, obwo ndyayefuuza, ndekye kukora ebirungi ebi mbaire niinyenda kurikorera. <verse eid="JER 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 18:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:3">Yer 7:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:5">25:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 35:15">35:15</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:13">2 Bag 17:13</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu irooko ogambire abantu ba Yuda n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, ninteekateeka kubareetaho akabi, kandi ncumire n'enaama y'okubarwanisa. Nyaabura 'mwe, nimugarukye, buri muntu arugye omu muhanda gwe omubi, mushemeze emitwarize yaanyu n'ebi murikukora.<verse eid="JER 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 18:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:25">Yer 2:25</ref>; <ref loc="JER 3:17">3:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka bo nibagira bati: Nooyeruhiza busha! Nitwija kukuratira enaama zaitu, buri muntu akuratire obugangaazi bw'omutima gwe omubi.<verse eid="JER 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 18:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:10">Yer 2:10</ref>, <ref loc="JER 2:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:30">5:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo MUKAMA arikugirira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:13">Mubuuririze omu mahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:13">Ku haraabe hariho orahuriire ebigambo nk'ebyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:13">Israeli akozire ekibi ky'eihano.<verse eid="JER 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 18:14" />Nimugira ngu ebirika bya Lebanooni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:14">Ebiri aha rukiri rw'omu ishwa biryabura?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:14">Nari shi amaizi agarikufuka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:14">Agarikuhimintika nigaruga hare garyayoma?<verse eid="JER 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 18:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:5">Yer 2:5</ref>, <ref loc="JER 2:13">13</ref>, <ref loc="JER 2:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="JER 6:16">6:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 57:14">Isa 57:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka abantu bangye banyebirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">Baayoterera baaruhanga b'ebishuba obubaane;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">Kandi kibareeteire kuteera entsibo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">omu mihanda yaabo eya ira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">Baatora obuhanda obw'aha rubaju,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">Baareka omuhanda rugyendwa,<verse eid="JER 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 18:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 19:8">Yer 19:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 29:8">2 Bus 29:8</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 16:4">Yob 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:7">Zab 22:7</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 2:15">Tonz 2:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:39">Mat 27:39</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baareetera ensi yaabo kuba erikutiinisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:16">N'ekintu ky'okweshaanya ebiro byona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:16">Orikugirabamu weena agyenda naashoberwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:16">Naazongoza omutwe.<verse eid="JER 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 18:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:27">Yer 2:27</ref>; <ref loc="JER 13:24">13:24</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 27:21">Yob 27:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 48:7">Zab 48:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 27:26">Ezk 27:26</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:15">Hos 13:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyabataataanisa omu maisho g'abazigu baabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:17">Nk'abarikuhunga omuyaga gw'oburugwa-izooba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:17">Aha izooba eri barigwererwaho akagwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:17">Ndyabateera amabega, tindireeba i bari.<verse eid="JER 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 18:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:8">Yer 2:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:13">5:13</ref>, <ref loc="JER 5:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="JER 6:13">6:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 9:3">9:3</ref>, <ref loc="JER 9:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 11:19">11:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 5:21">Yob 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 31:20">Zab 31:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima baagira bati: Mwije tugiire Yerusaalemu omu naama; ahabw'okuba ebiragiro tibiriruga ha munyamurwa, nari enaama kuruga aha munyabwengye, n'obu kyakuba ekigambo ahari nabi. Mwije tumubeiherere, tumushiishe, turekye kweta aha kigambo kye na kimwe.<verse eid="JER 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 18:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 35:1">Zab 35:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:25">Isa 49:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai MUKAMA, ompurire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:19">Ohurire amaraka g'abarikumpakanisa.<verse eid="JER 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 18:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 13:14">Neh 13:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 35:7">Zab 35:7</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 35:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 57:6">57:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:85">119:85</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekirungi nikizimuurirwa ekibi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:20">Kwonka bo bantimbiire obusya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:20">Ijuka oku mbaire niinyemerera omu maisho gaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:20">Kubatonganira, ngu mbaiheho ekiniga kyawe.<verse eid="JER 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 18:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 109:9">Zab 109:9</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 109:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo orekye abaana baabo baitwe enjara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:21">Kandi obaheyo, bamarweho rurara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:21">Abakazi baabo babe abamazire abaana, kandi abafaakazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:21">Abashaija baabo bamarweho orufu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:21">N'abatsigazi baabo baitirwe rurara omu rugamba.<verse eid="JER 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 18:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 140:5">Zab 140:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enduuru ehurirwe omu maka gaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:22">Ku oraabateeze ababisha kitaraariire!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:22">Ahabw'okuba bantimbiire obusya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:22">N'ebigyere byangye baabitega emiriiti.<verse eid="JER 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 18:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 4:5">Neh 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 35:22">Zab 35:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka iwe, MUKAMA, noomanya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:23">Enaama zaabo zoona ezi baanyiniire kuunyita.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:23">Otabasaasira eby'okushiisha byabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:23">N'obu kwakuba okuragaza ekibi kyabo omu maisho gaawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:23">Kureka bateezibwe entsibo, bakugwere kimwe omu maisho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:23">Kandi omu biro by'ekiniga kyawe ogire oku waabagira.<verse eid="JER 18:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JER 19" />
  <para style="s1">Akamanyiso k'orunywero rwatikire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 19:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 18:2">Yer 18:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 8:1">Ezk 8:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Irooko ogure orunywero aha mubumbi, otware bamwe aha bakuru b'eihanga, n'abandi aha banyamurwa abakuru, <verse eid="JER 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 19:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:8">Yos 15:8</ref>. </char></note> muze omu ruhanga rwa mwene Hinoomu, aharikutaahirwa omu Irembo ry'Engusyo, orangireyo ebigambo ebi ndaakugambire, <verse eid="JER 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 19:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 13:13">Yer 13:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:20">17:20</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 3:11">1 Sam 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 21:12">2 Bag 21:12</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 21:16">16</ref>. </char></note> noogira oti: Imwe bagabe ba Yuda 'mwe n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu, nimuhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA. Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, ndyareeta akabi omuri ogu mwanya, akarireetera amatu g'orikahurira weena kuteera enduuru. <verse eid="JER 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 19:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:6">Yer 1:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:13">17:13</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'abantu kuunyimuura, bakahagara ogu mwanya nibagusiisisa okugwotereramu baaruhanga abandi obubaane, abu batakamanyaga n'obu baakuba baishenkurubo nari abagabe ba Yuda, n'okugwijuza eshagama y'abataine rubanja, <verse eid="JER 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 19:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5, 6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:31">Yer 7:31</ref>, <ref loc="JER 7:32">32</ref>, <ref loc="JER 7:33">33</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:21">Lev 18:21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 17:3">Bir 17:3</ref>. </char></note> n'okwombekyera Baali emyanya mikuru y'okuramizamu, okurabizamu batabani baabo omu muriro kuba ebitambo by'okwotsya by'okutambira Baali, ebi ntararagiire n'obu kwakuba okutaho, kandi ebitakaijaga mu biteekateeko byangye; <verse eid="JER 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 19:6" />n'ahabw'ekyo, reeba, obunaku buryaija, obu ogu mwanya gutarigaruka kwetwa ogwa Tofeti, n'obu rwakuba oruhanga rwa mwene Hinoomu, kureka guryayetwa oruhanga rw'eriitiro; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 19:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:17">Lev 26:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 19:3">Isa 19:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omuri ogu mwanya enaama za Yuda na Yerusaalemu nimwo ndizicwera busha, nkareetera abantu baabo kwitirwa omu maisho g'abazigu baabo bakaitwa abarikubahiiga. Kandi emitumbi yaabo ndyagigaburira amahungu g'omu mwanya n'enyamaishwa z'omu ihamba. <verse eid="JER 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 19:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 18:16">Yer 18:16</ref>. </char></note> Kandi orurembo ndyaruhindura ekirikutiinisa n'eky'okweshaanya, orirurabaho weena ashishwe, ayeshaanye ahabw'akabi koona aku rwareebire. <verse eid="JER 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 19:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:29">Lev 26:29</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 2:20">Tonz 2:20</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:29">Lev 26:29</ref>. </char></note> Ndyabariisa abaana baabo b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki, buri muntu arye mutaahi we omu biro by'okugotwa n'eby'enaku, ezi abazigu baabo n'abaribahiiga baribareebesa.<verse eid="JER 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 19:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:63">Yer 51:63</ref>, <ref loc="JER 51:64">64</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima oyatire orwo runywero omu maisho g'abashaija abaraagyende naiwe, <verse eid="JER 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 19:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:9">Zab 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 6:15">Enf 6:15</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 4:2">Tonz 4:2</ref>. </char></note> obagire oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Oku nikwo ndyata aba bantu n'oru rurembo, nk'oku omuntu ayata enyungu y'omubumbi, ekarema kuhomeererwa. Abantu baryaziika omuri Tofeti ahabw'okubura ahandi hoona ah'okuziika. <verse eid="JER 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 19:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:10">2 Bag 23:10</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 23:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Okwo nikwo ndigira ogu mwanya n'abagutwiremu, nkagira oru rurembo nka Tofeti; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 19:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:18">Yer 7:18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:29">32:29</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:18">44:18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:19">Bir 4:19</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 1:5">Zef 1:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:42">Byak 7:42</ref>. </char></note> Amaju ga Yerusaalemu na zaanyaruju z'abagabe ba Yuda biryahagarwa nk'ogwo mwanya gwa Tofeti; nigo maju goona agaabaire nigookyezibwaho obubaane nibooterera eihe ryona ery'omu iguru, bakashukiriraho baaruhanga abandi empongano z'eby'okunywa.<verse eid="JER 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 19:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 26:2">Yer 26:2</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 20:5">2 Bus 20:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Yeremia yaaruga Tofeti, ei MUKAMA yaabaire amutumire kuhanuura, yaayemerera omu kibuga ky'enju ya MUKAMA, yaagira abantu boona ati: <verse eid="JER 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 19:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:26">Yer 7:26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:3">25:3</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, ndyareeta omuri oru rurembo na tauni zaarwo zoona akabi koona aku ndugambireho; ahabw'okuba bakagangaaza ebitsya, baayanga kuhurira ebigambo byangye.<verse eid="JER 19:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JER 20" />
  <para style="s1">Pashuri okuta Yeremia omu kihome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 20:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 2:37">Ezr 2:37</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 2:38">38</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Pashuri omunyamurwa, mwene Imeri owaabaire ari omutegyeki mukuru omu nju ya MUKAMA, yaahurira Yeremia naahanuura ebigambo ebyo. <verse eid="JER 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 20:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:26">Yer 29:26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:13">37:13</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 16:10">2 Bus 16:10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 16:24">Byak 16:24</ref>. </char></note> Pashuri ogwo yaateera nabi Yeremia, yaamuta omu nkomo ezaabaire ziri omu Irembo rya Benyamiini ery'eruguru ery'enju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="JER 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 20:3" />Ku bwaseesire, Pashuri yaiha Yeremia omu nkomo; Yeremia nikwo kumugira ati: MUKAMA tarikukweta Pashuri, kureka Magori-misabiibu, amakuru ngu “Ebirikutiinisa embaju zoona.” <verse eid="JER 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 20:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:25">Yer 6:25</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, ndyakugira ekirikutiinisa ahariiwe n'ahari bagyenzi baawe boona. Baryaitwa rurara y'omugabe wa Babulooni, abatware Babulooni bari enkwatwa, abaite na rurara. <verse eid="JER 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 20:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 20:17">2 Bag 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:13">24:13</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:13-17">25:13-17</ref>. </char></note> Kandi obutungi bwona obw'orururembo, amagoba gaarwo goona, ebintu byarwo byona eby'obuguzi bwingi, n'eitungo ryona ery'abagabe ba Yuda, ndyabihayo omu mikono y'abazigu baabo, babanyagye, babakwate, babatware Babulooni. <verse eid="JER 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 20:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:14">Yer 14:14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi naiwe Pashuri n'abatuura omu nju yaawe boona, muryagyenda muri enkwatwa, oze Babulooni; okwo niyo origwa, kandi niyo oriziikwa, iwe na bagyenzi baawe boona abu ohanuurira ebishuba.<verse eid="JER 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia okwetomboitera MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 20:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:51">Zab 119:51</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 3:14">Tonz 3:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai MUKAMA, okambeiha, naabiikiriza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:7">Nonkiza amaani, kandi osingwire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:7">Mpindukire eky'okushekyererwa eizooba ryona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:7">Buri muntu nanteerera enaku.<verse eid="JER 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 20:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:7">Yer 6:7</ref>, <ref loc="JER 6:10">10</ref>, <ref loc="JER 6:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 79:4">Zab 79:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba buri murundi gwona ogu ngamba, ntaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:8">Ningira nti, Obubisha n'okucwekyereza!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:8">Ahabw'okuba ekigambo kya MUKAMA kimpindukiire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:8">Ekijumo n'ekigaaniizo eizooba ryona.<verse eid="JER 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 20:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 32:18">Yob 32:18</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 32:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 39:3">Zab 39:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku ndikugira nti: Ka ndekye kumugambaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">N'obu kwakuba okugaruka kugamba omu iziina rye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">Omu mutima gwangye oshusha oti harimu omuriro</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">Ogurikubuguma oguri omu magufa gangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">Okufa mamigye nikundusya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">Kandi tindikukubaasa.<verse eid="JER 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 20:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 9:4">Yer 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 31:13">Zab 31:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 35:15">35:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 41:9">41:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 56:6">56:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba nimpurira baingi nibahwihwitsa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">Okutiinisa kuri embaju zoona!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">Banywani bangye ab'ah'amara</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">Abategyereize okugwa kwangye, nibagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">Muregye, naitwe nitwija kumurega,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">Shana akaabeihwabeihwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">Tubone kumusingura, tumuhoora.<verse eid="JER 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 20:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 1:8">Yer 1:8</ref>, <ref loc="JER 1:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:18">17:18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:40">23:40</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka MUKAMA ari hamwe naanye nk'omurwani orikutiinisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:11">N'ahabw'ekyo abarikumpiiga baryateera entsibo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:11">Tibarinsingura.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:11">Baryakwatirwa kimwe enshoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:11">Ahabw'okuba tibaribaasa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:11">Okuhemuka kwabo okw'ebiro n'ebiro tikuryeba.<verse eid="JER 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 20:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 11:20">Yer 11:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai MUKAMA ow'amahe, ogyeza abahikiriire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:12">Kandi oreeba eby'omu mutima n'ebiteekateeko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:12">Ka ndeebe oku oraabahoore,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:12">Ahabw'okuba niiwe nyegyekyereire ebyangye.<verse eid="JER 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 20:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 35:9">Zab 35:9</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 35:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:30">109:30</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 109:31">31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mweshongorere MUKAMA, mumuhimbise,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:13">Ahabw'okuba ajunire amagara g'abakyene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:13">Yaagaiha omu mikono y'enkozi z'ebibi.<verse eid="JER 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 20:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 15:10">Yer 15:10</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 3:3">Yob 3:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eizooba eri naazaariirweho nirikakyeenwe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:14">Ekiro eki maawe yanzaariireho nikikabure omugisha!<verse eid="JER 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 20:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 16:21">Yoh 16:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'omuntu owaagambiire tata ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:15">Waazaara omwana w'omwojo, naamushemeza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:15">Nawe naakakyeenwe!<verse eid="JER 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 20:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 18:22">Yer 18:22</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:25">Kut 19:25</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:19">Isa 13:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkahenwa ki ogwo mushaija aba nk'endembo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:16">Ezi MUKAMA yaacwekyereize ataine saasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:16">Ahurira okucura omu kasheeshe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:16">N'enduuru omu ihangwe;<verse eid="JER 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 20:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:17, 18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 3:10">Yob 3:10</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 3:11">11</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 3:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 3:1">Tonz 3:1</ref>, <ref loc="LAM 3:2">2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba taraanyitiire mu nda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:17">Maawe akaba ekituuro kyangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:17">N'enda ye ekaguma eri nyarwegye.<verse eid="JER 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 20:18" />Mbwenu nkaba naarugira ki omunda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:18">Kufa kubi n'okureeba enaku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:18">N'okumara ebiro byangye nyine enshoni?<verse eid="JER 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JER 21" />
  <para style="s1">Omugabe Zedekia okwehanuuza ahari Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 21:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 29:25">Yer 29:25</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:3">37:3</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 34:8">2 Bus 34:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eki n'ekigambo ekyaizire ahari Yeremia nikiruga ahari MUKAMA, obu omugabe Zedekia yaamutumaho Pashuri mwene Malikia, na Zefania omunyamurwa mwene Maaseya, <verse eid="JER 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 21:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 37:7">Yer 37:7</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:1">2 Bag 25:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 105:2">Zab 105:2</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 105:5">5</ref>. </char></note> naagira ati: Tubuurize MUKAMA, ahabw'okuba Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni aizire kuturwanisa; obundi MUKAMA akaatugirira nk'eby'okutangaaza ebi akora oku biri, amutwihaho, areka kututeera.<verse eid="JER 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 21:3" />Atyo Yeremia yaabagira ati: Oku nikwo muraagire Zedekia muti: <verse eid="JER 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 21:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:5">Yer 32:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:10">37:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:4">Isa 13:4</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, niinyija kucwa busha eby'okurwanisa ebi mukwaitse kurwanisa omugabe wa Babulooni n'Abakaludaaya abari enyima y'orugo babagotsire, imwe mbagarure omu rurembo; <verse eid="JER 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 21:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:5">Yer 27:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:17">32:17</ref>, <ref loc="JER 32:37">37</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 6:6">Kur 6:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:34">Bir 4:34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 29:28">29:28</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:33">Ezk 20:33</ref>. </char></note> kandi nyowe nyerwanire naimwe mbabangiire omukono gw'amaani, mbagwereirwe kubi, mbainiire ekiniga kingi munonga. <verse eid="JER 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 21:6" />Niinyija kuteera eby'omuri oru rurembo, abantu n'amatungo, biitwe orufu rw'amaani. <verse eid="JER 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 21:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 37:17">Yer 37:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 39:5">39:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:9">52:9</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:50">Bir 28:50</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 5:11">Ezk 5:11</ref>. </char></note> Kandi bwanyima y'ebyo Zedekia omugabe wa Yuda n'abagaragwa be n'abantu boona abariba baari omuri oru rurembo, barokokire ahari orwo rufu, n'ahari rurara n'enjara, ndyabahayo omu mikono ya Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni n'ey'abazigu baabo, n'ey'abarikwenda kubaita. Aryabaitsa rurara, taribasaasira, nari kubareka, n'obu kwakuba okubagirira esaasi; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 21:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 38:2">Yer 38:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 30:15">Bir 30:15</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 30:19">19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ogambire abantu aba oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, ntaire omu maisho gaanyu omuhanda gw'amagara n'ogw'okufa. <verse eid="JER 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 21:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:2">Yer 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:13">37:13</ref>, <ref loc="JER 37:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 39:18">39:18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 45:5">45:5</ref>. </char></note> Origuma omuri oru rurembo aryaitwa rurara, enjara n'orufu; kwonka orishohora, akeenaga omu mikono y'Abakaludaaya ababagotsire, aryagumaho, atimbuukye omu rugamba n'engabirano, nigo magara ge. <verse eid="JER 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 21:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:7">Yer 21:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:11">44:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:16">Zab 34:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 14:8">Ezk 14:8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 9:4">Amo 9:4</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba ntaire amaisho gangye ahari oru rurembo kurukora kubi, ti kurukora gye, kandi ruryaheebwayo omu mikono y'omugabe wa Babulooni, arwotsye n'omuriro; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 21:11" />Muhurire ekigambo eki MUKAMA arikugambira enju y'omugabe wa Yuda, <verse eid="JER 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 21:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:4">Yer 4:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:3">22:3</ref>, <ref loc="JER 22:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 7:9">Zek 7:9</ref>. </char></note> naagira ati: Iwe nju ya Daudi 'we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:12">Mugume mucwe emanja z'oburyo buri kasheeshe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:12">Mujune abanyagirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:12">Mubaihe omu mikono y'abarikubahata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:12">Ekiniga kyangye kitakaayaka nk'omuriro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:12">Kikaaka, hakabura owaakiraaza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:12">nimbatura ebibi ebi murikukora.<verse eid="JER 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 21:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 49:4">Yer 49:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 13:8">Ezk 13:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:13">Reeba, naaba omuzigu wawe, iwe otwire omu ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:13">N'aha rukiri rw'omu ruhita,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:13">Iwe orikugira oti: N'oha orishuuma kuturwanisa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:13">Nari n'oha oritaaha omu maka gaitu?<verse eid="JER 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 21:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 1:31">Enf 1:31</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:47">Ezk 20:47</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyabaha ekifubiro ekishemereire ebi murikukora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:14">Ntwekye omuriro omu kibira kyaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:14">Gumareho byona ebiheehinguriririize.<verse eid="JER 21:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JER 22" />
  <para style="s1">Okuhanuurira abagabe ba Yuda ebiribabaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 22:1" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Shuuma oze ow'omugabe wa Yuda, ogambireyo ekigambo eki, <verse eid="JER 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 22:2" />noogira oti: Iwe mugabe wa Yuda 'we ori aha ngoma ya Daudi, hurira ekigambo kya MUKAMA, iwe n'abagaragwa baawe n'abantu baawe abaraba omuri aga marembo. <verse eid="JER 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 22:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:5">Yer 7:5</ref>, <ref loc="JER 7:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 26:15">26:15</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:33">Lev 19:33</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 82:3">Zab 82:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:17">Isa 1:17</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Mugume mukore eby'oburyo n'eby'okuhikiirira, abanyagirwe mubaihe omu mikono y'abarikubahata, kandi omunyaihanga n'efuuzi n'omufaakazi mutabakora kubi, n'obu kwakuba okubakorera eby'obubisha, nari okusheesha eshagama y'abataine rubanja omuri ogu mwanya. <verse eid="JER 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 22:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:25">Yer 17:25</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba ku muraayorobere ekigambo eki omu mazima, abagabe abari aha ngoma ya Daudi baryaguma nibataahira omu marembo g'ebikaari by'egi nju, bari omu bigaari by'orugamba n'aha mbaraasi, bo n'abagaragwa baabo, n'abantu baabo. <verse eid="JER 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 22:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:11">Yer 25:11</ref>, <ref loc="JER 25:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:6">44:6</ref>, <ref loc="JER 44:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:13">49:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:14">51:14</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:16">Kut 22:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 64:10">Isa 64:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 5:14">Ezk 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 6:8">Amo 6:8</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 6:13">Heb 6:13</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku muraayangye kuta omutima ahari ebyo bigambo, niinyerahira nti: Egi nju eryahinduka omushaka; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 22:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:4">Yer 6:4</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba aha nju y'omugabe wa Yuda ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:6">Ombeereire nka Gileadi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:6">N'omutwe gw'orushozi Lebanooni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:6">Kwonka buzimazima ndyakuhindura eihamba ry'omusheenyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:6">Orurembo orutatwirwemu.<verse eid="JER 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 22:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 19:23">2 Bag 19:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyakuteekateekyera abahwerekyerezi b'okukurwanisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:7">Buri omwe akwaitse eby'okurwanisa bye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:7">Baryatema emyereezi yaawe erikukira oburungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:7">Baginagye omu muriro.<verse eid="JER 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 22:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:19">Yer 5:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amahanga maingi garyaraba ahari oru rurembo, buri muntu abuuze mugyenzi we ati: Ahabw'enki MUKAMA agizire ati oru rurembo ruhango? <verse eid="JER 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 22:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:25">Bir 29:25</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 29:26">26</ref>. </char></note> Nabo baryagarukamu bati: Ahabw'okuba bakatsigaho endagaano ya MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo, baaramya baaruhanga abandi, baabaheereza.<verse eid="JER 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 22:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 35:24">2 Bus 35:24</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 35:25">25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mutacurira ofiire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:10">N'obu kwakuba okumuboroogyera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:10">Kureka muririre munonga ogyenzire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:10">Ahabw'okuba tarigaruka bundi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:10">Kureeba ensi ye y'obuzaarwa.<verse eid="JER 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 22:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:11, 12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 23:34">2 Bag 23:34</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 19:4">Ezk 19:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba ahari Shalumu mwene Yosia omugabe wa Yuda, owaahungwire engoma ya Yosia ishe, kandi owaagyenzire, akaruga omuri ogu mwanya, naagira ati: <verse eid="JER 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 22:12" />Tarigaruka aha bundi, kureka ei baamutwairwe ari enkwatwa, niyo arigwa, kandi tarigaruka kureeba egi nsi.<verse eid="JER 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 22:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 9:13">Lev 9:13</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:39">25:39</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 5:18-23">Isa 5:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 3:10">Mik 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 2:12">Hab 2:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryakareeba, orikwombekyesa enju ye okutahikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:13">N'ebishengye bye akabyombekyesa obutainganisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:13">Orikukoreseza mutaahi we busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:13">Atamuhe bihembo bye,<verse eid="JER 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 22:14" />Orikugira ati: Ndyayeyombekyera enju rutaaba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:14">Eine ebishengye bihango by'ahaiguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:14">Ngicwemu amadirisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:14">Ngikiikizemu embaaho z'emyereezi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:14">Ngisiigye erangi erikutukura.<verse eid="JER 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 22:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 23:25">2 Bag 23:25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 128:2">Zab 128:2</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 8:12">Mub 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 3:10">Isa 3:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Noogira ngu okwenda kukira abandi omu kwombekyesa emyereezi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:15">Nikyo kiraakugire omugabe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:15">Sho akaba atarya, akanywa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:15">Kandi omu biro bye taratungire, akagogyera?<verse eid="JER 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 22:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 2:10">Bar 2:10</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 31:9">Enf 31:9</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 22:13">Ezk 22:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Akaba acwera abooro n'abakyene emanja.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:16">Nabwo biba gye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:16">Okwo tikwo kummanya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:16">Nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 22:17" />Kwonka amaisho gaawe n'omutima gwawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:17">Nibiruruuhira amagoba gatari g'amazima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:17">Kusheesha eshagama y'abataine rubanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:17">N'okukora eby'okuhata n'eby'obubisha.<verse eid="JER 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 22:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 16:4-6">Yer 16:4-6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 34:5">34:5</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 13:30">1 Bag 13:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba ahari Yehoyakimu mwene Yosia omugabe wa Yuda ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:18">Tibarimutongyeza nibagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:18">Ai bambe, mukuru wangye! Nari shi bati, Ai bambe munyaanyazi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:18">Kandi tibarimutongyeza nibagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:18">Ai bambe, mukama wangye! Nari shi bati, Nangwa ndikaitwa ekyo kitiinisa kye!<verse eid="JER 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 22:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 8:2">Yer 8:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 36:30">36:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryaziikwa nk'oku baziika endogoya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:19">Akururwe, anagwe enyima y'amarembo ga Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="JER 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 22:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:49">Bir 32:49</ref>. </char>
    </note> Inamuka oze Lebanooni oteere enduuru;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:20">Oimutsye eiraka ryawe omuri Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:20">Oboroogye nooyema Abariimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:20">Ahabw'okuba nkunzi zaawe zoona zicwekyereziibwe.<verse eid="JER 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 22:21" />Nkagamba naiwe obu waabaire ogogyeire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:21">Kwonka wangira oti: Tindikwija kukuhurira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:21">Egyo niyo yaabaire eri emitwarize yaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:21">okutoorobera iraka ryangye okwiha omu buto bwawe.<verse eid="JER 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 22:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 3:25">Yer 3:25</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:1">23:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:10">Ezk 34:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuyaga guryariisa abariisa baawe boona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:22">Nkunzi zaawe zize omu bukwatwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:22">Obwo nibwo oriitwa enshoni, okabwerabwera</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:22">Ahabw'obubi bwawe bwona.<verse eid="JER 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 22:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:24">Yer 6:24</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:8">Isa 13:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe mutuuzi wa Lebanooni 'we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:23">Otwire omu myereezi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:23">Eshi oryatsinda ku orihikwaho obusaasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:23">Waagira ebisha nk'omukazi orikwenda kuzaara!<verse eid="JER 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 22:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 21:8">1 Bag 21:8</ref>; <ref loc="SNG 8:6">Kyesh 8:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:18">Isa 49:18</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 2:23">Hag 2:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati: Niinyerahira, iwe Konia mutabani wa Yehoyakimu omugabe wa Yuda, n'obu waakuba empeta y'akamanyiso aha rukumu rw'omukono gwangye gwa buryo, nkaakuhuruuturaho, <verse eid="JER 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 22:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 34:20">Yer 34:20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 39:17">39:17</ref>. </char></note> nkuhayo omu mikono y'abarikwenda kukwita, omu mikono ya Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni n'omu y'Abakaludaaya. <verse eid="JER 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 22:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:8">2 Bag 24:8</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 24:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Kandi iwe na nyoko kikuzaara ndyababinga, mbanagye omu ndiijo nsi, ei otarazaariirwemu; okwo niyo murigwa. <verse eid="JER 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 22:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 44:14">Yer 44:14</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ensi ei baryetenga munonga kugarukamu, tibarigigarukamu.<verse eid="JER 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 22:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 15:14">Yer 15:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 48:38">48:38</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 31:12">Zab 31:12</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 8:8">Hos 8:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Beitu ogwo mushaija Konia t'enyungu eyatikire erikugaywa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:28">Ei omuntu weena atarikwetaho?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:28">Ahabw'enki we n'abaana be nibabingwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:28">Kunagwa omu nsi ei batarikumanya?<verse eid="JER 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 22:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:2">Isa 1:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe nsi 'we, nsi 'we, nsi 'we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:29">hurira ekigambo kya MUKAMA!<verse eid="JER 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 22:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 36:30">Yer 36:30</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 3:17">1 Bus 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 1:12">Mat 1:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:30">Muhandiikye ogu mushaija nk'encwekye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:30">Omushaija otariba gye mu biro bye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:30">Ahabw'okuba tihariho w'omu ruzaaro rwe n'omwe oriba gye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:30">Akaza aha ngoma ya Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:30">Akagaruka kutegyeka Yuda.<verse eid="JER 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JER 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia okuhanuura aha kwija kwa Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 23:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 56:11">Isa 56:11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 6:3">Yer 6:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 10:21">10:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:22">22:22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:34">25:34</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:2">Ezk 34:2</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 11:17">Zek 11:17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:12">Yoh 10:12</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 10:13">13</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati: Abariisa, abahwerekyereza entaama z'omu iriisizo, kandi bakazitaataanisa, baryakareeba. <verse eid="JER 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 23:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:4">Yer 4:4</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugambira aha bariisa abarikureeberera abantu bangye, naagira ati: Mutaataaniise obusyo bwangye, mwabubinga, timwabutaho mutima. Reeba, naanye ndyabafubira mbature ebibi ebi murikukora; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 23:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:3">Bir 30:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:3">Zab 107:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:14">Yer 29:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:37">32:37</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:34">Ezk 20:34</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 20:41">41</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:11-16">34:11-16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:21">37:21</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima ndyataaruura ab'obusyo bwangye abaritsigaraho, mbaihe omu nsi ezi naababingiiremu, mbagarure omu ka yaabo, bazaare, bakanye; <verse eid="JER 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 23:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:15">Yer 3:15</ref>. </char></note> mbateho abariisa abaribataho omutima, tibaritiina bundi, n'obu kwakuba okuhahaaza omutima, kandi tiharigira n'omwe owaabura; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 23:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 30:9">Yer 30:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:14-16">33:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 4:2">Isa 4:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:1">11:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 32:1">32:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:24">Ezk 37:24</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 3:5">Hos 3:5</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zek 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 2:2">Mat 2:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati: Reeba, obunaku buryahika, nyimukize Daudi Eitaagi erihikiriire, ategyekye nk'omugabe, akorese obwengye, akore eby'oburyo n'eby'okuhikiirira omu nsi. <verse eid="JER 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 23:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 16:14">Yer 16:14</ref>, <ref loc="JER 16:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Omu biro bye Yuda eryajunwa na Israeli etuure buhooro. Kandi eri niryo iziina eri aryetwa, MUKAMA OKUHIKIIRIRA kwaitu.<verse eid="JER 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 23:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 16:14">Yer 16:14</ref>, <ref loc="JER 16:15">15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: N'ahabw'ekyo reeba, obunaku buryahika obu abantu bariba batakigira bati: Nindahira MUKAMA ohuriire, owaihire Abaisraeli omu nsi ya Misri; <verse eid="JER 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 23:8" />kureka bati: Nindahira MUKAMA ohuriire, owaareetsire baijukuru b'enju ya Israeli, akabeebembera naabaiha omu nsi y'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho n'omu nsi zoona ezi yaabaire ababingiiremu. Obwo nibwo barituura omu nsi yaabo ey'obuzaarwa.<verse eid="JER 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia okuteisa baanabi b'ebishuba</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 23:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 3:16">Hab 3:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebya baanabi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">Omutima gwangye omunda gucwekire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">Amagufa gangye goona gajogajogokire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">Ninshusha omusinzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">Kandi ndi nk'omuntu orembiirwe viinyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">Ahabwa MUKAMA n'ahabw'ebigambo bye ebirikwera.<verse eid="JER 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 23:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:28">Yer 4:28</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:7">5:7</ref>, <ref loc="JER 5:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 9:10">9:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:17">22:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 10:7">Zab 10:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:34">107:34</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 4:2">Hos 4:2</ref>, <ref loc="HOS 4:3">3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba ensi eijwire abashambani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:10">Kandi omukyeeno gureeteire ensi okuborooga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:10">N'amariisizo g'omu ihamba goomire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:10">Emitwarize yaabo ni mibi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:10">N'amaani gaabo ti marungi.<verse eid="JER 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 23:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:13">Yer 6:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:30">7:30</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 8:16">Ezk 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 23:39">23:39</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 3:4">Zef 3:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:11">Baanabi n'abanyamurwa tibarikutiina Ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:11">Kandi n'omu nju yangye nshangiremu obubi bwabo.<verse eid="JER 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 23:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 11:23">Yer 11:23</ref>; <ref loc="JER 13:16">13:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 35:6">Zab 35:6</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 4:19">Enf 4:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo omuhanda guryababeera</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:12">Nk'akahanda akarikuteerera omu mwirima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:12">Aku baribingirwamu, bakakagwamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:12">Ahabw'okuba ndyabareetaho akabi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:12">Omu biro by'okufubirwa kwabo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:12">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 23:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:8">Yer 2:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:16">Isa 9:16</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 2:14">Tonz 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 16:46">Ezk 16:46</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 7:1">Hos 7:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuri baanabi ba Samaria</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:13">Nkareebamu ekintu ky'obushema;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:13">Oku baabaire bahanuura omu iziina rya Baali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:13">Bakahabisa abantu bangye Israeli.<verse eid="JER 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 23:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 29:23">Yer 29:23</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 64:5">Zab 64:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:9">Isa 1:9</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 1:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka omuri baanabi b'omuri Yerusaalemu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">Nkareebamu ekirikureetera omuntu kushishwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">Oku baabaire bashambana, bakabeiha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">Kandi bakaha emikono y'enkozi z'ebibi amaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">Hakabura owaahinduka kureka obubi bwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">Boona bakambeera nk'aba Sodoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">N'abatuuzi baamwo nk'aba Gomora.<verse eid="JER 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 23:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 8:14">Yer 8:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 9:15">9:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugambira ahari baanabi abo ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:15">Reeba, niinyija kubagaburira <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">apusinto n'ekiti ekrikushaarira nk'omuravunga. </char></note>apusinto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:15">Mbanywaise amaizi garimu obushegu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:15">ahabw'okuba omuri baanabi b'omuri Yerusaalemu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:15">Harugiremu okutatiina Ruhanga, kwabuga ensi yoona.<verse eid="JER 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 23:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 16:28">Kub 16:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Mutahurira ebigambo ebi baanabi barikubahanuurira, bakabeesigisa ebitariho, nibagamba eby'okworekwa ebirugire omu biteekateeko byabo, ebitarugire omu kanwa kangye. <verse eid="JER 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 23:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:12">Yer 5:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 6:14">6:14</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 3:11">Mik 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 10:2">Zek 10:2</ref>. </char></note> Baguma nibagambira abarikungaya, nibagira bati: MUKAMA agizire ati: Muryaba gye; kandi bagambira omuntu weena orikukuratira ebi omutima gwe gurikwenda, bati: Tihariho kabi koona akarikuhikwaho.<verse eid="JER 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 23:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:14">Isa 40:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'oha omuribo oragiire omu ishengyero rya MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:18">Okwetegyereza n'okuhurira ekigambo kye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:18">Nari n'oha orataire omutima</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:18">Aha kigambo kye, akakihurira?<verse eid="JER 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 23:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 25:32">Yer 25:32</ref>; <ref loc="JER 30:24">30:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba eihunga rya MUKAMA! Ekiniga kye kyashohoire!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:19">Eego, omuyaga gw'akasooroora gwaza kuteera emitwe y'ababi.<verse eid="JER 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 23:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:11">Isa 55:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekiniga kya MUKAMA tikirigarukayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:20">Okuhitsya obu ariheza kufubira</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:20">N'okuhikiiriza ebi arikwenda kukora.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:20">Omu biro by'aha muheru nibwo murikimanyira kimwe.<verse eid="JER 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 23:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 14:14">Yer 14:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baanabi abo tiinye naabatumire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:21">Kwonka bakarahuka, baayetumisiriza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:21">Tindabagambiire, kwonka bakahanuura.<verse eid="JER 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 23:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 25:5">Yer 25:5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:17">Luk 1:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka kuri baagiire omu ishengyero ryangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:22">Bakaagambiire abantu bangye ebigambo byangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:22">Nabo bahinduka bareka emihanda yaabo mibi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:22">N'obubi bw'ebi barikukora.<verse eid="JER 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 23:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 94:7">Zab 94:7</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 94:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 139:7-12">139:7-12</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati: Nimugira ngu ndi Ruhanga wa haihi kwonka, otari Ruhanga wa hare munonga? <verse eid="JER 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 23:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa 66:1</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 9:2">Amo 9:2</ref>, <ref loc="AMO 9:3">3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi naagira ati: Hariho owaakubaasa kweshereka aheekiikire, ntamureebe? Tiinyijwire eiguru n'ensi? Nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 23:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 10:2">Zek 10:2</ref>. </char></note> Mpuriire ebi baanabi baagambire nibahanuura ebishuba omu iziina ryangye, nibagira bati: Ndootsire! Ndootsire! <verse eid="JER 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 23:26" />Mbwenu ebyo biryahitsya hi okuguma omu mitima ya baanabi abarikuhanuura ebishuba n'eby'obugobya bw'omu mitima yaabo, <verse eid="JER 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 23:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 3:7">Bar 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 8:33">8:33</ref>. </char></note> abarikuteekateeka kwebesa abantu bangye eiziina ryangye, ahabw'ebirooto byabo ebi barikurootororerana, nk'oku baishenkurubo baayebirwe eiziina ryangye ahabwa Baali? <verse eid="JER 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 23:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:6">Kub 12:6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:17">Luk 3:17</ref>. </char></note> Nabi oine eki arootsire, akirootorore; kandi n'oine ekigambo kyangye, akigambe n'obwesigwa. Ebishushunga biine kakwate ki n'engano? Nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 23:29" />Ekigambo kyangye tikiri nk'omuriro, nari nk'enyondo erikwatagura orukiri? Nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 23:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:20">Bir 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 13:8">Ezk 13:8</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo reeba, naaba omuzigu wa baanabi abarikwibana ebigambo byangye; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 23:31" />Kandi MUKAMA naagira ati: Reeba, naaba omuzigu wa baanabi abarikugambira eryo n'endimi zaabo nibagira bati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 23:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:14">Yer 14:14</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, naaba omuzigu w'abarikuhanuura ebirooto by'ebishuba, bakabirootorora, bakahabya abantu bangye n'ebishuba byabo n'okugambira eryo kwabo, haza ntabatumire n'obu kwakuba okubaragiira; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. N'ahabw'ekyo tibaine ki barikugasira aba bantu na kakye; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 23:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 2:14">Tonz 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 14:1-11">Ezk 14:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 4:6">Hos 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:1">Mal 1:1</ref>. </char></note> Omwe ahari aba bantu nari nabi nainga omunyamurwa ku haraagire owaakubuuza naagira ati: Omutwaro gwa MUKAMA niki? Obagire oti: Ogwo mutwaro niimwe, kandi ndyabanagira kimwe; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 23:34" />Kandi nabi ogwo nari omunyamurwa, nari omwe aha bantu orikugira oti: Omutwaro gwa MUKAMA, ndyafubira ogwo muntu n'eka ye. <verse eid="JER 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 23:35" />Oku nikwo buri muntu aribuuza mutaahi we na buri muntu mwene ishe ati: MUKAMA akugarukiremu ki? Nari ati: MUKAMA agambire ki? <verse eid="JER 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 23:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:6">Mat 15:6</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka mutarigaruka kugamba Omutwaro gwa MUKAMA obundi, ahabw'okuba ogwo mutwaro n'ekigambo eki buri muntu ayegunziire, kandi mutuura nimukiikamya ebigambo bya Ruhanga ohuriire, MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga waitu. <verse eid="JER 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 23:37" />Oku nikwo oribuuza nabi ogwo oti: MUKAMA akugarukiremu ki? Nari oti MUKAMA agambire ki? <verse eid="JER 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 23:38" />Kwonka ku murigira muti: Omutwaro gwa MUKAMA, oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Ahabw'okugamba ekigambo eki muti, Omutwaro gwa MUKAMA, haza naabaire naabatumireho nti: Mutarigira muti, Omutwaro gwa MUKAMA, <verse eid="JER 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 23:39" />n'ahabw'ekyo reeba, buzimazima ndyabakiriza mbanagye, mundugye omu maisho, imwe n'orurembo oru naabahaire na baashwenkuriimwe, <verse eid="JER 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 23:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 20:11">Yer 20:11</ref>. </char></note> mbareeteho ekijumo ekitarihwaho, n'enshoni ez'ebiro n'ebiro ezitaryeba.<verse eid="JER 23:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JER 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia okworekwa akamanyiso k'ebijuma by'emitiini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 24:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 22:18">Yer 22:18</ref>, <ref loc="JER 22:24">24</ref>, <ref loc="JER 22:28">28</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:12">2 Bag 24:12</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 8:1">Amo 8:1</ref>, <ref loc="AMO 8:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 1:11">Mat 1:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni ku yaaherize kwiha Yekonia mwene Yehoyakimu omugabe wa Yuda Yerusaalemu, yaamutwara Babulooni ari enkwatwa, hamwe n'abanyiginya ba Yuda n'ababaizi n'abaheesi, MUKAMA yaanyoreka okworekwa oku. Reeba, ebiibo bibiri by'emitiini bikaba bitairwe omu maisho ga hekalu ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="JER 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 24:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:17">Yer 29:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 28:4">Isa 28:4</ref>. </char></note> Ekiibo kimwe kikaba kirimu emitiini mirungi munonga nk'ey'okubanza; kwonka ekya kabiri kikaba kirimu emitiini mibi munonga, etarikubaasa kuriibwa. <verse eid="JER 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 24:3" />MUKAMA yangira ati: Yeremia, nooreba ki? Naanye nti: Nindeeba emitiini, emirungi ni mirungi munonga, n'emibi ni mibi munonga etarikubaasa kuriibwa.<verse eid="JER 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 24:4" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 24:5" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Nk'oku egi mitiini eri mirungi, nikwo ndibara Abayuda abatwairwe bari enkwatwa kuba barungi, abu naabingire omu mwanya ogu, nkabatwara omu nsi y'Abakaludaaya. <verse eid="JER 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 24:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:10">Yer 1:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 12:15">12:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:10">29:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:28">31:28</ref>; <ref loc="JER 42:10">42:10</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 9:4">Amo 9:4</ref>, <ref loc="AMO 9:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Ndyaguma mbataireho amaisho kubagirira gye, mbagarure omuri egi nsi. Ndyabombeka, tindibasheenya; ndyababyara, tindibakuura. <verse eid="JER 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 24:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:13">Yer 29:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 30:22">30:22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 30:6">Bir 30:6</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:12">Yoel 2:12</ref>. </char></note> Ndyabaha omutima gw'okummanya ku niinye MUKAMA; kandi baryaba abantu bangye, naanye mbe Ruhanga waabo, ahabw'okuba baryangarukira n'omutima gwabo gwona.<verse eid="JER 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 24:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 21:1">Yer 21:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 43:1-13">43:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:1-30">44:1-30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Nk'emitiini egyo emibi munonga etarikubaasa kuriibwa, oku eri, nikwo nditwaza Zedekia omugabe wa Yuda, abanyiginya be, n'abantu abaahonokireho omuri Yerusaalemu, bakatsigara omu nsi egi, kandi n'abatwire omu nsi ya Misri, <verse eid="JER 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 24:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:4">Yer 15:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:18">25:18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 26:6">26:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:18">29:18</ref>, <ref loc="JER 29:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:37">Bir 28:37</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:28">Isa 43:28</ref>. </char></note> mbahindure eky'okunaganwa omu bugabe bwona obw'omu nsi, babe eky'okujumwa, eky'okucweraho enfumu, ekigaaniizo n'eky'okukyeenwa omu myanya yoona ei ndibabingiramu. <verse eid="JER 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 24:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:21">Yer 14:21</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyabaitsa rurara, mbateeze enjara n'orufu, okuhitsya obu barimarirwaho kimwe omu nsi ei naabahaire na baishenkurubo.<verse eid="JER 24:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JER 25" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia okuhanuura aha myaka ei Abayuda barimara omu bukwatwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 25:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 24:1">2 Bag 24:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa kana ogw'omu busingye bwa Yehoyakimu mwene Yosia omugabe wa Yuda (nigwo mwaka gw'okubanza gwa Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni), ekigambo kikaija ahari Yeremia, nikigamba aha Bayuda boona. <verse eid="JER 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 25:2" />Nabi Yeremia ogwo yaakigambira Abayuda boona n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu boona, naagira ati: <verse eid="JER 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 25:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:2">Yer 1:2</ref>. </char></note> Okwiha omu mwaka gwa ikumi n'eshatu ogwa Yosia mwene Amoni omugabe wa Yuda okuhitsya hati, mmazire emyaka makumi abiri n'eshatu ekigambo kya MUKAMA nikiinyijaho, kandi ntuura nimbagambira, kwonka mukanga kuhurira. <verse eid="JER 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 25:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:13">Yer 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:15">2 Bus 36:15</ref>. </char></note> Mukanga kuhurira n'obu kwakuba okutega amatu, n'obu MUKAMA araabe atuura naabatumaho abairu be baanabi boona naagira ati: <verse eid="JER 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 25:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:6">Yer 7:6</ref>, <ref loc="JER 7:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 18:11">18:11</ref>. </char></note> Muhindukye hati, buri muntu omuriimwe arekye emitwarize ye mibi, n'ebibi ebi arikukora, mugume omu nsi ei MUKAMA yaabahaire na baashwenkuriimwe kuba eyaanyu okwiha ira okuhitsya ebiro byona; <verse eid="JER 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 25:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:30">Yer 32:30</ref>. </char></note> kandi murekye kukuratira baaruhanga abandi kubaheereza n'okubaramya, murekye kungwisa kubi n'ebi murikukora n'emikono yaanyu. Obwo nibwo ntaribakora kubi. <verse eid="JER 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 25:7" />Kwonka na hati timukanyorobeire, kureka nimukingwisa kubi n'ebi murikukora n'emikono yaanyu, kwereetera akabi; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 25:8" />Nikyo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugirira ati: Ahabw'okwanga kworobera ebigambo byangye, <verse eid="JER 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 25:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:15">Yer 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 18:16">18:16</ref>; <ref loc="JER 27:6">27:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 43:10">43:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 29:18-20">Ezk 29:18-20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:28">Isa 44:28</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:1">48:1</ref>. </char></note> reeba, niinyija kutuma aha nganda zoona ez'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, n'aha mwiru wangye Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni, baije, mboohereze kuteera egi nsi n'abatuuzi baamwo, n'amahanga aga goona agabeehinduririize. Ndyabacwekyerereza kimwe, mbagire ekirikutiinisa, n'eky'okweshaanya, n'eky'okujumwa ebiro byona. <verse eid="JER 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 25:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 12:4">Mub 12:4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:22">Kush 18:22</ref>, <ref loc="REV 18:23">23</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyabamaramu eiraka ry'okwesiima n'ery'okushemererwa, erya kishwera n'erya kishwerwa, ery'orubengo n'okwaka kw'etabaaza. <verse eid="JER 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 25:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:3-6">Yer 27:3-6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:10">29:10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:21">2 Bus 36:21</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 36:22">22</ref>. </char></note> Egi nsi yoona eryaba amatongo n'eihamba, kandi ago mahanga garyamara emyaka makumi mushanju nigaheereza omugabe wa Babulooni. <verse eid="JER 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 25:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:24">Yer 51:24</ref>, <ref loc="JER 51:26">26</ref>, <ref loc="JER 51:62">62</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:19">Isa 13:19</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima egyo myaka makumi mushanju ku erihwa, ndyafubira omugabe wa Babulooni n'eryo ihanga, n'ensi y'Abakaludaaya, nimbatura eby'okushiisha byabo, mpagire eihamba ebiro byona; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 25:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 48:1-51:64">Yer 48:1—51:64</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyareeta aha nsi egyo ebigambo byona ebi naagigambireho, ebihandiikirwe omuri eki kitabo eky'ebi Yeremia yaahanwire aha mahanga goona. <verse eid="JER 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 25:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:7">Yer 27:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:9">50:9</ref>, <ref loc="JER 50:41">41</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:27">51:27</ref>, <ref loc="JER 51:28">28</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba amahanga maingi n'abagabe b'amaani baryabahindura abahuuku; ntyo mbazimuurire ebirikwingana n'ebi baakozire, kandi nk'emirimo y'emikono yaabo oku eri.<verse eid="JER 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 25:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 49:12">Yer 49:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:7">51:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 21:20">Yob 21:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, yangambiire naagira ati: Twara eki kikopo kya viinyo y'ekiniga ekiri omu ngaro zangye, okinywaise amahanga goona, agu ndikukutumaho. <verse eid="JER 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 25:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 47:6">Yer 47:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 51:22">Isa 51:22</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 51:23">23</ref>. </char></note> Nigaija kunywa, gagwererane, gagwe eiraro, ahabwa rurara ei ndaagooherezemu.<verse eid="JER 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 25:17" />Ntyo naiha ekikopo omu ngaro za MUKAMA, naakinywaisa amahanga goona agu MUKAMA yantumaho; <verse eid="JER 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 25:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 18:16">Yer 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:2">Zek 12:2</ref>. </char></note> Yerusaalemu n'endembo za Yuda, abagabe baayo n'abanyiginya baayo, kubahindura amatongo, eihamba, eky'okweshaanya n'eky'okukyeenwa nk'oku kiri hati; <verse eid="JER 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 25:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 46:25">Yer 46:25</ref>. </char></note> na Faraho omugabe wa Misri, abaheereza be boona; <verse eid="JER 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 25:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 47:1">Yer 47:1</ref>, <ref loc="JER 47:4">4</ref>, <ref loc="JER 47:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:37">50:37</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 4:21">Tonz 4:21</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 30:5">Ezk 30:5</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 1:1">Yob 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:38">Kur 12:38</ref>. </char></note> n'abanyiginya boona ababatwiremu, abagabe boona ab'omu nsi ya Uuzi, n'abagabe boona ab'omu nsi y'Abafilisita (Ashekelooni, Gaaza, Ekurooni n'abatsigaire omuri Ashidoodi); <verse eid="JER 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 25:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:26">Yer 9:26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 48:1-47">48:1-47</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:1-22">49:1-22</ref>. </char></note> Edomu, Moabu n'Abaamoni, <verse eid="JER 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 25:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 47:4">Yer 47:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 23:1">Isa 23:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 23:2">2</ref>. </char></note> abagabe boona aba Tuuro, n'abagabe boona aba Sidoni, n'abagabe b'ensi za seeri y'enyanja, <verse eid="JER 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 25:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:26">Yer 9:26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:8">49:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 21:13">Isa 21:13</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 6:19">Yob 6:19</ref>. </char></note> Dedani, Teema, Buuzi, abarikutega ebyeyera, <verse eid="JER 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 25:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 9:14">2 Bus 9:14</ref>. </char></note> abagabe ba Buharabu boona, n'abagabe boona ab'enganda z'ebijwangye abatwire omu ihamba, <verse eid="JER 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 25:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:34-39">Yer 49:34-39</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:11">Isa 11:11</ref>. </char></note> n'abagabe boona aba Zimuri, n'ab'omuri Elamu boona, n'aba Bumeedi boona, <verse eid="JER 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 25:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 50:9">Yer 50:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:41">51:41</ref>. </char></note> n'ab'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho boona, abari hare n'abari haihi, nk'oku barikukuratana, n'obugabe bwona obw'omu nsi yoona. Kandi ku bariheza, n'omugabe wa Babulooni aryanywa.<verse eid="JER 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 25:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 38:21">Ezk 38:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima obagire oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Munywe, musinde, mutanakye, mugwe obutaimuka, ahabwa rurara ei ndikwoherereza kubaita. <verse eid="JER 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 25:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:12">Yer 49:12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku baraayangye kwakiira ekikopo ekiri omu ngaro zaawe kukinywa, obagire oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Nimuragiirwa kukinywa! <verse eid="JER 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 25:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:31">Enf 11:31</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 10:12">Isa 10:12</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 3:2">Amo 3:2</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba reeba, orurembo orurikwetererwa eiziina ryangye, ku ndaabe nirwo ntandikiireho kukora kubi, nimugira ngu imwe nimwija kutsigara mutafubiirwe? Timuribura kufubirwa; ahabw'okuba niinyija kuhuruza rurara, erwanise abatwire omu nsi boona; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira.<verse eid="JER 25:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 25:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 3:16">Yoel 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 9:27">Bar 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 16:10">Isa 16:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo obahanuurire ebi bigambo byona, noobagira oti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">MUKAMA naija kutsinda ari ahaiguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">Aimutsye eiraka rye naayema omu butaaho bwe oburikwera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">Naija kutsinda n'amaani, ateere eka y'obusyo bwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">Ateere akaari nk'abarikunyuuka emizaabibu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">Arwanise abatwire omu nsi boona.<verse eid="JER 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 25:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 66:16">Isa 66:16</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 4:1">Hos 4:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwaku nibwija kuhika aha muheru gw'ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:31">Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA aine eki arikufa n'amahanga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:31">Naija kutonganisa abaine omubiri boona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:31">N'ababi abaitse rurara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:31">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 25:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:22">Yer 6:22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:19">23:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:32">Reeba, akabi nikagyenda nikaranda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:32">Nikaruga omu ihanga nikaza omu rindi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:32">Eihunga ry'amaani niriimuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:32">Niritandikira aha muheru gw'ensi.<verse eid="JER 25:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 25:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 16:4">Yer 16:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi abariitwa MUKAMA eryo izooba baryashangwa hoona, okuruga aha muheru gumwe gw'ensi okuhika aha gundi. Tibaricurirwa, tibarishanguruzibwa n'obu kwakuba okuziikwa, kureka baryaba nk'amasha aha itaka.<verse eid="JER 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 25:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:8">Yer 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 6:26">6:26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:1">23:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe bariisa 'mwe, nimucure, muboroogye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:34">Naimwe bakama b'obusyo, mwekuringye omu iju,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:34">Ahabw'okuba ebiro by'okwitwa n'okutaataana kwanyu bihikire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:34">Nimwija kugwa nk'empaya z'entaama ezicookirwe.<verse eid="JER 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 25:35" />Abariisa baryabura obuhungiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:35">Na bakama b'obusyo babure obukiriro.<verse eid="JER 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 25:36" />Nimuhurire okutaka kw'abariisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:36">N'okuborooga kwa bakama b'obusyo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:36">Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA naashiisha eiriisizo ryabo,<verse eid="JER 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 25:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 32:18">Isa 32:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'amaka g'amasyo g'obusingye gasheenyukire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:37">Ahabw'ekiniga kya MUKAMA eky'amaani.<verse eid="JER 25:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 25:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 46:16">Yer 46:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 76:2">Zab 76:2</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 38:40">Yob 38:40</ref>. </char>
    </note> Atsigireho obutaaho bwe nk'entare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:38">Ahabw'okuba ensi yaabo ehindukire eihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:38">Ahabwa rurara ya MUKAMA n'ekiniga kye kingi.<verse eid="JER 25:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JER 26" />
  <para style="s1">Okuhanuura ahari hekalu ku ericwekyerezibwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 26:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 27:1">Yer 27:1</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:36">2 Bag 23:36</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu kutandika kw'obutegyeki bwa Yehoyakimu mwene Yosia omugabe wa Yuda, ekigambo eki kikaruga ahari MUKAMA nikigira kti: <verse eid="JER 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 26:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 19:14">Yer 19:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:2">Bir 4:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 3:10">Ezk 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:27">Byak 20:27</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Irooko oyemerere omu kikaari ky'enju ya MUKAMA, ogambire ab'omu ndembo za Yuda zoona, abatuura nibaija kuramiza omu nju ya MUKAMA, ebigambo byona ebi ndikukuragiira kubagambira; otagira ekigambo na kimwe eki waatsigayo. <verse eid="JER 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 26:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 18:8">Yer 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 36:3">36:3</ref>. </char></note> Obundi bakaahurira, buri muntu ahinduka, aruga omu mitwarize ye emibi, naanye mbona kwegarukamu kureka akabi aku naaba niinyenda kubareetaho nimbatura ebibi ebi barikukora. <verse eid="JER 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 26:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:14">Lev 26:14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi obagire oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Ku muraayangye kumpurira kugyendera omu biragiro byangye ebi naataire omu maisho gaanyu, <verse eid="JER 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 26:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:3">Yer 25:3</ref>, <ref loc="JER 25:4">4</ref>. </char></note> n'okuta omutima aha bigambo by'abaheereza bangye baanabi, abu ntuura nimbatumaho, kwonka mutarikukyetaho, <verse eid="JER 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 26:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:12">Yer 7:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 24:9">24:9</ref>. </char></note> egi nju ndyagigira nka Shiilo, n'oru rurembo ndugire eky'okukyeenwa omu mahanga goona ag'omu nsi.<verse eid="JER 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abanyamurwa na baanabi okwenda kwita Yeremia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 26:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 23:33">Yer 23:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abanyamurwa, baanabi n'abantu boona bahurira Yeremia naagambira ebyo bigambo omu nju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="JER 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 26:8" />Yeremia ku yaaherize kugamba byona ebi MUKAMA yaamuragiire kugambira abantu boona, abanyamurwa na baanabi n'abantu boona baamukwata, baagira bati: Buzimazima noija kufa. <verse eid="JER 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 26:9" />Ahabw'enki ohanwire omu iziina rya MUKAMA noogira oti: Egi nju eryaba nka Shiilo, n'oru rurembo ruryaba amatongo, rubure ow'okurutuuramu? Abantu boona baateeranira ahari Yeremia omu nju ya MUKAMA.<verse eid="JER 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 26:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 36:10">Yer 36:10</ref>, <ref loc="JER 36:12">12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abanyiginya ba Yuda, ku baabihuriire, baaruga ow'omugabe, baija omu nju ya MUKAMA, baashutama aharikutaahirwa omu Irembo Risya ry'enju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="JER 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 26:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 38:4">Yer 38:4</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima abanyamurwa na baanabi baagambira abanyiginya n'abantu boona bati: Ogu muntu ashemereire kucwerwa orubanja rw'okufa, ahabw'okuba ahanwire kubi ahari oru rurembo, nk'oku mubihuriire n'amatu gaanyu.<verse eid="JER 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 26:12" />Yeremia nikwo kugambira abanyiginya n'abantu boona ati: MUKAMA antumire kuhanuura aha nju egi n'ahari oru rurembo ebigambo ebi byona ebi muhuriire, ebirirubaho. <verse eid="JER 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 26:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:3">Yer 7:3</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 30:2">Bir 30:2</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu mushemeze emitwarize yaanyu n'ebi murikukora, kandi mworobere eiraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu; na MUKAMA naija kwegarukamu, arekye akabi aku abagambireho. <verse eid="JER 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 26:14" />Kwonka nyowe reeba, ndi omu mikono yaanyu. Munkore eki murikusiima ngu ni kirungi kandi kihikire. <verse eid="JER 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 26:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:24">Mat 27:24</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka mumanyire kimwe ngu, ku muraanyite, nimuba mwereetsireho eshagama y'otaine rubanja, kandi n'ahari oru rurembo n'abatuuzi baarwo; ahabw'okuba buzimazima MUKAMA niwe abantumireho kubagambira ebyo bigambo.<verse eid="JER 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abanyiginya okukiza Yeremia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 26:16" />Bwanyima abanyiginya n'abantu boona baagambira abanyamurwa na baanabi bati: ogu muntu tashemereire kucwerwa rubanja rw'okufa, ahabw'okuba atugambiire omu iziina rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu. <verse eid="JER 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 26:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 19:1">Yer 19:1</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 5:34">Byak 5:34</ref>. </char></note> Bamwe aha bakuru b'omuri egyo nsi baagambira abantu abateeraniire aho, bati: <verse eid="JER 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 26:18" />Omu busingye bwa Hezekia omugabe wa Yuda Miika owa Moresheesi akahanuura, yaagira Abayuda boona ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 26:18">Saayuuni eryahingwa nk'omusiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 26:18">Yerusaalemu ebe emituumo y'ebisheenyuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 26:18">N'orushozi rw'enju ya MUKAMA rube nk'akabungo kashwekirwe ekibira.<verse eid="JER 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 26:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 32:14">Kur 32:14</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:26">2 Bus 32:26</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 5:39">Byak 5:39</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimugira ngu Hezekia omugabe wa Yuda n'Abayuda boona bakamwita? Timurikumanya ku yaatiinire MUKAMA, akamweshengyereza kumugirira embabazi, MUKAMA akeegarukamu, akareka akabi aku yaabagambireho? Kwonka itwe nitwenda kwereetaho akabi kahango.<verse eid="JER 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 26:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 6:21">1 Sam 6:21</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 7:1">7:1</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 7:2">2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi hakaba hariho ondiijo mushaija owaahanwire omu iziina rya MUKAMA, owaabaire naayetwa Uria mwene Shemaaya owa Kiryasi-yearimu. Nawe akahanuura ahari oru rurembo n'ahari egi ensi ebigambo ebirikushushana n'ebya Yeremia. <verse eid="JER 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 26:21" />Omugabe Yehoyakimu hamwe n'amamanzi ge goona n'abanyiginya be boona, ku baahuriire ebigambo bye, omugabe yaayenda kumwita; kwonka Uria ku yaakihuriire, yaatiina, yaacwa, yaahungira Misri. <verse eid="JER 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 26:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:12">Yer 36:12</ref>, <ref loc="JER 36:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 22:12">2 Bag 22:12</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 22:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima omugabe Yehoyakimu yaatuma abantu Misri, Elinasani mwene Akiboora n'abandi abu yaabaire aine, <verse eid="JER 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 26:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:17">Yer 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:26">Neh 9:26</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:35">Mat 21:35</ref>. </char></note> baihayo Uria, baamureetera omugabe Yehoyakimu, yaamwitsa rurara, omutumbi gwe baagunaga omu iziikiro ry'abantu b'obutoosha.<verse eid="JER 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 26:24" />Kwonka Ahikaamu mwene Shafani yaarwana ahari Yeremia, tiyaaheebwayo mu mikono y'abantu kwitwa.<verse eid="JER 26:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JER 27" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia okuhabura Zedekia kwehongyera Nebukadeneeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 27:1" />Omu kutandika kw'obutegyeki bwa Zedekia mwene Yosia omugabe wa Yuda, ekigambo eki kikaija ahari Yeremia nikiruga ahari MUKAMA. <verse eid="JER 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 27:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 28:10">Yer 28:10</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:13">Lev 26:13</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:11">1 Bag 22:11</ref>. </char></note> Yeremia yaagira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA angambiire naagira ati: Yesharire enkoba, oyebaijere emigamba, obite omu bitsya. <verse eid="JER 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 27:3" />Bwanyima otume aha mugabe wa Edomu, owa Moabu, ow'Abaamoni, owa Tuuro n'owa Sidoni, obatumeho entumwa eziizire Yerusaalemu ahari Zedekia omugabe wa Yuda. <verse eid="JER 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 27:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:5">Yer 21:5</ref>. </char></note> Ozitume ahari bakama baazo oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba naagira ati: Oku nikwo muraagambire bakama baanyu muti: <verse eid="JER 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 27:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:5">Yer 21:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 115:15">Zab 115:15</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 115:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:12">Isa 45:12</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 4:17">Dan 4:17</ref>. </char></note> Niinye naahangire ensi n'abantu n'enyamaishwa ebigirimu, nkabihangisa obushoboorozi bwangye bwingi n'omukono gwangye ogugoroirwe, kandi ningiha weena ou ndikusiima. <verse eid="JER 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 27:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:9">Yer 25:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 28:14">28:14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 30:21">Ezk 30:21</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 30:25">25</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu hati ezi nsi zoona naaziha omwiru wangye Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni, kandi naamuha n'enyamaishwa z'omu ishwa zoona kumuheereza. <verse eid="JER 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 27:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:12">Yer 25:12</ref>, <ref loc="JER 25:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:31">52:31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 2:37">Dan 2:37</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 2:38">38</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 5:1">5:1</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 5:30">30</ref>. </char></note> Amahanga goona garyamukorera, n'omwana we n'omwijukuru, okuhitsya obu obunaku bw'ensi ye burihika; bwanyima amahanga maingi n'abagabe b'amaani baryamugira omuhuuku waabo.<verse eid="JER 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 27:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 30:8">Yer 30:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka eihanga ryona nari obugabe bwona, oburyanga kuheereza Nebukadeneeza ogwo, omugabe wa Babulooni, n'okwikiriza kwinika ebitsya kutegyekwa ogwo mugabe, ndyafubira eryo ihanga na rurara n'enjara n'orufu, okuhitsya obu ndirimarisaho omukono gwe; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 27:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:14">Yer 14:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:8">29:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 2:6">Isa 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:10">Bir 18:10</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo murekye kuhurira baanabi baanyu, abafumu baanyu, nari abarogi baanyu, abarikubagira bati: Timuriheereza omugabe wa Babulooni; <verse eid="JER 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 27:10" />ahabw'okuba ebi barikubahanuurira n'ebishuba ebirikwija kubareetera okutwarwa hare n'ensi yaanyu; kandi naanye ndyagibabingamu, muhwerekyerere. <verse eid="JER 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 27:11" />Kwonka eihanga ryona eririikiriza kwinika ebitsya kutegyekwa omugabe wa Babulooni n'okumuheereza, eryo niryo ndireka omu nsi yaaryo kugihinga n'okugituuramu; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 27:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 38:17">Yer 38:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima naagambira Zedekia omugabe wa Yuda omu muringo nk'ogwo, ningira nti: Mwinikye ebitsya byanyu, mutegyekwe omugabe wa Babulooni, mumuheereze, we n'abantu be, mubone kugumaho. <verse eid="JER 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 27:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:31">Ezk 18:31</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu iwe n'abantu baawe ku mwakwitwa rurara n'enjara n'orufu, nk'oku MUKAMA agambire aha ihanga ryona eririkwanga kuheereza omugabe wa Babulooni, mukaazira ki? <verse eid="JER 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 27:14" />Mutahurira ebigambo bya baanabi abarikubagira bati: Timuriheereza omugabe wa Babulooni; ahabw'okuba ebi barikubahanuurira n'ebishuba. <verse eid="JER 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 27:15" />Tiinye mbatumire, kureka nibahanuura ebishuba omu iziina ryangye; ekiraarugyemu ndyababinga omuri egi nsi, muhwerekyerere, imwe na baanabi abarikubahanuurira; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 27:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 28:3">Yer 28:3</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:13">2 Bag 24:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima naagambira abanyamurwa n'abantu abo boona nti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Mutahurira ebi baanabi barikubahanuurira nibagira bati: Reeba, ebintu by'omu nju ya MUKAMA nibiija kwihwa Babulooni, bigarurwe juba; ahabw'okuba ebi barikubahanuurira n'ebishuba. <verse eid="JER 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 27:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:34">Yer 7:34</ref>. </char></note> Mutabahurira; muheereze omugabe wa Babulooni, mubone kugumaho. Mbwenu oru rurembo ku rwakuhinduka amatongo, rukaazira ki? <verse eid="JER 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 27:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:16">Isa 59:16</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 1:2">Dan 1:2</ref>. </char></note> Ku baraabe bari baanabi, kandi ekigambo kya MUKAMA ku kiraabe kiri hamwe nabo, nibeeshengyereze MUKAMA ow'amahe, ebintu ebitsigaire omu nju ya MUKAMA n'omu nju y'omugabe wa Yuda kandi n'omuri Yerusaalemu birekye kutwarwa Babulooni. <verse eid="JER 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 27:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:13">2 Bag 25:13</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba aha nyomyo, ekitanka, ebitebe by'ebinaabiro, n'ebindi bintu ebitsigaire omuri oru rurembo, <verse eid="JER 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 27:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 24:1-10">Yer 24:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:14">2 Bag 24:14</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 24:15">15</ref>. </char></note> ebi Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni ataratwaire, obu yaatwara Yekonia mwene Yehoyakimu omugabe wa Yuda, naamwiha Yerusaalemu akamutwara Babulooni ari enkwatwa hamwe n'abakungu ba Yuda n'aba Yerusaalemu <verse eid="JER 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 27:21" />naagira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba aha bintu ebitsigaire omu nju ya MUKAMA n'omu nju y'omugabe wa Yuda n'omuri Yerusaalemu, naagira ati: <verse eid="JER 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 27:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:10">Yer 29:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:5">32:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:17">52:17</ref>, <ref loc="JER 52:20">20</ref>, <ref loc="JER 52:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 1:1">Ezr 1:1</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 1:7">7</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 1:8">8</ref>. </char></note> Biryatwarwa Babulooni, kandi niyo biriguma okuhitsya aha izooba eri ndibiijukiraho. Bwanyima ndyabigarura, mbite omuri ogu mwanya.<verse eid="JER 27:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JER 28" />
  <para style="s1">Hanania okuhanuura naahakanisa Yeremia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 28:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 9:3">Yos 9:3</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 21:17">21:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuri ogwo mwaka aha kutandika kw'obutegyeki bwa Zedekia omugabe wa Yuda, omu kwezi kwa kataano okw'omu mwaka gwa kana, Hanania mwene Azuuri, nabi ow'omuri Gibeoni, akangambirira omu nju ya MUKAMA omu maisho g'abanyamurwa n'abantu boona naagira ati: <verse eid="JER 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 28:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:2">Yer 27:2</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Mpenzire omugamba gw'obutegyeki bw'omugabe wa Babulooni. <verse eid="JER 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 28:3" />Emyaka ebiri etakahweire, ndyagarura omu mwanya ogu ebintu byona eby'enju ya MUKAMA, ebi Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni yaihiremu, akatwara Babulooni; <verse eid="JER 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 28:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:10">Yer 22:10</ref>. </char></note> kandi ndyagarura Yekonia mwene Yehoyakimu omugabe wa Yuda n'Abayuda boona abaagiire Babulooni bari enkwatwa; ahabw'okuba ndyahenda omugamba gw'obutegyeki bw'omugabe wa Babulooni.<verse eid="JER 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 28:5" />Bwanyima nabi Yeremia yaagambirira nabi Hanania omu maisho g'abanyamurwa n'abantu boona abaabaire beemereire omu nju ya MUKAMA, <verse eid="JER 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 28:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:36">1 Bag 1:36</ref>. </char></note> naagira ati: Amiina! Nkaabaasibwa ki MUKAMA akora atyo; kandi ahikiiriza ebi waahanuura, agarura omu mwanya ogu ebintu by'enju ya MUKAMA ebiri Babulooni, hamwe n'abatwairweyo boona bari enkwatwa. <verse eid="JER 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 28:7" />Kwonka hati hurira ekigambo eki ndikukugambira, iwe n'abantu boona. <verse eid="JER 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 28:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 26:18">Yer 26:18</ref>. </char></note> Baanabi aba ira abaatubandiize twembi bakahanuurira amahanga maingi n'obugabe bw'amaani, ku birihikwaho engamba, enjara n'orufu. <verse eid="JER 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 28:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:14">Yer 6:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:22">Bir 18:22</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka nabi orikuhanuura eby'obusingye, ekigambo kya nabi ogwo ku kiriba kwo, niho kirimanyirwa ngu buzimazima MUKAMA niwe yaamutumire.<verse eid="JER 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 28:10" />Bwanyima nabi Hanania yaiha emigamba eyaabaire eri aha bitsya bya nabi Yeremia, yaagihenda, <verse eid="JER 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 28:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:7">Yer 27:7</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:11">1 Bag 22:11</ref>. </char></note> kandi yaagambira omu maisho g'abantu boona ati: oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Nikwo ndihenda ntyo omugamba gw'obutegyeki bwa Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni, nkwagwiha aha bitsya by'amahanga goona, emyaka ebiri etakahweire. Kwonka nabi Yeremia yaayegyendera.<verse eid="JER 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 28:12" />Ku haahingwireho ebiro, nabi Hanania aherize kuhenda emigamba eyaabaire eri aha bitsya bya nabi Yeremia, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija ahari Yeremia nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 28:13" />Irooko ogambire Hanania oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Ohenzire emigamba y'ebiti, kwonka nyowe niinyija kukora ey'ebyoma omu mwanya gwayo; <verse eid="JER 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 28:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:11">Yer 25:11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:48">Bir 28:48</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Ntaire omugamba gw'ekyoma aha bitsya by'ago mahanga goona kuba abahuuku ba Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni; kandi baryamuheereza, ahabw'okuba mmuhaire nangwa n'enyamaishwa z'omu ishwa. <verse eid="JER 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 28:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:31">Yer 29:31</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:20">Bir 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 13:22">Ezk 13:22</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 13:23">23</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nabi Yeremia yaagira nabi Hanania ati: Hurira, iwe Hanania; MUKAMA takutumire, kandi oreeteire aba bantu kwesiga ebishuba. <verse eid="JER 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 28:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:32">Yer 29:32</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 13:5">Bir 13:5</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo MUKAMA arikugirira ati: Reeba, niinyija kukwiha omu nsi. Ogu mwaka noogufamu, ahabw'okuba ogambire eby'okugomera MUKAMA.<verse eid="JER 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 28:17" />Omuri ogwo mwaka omu kwezi kwa mushanju nabi Hanania yaafa.<verse eid="JER 28:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JER 29" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia okuhandiikira enkwatwa omuri Babulooni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 29:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 8:1">Ezk 8:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebi nibyo bigambo by'ebaruha ei nabi Yeremia yaahandiikire ari Yerusaalemu, naahandiikira abakuru omu nkwatwa, abanyamurwa, baanabi, n'abantu boona, abu Nebukadeneeza yaihire Yerusaalemu, akatwara Babulooni bari enkwatwa. <verse eid="JER 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 29:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 24:1">Yer 24:1</ref>. </char></note> Omuri obwo bunaku omugabe Yekonia, nyina-omugabe, abakonwa, abanyiginya ba Yuda na Yerusaalemu, ababaizi n'abaheesi, bakaba barugire Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="JER 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 29:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 34:8">2 Bus 34:8</ref>. </char></note> Egyo baruha ekatwarwa Elasa mwene Shafani, na Gemaria mwene Hilukia, abu Zedekia omugabe wa Yuda yaatumire Babulooni ahari Nebukadeneeza omugabe waayo, <verse eid="JER 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 29:4" />neegira eti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugambira enkwatwa zoona, ezi yaihire Yerusaalemu akoohereza Babulooni, naagira ati: <verse eid="JER 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 29:5" />Nimwombekye amaju, mugatuuremu; muhingye emisiri, murye ebi muryezamu; <verse eid="JER 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 29:6" />mushwere abakazi, muzaare abaana b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki; mushwererere batabani baanyu, kandi muhingire bahara baanyu, nabo bazaare abaana b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki, mukanyireyo, murekye kutuuba. <verse eid="JER 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 29:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 6:10">Ezr 6:10</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 2:1">1 Tim 2:1</ref>, <ref loc="1TI 2:2">2</ref>. </char></note> Kandi orwo rurembo oru naabatwairemu muri enkwatwa, murwendeze ebirungi, murushabire ahari MUKAMA; ahabw'okuba ku ruriba gye, naimwe muryaba gye. <verse eid="JER 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 29:8" />Ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Mutaikiriza baanabi n'abafumu baanyu abari omuriimwe kubahabya, kandi muteeta aha birooto ebi barikuroota, <verse eid="JER 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 29:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:9, 10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:12">Yer 25:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 27:22">27:22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:14">33:14</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba ebi barikubahanuurira omu iziina ryangye n'ebishuba. Tiinye mbatumire; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 29:10" />Kureka oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Emyaka makumi mushanju eyaahanwirwe ahari Babulooni ku erihwa, ndyabataayaayira, mpikiirize eki naabaraganiise, mbagarure omu mwanya ogu. <verse eid="JER 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 29:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:11, 12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:17">Yer 31:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:3">33:3</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:3">Dan 9:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 55:8">Isa 55:8</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 55:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba nimmanya ebi ndikubateekateekyera, eby'oburungi, bitari by'obubi, ngu mbone kubatamu amatsiko g'ebiribaho bwanyima; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 29:12" />Obwo nibwo murintakira, mukaija mukanshaba, naanye nkabahurira. <verse eid="JER 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 29:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 24:7">Yer 24:7</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 8:17">Enf 8:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:29">Bir 4:29</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 30:1-3">30:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 15:2">2 Bus 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 32:6">Zab 32:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:34">78:34</ref>. </char></note> Muryansherura, mumbone, ku murinsherura n'omutima gwanyu gwona. <verse eid="JER 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 29:14" />Buzimazima muryambona, kandi ndyabaiha omu bukwatwa, mbataaruure omu mahanga goona n'omu myanya yoona, ei naababingiiremu, mbagarure omu mwanya ogu naabaihiremu nimbatwara omu bukwatwa; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 29:15" />Ahabw'okuba mugizire muti: MUKAMA atwimukiize baanabi omuri Babulooni <verse eid="JER 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 29:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:2">Yer 22:2</ref>. </char></note> oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba aha mugabe ori aha ngoma ya Daudi, n'aha bantu boona abatwire omuri orwo rurembo, beene waanyu abataratwairwe naimwe mu bukwatwa, <verse eid="JER 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 29:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 24:8">Yer 24:8</ref>. </char></note> naagira ati: Reeba, niinyija kubaitsa rurara, mbateeze enjara n'orufu, mbagire nk'emitiini eri emibi munonga etarikubaasa kuriibwa. <verse eid="JER 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 29:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:4">Yer 15:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 42:18">42:18</ref>. </char></note> Ndyabakuratsa rurara, enjara n'orufu, mbagire ekirikutiinisa aha mahanga goona ag'omu nsi, babe eky'okukyeenwa, eky'okutiinisa, eky'okweshaanya, n'ekijumo omu mahanga goona agu ndiba mbabingiiremu, <verse eid="JER 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 29:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:4">Yer 25:4</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okutata mutima aha bigambo byangye, ebi naabaire ntuura nimbatumaho abairu bangye baanabi, kwonka mukanga kuhurira; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 29:20" />Mbwenu muhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA, imwe mwena enkwatwa abu naabingire Yerusaalemu kuza Babulooni. <verse eid="JER 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 29:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:14">Yer 14:14</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba ahari Ahabu mwene Kolaaya, na Zedekia mwene Maaseya, abarikubahanuurira ebishuba, naagira ati: Reeba, ndyabahayo omu mikono ya Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni, abaitire omu maisho gaanyu. <verse eid="JER 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 29:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 24:9">Yer 24:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:15">Isa 65:15</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 3:6">Dan 3:6</ref>. </char></note> Enkwatwa zoona eziri Babulooni ezaarugire Yuda nibo ziriihaho ekijumo nizigira ziti: MUKAMA nakakugire nka Zedekia na Ahabu, abu omugabe wa Babulooni yaayokize omu muriro <verse eid="JER 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 29:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:14">Yer 23:14</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:5">Mal 3:5</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okukora eby'obushema omuri Israeli, bakashambana n'abakazi ba bataahi baabo, bakagamba ebigambo by'ebishuba omu iziina ryangye, ebi ntarabaragiire. Niinye ndikubimanya, kandi niinye mushinja; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 29:24" />Kandi mugambire Shemaaya owa Nehelaamu, muti: <verse eid="JER 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 29:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:1">Yer 21:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 35:4">35:4</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Oyeragiire, waatwekyera abantu boona ab'omuri Yerusaalemu ebaruha, na Zefania mwene Maaseya omunyamurwa, n'abanyamurwa boona noogira oti: <verse eid="JER 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 29:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 20:1">Yer 20:1</ref>, <ref loc="JER 20:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 11:4">2 Bag 11:4</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 11:15">15</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA akugizire omunyamurwa omu mwanya gwa Yehoyaada omunyamurwa, kugira obushoboorozi omu nju ya MUKAMA bw'okutegyeka omushazi weena orikuhanuura, kumuboha amaguru n'okumuta omu nkomo. <verse eid="JER 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 29:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:7">Yer 32:7</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu n'enki ekikuzibiire kuhana Yeremia owa Anatoosi, oyegizire nabi ahariimwe? <verse eid="JER 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 29:28" />Ahabw'okuba itwe abari omuri Babulooni atutumireho, naagira ati: obukwatwa bwanyu nibwija kumara omwanya muhango; mbwenu mwombekye amaju, mugatuuremu; muhingye emisiri, murye ebi muryezamu.<verse eid="JER 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 29:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 25:18">2 Bag 25:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Zefania omunyamurwa, ku yaareebire egyo baruha, yaagishomera nabi Yeremia. <verse eid="JER 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 29:30" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija ahari Yeremia nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 29:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:31">Yer 5:31</ref>. </char></note> Tuma aha nkwatwa zoona, ozigire oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba ahari Shemaaya owa Nehelaamu, naagira ati: Ahabwa Shemaaya kubahanuurira ntamutumire, akabeesigisa ebishuba, <verse eid="JER 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 29:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:6">Yer 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 28:16">28:16</ref>. </char></note> nikyo MUKAMA arikugirira ati: Ndyafubira Shemaaya owa Nehelaamu n'abaijukuru; tarigira n'omwe oritsigara omu ihanga eri orireeba ebirungi ebi ndikorera abantu bangye, ahabw'okuba agambire eby'okungomera; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 29:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JER 30" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia okuhandiika omu kitabo eby'obunabi bwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 30:1" />Ekigambo ekyarugire ahari MUKAMA kikaija ahari Yeremia nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 30:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:2">Yer 36:2</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 2:2">Hab 2:2</ref>, <ref loc="HAB 2:3">3</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Handiika omu kitabo ebigambo byona ebi naakugambiire; <verse eid="JER 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 30:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 12:15">Yer 12:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 16:15">16:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:14">29:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:23">31:23</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:44">32:44</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:7">33:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 2:1">Ezr 2:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 42:10">Yob 42:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:12">Isa 11:12</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 11:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:42">Ezk 20:42</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 1:11">Hos 1:11</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba reeba, obunaku buryahika, obu ndimariraho kimwe obukwatwa bw'abantu bangye Abaisraeli n'Abayuda, nkabagarura omu nsi ei naahaire baishenkurubo, kandi baryagikubuura.<verse eid="JER 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 30:4" />Ebi nibyo bigambo ebi MUKAMA yaagambire ahari Israeli na Yuda.<verse eid="JER 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 30:5" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:5">Tuhuriire eiraka ry'abantu abarikukangarana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:5">Baine obwoba, kandi bataine busingye.<verse eid="JER 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 30:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:6, 7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:6">Yoel 2:6</ref>, <ref loc="JOL 2:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:8">Isa 13:8</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 1:14">Zef 1:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu mubuuze, mureebe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:6">Omushaija naabaasa kurumwa okuzaara?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:6">Ahabw'enki nindeeba buri mushaija</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:6">Ayekwaitse omu manyaanya nk'omukazi orikurumwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:6">Aha maisho ge hahinduriize?<verse eid="JER 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 30:7" />Ai bambe! Eshi eryo izooba rigumire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:7">Tihaine rindi eririkushushana naryo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:7">Nibyo biro by'enaku za Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:7">Kwonka aryabyogamu.<verse eid="JER 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 30:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 27:2">Yer 27:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:27">Ezk 34:27</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 1:14">Nah 1:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi MUKAMA ow'amahe naagira ati: Ahari eryo izooba ndyahenda omugamba gw'obuhuuku, ngwihe aha bitsya byabo, ncwe ebibabohire; kandi abanyamahanga tibarigaruka kubagira bahuuku bundi; <verse eid="JER 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 30:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:5">Yer 23:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 55:3">Isa 55:3</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 55:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 3:5">Hos 3:5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:69">Luk 1:69</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 1:70">70</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:22">Byak 13:22</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 13:23">23</ref>. </char></note> kureka baryaheereza MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo na Daudi omugabe waabo, ou ndibaimukiza.<verse eid="JER 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuhanuura aha kugaruka kw'abaatwairwe omu bukwatwa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 30:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 42:11">Yer 42:11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 46:27">46:27</ref>, <ref loc="JER 46:28">28</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 41:8">Isa 41:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:5">43:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo otatiina, iwe Yakobo omwiru wangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">Nikwo MUKAMA arikugira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">Naiwe Israeli, otahahaaza omutima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">Ahabw'okuba ndyakujuna, nkwihe hare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">N'oruzaaro rwawe ndwihe omu nsi y'obukwatwa bwarwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">Yakobo aryagaruka, ahitsye omutima omunda, aruhuukye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">Tihaine orimutiinisa.<verse eid="JER 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 30:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 10:24">Yer 10:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba ndi hamwe naiwe kukujuna;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">Nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">Ndyamariraho kimwe amahanga goona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">Agu naakutaataanisiizemu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">Kwonka iwe tindikumariraho kimwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">Kureka ndyakuteera ninkubarira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">Kandi hoona tindikureka ntakufubiire.<verse eid="JER 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 30:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 10:19">Yer 10:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 15:18">15:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:12">Obusaasi bwawe ti bw'okukira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:12">Obuhuta bwawe nibuhurura munonga,<verse eid="JER 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 30:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 46:11">Yer 46:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tihaine w'okukutonganira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:13">Tihariho mubazi gw'okubwomoora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:13">N'obu kyakuba eky'okukutambira.<verse eid="JER 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 30:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:30">Yer 4:30</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 13:24">Yob 13:24</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 30:21">30:21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:10">Isa 63:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkunzi zaawe zoona zikwebirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">Tizaakikwetaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">Ahabw'okuba nkuhutaarize obuhuta bw'obuzigu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">N'ekifubiro ky'omuzigu otaine saasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">Ahabw'okuba orubanja rwawe ni ruhango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">N'ebibi byawe birengyesereize.<verse eid="JER 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 30:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:6">Yer 5:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'enki nootakisibwa obusaasi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:15">Okuhururwa kwawe tikurikubaasa kutambwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:15">Ebyo byona nkabikukorera</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:15">Ahabw'orubanja rwawe ruhango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:15">N'ahabw'ebibi byawe ebirengyesereize.<verse eid="JER 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 30:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 10:25">Yer 10:25</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:22">Kur 23:22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 33:1">Isa 33:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 41:11">41:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo abarikukumaraho baryamarwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:16">N'abazigu baawe boona oku baingana baryatwarwa omu bukwatwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:16">Abarikukunyaga baryanyagwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:16">N'abarikukushahura, ndyabahindura eky'okushahurwa,<verse eid="JER 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 30:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 33:6">Yer 33:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 6:2">Zab 6:2</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 4:6">Mik 4:6</ref>, <ref loc="MIC 4:7">7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba ndyakugaruramu amagara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:17">n'obuhuta bwawe mbukize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:17">Ahakuba bakakweta encuubwa nibagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:17">Ni Saayuuni, etagira ogyetaho!<verse eid="JER 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 30:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 13:16">Bir 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 9:11">Amo 9:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:18">Reeba, ndyagarura ab'omu mahema ga Yakobo, mbaihe omu bukwatwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:18">Ngirire embabazi amaka ge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:18">Orurembo ruryagaruka kwombekwa aha mituumo yaarwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:18">Kandi n'ekikaari kiryaza ahu kyabaire kiri.<verse eid="JER 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 30:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:12">Yer 31:12</ref>, <ref loc="JER 31:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:11">33:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 35:10">Isa 35:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:10">Ezk 36:10</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 36:37">37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuribyo haryarugamu ebyeshongoro by'okusiima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:19">N'amaraka g'abarikushemererwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:19">Ndyabahaisa ekitiinisa, tibariba abarikugaywa.<verse eid="JER 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 30:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:26">Isa 1:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaana baabo baryaba nk'oku baabaire bari ira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:20">N'eihanga ryabo riryahamibwa omu maisho gangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:20">Kandi ndyafubira abarikubahata boona.<verse eid="JER 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 30:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 49:19">Yer 49:19</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 49:10">Kut 49:10</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 16:5">Kub 16:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:18">Bir 18:18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 5:4">Heb 5:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omugabe waabo aryaba omwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:21">Omutegyeki waabo abakomookyemu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:21">Ndyamwiriza haihi, ampikye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:21">Mbwenu owaakwehanga kumpika n'oha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:21">Nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 30:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 24:7">Yer 24:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:1">31:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:38">32:38</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:12">Lev 26:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muryaba abantu bangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:22">Naanye mbe Ruhanga waanyu.<verse eid="JER 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 30:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 23:19">Yer 23:19</ref>, <ref loc="JER 23:20">20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, eihunga rya MUKAMA!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:23">Ekiniga kye kyashohora nk'omuyaga gw'akasooroora;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:23">Nikiza kuteera emitwe y'ababi.<verse eid="JER 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 30:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 12:13">Yer 12:13</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 3:5">Hos 3:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekiniga kya MUKAMA ekingi tikirigarukayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:24">Okuhitsya obu ariheza kufubira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:24">N'okuhikiiriza ebi arikwenda kukora.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:24">Omu biro by'aha muheru nibwo murikimanyira kimwe.<verse eid="JER 30:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JER 31" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okuhuumuriza abantu be n'okubagarura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 31:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 6:18">2 Kor 6:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati: Omu bunaku obwo ndyaba Ruhanga w'enganda za Israeli zoona, nabo babe abantu bangye. <verse eid="JER 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 31:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Zab 95:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:14">Isa 63:14</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:2">Abantu abahonokire ahari rurara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:2">Bakagirirwa embabazi omu ihamba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:2">Israeli ku yaasherwire oburuhuukiro,<verse eid="JER 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 31:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 7:8">Bir 7:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 36:10">Zab 36:10</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 11:4">Hos 11:4</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:28">Rom 11:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA yaamweyoreka ari omu nsi ya hare, naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:3">Nkakukunda na rukundo etahwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:3">Nikyo ngumiire ninkugirira embabazi.<verse eid="JER 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 31:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 33:7">Yer 33:7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 15:20">Kur 15:20</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 6:14">2 Sam 6:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:10">Isa 61:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyagaruka nkwombekye, naiwe oyombekwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:4">Iwe mwishiki wa Israeli 'we oshugaine!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:4">Oryagaruka oyehunde ebitaasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:4">Oshohore oze kuzina n'abarikushemererwa.<verse eid="JER 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 31:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 2:3">Isa 2:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 27:13">27:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oryagaruka ohingye emizaabibu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:5">Aha bibungo bya Samaria;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:5">Ababyazi baryagibyara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:5">Bashemerererwe ebijuma byayo.<verse eid="JER 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 31:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 2:3">Isa 2:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 27:13">27:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba haryabaho eizooba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:6">Ei abarinzi bariimukizaho amaraka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:6">Omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu nibagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:6">Mwimukye tugyende, twinamukye Saayuuni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:6">Tushangyeyo MUKAMA, Ruhanga waitu.<verse eid="JER 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 31:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:25">Zab 118:25</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 12:6">Isa 12:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:18">65:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:7">Mweshongore n'okushemererwa ahabwa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:7">Muteere akaari ahabw'eri ihanga eririkukira agandi obukuru;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:7">Murangye, muhimbise, mugire muti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:7">MUKAMA ajunire abantu be Abaisraeli abahonokireho.<verse eid="JER 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 31:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 3:19">Yer 3:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 6:22">6:22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:3">23:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 35:5">Isa 35:5</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 35:6">6</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 35:7">7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, ndyabareeta nimbaiha omu nsi y'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:8">Mbataaruure nimbaiha aha muheru gw'ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:8">Barimu empumi, ebirema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:8">Abakazi abaine enda, n'abarikurumwa kuzaara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:8">Bagarukye aha, bari omutwe muhango.<verse eid="JER 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 31:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 4:22">Kur 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 3:13">Ezr 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 10:1">10:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 23:2">Zab 23:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 35:8">Isa 35:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:19">43:19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:10">49:10</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 49:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 3:21">Yer 3:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:4">50:4</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zek 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:15">Rom 8:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryaija nibarira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">Mbeebembere, mbagarure nimbarembesereza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">Ndyabarabya aha tugyera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">Omu muhanda ogugororokire, omu batariteerera ntsibo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">Ahakuba ahari Israeli ndi omuzaire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">Kandi Efuraimu n'omujigaijo gwangye.<verse eid="JER 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 31:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:11">Isa 40:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe mahanga 'mwe, nimuhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:10">Mukirangye omu birwa ebiri hare, nimugira muti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:10">Owaataataaniise Israeli niwe arimutaaruura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:10">Akamurinda nk'oku omuriisa arinda obusyo bwe.<verse eid="JER 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 31:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 43:1">Isa 43:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:20">48:20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:24">49:24</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 49:25">25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA acungwire Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:11">Yaamwiha omu mikono y'orikumukiza amaani.<verse eid="JER 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 31:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 12:17">Bir 12:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 2:2">Isa 2:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 35:10">35:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 58:11">58:11</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 3:5">Hos 3:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryaija aha mutwe gw'orushozi Saayuuni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">Beeshongorereyo munonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">Bashemerererwe oburungi bwa MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">Bashangyeyo engano, viinyo n'amajuta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">Kandi n'abaana b'omu masyo g'entaama n'ag'ente,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">Amagara gaabo garyaba nk'omusiri ogurikwitirirwa amaizi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">Kandi tibarigaruka kuhwa maani.<verse eid="JER 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 31:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 16:20">Yoh 16:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo nibwo abaishiki barizina, bakashemererwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:13">Abatsigazi n'abagurusi bakeesiimira hamwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:13">Ahabw'okuba okucura ndyakuhindura okushemererwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:13">Mbahuumurize, mbahe okwesiima omu mwanya gw'enaku;<verse eid="JER 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 31:14" />Kandi amagara g'abanyamurwa ndyagaigutsa eby'ebishaju,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:14">Abantu bangye bahaagye oburungi bwangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:14">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 31:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 10:20">Yer 10:20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 2:18">Mat 2:18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 35:19">Kut 35:19</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 35:20">20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">Enduuru neehurirwa omuri Raama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">Okucura n'okurira munonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">Rakeeli naacurira abaana be;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">Tarikwenda kuyaagirwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">ahabw'okuba bahweireho.<verse eid="JER 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 31:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 1:5">Ezr 1:5</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 1:11">Hos 1:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:16">Zibira eiraka ryawe kucura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:16">N'amaisho gaawe kuhimintikwamu amarira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:16">Ahabw'okuba ebi orikukora biryakuhaisa ebihembo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:16">Kandi abo baana baryaruga omu nsi y'abazigu baabo, bagarukye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:16">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 31:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 29:11">Yer 29:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hakiriho amatsiko ahabw'ebirikubaho bwanyima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:17">Abaana baawe baryagaruka omu nsi yaabo y'obuzaarwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:17">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 31:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 80:3">Zab 80:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkahurira Efuraimu naaborooga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:18">Okampana, naahanwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:18">Nk'ekimasha kitakeegyesiibwe kuhinga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:18">Ongarure, mbone kugarurwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:18">Ahabw'okuba niiwe MUKAMA, Ruhanga wangye.<verse eid="JER 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 31:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 3:25">Yer 3:25</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 30:2">Bir 30:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 21:12">Ezk 21:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku naaherize kuhinduka, naayeteisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:19">Kandi ku naaherize kwegyesibwa, naayemamaata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:19">Naagira enshoni, naabwerabwera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:19">Ahakuba nkaba nyekoreire ekihemu ky'obutsigazi bwangye.<verse eid="JER 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 31:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="SNG 5:4">Kyesh 5:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 16:11">Isa 16:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Efuraimu t'omwana wangye ou nkunda?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">T'omwana wangye enkoramutima?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">Ahabw'okuba kaingi, n'obu ndaabe mmugambaho, nimmuhana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">Kwonka na hati ninkimwijuka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">Nikyo omutima gwangye gumwiniriire orushusho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">Buzimazima ndyamugirira embabazi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 31:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 30:4">Yer 30:4</ref>, <ref loc="JER 30:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 57:14">Isa 57:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yeteereho obumanyiso bw'omuhanda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">Oyeteereho ebyapa by'okukuhabura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">Oyetegyereze gye omuhanda rugyendwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">Ogu waatoire noogyenda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">Garuka, iwe Israeli 'we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">Ogarukye omuri ezi ndembo zaawe.<verse eid="JER 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 31:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:18">Yer 2:18</ref>, <ref loc="JER 2:23">23</ref>, <ref loc="JER 2:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:4">49:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oryahitsya hi n'okukora oku n'oku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:22">Iwe mwishiki orikugaruka enyima 'we?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:22">Ahakuba MUKAMA ahangire ekitakareebwaga mu nsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:22">Omukazi kurinda omushaija.<verse eid="JER 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okuragaana n'abantu be endagaano nsya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 31:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 30:3">Yer 30:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:7">50:7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 8:3">Zek 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 122:6">Zab 122:6</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 122:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:26">Isa 1:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Ku ndibaiha omu bukwatwa, naabagarura, baryagaruka bakorese egi ndamutsyo omu nsi ya Yuda n'omu ndembo zaayo, nibagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:23">MUKAMA akuhe omugisha, iwe butaaho bw'okuhikiirira 'we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:23">Ekibungo ekirikwera!<verse eid="JER 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 31:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 33:13">Yer 33:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abayuda n'ab'omu ndembo zaayo zoona baryatuurayo kumwe, abahingi n'abarikufurafuruka n'amasyo gaabo. <verse eid="JER 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 31:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 36:8">Zab 36:8</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba ndyahaazya abaruhire, n'abahweirwemu amaani ngabagaruremu.<verse eid="JER 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 31:26" />Ahonaaho ku naasisiimukire, naashanga oturo nitukinnurira.<verse eid="JER 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 31:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:10">Isa 53:10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 10:9">Zek 10:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA yaagira ati: Reeba, obunaku nibwija, obu ndibiba omu nju ya Israeli n'omu ya Yuda embibo z'abantu n'ez'amatungo. <verse eid="JER 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 31:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:10">Yer 1:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 24:6">24:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:40">31:40</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:42">32:42</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:27">44:27</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku naabataireho amaisho kubarandura, kubasheenya, kubakumbagaza, kubacwekyereza n'okubareetaho akabi, nikwo ndibataho amaisho kubombeka n'okubabyara, nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 31:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 5:7">Tonz 5:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 18:2">Ezk 18:2</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 18:3">3</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 18:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Omu biro ebyo tibarigaruka kugira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:29">Abazaire bariire emizaabibu erikushaarira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:29">Amaino g'abaana gaaba nigo gaagira amangigina;<verse eid="JER 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 31:30" />kureka buri muntu aryafa azire ekibi kye, n'omuntu weena orirya emizaabibu erikushaarira, amaino ge nigo garigira amangigina.<verse eid="JER 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 31:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:31-34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 8:8-12">Heb 8:8-12</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati: Reeba, ebiro biryaija, obu ndiragaana endagaano nsya n'enju ya Israeli n'eya Yuda,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:20">Luk 22:20</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 3:6">2 Kor 3:6</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JER 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 31:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:14">Yer 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:31">Bir 1:31</ref>. </char></note> etarikushushana n'ei naaragaine na baishenkurubo, obu naabakwata aha mukono kubaiha omu nsi ya Misri; haza egyo ndagaano yangye bakagiita, n'obu ndaabe naabaire ndi ibabo; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 31:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 31:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:22">Yer 30:22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:40">32:40</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 37:31">Zab 37:31</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:26">Ezk 37:26</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hos 2:23</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 8:8">Zek 8:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 3:3">2 Kor 3:3</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:16">Heb 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:7">Kush 21:7</ref>. </char></note> Kureka egi niyo ndagaano ei ndiragaana n'enju ya Israeli bwanyima y'ebiro ebyo; ndyabatamu ebiragiro byangye, mbihandiikye omu mitima yaabo; kandi ndyaba Ruhanga waabo, nabo babe abantu bangye; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 31:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:13">Yer 6:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:8">33:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 36:3">36:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:20">50:20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:25">Isa 43:25</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 54:13">54:13</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:18">Mik 7:18</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 10:43">Byak 10:43</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:27">Rom 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:17">Heb 10:17</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omuntu aryaba atakyegyesa mutaahi we nari mwene ishe, naamugira ati: Manya MUKAMA; ahabw'okuba boona baryammanya okuruga aha muto okuhika aha mukuru; ahakuba ndyabasaasira eby'okushiisha byabo, n'ekibi kyabo tindikiijuka bundi; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 31:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 10:16">Yer 10:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">Oha eizooba kwakira abantu nyomushana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">Akaragiira okwezi n'enyonyoozi kubamurikira nyekiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">Oreetera enyanja kwimuka, ebingonzi byayo bikahoorera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">MUKAMA ow'amahe niryo iziina rye.<verse eid="JER 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 31:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 32:24-26">Yer 32:24-26</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 54:9">Isa 54:9</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 54:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 148:6">Zab 148:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA ogwo naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:36">Ebyo bintu ku byakuruga omu buteeka bwabyo omu maisho gangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:36">Obwo n'oruzaaro rwa Israeli rukaarekyera aho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:36">Kuba eihanga omu maisho gangye ebiro byona.<verse eid="JER 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 31:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 11:1">Rom 11:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:37">Eiguru eriri ahaiguru ku ryakubaasa kugyerwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:37">N'emisingi y'ensi okuzimu ekazoorwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:37">Obwo nkaacwa oruzaaro rwa Israeli rwona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:37">Ndutura ebi rwakozire byona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:37">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 31:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 14:13">2 Bag 14:13</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 3:1">Neh 3:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi MUKAMA yaagira ati: Reeba, obunaku nibwija, obu oru rurembo rurigaruka kwombekyerwa MUKAMA, okuruga aha munaara gwa Hananeeli okuhika aha Irembo ry'Akeekubo. <verse eid="JER 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 31:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:3">Ezk 40:3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 1:16">Zek 1:16</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 2:1">2:1</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 2:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:1">Kush 11:1</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omugoye gw'okugyeresa guryayeyongyera omu maisho, gugumizemu guhikye aha kibungo Garebu, gukube guze Goa. <verse eid="JER 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 31:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:31">Yer 7:31</ref>, <ref loc="JER 7:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 15:23">2 Sam 15:23</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 23:15">2 Bus 23:15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:1">Isa 52:1</ref>. </char></note> N'oruhanga rwona, oruteebwamu emitumbi n'eiju rya kashenda, n'emisiri yoona okuhika aha kagyera Kidirooni, n'okuhika aha keekubo k'aha Irembo ry'Embaraasi eririkureeba oburugwa-izooba, biryayerezibwa MUKAMA. Orwo rurembo tiruriihwaho bundi n'obu kwakuba okusheenywa ebiro byona.<verse eid="JER 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JER 32" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia okuragiirwa okugura omusiri Anatoosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 32:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 39:1">Yer 39:1</ref>, <ref loc="JER 39:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:4">52:4</ref>, <ref loc="JER 52:12">12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa ikumi ogw'omu bisingye bwa Zedekia omugabe wa Yuda, nigwo mwaka gwa ikumi na munaana gwa Nebukadeneeza, ekigambo kikaruga ahari MUKAMA, kyaija ahari Yeremia. <verse eid="JER 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 32:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:1">Yer 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:21">37:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 38:6">38:6</ref>, <ref loc="JER 38:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 39:14">39:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 88:8">Zab 88:8</ref>. </char></note> Omu bunaku obwo eihe ry'omugabe wa Babulooni rikaba rigootsire Yerusaalemu, kandi nabi Yeremia akaba akomeirwe omu kibuga ky'abarinzi ekiri omu kikaari ky'omugabe wa Yuda. <verse eid="JER 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 32:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:3, 4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:10">Yer 21:10</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba Zedekia omugabe wa Yuda akaba amutaire omu kihome, naamugira ati: Ahabw'enki noohanuura, okagira oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, oru rurembo niinyija kuruhayo omu mikono y'omugabe wa Babulooni, arukwate; <verse eid="JER 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 32:4" />na Zedekia omugabe wa Yuda tarikira Bakaludaaya, kureka buzimazima aryaheebwayo omu mikono y'omugabe wa Babulooni, bagambe hamwe nibareebana; <verse eid="JER 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 32:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:4">Yer 21:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 39:7">39:7</ref>. </char></note> bwanyima aryatwara Zedekia Babulooni; okwo niyo ariguma okuhitsya obu ndimutaayaayira; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. N'obu murirwanisa Abakaludaaya, timuribabaasa.<verse eid="JER 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 32:6" />Yeremia yaagira ati: Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kiinyizireho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 32:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 35:4">Yer 35:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:25">Lev 25:25</ref>; <ref loc="RUT 4:4">Rus 4:4</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, Hanameeli, mwene Shalumu shwento, naija kukwijaho akugire ati: Gura ekibanja kyangye ekiri Anatoosi; ahabw'okuba niiwe oine obushoboorozi bw'okukicungura, okakigura. <verse eid="JER 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 32:8" />Bwanyima Hanameeli mwene tatento yanshanga omu kibuga ky'abarinzi, nk'oku ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyabaire kiri, yangira ati: Ninkweshengyereza, gura ekibanja kyangye ekiri Anatoosi omu ishaza rya Benyamiini; ahabw'okuba niiwe oine obushoboorozi bw'okukihungura n'okukicungura; mbwenu okyegurire. Ntyo naamanyira aho ku ekyo kigambo kirugire ahari MUKAMA.<verse eid="JER 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 32:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 23:16">Kut 23:16</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 11:12">Zek 11:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:15">Mat 26:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima naagura ekyo kibanja ekyabaire kiri Anatoosi ahari Hanameeli mwene tatento, naamupimira obuguzi bwakyo, shekeli z'efeeza ikumi na mushanju. <verse eid="JER 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 32:10" />Naata omukono aha ndagaano, naagitaho akamanyiso, naareeta baakareebi, naapima efeeza aha minzaani. <verse eid="JER 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 32:11" />Bwanyima naatwara endagaano y'okugura etairweho akamanyiso, hamwe na kopi yaayo etakubire, nk'ebiragiro n'emigyenzo byabyo oku byabaire biri; <verse eid="JER 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 32:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:4">Yer 36:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:2">Isa 8:2</ref>. </char></note> egyo ndagaano naagiheera Baruki mwene Neria, mwijukuru wa Maaseya, omu maisho ga Hanameeli mwene tatento, n'omu maisho ga baakareebi abataire emikono aha ndagaano, kandi n'omu maisho g'Abayudaaya boona abaabaire bashutami omu kibuga ky'abarinzi. <verse eid="JER 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 32:13" />Naayehanangiririza Baruki omu maisho gaabo nti: <verse eid="JER 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 32:14" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Twara ezi ndagaano z'okugura, egi etairweho akamanyiso n'etakubire, ozite omu nyungu y'eibumba, zibone kumara ebiro bingi. <verse eid="JER 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 32:15" />Ahabw'okuba oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Amaju n'emisiri n'emisiri y'emizaabibu, biryagaruka bigurwe omu nsi egi.<verse eid="JER 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 32:16" />Ku naaherize kuha Baruki mwene Neria egyo ndagaano y'okugura, naashaba MUKAMA ningira nti: <verse eid="JER 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 32:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Kut 18:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 37:16">Isa 37:16</ref>. </char></note> Ai Mukama RUHANGA, niiwe waahangiise eiguru n'ensi obushoboorozi bwawe n'omukono gwawe ogugoroire. Tihariho kintu na kimwe ekikurema. <verse eid="JER 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 32:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 10:16">Yer 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:6">Kur 20:6</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:7">34:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 79:12">Zab 79:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:6">Isa 9:6</ref>. </char></note> Iwe ogirira embabazi abantu enkumi n'enkumi. Kwonka ohoora abaana noobatura ebibi bya baishenkurubo. Ori Ruhanga omukuru; MUKAMA ow'amahe niryo iziina ryawe. <verse eid="JER 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 32:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 16:17">Yer 16:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:10">17:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 66:3">Zab 66:3</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 66:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 28:29">Isa 28:29</ref>. </char></note> Ori rugambwa omu naama, kandi omu kukora ori ow'amaani; amaisho gaawe gareeba emitwarize y'abantu yoona, noozimuurira buri muntu nk'emitwarize ye n'ebirugire omu bi akozire oku biri. <verse eid="JER 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 32:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:23">2 Sam 7:23</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:10">Neh 9:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 135:9">Zab 135:9</ref>. </char></note> Niiwe waayorekire obumanyiso n'eby'okutangaaza omu nsi ya Misri, okaguma noobyoreka omu Baisraeli n'omu bantu boona n'okuhitysa hati, kandi okeetungira eiziina, nk'oku kiri hati. <verse eid="JER 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 32:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:6">Kur 6:6</ref>. </char></note> Okaiha abantu baawe Abaisraeli omuri Misri, waabaihisayo obumanyiso n'eby'okutangaaza n'omukono gw'amaani ogubangire n'okutiinisa kwingi; <verse eid="JER 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 32:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:8">Kur 3:8</ref>. </char></note> waabaha ensi egi, ei waarahiire kuha baishenkurubo, ensi y'amate n'obwoki, <verse eid="JER 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 32:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 11:8">Yer 11:8</ref>. </char></note> baagizamu, baagikubuura; kwonka tibaayorobera iraka ryawe, n'obu kwakuba okugyendera omu biragiro byawe; tibaagira kintu na kimwe eki baakora omu bi waabaragiire byona. Nikyo waabareeteireho akabi aka koona. <verse eid="JER 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 32:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:6">Yer 6:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 14:12">14:12</ref>. </char></note> Reeba eby'okutemberaho bigootsire orurembo; baahikire aha rurembo kurukwata; kandi orurembo ruhairweyo omu mikono y'Abakaludaaya, abarikururwanisa, ahabwa rurara n'enjara n'orufu. Ebi waagambire byona bihikiriire; naiwe nookireeba. <verse eid="JER 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 32:25" />Kwonka ai Mukama RUHANGA, n'obu orurembo ruraabe ruhairweyo omu mikono y'Abakaludaaya, ongizire oti: Gura ekyo kibanja n'efeeza, kandi ogire baakareebi.<verse eid="JER 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 32:26" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyaija ahari Yeremia nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 32:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Kut 18:14</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 16:22">Kub 16:22</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, ndi MUKAMA, Ruhanga w'ebiine omubiri byona; hariho ekirikundema? <verse eid="JER 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 32:28" />N'ahabw'ekyo, oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, naaza kuhayo oru rurembo omu mikono y'Abakaludaaya n'omu mikono ya Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni, arukwate. <verse eid="JER 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 32:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:18">Yer 7:18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 19:13">19:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 21:10">21:10</ref>. </char></note> Abakaludaaya abarikururwanisa nibaija kwija, barutwekyemu omuriro, barwotsye, hamwe n'amaju agu batuura nibootererera aha mitwe yaago Baali obubaane, bakashukiriraho baaruhanga abandi empongano z'eby'okunywa, kungwisa kubi. <verse eid="JER 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 32:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:25">Yer 3:25</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:6">25:6</ref>, <ref loc="JER 25:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba Abaisraeli n'Abayuda, okwiha omu buto bwabo, tibaine kindi eki barakozire omu maisho gangye kureka ebibi byonka; kandi Abaisraeli tibaine kindi eki barakozire kureka okungwisa kubi n'ebi bakora; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 32:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:27">2 Bag 23:27</ref>. </char></note> Oru rurembo rukanyitsa ekiniga, rwangwisa kubi, okwiha aha izooba eri rwayombekyeirweho n'okuhitsya hati; n'ahabw'ekyo niinyija kurwiha omu maisho gangye, <verse eid="JER 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 32:32" />nintura Abaisraeli n'Abayuda ebibi byona ebi baakozire kungwisa kubi, abagabe baabo, abanyiginya baabo, abanyamurwa baabo, baanabi baabo, abantu ba Yuda n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="JER 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 32:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:26">Yer 2:26</ref>, <ref loc="JER 2:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:24">7:24</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 8:16">Ezk 8:16</ref>. </char></note> Omu mwanya gw'okuntaho amaisho bakanteera omugongo; kandi n'obu ndaabe ntuura nimbegyesa, tibakategaga matu kuhurira okwegyesibwa. <verse eid="JER 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 32:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:30">Yer 7:30</ref>, <ref loc="JER 7:31">31</ref>. </char></note> Bakata ebirikunugwa byabo omu nju erikwetererwa eiziina ryangye kugihagara. <verse eid="JER 32:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 32:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:21">Lev 18:21</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 16:19">1 Bag 16:19</ref>. </char></note> Bakombekyera Baali emyanya mikuru y'okuramizamu omu ruhanga rwa mwene Hinoomu, kuhongyererayo Moleki abaana baabo b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki, eki ntarabaragiire, kandi ekitakaijaga mu biteekateeko byangye, ngu bakore ekirikunugwa ekyo okusiisisa Yuda.<verse eid="JER 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia okuhanuura aha ndagaano nsya n'embabazi za Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 32:36" />N'ahabw'ekyo oku nikwo MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba ahari oru rurembo oru orikugira ngu ruhairweyo omu mikono y'omugabe wa Babulooni kwitwa rurara, enjara n'orufu, <verse eid="JER 32:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 32:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:5">Yer 21:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:3">23:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:16">33:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 29:28">Bir 29:28</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:25">Ezk 34:25</ref>. </char></note> naagira ati: Reeba, ndyabataaruura, mbaihe omu nsi zoona ezi naababingiiremu, ngwirwe kubi, nyine ekiniga, kandi nyine ekiniga kingi, mbagarure omuri ogu mwanya, mbatuuzemu buhooro. <verse eid="JER 32:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 32:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:22">Yer 30:22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:33">31:33</ref>. </char></note> Kandi baryaba abantu bangye, naanye mbe Ruhanga waabo. <verse eid="JER 32:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 32:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:19">Ezk 11:19</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 11:20">20</ref>. </char></note> Ndyabaha omutima gumwe n'emitwarize emwe, babone kuntiina ebiro byona, babe gye, bo n'abaana baabo abarikurataho. <verse eid="JER 32:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 32:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:3">Isa 55:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 16:60">Ezk 16:60</ref>. </char></note> Ndyaragaana nabo endagaano etarihwaho, ku ntarireka kubakorera gye, kandi ndyata okuntiina omu mitima yaabo, ngu barekye kundugaho. <verse eid="JER 32:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 32:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 24:6">Yer 24:6</ref>. </char></note> Ndyashemerererwa okubakora gye, mbabyare omuri egi nsi omu mazima n'omutima gwangye gwona n'amagara gangye goona.<verse eid="JER 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 32:42" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:42: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:28">Yer 31:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Nk'oku naareetsire ako kabi kahango koona ahari aba bantu, nikwo ndibareetaho ntyo ebirungi byona ebi ndikubaraganisa. <verse eid="JER 32:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 32:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 33:10">Yer 33:10</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima egi nsi, ei murikugirangu n'amatongo, etarimu bantu nari amatungo, kureka ehairweyo omu mikono y'Abakaludaaya, niyo muriguramu ebibanja. <verse eid="JER 32:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 32:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:26">Yer 17:26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 30:3">30:3</ref>. </char></note> Abantu baryagura ebibanja n'empiiha, bahandiikye endagaano z'okugura, baziteho emikono n'akamanyiso kandi zigire na baakareebi, omu ishaza rya Benyamiini, omu myanya eyehinguririize Yerusaalemu, omu ndembo za Yuda, omu ndembo z'omu nsi y'ebibungo, omu z'omu mpita n'omu ndembo z'omuri Negebu; ahabw'okuba ndyagarura abantu baabo abaatwairwe omu bukwatwa.<verse eid="JER 32:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JER 33" />
  <para style="s1">Okuhanuura aha by'okugaruka kw'Abaisraeli n'Abayuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 33:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 32:2">Yer 32:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyaija ahari Yeremia obwa kabiri, obu yaabaire akikingirainwe omu kibuga ky'abarinzi nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 33:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:3">Kur 6:3</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba, owaahangire ensi, akagikora kugihamya, MUKAMA niryo iziina rye, naagira ati: <verse eid="JER 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 33:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:12">Yer 29:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 91:15">Zab 91:15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:6">Isa 48:6</ref>. </char></note> Onyete, nkwetabe, nkugambire ebikuru eby'omubonano, ebi otakamanyaga. <verse eid="JER 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 33:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:24">Yer 32:24</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba aha maju g'omuri oru rurembo, n'ahari zaanyaruju z'abagabe ba Yuda ezaasheenyirwe, ngu ebisheenyuka babone kubikumiiriza abarikutemba aha by'okutemberaho, n'abarikurwanisa rurara, naagira ati: <verse eid="JER 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 33:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:17">Bir 31:17</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 31:18">18</ref>. </char></note> Abakaludaaya nibaija kwija kurwana n'okwijuza ago maju emitumbi y'abantu, abu ndiita ngwirwe kubi, nyine ekiniga kingi; ahabw'okuba obubi bwabo bwona bundeeteire kwima oru rurembo amaisho. <verse eid="JER 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 33:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:17">Yer 30:17</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, ndyarureetera okuba gye, ndutambire, n'abantu baamwo mbakize, mboorekye obusingye bwingi n'amazima. <verse eid="JER 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 33:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 24:6">Yer 24:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:26">Isa 1:26</ref>. </char></note> Ndyagarura aha buteeka Abayuda n'Abaisraeli abaatwairwe omu bukwatwa, ngarukye mbombekye, babe nk'oku baabaire bari okubanza. <verse eid="JER 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 33:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:34">Yer 31:34</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 51:2">Zab 51:2</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 51:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:25">Ezk 36:25</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 9:13">Heb 9:13</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 9:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Ndyabashemeza, mbaiheho orubanja rwona orw'ebibi ebi bancumwireho; kandi ndyabasaasira eby'okushiisha byabo byona, ebi bancumwireho n'ebi baakozire nibangomera. <verse eid="JER 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 33:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 13:11">Yer 13:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 130:4">Zab 130:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:5">Isa 60:5</ref>. </char></note> Kandi orurembo oru ruryambeera eiziina ry'okushemererwa, n'eky'okumpimbisisa, n'okumpaisa ekitiinisa omu maisho g'amahanga goona ag'omu nsi yoona, agarihurira ebirungi byona ebi ndikubakorera; kandi baryatiina, bateteme ahabw'ebirungi byona n'obusingye bwona obu nduhaire.<verse eid="JER 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 33:10" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Ogu mwanya ogu murikugira ngu n'amatongo, tigurimu bantu nari amatungo, n'endembo za Yuda, n'enguuto za Yerusaalemu, ezibaire amatongo, ezitaine bantu bazitwiremu n'obu gaakuba amatungo, <verse eid="JER 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 33:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:34">Yer 7:34</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:12">Lev 7:12</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 16:34">1 Bus 16:34</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:22">Zab 107:22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 12:4">Isa 12:4</ref>. </char></note> nigwo gurigaruka kuhurirwamu eiraka ry'okushemererwa n'okwesiima, eiraka rya kishwera na kishwerwa, n'amaraka g'abarikweshongora, nibareeta omu nju ya MUKAMA empongano z'okusiima nibagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 33:11">Musiime MUKAMA ow'amahe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 33:11">Ahabw'okuba ni murungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 33:11">Kandi embabazi ze n'ez'ebiro byona.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JER 33:11">Ahakuba ndyagarura ensi aha buteeka nk'oku yaabaire eri okubanza; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 33:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:24">Yer 31:24</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:19">50:19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:10">Isa 65:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:14">Ezk 34:14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:11">36:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Omwanya ogu ogwabaire amatongo ogutarimu bantu nari amatungo, n'endembo zaagwo zoona, nigwo gurigaruka kuba obutaaho bw'abariisa, omu barizaagiza amasyo gaabo. <verse eid="JER 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 33:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:26">Yer 17:26</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:3">Yoh 10:3</ref>. </char></note> Endembo z'omu nsi y'ebibungo, ez'omu mpita, ez'omuri Negebu, omu ishaza rya Benyamiini, emyanya eyehinguririize Yerusaalemu, n'endembo za Yuda, amasyo garyagaruka kuraba ahansi y'omukono gw'orikugabara; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 33:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 23:5">Yer 23:5</ref>, <ref loc="JER 23:6">6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi MUKAMA naagira ati: Reeba, obunaku nibwija obu ndihikiiriza eki naaraganiise enju ya Israeli n'eya Yuda. <verse eid="JER 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 33:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 4:2">Isa 4:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:1">11:1</ref>. </char></note> Omuri ebyo biro n'omuri obwo bunaku ndyamereza Daudi Eitaagi ry'okuhikiirira, kandi Itaagi ogwo aryahikiiriza emanja z'oburyo n'okuhikiirira omu nsi. <verse eid="JER 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 33:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:6">Yer 23:6</ref>. </char></note> Omuri ebyo biro Yuda aryajunwa, Yerusaalemu etuure buhooro. Kandi eri niryo iziina eri eryetwa, MUKAMA Kuhikiirira kwaitu.<verse eid="JER 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 33:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 2:4">1 Bag 2:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:3">Zab 89:3</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 89:4">4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Daudi taribura muntu w'okushutama aha kitebe ky'obugabe bw'enju ya Israeli; <verse eid="JER 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 33:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:21">Isa 66:21</ref>. </char></note> n'abanyamurwa Abaleevi tibaribura muntu w'okuunyemerera omu maisho kutamba ebitambo by'okwotsya, n'okwotsya empongano z'esaano n'okutamba ebitambo obutwire bwona.<verse eid="JER 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 33:19" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija ahari Yeremia nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 33:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:36">Yer 31:36</ref>, <ref loc="JER 31:37">37</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 8:22">Kut 8:22</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Ku mwakuba nimubaasa kwita endagaano yangye, ei naaragaine na nyomushana na nyekiro birekye kubaho omu bunaku bwabyo, <verse eid="JER 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 33:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:34">Zab 89:34</ref>. </char></note> n'endagaano ei naaragaine n'omwiru wangye Daudi ekaafa, abura omwana w'okuza aha ngoma kutegyeka, kandi n'ei naaragaine n'abaheereza bangye abanyamurwa, Abaleevi nayo efa. <verse eid="JER 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 33:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:17">Kut 22:17</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku eihe ry'omu iguru ritarikubaasa kubarwa, n'omusheenyi gw'aha nyanja gutarikubaasa kurengwa, nikwo naanye ndikanyisa oruzaaro rw'omwiru wangye Daudi, n'abanyamurwa Abaleevi abarikumpeereza.<verse eid="JER 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 33:23" />Kandi ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija ahari Yeremia nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 33:24" />Torikuteekateeka aha ki abo bantu barikugamba nibagira bati: MUKAMA ayangire enganda ezo ibiri ezi yaatooraine? Okwo nikwo bagayire abantu bangye, ngu tibakiri ihanga omu maisho gaabo. <verse eid="JER 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 33:25" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Kuri ntarahamize ndagaano yangye ei naaragaine na nyomushana na nyekiro, kandi ntarahamize biragiro by'eiguru n'ensi, <verse eid="JER 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 33:26" />Obwo nibwo naakwangire oruzaaro rwa Yakobo n'orwa Daudi omwiru wangye, nkanga kutoorana omwe aha baijukuru be kutegyeka oruzaaro rwa Abrahamu, Isaaka na Yakobo. Ahabw'okuba ndyabagarura, mbaihe omu bukwatwa, mbagirire embabazi.<verse eid="JER 33:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JER 34" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia okuhanuura aha kukwatwa kw'omugabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 34:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 1:15">Yer 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:1">2 Bag 25:1</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 25:2">2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eki n'ekigambo ekyarugire ahari MUKAMA, kikaija ahari Yeremia, obu Nebukadeneeza n'eihe rye ryona n'abantu b'abagabe boona ab'ensi z'omu butegyeki bwe n'ab'amahanga goona baarwanisa Yerusaalemu n'endembo zaayo zoona, nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 34:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:10">Yer 21:10</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Irooko ogambe na Zedekia omugabe wa Yuda, omugire oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, oru rurembo ninduhayo omu mikono y'omugabe wa Babulooni, kandi aryarwotsya n'omuriro; <verse eid="JER 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 34:3" />kandi naiwe torimukira, kureka buzimazima oryakwatwa, oheebweyo omu mikono ye; ogwo mugabe wa Babulooni muryagamba hamwe nimureebana, bwanyima otwarwe Babulooni. <verse eid="JER 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 34:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 38:17">Yer 38:17</ref>, <ref loc="JER 38:20">20</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka iwe Zedekia omugabe wa Yuda, hurira ekigambo kya MUKAMA! Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikukugambaho naagira ati: Toriitwa rurara, kureka oryafa gye. <verse eid="JER 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 34:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:18">Yer 22:18</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 31:12">1 Sam 31:12</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 16:14">2 Bus 16:14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nk'oku baayotereire baashwenkuru abagabe abaakubandiize obubaane, nikwo naiwe barikwoterera obubaane, bakakucurira nibagira bati: Ai bambe, mukama wangye! Ahakuba niinye naagamba ekyo kigambo; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 34:6" />Atyo nabi Yeremia yaagambira Zedekia omugabe wa Yuda ebigambo ebyo byona bari Yerusaalemu, <verse eid="JER 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 34:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:5">Yer 4:5</ref>. </char></note> obu eihe ry'omugabe wa Babulooni ryabaire nirirwanisa Yerusaalemu n'endembo za Yuda, Lakishi na Azeeka, ezaabaire zitsigaireho; ahabw'okuba ezo zombi nizo ndembo ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare ezaabaire zitsigaireho.<verse eid="JER 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zedekia okwita endagaano y'okurekura abahuuku omu Bayuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 34:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 21:2">Kur 21:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikaija ahari Yeremia, omugabe Zedekia aherize kuragaana n'ab'omuri Yerusaalemu endagaano y'okubarangira eby'okurekura abahuuku, <verse eid="JER 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 34:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:39-46">Lev 25:39-46</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 5:8">Neh 5:8</ref>. </char></note> ngu buri muntu weena arekure abahuuku be n'abazaana be b'Abaheburaayo, harekye kubaho omuntu weena owaagira mwene waabo Omuyudaaya omuhuuku. <verse eid="JER 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 34:10" />Boona baagyorobera; abanyiginya boona n'abantu boona abaaragaine egyo ndagaano erikugira ngu buri muntu arekure omuhuuku we n'omuzaana we, barekye kugaruka kuza omu buhuuku; boona baabyorobera, baabarekura. <verse eid="JER 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 34:11" />Kwonka bwanyima baahinduka, baagarura abo bahuuku n'abazaana abu baarekwire, baabagarura omu buhuuku. <verse eid="JER 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 34:12" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija ahari Yeremia nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 34:13" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Nkaragaana na baashwenkuriimwe, obu naabaiha omu nsi ya Misri omu nju y'obuhuuku, ningira nti: <verse eid="JER 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 34:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:12">Bir 15:12</ref>. </char></note> Ahari buri muheru gw'emyaka mukaaga, buri muntu omuriimwe aryarekura Omuheburaayo mugyenzi we ou yaaguziibwe, omazire emyaka mukaaga naamukorera; aryamurekura arugye omu buhuuku. Kwonka baashwenkuriimwe tibarampuriire n'obu kwakuba okuntega amatu. <verse eid="JER 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 34:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:3">2 Bag 23:3</ref>. </char></note> Ebiro ebi mweteisize, mwakora ebi ndikusiima, mwaranga obusingye, buri muntu yaagambira mugyenzi we eby'okurekurwa, mwaraganira endagaano omu maisho gangye omu nju erikwetererwa eiziina ryangye. <verse eid="JER 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 34:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:21">Lev 18:21</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka muhindukire, mwajumisa eiziina ryangye, buri muntu omuriimwe yaagarura abahuuku be n'abazaana be, abu mubaire murekwire, nk'oku babaire nibenda, mwabagarura omu buhuuku kuba abahuuku n'abazaana. <verse eid="JER 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 34:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:12">Yer 14:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 15:4">15:4</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 6:7">Gal 6:7</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:13">Yak 2:13</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo MUKAMA arikugirira ati: Timumpuriire, buri muntu kurangira mugyenzi we na mutaahi we eby'okurekurwa. Reeba, nyowe nimbarangira okurekurwa, nikwo kurekurirwa rurara, n'orufu n'enjara, mbahindura eky'okutiinisa aha mahanga goona ag'omu nsi; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 34:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:10">Kut 15:10</ref>. </char></note> Kandi n'abo bashaija abaitsire endagaano yangye, bakanga kuhitsya egyo ndagaano ei baragaine omu maisho gangye, niinyija kubagira nk'enyana ei baacwiremu ebicweka bibiri, bakabiraba ahagati: <verse eid="JER 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 34:19" />abanyiginya ba Yuda, aba Yerusaalemu, abakonwa, abanyamurwa n'abantu boona ab'omuri egi nsi, abaarabire ahagati y'ebicweka by'egyo nyana, <verse eid="JER 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 34:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:33">Yer 7:33</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:25">22:25</ref>. </char></note> ndyabahayo omu mikono y'abazigu baabo n'ey'abarikwenda kubaita. Kandi emitumbi yaabo eryaba eby'okurya by'amahungu g'omu mwanya n'enyamaishwa z'omu ihamba. <verse eid="JER 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 34:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 37:5">Yer 37:5</ref>, <ref loc="JER 37:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Zedekia omugabe wa Yuda n'abanyiginya be ndyabahayo omu mikono y'abazigu baabo n'ey'abarikwenda kubaita, n'omu mikono y'eihe ry'omugabe wa Babulooni, eryabarugireho rikagarukayo. <verse eid="JER 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 34:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:7">Yer 4:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 9:11">9:11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:8">37:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 10:6">Isa 10:6</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, niinyija kubaragiira, bagarukye ahari oru rurembo, barurwanise, barukwate, barwotsye n'omuriro. N'endembo za Yuda ndyazihindura amatongo, zibure ab'okuzituuramu; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 34:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JER 35" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okusiima beene Rekabu abataraitsire ndagaano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 35:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 25:1">Yer 25:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekigambo kikaruga ahari MUKAMA, kyaija ahari Yeremia omu busingye bwa Yehoyakimu mwene Yosia omugabe wa Yuda, nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 35:2" />Irooko oze omu nju y'aba Rekabu, ogambe nabo, kandi obareete omu nju ya MUKAMA omuri kimwe aha bishengye byayo, obahe viinyo y'okunywa. <verse eid="JER 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 35:3" />Ntyo naatwara Yaazania mwene Yeremia, omwijukuru wa Habazinia, na beene ishe, n'abatabani boona. <verse eid="JER 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 35:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:1">Yer 21:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:7">32:7</ref>. </char></note> Naabareeta omu nju ya MUKAMA omu kishengye kya beene Hanani mwene Igidalia omuntu wa Ruhanga, ekyabaire kiri haihi n'ekishengye ky'abanyiginya ekiri ahaiguru y'ekishengye kya Maaseya mwene Shalumu, omurinzi w'ekisasi. <verse eid="JER 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 35:5" />Bwanyima naata omu maisho g'aba Rekabu enjoga ziijwire viinyo hamwe n'ebikopo, naabagira nti: Nimunywe viinyo. <verse eid="JER 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 35:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 10:15">2 Bag 10:15</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 10:23">23</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka baagarukamu bati: Titurikwija kuginywa, ahabw'okuba Yonadabu mwene Rekabu tatenkuriitwe akaturagiira ati: Mutarinywa viinyo, imwe n'abatabani baanyu ebiro byona; <verse eid="JER 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 35:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Kur 20:12</ref>. </char></note> kandi mutaryombeka amaju, mutaribiba embibo, mutaribyara emizaabibu, n'obu kwakuba okugira omusiri gwayo; kureka mugume mutaahe omu mahema ebiro byanyu byona, mubone kuhangaarira omu nsi ei murishuuhuukiramu. <verse eid="JER 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 35:8" />Naitwe twayorobera ekigambo kya Yonadabu mwene Rekabu tatenkuriitwe, omu bi yaaturagiire byona, kutanywa viinyo ebiro byaitu byona, itwe n'abakazi baitu n'abatabani baitu na bahara baitu, <verse eid="JER 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 35:9" />n'okutombeka maju g'okutaahamu. N'ahabw'ekyo titwine misiri y'emizaabibu, nari endiijo misiri nari embibo; <verse eid="JER 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 35:10" />kureka tutaaha omu mahema, kandi tutuura nitworobera ebi Yonadabu tatenkuriitwe yaaturagiire byona nitubikora. <verse eid="JER 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 35:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:1">2 Bag 24:1</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 24:2">2</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni ku yaizire kuteera ensi egi, twagira tuti: Mwije tuze Yerusaalemu, tuhungye eihe ry'Abakaludaaya n'ery'Abasiria. Nikyo tutuuriire Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="JER 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 35:12" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija ahari Yeremia nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 35:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:3">Yer 5:3</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba naagira ati: Irooko ogambire abantu ba Yuda oti: MUKAMA naabagira ati: Timurikwikiriza kuhaburwa, mukahurira ebigambo byangye? <verse eid="JER 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 35:14" />Ekigambo, eki Yonadabu mwene Rekabu yaaragiire abatabani, kutanywa viinyo, kikahikiirizibwa; n'okuhitsya hati tibaginywa; ahabw'okuba bakoorobera ekiragiro kya ishenkurubo. Kwonka nyowe ntuura ningamba naimwe, haza mwanga kuunyorobera. <verse eid="JER 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 35:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:13">2 Bag 17:13</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ntuura nimbatumaho abaheereza bangye baanabi, nimbatuma obutoosha ningira nti: Nimuhindukye, buri muntu omuriimwe arekye emitwarize ye emibi, mushemeze ebi murikukora, murekye kukuratira baaruhanga abandi kubaheereza; obwo nibwo murituura omu nsi ei naabahaire na baashwenkuriimwe. Kwonka timurantegire matu, n'obu kwakuba okumpurira. <verse eid="JER 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 35:16" />Beene Yonadabu mwene Rekabu bakakora eki ishenkurubo yaabaragiire, kwonka abantu aba bo tibakanyoroberaga. <verse eid="JER 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 35:17" />Ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA Ruhanga ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, nindeeta ahari Yuda n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu boona akabi koona aku naabagambireho, ahabw'okuba ngambire nabo, baayanga kuhurira; naabeeta, tibaanyetaba. <verse eid="JER 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 35:18" />Kwonka ab'enju ya Rekabu Yeremia yaabagira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Ahabw'okworobera ekiragiro kya Yonadabu shwenkuriimwe, n'ebi yaataireho, mukakora ebi yaaragiire, <verse eid="JER 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 35:19" />nikyo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugirira ati: Yonadabu mwene Rekabu taribura muntu w'okumpeereza.<verse eid="JER 35:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JER 36" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia okuhandiikisa Baruki omuzingo gw'ekitabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 36:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 1:2">Yer 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:3">25:3</ref>, <ref loc="JER 25:15-26">15-26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 30:2">30:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 46:1-51:64">46:1—51:64</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa kana ogw'omu busingye bwa Yehoyakimu mwene Yosia omugabe wa Yuda, ekigambo eki kikaruga ahari MUKAMA, kyaija ahari Yeremia nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 36:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:1">Yer 1:1</ref>. </char></note> Kwata omuzingo gw'ekitabo, oguhandiikyemu ebigambo byona ebi naakugambiire nimpana Israeli na Yuda n'amahanga goona, okwiha aha busingye bwa Yosia n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="JER 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 36:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 18:8">Yer 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 26:3">26:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 12:3">Ezk 12:3</ref>. </char></note> Obundi ab'enju ya Yuda bakaahurira akabi koona aku mmaririire kubareetaho, buri muntu abona kuhinduka, areka emitwarize ye emibi, naanye mbona kubasaasira eby'okushiisha byabo n'ekibi kyabo.<verse eid="JER 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 36:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 32:12">Yer 32:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Atyo Yeremia yaayeta Baruki mwene Neria, Baruki ogwo yaahandiika omu muzingo gw'ekitabo ebigambo byona ebirikuruga omu kanwa ka Yeremia, ebi MUKAMA yaabaire amugambira. <verse eid="JER 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 36:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:2">Yer 32:2</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Yeremia yaagira Baruki ati: Banzibiire kuza omu nju ya MUKAMA; <verse eid="JER 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 36:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:9">Yer 36:9</ref>. </char></note> n'ahabw'ekyo obe niiwe waagyenda, kandi oshome ebigambo bya MUKAMA ebihandiikirwe omu muzingo gw'ekitabo ogu ohandiikiremu ebigambo ebi nkugambiire; obishomere abantu boona abateeraniire omu nju ya MUKAMA aha izooba ry'okwesiibyakwo. Kandi obishomere n'Abayuda boona abarugire omu ndembo zaabo. <verse eid="JER 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 36:7" />Obundi okweshengyereza kwabo kukaahika ahari MUKAMA, buri muntu ahinduka areka emitwarize ye emibi, ahabw'okuba okuguubwa kubi kwa MUKAMA n'ekiniga kye, ebi agambire kugirira abo bantu, ni bingi. <verse eid="JER 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 36:8" />Atyo Baruki mwene Neria yaakora byona ebi nabi Yeremia yaamuragiira, yaashoma ebigambo bya MUKAMA ebihandiikirwe omuri ogwo muzingo gw'ekitabo, naabishomera omu nju ya MUKAMA.<verse eid="JER 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 36:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 20:3">2 Bus 20:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa kataano ogw'omu busingye bwa Yehoyakimu mwene Yosia omugabe wa Yuda, omu kwezi kwa mwenda, abantu ba Yerusaalemu boona n'abandi boona abaizire Yerusaalemu nibaruga omu ndembo za Yuda, baaranga ku habaho okwesiibyakwo omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="JER 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 36:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 26:10">Yer 26:10</ref>, <ref loc="JER 26:24">24</ref>; <ref loc="JER 40:5">40:5</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Baruki yaashoma omu muzingo gw'ekitabo ebigambo bya Yeremia, naabishomera omu nju ya MUKAMA omu kishengye kya Gemaria mwene Shafani omuhandiiki, ekiri omu kibuga kya ruguru, aharikutaahirwa omu Irembo Risya ery'enju ya MUKAMA.<verse eid="JER 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 36:11" />Mikaaya mwene Gemarira, mwijukuru wa Shafani, ku yaahuriire ebigambo bya MUKAMA byona, ebyashomwa omuri ogwo muzingo, <verse eid="JER 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 36:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 26:22">Yer 26:22</ref>. </char></note> yaashuuma, yaaza omuri nyaruju y'omugabe omu kishengye ky'omuhandiiki; yaashanga abanyiginya boona bashutami omwo, Elishaama omuhandiiki, Delaaya mwene Shemaaya, Elinasani mwene Akiboora, Gemaria mwene Shafani Zedekia mwene Hanania n'abanyiginya boona. <verse eid="JER 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 36:13" />Atyo yaabagambira ebigambo byona ebi yaahurira, obu Baruki yaaba naashomera abantu boona omuzingo gw'ekitabo. <verse eid="JER 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 36:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 37:3">Yer 37:3</ref>, <ref loc="JER 37:13">13</ref>. </char></note> Abanyiginya boona kikwo kutuma Yehudi mwene Netamia mwijukuru wa Shelemia mwene Kuushi, kugira Baruki bati: Kwata omuzingo ogu waashomera abantu, oije. Atyo Baruki mwene Neria yaagukwata, yaija ahu bari. <verse eid="JER 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 36:15" />Baamugira bati: Shutama, ogushome. Atyo yaagubashomera. <verse eid="JER 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 36:16" />Ku baahuriire ebigambo byona, baahindukirana baine obwoba, baagira Baruki bati: Buzimazima tushemereire kugambira omugabe ebigambo ebi byona. <verse eid="JER 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 36:17" />Bwanyima baabuuza Baruki bati: Tugambire oku wahandiikikire ebyo bigambo byona, ebi Yeremia yaakugambiire. <verse eid="JER 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 36:18" />Baruki yaabagarukamu ati: Akaba angambira ebigambo ebi byona, naanye mbihandiikisa bwino omuri ogu muzingo. <verse eid="JER 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 36:19" />Abanyiginya baagira Baruki bati: Iwe na Yeremia mwirooko mwesherekye, hatagira owaamanya ahu muri.<verse eid="JER 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugabe okwotsya omuzingo gw'ekitabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 36:20" />Bwanyima ku baaherize kuta ogwo muzingo omu kishengye kya Elishaama omuhandiiki, baaza omu kikaari, ahu omugabe ari, baamugambira ebyo bigambo byona. <verse eid="JER 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 36:21" />Ahonaaho omugabe yaatuma Yehudi kureeta ogwo muzingo, yaagwiha omu kishengye kya Elishaama omuhandiiki. Yehudi ku yaagureetsire, yaagushomera omugabe, abanyiginya boona bamwemereire aha rubaju. <verse eid="JER 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 36:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 3:15">Amo 3:15</ref>. </char></note> Obwo kukaba kuri okwezi kwa mwenda, kandi omugabe akaba ashutami omu nju ei ashutamamu omu biro by'embeho, omuriro nigwaka omu mahega omu maisho ge. <verse eid="JER 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 36:23" />Yehudi ku yaabaire aheza kushoma ebicweka bishatu nari bina, omugabe abishara n'akasyo, abinaga omu muriro omu mahega, okuhitsya obu ogwo muzingo gwona gwahwereire omu muriro omu mahega. <verse eid="JER 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 36:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:16">Yer 36:16</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 7:6">Yos 7:6</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka n'obu kiraabe kyabaire kityo, omugabe n'obu yaakuba omwe aha bagaragwa be boona, abaahuriire ebyo bigambo byona, tibaratiinire, n'obu kwakuba okutaagura ebijwaro byabo. <verse eid="JER 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 36:25" />Kandi hoona Elinasani na Delaaya na Gemaria n'obu baraabe bayeshengyereize omugabe kutootsya ogwo muzingo, kwonka tarabakundiire. <verse eid="JER 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 36:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 45:1-3">Yer 45:1-3</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima omugabe yaaragiira Yerameeli omutabani na Seraya mwene Azirieli na Shelemia mwene Abudeeli kukwata Baruki omuhandiiki na nabi Yeremia; kwonka MUKAMA yaabashereka.<verse eid="JER 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okuragiira Yeremia kuhandiika ogundi muzingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 36:27" />Omugabe ku yaaherize kwotsya omuzingo gw'ekitabo ogurimu ebigambo ebi Yeremia yaagambiire Baruki kuhandiika, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija ahari Yeremia nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 36:28" />Kwata ogundi muzingo, oguhandiikyemu ebigambo byona ebibaire biri omu muzingo gw'okubanza, ogu Yehoyakimu omugabe wa Yuda ayokize. <verse eid="JER 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 36:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 26:9">Yer 26:9</ref>. </char></note> Na Yehoyakimu omugabe wa Yuda omugire oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Oyokize ogwo muzingo gw'ekitabo, noogira oti: Ahabw'enki waaguhandiikiremu oti: Buzimazima omugabe wa Babulooni aryaija acwekyereze egi nsi, agimaremu abantu n'amatungo? <verse eid="JER 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 36:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:2">Yer 22:2</ref>, <ref loc="JER 22:19">19</ref>, <ref loc="JER 22:30">30</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo MUKAMA arikugambira ahari Yehoyakimu omugabe wa Yuda ati: tarigira w'okuza aha ngoma ya Daudi, kandi omutumbi gwe guryanagwa aheeru omu kibabo ky'omushana nyomushana, n'omu mbeho nyekiro. <verse eid="JER 36:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 36:31" />Kandi ndyamuhana n'oruzaaro rwe n'abagaragwa be, mbature eby'okushiisha byabo; bo n'abatwire Yerusaalemu, n'abantu ba Yuda, ndyabareetaho akabi koona aku naabagambireho, haza bakanga kuhurira.<verse eid="JER 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 36:32" />Atyo Yeremia yaakwata ogundi muzingo, yaaguha Baruki omuhandiiki mwene Neria, yaaguhandiikamu ebigambo byona ebyabaire biri omu muzingo ebyagambirwe Yeremia, ogu Yehoyakimu omugabe wa Yuda yaayokize omu muriro; kandi yaayongyeraho ebindi bingi ebirikushushana nabyo.<verse eid="JER 36:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JER 37" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia okuteebwa omu kihome ahabw'okuhanuura ahari Yuda kusingurwa Abakaludaaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 37:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 22:24">Yer 22:24</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:17">2 Bag 24:17</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 17:13">Ezk 17:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Zedekia mwene Yosia, ou Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni yaataire aha ngoma omu nsi ya Yuda, akategyeka omu mwanya gwa Konia mwene Yehoyakimu. <verse eid="JER 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 37:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:12-14">2 Bus 36:12-14</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka we n'abagaragwa be n'abantu b'omuri egyo nsi, tihaine waahuriire ebigambo bya MUKAMA ebi yaagambire naaraba omuri nabi Yeremia.<verse eid="JER 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 37:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 21:12">Yer 21:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 35:4">35:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 38:1">38:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omugabe Zedekia yaatuma Yehukaali mwene Shelemia, na Zefania omunyamurwa mwene Maaseya, ahari nabi Yeremia naagira ati: Tushabire ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu. <verse eid="JER 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 37:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:2">Yer 32:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:1">33:1</ref>. </char></note> Obwo Yeremia akaba akiine obusingye kuza omu bantu naagaruka omuka, ahabw'okuba akaba atakatairwe mu kihome. <verse eid="JER 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 37:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:15">Ezk 17:15</ref>. </char></note> Kandi eihe rya Faraho rikaba rirugire Misri; Abakaludaaya abaabaire bagotsire Yerusaalemu, ku baahuriire enkuru yaabo, baaruga Yerusaalemu, baagyenda.<verse eid="JER 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 37:6" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija ahari nabi Yeremia nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 37:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 46:17">Yer 46:17</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:7">2 Bag 24:7</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 4:17">Tonz 4:17</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 29:2">Ezk 29:2</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 29:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Oku mube nikwo mwagambira omugabe wa Yuda obatumire kuunyehanuuzaho muti: Reeba, eihe rya Faraho, eriizire kubaha emikono, riri haihi kugaruka Misri omu nsi yaabo. <verse eid="JER 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 37:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 34:22">Yer 34:22</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Abakaludaaya nibaija kugaruka, bateere oru rurembo, barukwate, barwotsye. <verse eid="JER 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 37:9" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Murekye kwebeiha nimugira muti: Buzimazima Abakaludaaya baryagumayo; mumanye ngu tibarikwija kugumayo. <verse eid="JER 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 37:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:4">Yer 21:4</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba n'obu mwakusingura eihe ry'Abakaludaaya ryona eririkubarwanisa, hakatsigara emputa zonka, buri mputa ekaahuruutuka omu ihema ryayo, ziimuka, zootsya oru rurembo n'omuriro.<verse eid="JER 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 37:11" />Eihe ry'Abakaludaaya ku ryarugire Yerusaalemu ahabw'okutiina eihe rya Faraho, <verse eid="JER 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 37:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:1">Yer 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:8">32:8</ref>, <ref loc="JER 32:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Yeremia yaaruga Yerusaalemu kuza omu nsi ya Benyamiini kutunga omugabo gwe omu bantu baayo. <verse eid="JER 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 37:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:9">Yer 21:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 38:7">38:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:15">52:15</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaabaire yaahika aha irembo rya Benyamiini, omuserukare orikurinda orikwetwa Iriiya mwene Shelemia, mwijukuru wa Hanania, yaamukwata, yaamugira ati: Noocwa kuza omu Bakaludaaya. <verse eid="JER 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 37:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:12">Yer 36:12</ref>. </char></note> Yeremia yaamugarukamu ati: Ngaaha! Noobeiha; tindikucwera omu Bakaludaaya. Kwonka Iriiya tiyaikiriza bi arikugamba, yaamukwata, yaamutwarira abategyeki. <verse eid="JER 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 37:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:36">Heb 11:36</ref>. </char></note> Abategyeki baagirira Yeremia ekiniga kingi, baamuteera, baamuta omu nju ya Yonasaani omuhandiiki, ahabw'okuba bakaba bagihindwire ekihome.<verse eid="JER 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 37:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:16, 17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 21:7">Yer 21:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 38:6-14">38:6-14</ref>, <ref loc="JER 38:16">16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yeremia ku yaagiire omu kihome, yaamara ebiro bingi omu kashengye kafunzire. <verse eid="JER 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 37:17" />Bwanyima omugabe Zedekia yaatuma ku bamureeta, yaamwakiira, yaamubuuriza omu nju ye bari bombi, naagira ati: Hariho ekigambo kyona ekirugire ahari MUKAMA? Yeremia yaamugira ati: kiriho. Yeremia yaagaruka yaagira ati: Noija kuheebwayo omu mikono y'omugabe wa Babulooni. <verse eid="JER 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 37:18" />Kandi Yeremia yaagaruka yaamubuuza ati: Nkucumwireho ki, iwe n'abaheereza baawe, nari ncumwire ki ahari eri ihanga, mwaza kunta omu kihome? <verse eid="JER 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 37:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 28:2">Yer 28:2</ref>, <ref loc="JER 28:11">11</ref>, <ref loc="JER 28:17">17</ref>. </char></note> Baanabi baanyu, ababaire nibabahanuurira nibagira ngu omugabe wa Babulooni taribateera, n'obu kwakuba okurwanisa egi nsi, barahi? <verse eid="JER 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 37:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 38:26">Yer 38:26</ref>, <ref loc="JER 38:28">28</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu mpurira, ninkweshengyereza, Nyakusinga Omugabe, oikirize okweshengyereza kwangye, orekye kungarura omu nju ya Yonasaani omuhandiiki, ntakaagwayo. <verse eid="JER 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 37:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 38:9">Yer 38:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:6">52:6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 4:10">Ezk 4:10</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 4:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Atyo omugabe Zedekia yaaragiira ku barindira Yeremia omu kibuga ky'abarinzi; yaaguma naaheebwa omugaati gumwe buri izooba, okuruga omu nguuto y'abateeki b'emigaati, okuhitsya obu emigaati yoona yaahweire omu rurembo. Atyo Yeremia yaaguma omu kibuga ky'abarinzi.<verse eid="JER 37:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JER 38" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia okunagwa omu kiziba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 38:1" />Kandi Shefania mwene Mataani, Gedalia mwene Pashuri, Yukaali mwene Shelemia na Pashuri mwene Malukia baahurira ebigambo ebi Yeremia yaagambiire abantu boona, naagira ati: <verse eid="JER 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 38:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:9">Yer 21:9</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Omuntu oraagume omuri oru rurembo naija kwitwa rurara, n'enjara, kandi n'orufu; kwonka oraarugyemu akeehongyera Abakaludaaya aryagumaho, atimbuukye omu rugamba n'engabirano, nigo magara ge. <verse eid="JER 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 38:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:3">Yer 32:3</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Buzimazima orurembo oru nirwija kuheebwayo omu mikono y'eihe ry'omugabe wa Babulooni, rukwatwe. <verse eid="JER 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 38:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 26:11">Yer 26:11</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima abategyeki baagira omugabe bati: Reka ogu mushaija aitwe, ahabw'okuba naacwa abaserukare abatsigaire omuri oru rurembo, n'abandi bantu boona, entegye, ahabw'okubagambira ebigambo ebyo. Nimureeba omushaija ogu ku atarikwendeza eri ihanga ebirungi, kureka akabi. <verse eid="JER 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 38:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 38:24-28">Yer 38:24-28</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe Zedekia yaagira ati: Reeba, ari omu mikono yaanyu; ahabw'okuba omugabe tarikubaasa kubazibira. <verse eid="JER 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 38:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 37:16">Yer 37:16</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 37:24">Kut 37:24</ref>. </char></note> Batyo baatwara Yeremia, baamunaga omu kiziba kya Malukia kiri omu kibuga ky'abarinzi, baamushuumisamu emirunga. Kwonka omuri ekyo kiziba hakaba hatarimu maizi, kureka ebyondo. Yeremia yaabishaayiramu.<verse eid="JER 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 38:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:14">Zab 69:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 56:3-5">Isa 56:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8:27">Byak 8:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Ebedi-meleki Omunyesiopia omukonwa, owaabaire ari omu nju y'omugabe, ku yaahuriire ngu banagire Yeremia omu kiziba obwo omugabe akaba ashutami omu irembo rya Benyamiini <verse eid="JER 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 38:8" />yaashohora, yaaruga omuri nyaruju, yaagira omugabe ati: <verse eid="JER 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 38:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 11:22">Yer 11:22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 14:18">14:18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 19:9">19:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:21">37:21</ref>. </char></note> Nyakusinga Omugabe, abo bantu, omu bi bakozire Yeremia byona, bakozire kubi kumunaga omu kiziba; kandi naija kwitirwamu enjara, ahabw'okuba omu rurembo tihaakirimu mugaati gwona. <verse eid="JER 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 38:10" />Ahonaaho omugabe yaaragiira Ebedi-meleki Omunyesiopia naamugira ati: Twara abashaija bashatu okuruga aha, mugyende mwihe nabi Yeremia omu kiziba atakafiire. <verse eid="JER 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 38:11" />Atyo Ebedi-meleki yaagyenda n'abo bashaija, yaataaha omuri nyaruju omu kishengye ekibiikwamu emyenda, baihamu obucancabari bw'emyenda n'ebijwaro bikuzire, yaabishuumisa emirunga omu kiziba, yaabiha Yeremia. <verse eid="JER 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 38:12" />Bwanyima Ebedi-meleki Omunyesiopia yaagira Yeremia ati: Ta obucancabari n'ebijwaro bikuzire omu maahwa, orabyeho emirunga. Yeremia yaakora atyo. <verse eid="JER 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 38:13" />Batyo baiha Yeremia omu kiziba n'emirunga, baamutuuhuurayo. Okuruga aho Yeremia yaaguma omu kibuga ky'abarinzi.<verse eid="JER 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 38:14" />Omugabe Zedekia yaatuma kweta nabi Yeremia, yaamwakiirira aha irembo rya kashatu erya hekalu ya MUKAMA. Omugabe yaagira Yeremia ati: Naaza kukubuuza; haza otagira eki wanshereka. <verse eid="JER 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 38:15" />Yeremia yaagarukamu Zedekia ati: Ku ndaakugambire, buzimazima torikwija kuunyita? Kandi n'obu ndaakuhe obwengye, torikwija kuunyikiriza. <verse eid="JER 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 38:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 37:17">Yer 37:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 38:1-9">38:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 57:16">Isa 57:16</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima omugabe Zedekia yaarahirira Yeremia omu mubonano naagira ati: Nindahira MUKAMA ohuriire owaatuhangire, tindikwija kukwita, n'obu kwakuba okukuhayo omu mikono y'abantu abarikwenda kukwita.<verse eid="JER 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 38:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 27:12">Yer 27:12</ref>, <ref loc="JER 27:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 34:4">34:4</ref>, <ref loc="JER 34:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 39:3">39:3</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:12">2 Bag 24:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahonaaho Yeremia yaagira Zedekia ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA, Ruhanga ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Ku oraayehongyere abategyeki b'omugabe wa Babulooni, noija kukiza amagara gaawe, orurembo oru tiruryokibwa, kandi iwe n'eka yaawe muryagumaho. <verse eid="JER 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 38:18" />Kwonka ku oraabe oteehongyeire bategyeki b'omugabe wa Babulooni, oru rurembo nirwija kuheebwayo omu mikono y'Abakaludaaya, barwotsye n'omuriro, kandi naiwe toribakira. <verse eid="JER 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 38:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 31:4">1 Sam 31:4</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe Zedekia yaamugira ati: Nintiina Abayudaaya abeehongyeire Abakaludaaya, ngu ntakaaheebwayo omu mikono yaabo, bakandeebesa enaku. <verse eid="JER 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 38:20" />Yeremia yaamugira ati: Torikwija kuheebwayo mu mikono yaabo. Ninkweshengyereza, yorobera eiraka rya MUKAMA omu bi ndikukugambira; obwo nibwo orikwija kuba gye, n'amagara gaawe gakakira. <verse eid="JER 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 38:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:12">Yer 27:12</ref>, <ref loc="JER 27:13">13</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku oraayangye kugomooka, eki nikyo MUKAMA anyorekire. <verse eid="JER 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 38:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 20:10">Yer 20:10</ref>. </char></note> Ndeebire abakazi boona abatsigirwe omu nju y'omugabe wa Yuda, nibabashohoza, nibabatwarira abategyeki b'omugabe wa Babulooni; kandi abo bakazi babaire nibagira ngu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 38:22">Banywani baawe abu oyesiga bakubeihire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 38:22">Baakusingura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 38:22">Mbwenu ebigyere byawe ku biherize kushaayira omu byondo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 38:22">Baakutsigaho.<verse eid="JER 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 38:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 39:6">Yer 39:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 41:10">41:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi abakazi baawe boona n'abatabani baawe nibaija kutwarirwa Abakaludaaya, naiwe torikwija kubakira, kureka noija kukwatwa omugabe wa Babulooni, n'orurembo oru barwotsye n'omuriro.<verse eid="JER 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 38:24" />Bwanyima Zedekia yaagira Yeremia ati: Hatagira owaamanya ebyo bigambo, otakaafa. <verse eid="JER 38:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 38:25" />Abategyeki ku baraahurire ngu ngambire naiwe, baakwijaho, baakubuuza bati: Tugambire ebi ogambiire omugabe, kandi n'ebi omugabe akugambiire; otagira eki waatushereka tukakwita, <verse eid="JER 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 38:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 37:20">Yer 37:20</ref>. </char></note> obwo obagire oti: Nyeshengyereize omugabe n'obucureezi ngu atangarura omu nju ya Yonasaani, nkagwamu. <verse eid="JER 38:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 38:27" />Bwanyima abategyeki boona baija ahari Yeremia, baamubuuza, nawe yaabagarukamu nk'oku omugabe amuhabwire. Batyo baareka kugamba nawe; ahabw'okuba eki yaagambire n'omugabe tikiramanyirwe. <verse eid="JER 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 38:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:2">Yer 32:2</ref>. </char></note> Okuruga aho Yeremia yaaguma omu kibuga ky'abarinzi, okuhitsya aha izooba eri Yerusaalemu yaakwatiirweho.<verse eid="JER 38:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JER 39" />
  <para style="s1">Okukwatwa kwa Yerusaalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 39:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:1-10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 52:4-16">Yer 52:4-16</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:1-12">2 Bag 25:1-12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa mwenda ogw'omu busingye bwa Zedekia omugabe wa Yuda, omu kwezi kwa ikumi, Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni akaija n'eihe rye ryona, yaateera Yerusaalemu, yaagigota. <verse eid="JER 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 39:2" />Omu mwaka gwa ikumi na gumwe ogw'omu busingye bwa Zedekia, omu kwezi kwa kana, aha kiro kyakwo kya mwenda, bakasheenya ah'okutaahira omu rurembo. <verse eid="JER 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 39:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:15">Yer 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 39:13">39:13</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:17">2 Bag 18:17</ref>. </char></note> Ku baaherize kurukwata, abategyeki b'omugabe wa Babulooni boona baarutaahamu, baashutama omu irembo ry'ahagati; amaziina gaabo ni Nerigali-sharezeeri, Samugaari-neebo, Sarusekimu, Rabusarisi, na Nerugaali-sherezeeri Rabumaagi, hamwe n'abandi bategyeki b'omugabe wa Babulooni boona. <verse eid="JER 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 39:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:1">Bir 1:1</ref>. </char></note> Zedekia omugabe wa Yuda n'abaserukare be boona ku baabareebire, baahunga, baacwa omu rurembo nyekiro nibatoora omuhanda ogurikuraba omu musiri gw'omugabe omu irembo ry'ahagati y'engo zombi, baatoora ogurikuza Araba. <verse eid="JER 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 39:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 5:10">Yos 5:10</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:33">2 Bag 23:33</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 17:15">Ezk 17:15</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka eihe ry'Abakaludaaya ryabakurata, ryakwatira Zedekia omu ruhita rwa Yeriko. Ku baaherize kumukwata, baamutwarira Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni Ribula omu nsi ya Hamasi, yaamucwera orubanja. <verse eid="JER 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 39:6" />Omugabe wa Babulooni yaitirayo batabani ba Zedekia omu maisho ga ishebo, kandi yaita n'abakungu ba Yuda boona. <verse eid="JER 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 39:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:4">Yer 32:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 12:13">Ezk 12:13</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yaihamu Zedekia amaisho, yaamubohesa emihama, yaamutwara Babulooni. <verse eid="JER 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 39:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 1:3">Neh 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 5:5">Isa 5:5</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Abakaludaaya baayotsya nyaruju y'omugabe n'amaju g'abantu, baasheenya n'orugo rw'amabaare rwa Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="JER 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 39:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 40:1">Yer 40:1</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 37:36">Kut 37:36</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Nebuzaradaani omukuru w'abarinzi yaatwara abantu abaatsigaire omu rurembo, abaabaire bamwehongyeire hamwe n'abaabaire batsigaire omu rurembo, yaabatwara Babulooni bari enkwatwa. <verse eid="JER 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 39:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 40:7">Yer 40:7</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Nebuzaradaani omukuru w'abarinzi yaatsiga omuri Yuda abooro bamwe abataine kantu, yaabaha emisiri y'emizaabibu n'eshambu omuri obwo bunaku.<verse eid="JER 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 39:11" />Kandi Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni yaaragiira Nebuzaradaani omukuru w'abarinzi ebya Yeremia, naagira ati: <verse eid="JER 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 39:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 40:4">Yer 40:4</ref>. </char></note> Mutware, omurinde gye, otagira eki waamwitsa, kureka eki araakugambire, obe nikyo waamukorera. <verse eid="JER 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 39:13" />Atyo Nebuzaradaani omukuru w'abarinzi, Nebushazibaani Rabusarisi, Nerugaali-sharezaari Rabumaagi, n'abandi bategyeki b'omugabe wa Babulooni boona <verse eid="JER 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 39:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 38:28">Yer 38:28</ref>; <ref loc="JER 40:1-16">40:1-16</ref>; <ref loc="JER 41:1-18">41:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 22:3">2 Bag 22:3</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 22:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:22-25">25:22-25</ref>. </char></note> baatuma, baiha Yeremia omu kibuga ky'abarinzi, baamukwatsa Gedalia mwene Ahikaamu, mwijukuru wa Shafani, ngu amugarure omu ka ye. Atyo ku yaahikireyo, yaatuura omu bantu baayo.<verse eid="JER 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 39:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 37:12">Yer 37:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yeremia, obu yaabaire akikingirainwe omu kibuga ky'abarinzi, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikamwijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 39:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:10">Yer 21:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 38:7">38:7</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:12">Dan 9:12</ref>. </char></note> Irooko ogambire Ebedi-meleki Omunyesiopia oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, niinyija kuhikiiriza ahari oru rurembo ebi naagambire kurureetaho akabi, kutari kurureetaho birungi, kandi biryahikiirizibwa eryo izooba noobireeba; <verse eid="JER 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 39:17" />kwonka iwe, eryo izooba ndyakujuna, orekye kuheebwayo omu mikono y'abo bantu bu orikutiina; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 39:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:9">Yer 21:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 25:2">Zab 25:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 37:40">37:40</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba buzimazima ndyakujuna, toriitwa rurara; kureka oryatimbuuka omu rugamba n'engabirano, nigo magara gaawe, ahabw'okuba okanyesiga; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 39:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JER 40" />
  <para style="s1">Okurekurwa kwa Yeremia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 40:1" />Eki n'ekigambo ekyaizire ahari Yeremia nikiruga ahari MUKAMA, obu Nebuzaradaani omukuru w'abarinzi yaabaire aherize kumurekura kuruga Raama, naamutwara abohirwe n'enjegyere hamwe n'ezindi nkwatwa zoona eza Yerusaalemu na Yuda, ezaabaire nizitwarwa Babulooni. <verse eid="JER 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 40:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:24">Bir 29:24</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 29:25">25</ref>. </char></note> Omukuru w'abarinzi yaatwara Yeremia, yaamugira ati: MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe akagamba akabi aka akarihika aha mwanya ogu; <verse eid="JER 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 40:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:10-12">Dan 9:10-12</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA akihikiriize, yaakora nk'oku yaagambire. Ebi byona bibahikireho ahabw'okuba mukacumura ahari MUKAMA, mwayanga kuhurira eiraka rye. <verse eid="JER 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 40:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 39:12">Yer 39:12</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu eri izooba naaza kukwiha enjegyere aha mikono. Ku oraabe noosiima kugyenda naanye Babulooni, ija, naanye niinyija kukurinda gye. Kwonka ku oraabe otarikusiima kugyenda naanye Babulooni, orereere. Reeba, ensi yoona eri omu maisho gaawe; za ahu orikwenda hoona, ah'orikuteekateeka ngu ni harungi kandi hahikire. <verse eid="JER 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 40:5" />Ku oraatsigare, ogarukye ahari Gedalia mwene Ahikaamu, mwijukuru wa Shafani, ou omugabe wa Babulooni ataireho kutegyeka endembo za Yuda, otuure nawe omu bantu; nari shi oze ahu orikusiima hoona. Atyo omukuru w'abarinzi yaamuha entanda n'ekiconco, yaamureka. <verse eid="JER 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 40:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 41:6">Yer 41:6</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Yeremia yaagyenda yaashanga Gedalia mwene Ahikamu Mizipa, yaatuura nawe omu bantu abaabaire batsigaire omu nsi.<verse eid="JER 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 40:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 39:10">Yer 39:10</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:12">2 Bag 25:12</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 25:23">23</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 25:24">24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima abakuru b'engabo boona abaabaire bari omu bwerere, bo n'abantu baabo, ku baahuriire ngu omugabe wa Babulooni agizire Gedalia mwene Ahikaamu omutegyeki omuri egyo nsi, kandi ngu amukwatsize abashaija, abakazi n'abaana abarikukira abandi boona kuba abooro, abaabaire batatwairwe Babulooni omu bukwatwa, <verse eid="JER 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 40:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 41:1-3">Yer 41:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 42:1">42:1</ref>, <ref loc="JER 42:8">8</ref>. </char></note> baaza Mizipa owa Gedalia, amaziina gaabo nigo aga, Ishimaeli mwene Nesania, Yohanaani mwene Karea, Seraaya mwene Tanihumeesi, beene Efai aba Netofa, na Yezania mutabani w'Omunyamaaka, bo n'abashaija baabo. <verse eid="JER 40:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 40:9" />Gedalia mwene Ahikaamu mwijukuru wa Shafani yaabarahira, bo n'abashaija baabo, yaabagira ati: Murekye kutiina kwehongyera Abakaludaaya. Mugume omu nsi egi, nimuheereza omugabe wa Babulooni; obwo nibwo muraije kuguma muri gye. <verse eid="JER 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 40:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 52:12">Yer 52:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:38">Bir 1:38</ref>. </char></note> Nyowe niinyija kuguma Mizipa nimbatabaarira aha Bakaludaaya abariija owaitu; kwonka imwe mugume mushanguruze viinyo n'ebijuma by'omu kyanda n'amajuta, mubibiikye omu nyungu zaanyu, mutuure omu ndembo ezi mukubwire. <verse eid="JER 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 40:11" />N'Abayuda boona abaabaire batwire Moabu n'omu Baamoni n'omuri Edomu n'omu nsi ezindi zoona, ku bahuriire ngu omugabe wa Babulooni atsigireyo abaahonokire aha Bayuda, yaataho Gedalia mwene Ahikaamu mwijukuru wa Shafani kuba omutegyeki waabo, <verse eid="JER 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 40:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 43:5">Yer 43:5</ref>. </char></note> Abayudaaya abo boona baagaruka, baaruga ei baabaire babingiirwe yoona, baija Mizipa owa Gedalia omu nsi ya Yuda; baashanguruza viinyo n'ebijuma by'omu kyanda bingi munonga.<verse eid="JER 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ishimaeli okwenda kwita Gedalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 40:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 41:11">Yer 41:11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 42:1">42:1</ref>, <ref loc="JER 42:2">2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Yohanaani mwene Karea n'abakuru b'engabo abaabaire bari omu nsi y'obwerere, baija Mizipa ahari Gedalia, <verse eid="JER 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 40:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 41:10">Yer 41:10</ref>. </char></note> baamugira bati: Torikumanya ku Baalisi omugabe w'Abaamoni ayohereize Ishimaeli mwene Nesania kukwita? Kwonka Gedalia mwene Ahikaamu tiyaabaikiriza. <verse eid="JER 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 40:15" />Bwanyima Yohanaani mwene Karea yaagambirira Gedalia Mizipa omu mubonano, ati: Ninkushaba, ondekye nze kwita Ishimaeli mwene Nesania, kandi tihariho orikwija kukimanya. Mbwenu, ku yaakukwita, Abayudaaya boona abaakuteeraniireho baataataana, n'abahonokire aha Bayuda baahwerekyerera, okaazira ki? <verse eid="JER 40:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 40:16" />Kwonka Gedalia mwene Ahikaamu yaagira Yohanaani mwene Karea ati: Otakora ekyo kintu, ahabw'okuba noobeiherera Ishimaeli.<verse eid="JER 40:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JER 41" />
  <para style="s1">Okwitwa kwa Gedalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 41:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 25:25">2 Bag 25:25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 41:9">Zab 41:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu kwezi kwa mushanju Ishimaeli mwene Nesania, mwijukuru wa Elishaama, omunyiginya kandi omutegyeki mukuru omu bategyeki b'omugabe, yaija n'abantu ikumi Mizipa owa Gedalia mwene Ahikaamu. Ku baabaire nibariira hamwe eby'okurya omuri Mizipa, <verse eid="JER 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 41:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 13:28">2 Sam 13:28</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 13:29">29</ref>. </char></note> Ishimaeli mwene Nesania n'abo bashaija ikumi abu yaabaire aine, baimuka, baateera Gedalia mwene Ahikaamu, mwijukuru wa Shafani, rurara, baamugwisaho; kandi ogwo ou baitsire niwe omugabe wa Babulooni yaabaire ataireho kuba omutegyeki omuri egyo nsi. <verse eid="JER 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 41:3" />Kandi Ishimaeli yaagaruka yaita Abayudaaya boona abu Gedalia yaabaire aine Mizipa, hamwe n'abaserukare b'Abakaludaaya abaabaire bariho.<verse eid="JER 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 41:4" />Ku yaamazire kabiri aitsire Gedalia, kandi kitakamanyirwe muntu weena, <verse eid="JER 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 41:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:13">Yer 23:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 48:37">48:37</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:1">Bir 14:1</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 16:24">1 Bag 16:24</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 15:2">Isa 15:2</ref>. </char></note> haija abantu makumi munaana nibaruga Shekemu, Shiilo na Samaria bamweire ebireju, bajwaire ebijwaro bitaagukire, beesharashazire emibiri, bareetsire empongano z'esaano n'obubaane, kubihongyera omuri hekalu ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="JER 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 41:6" />Ishimaeli mwene Nesania yaaruga Mizipa kuza kubabugana, yaagyenda naarira. Ku yaabaire naakibabugana, yaabagira ati: Mwije tuze owa Gedalia mwene Ahikaamu. <verse eid="JER 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 41:7" />Ku baahikire omu rurembo, Ishimaeli mwene Nesania n'abashaija abu yaabaire aine baita abo bantu, baabanaga omu kiina. <verse eid="JER 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 41:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:11">Bar 6:11</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka hakaba hariho abantu ikumi omuribo abaagizire Ishimaeli bati: Otatwita, ahabw'okuba twine engano, sayiri, amajuta n'obwoki, bisherekire omu ishwa. Atyo yaabareka, tiyaabaita na bagyenzi baabo.<verse eid="JER 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 41:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 15:22">1 Bag 15:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekyo kiina eki Ishimaeli yaanagiremu emitumbi y'abu yaitsire boona kikaba kiri ekiina kihango ekyatimbisiibwe omugabe Asa ahabw'okutiina Baasha omugabe wa Israeli. Ishimaeli mwene Nesania yaakiijuza emitumbi y'abaitsirwe. <verse eid="JER 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 41:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 38:23">Yer 38:23</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Ishimaeli yaatwara abantu abaabaire bari Mizipa na bahara b'omugabe n'abantu boona abaabaire batsigaire Mizipa, abu Nebuzaradaani omukuru w'abarinzi yaabaire akwatsize Gedalia mwene Ahikaamu. Ishimaeli mwene Nesania yaabatwara bari enkwatwa, yaimuka kwambuka kuhungira omu Baamoni.<verse eid="JER 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 41:11" />Bwanyima Yohanaani mwene Karea n'abakuru b'engabo abu yaabaire aine, ku baahuriire akagwe aku Ishimaeli mwene Nesania agwisize, <verse eid="JER 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 41:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 9:3">Yos 9:3</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 9:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 2:13">2 Sam 2:13</ref>. </char></note> baahurura n'engabo zaabo zoona, baaza kurwanisa Ishimaeli mwene Nesania. Baamugwaho aha kiyanja kihango ekyabaire kiri Gibeoni. <verse eid="JER 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 41:13" />Abantu boona abaabaire bari hamwe na Ishimaeli, ku baareebire Yohanaani mwene Karea n'abakuru b'engabo boona abu yaabaire aine, baashemererwa. <verse eid="JER 41:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 41:14" />N'ahabw'ekyo abantu boona abu Ishimaeli mwene Nesania yaabaire aihire Mizipa, akabatwara bari enkwatwa, baakuba, baagaruka, baashanga Yohanaani mwene Karea. <verse eid="JER 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 41:15" />Kwonka Ishimaeli mwene Nesania yaahunga Yohanaani aine abantu munaana, yaaza omu Baamoni. <verse eid="JER 41:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 41:16" />Bwanyima Yohanaani mwene Karea n'abakuru b'engabo boona abu yaabaire aine baatwara abantu boona abaabaire batsigaire, abu Ishimaeli mwene Nesania yaabaire atwaire bari enkwatwa naabaiha Mizipa, aherize kwita Gedalia mwene Ahikaamu. Yohanaani yaabagarura naabaiha Gibeoni, abaserukare, abakazi abaana n'abakonwa. <verse eid="JER 41:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 41:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:37">2 Sam 19:37</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 19:38">38</ref>. </char></note> Baagyenda, baaguma Gerutikimuhaamu haihi na Betelehemu; obwo nibenda kuza Misri ahabw'Abakaludaaya; <verse eid="JER 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 41:18" />ahabw'okuba bakaba nibabatiina ahabwa ishimaeli mwene Nesania kwita Gedalia mwene Ahikaamu, ou omugabe wa Babulooni yaabaire ataireho kuba omutegyeki w'ensi egyo.<verse eid="JER 41:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JER 42" />
  <para style="s1">Yohanaani okwanga kworobera ekigambo kya MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 42:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 43:2">Yer 43:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima abakuru b'engabo boona na Yohanaani mwene Karea, na Azaria mwene Hoshaaya, n'abantu boona okuruga aha muto okuhika aha mukuru, bairira haihi nabi Yeremia, <verse eid="JER 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 42:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:7">Yer 36:7</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:22">Lev 26:22</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 7:8">1 Sam 7:8</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 12:19">12:19</ref>. </char></note> baamugira bati: Nitukweshengyereza oikirize okushaba kwaitu; otushabire ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, itwe twena abatsigaireho; ahabw'okuba tukaba turi baingi, mbwenu tutsigaire bakye nk'oku orikutureeba. <verse eid="JER 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 42:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 8:21">Ezr 8:21</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe atworekye omuhanda ogu tushemereire kutoora n'ebi tushemereire kukora. <verse eid="JER 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 42:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:18">Kub 22:18</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 3:18">1 Sam 3:18</ref>. </char></note> Nabi Yeremia yaabagarukamu ati: Naabahurira. Mbwenu naaza kushaba MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, nk'oku mwashaba; kandi eki MUKAMA araagarukyemu kyona, niinyija kukibagambira. Tiinyine ki ndaabasherekye. <verse eid="JER 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 42:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 11:10">Bar 11:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:5">Kush 1:5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:14">3:14</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima baagira Yeremia bati: Ku turaabe tutakozire ebi MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe araakutume kutugambira, MUKAMA abe niwe yaaba mushinja waitu ow'amazima kandi omwesigwa. <verse eid="JER 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 42:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:23">Yer 7:23</ref>. </char></note> Yaaba biba birungi nari bibi, nitwija kworobera eiraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu ou turikukutumaho, tubone kuba gye, ku turaabe twayorobeire eiraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu.<verse eid="JER 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 42:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 3:16">Ezk 3:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima ku haahingwireho ebiro ikumi, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija ahari Yeremia. <verse eid="JER 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 42:8" />Yaayeta Yohanaani mwene Karea n'abakuru b'amahe boona abu yaabaire aine, n'abantu boona okuruga aha muto okuhika aha mukuru, <verse eid="JER 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 42:9" />yaabagira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, ou mwantumireho kumuhitsyaho okweshengyereza kwanyu, arikugamba naagira ati: <verse eid="JER 42:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 42:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 18:8">Yer 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 24:6">24:6</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 6:6">Kut 6:6</ref>. </char></note> Ku muraagume omuri egi nsi, niinyija kubombeka, tindikwija kubasheenya; niinyija kubabyara, tindikwija kubakuura; ahabw'okuba nyefuurize ahabw'akabi aku naabareetsireho. <verse eid="JER 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 42:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 41:18">Yer 41:18</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:31">Rom 8:31</ref>. </char></note> Murekye kutiina omugabe wa Babulooni, ou murikutiina; mutamutiina; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira; ahabw'okuba ndi hamwe naimwe kubajuna n'okubaiha omu mikono ye. <verse eid="JER 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 42:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 1:11">Neh 1:11</ref>. </char></note> Ndyabaha okugirirwa embabazi, nawe abone kuzibagirira, kandi abarekye mugume omu nsi yaanyu. <verse eid="JER 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 42:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 43:4">Yer 43:4</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku muraagire muti: Titurikwija kuguma omuri egi nsi, mwagomera eiraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, <verse eid="JER 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 42:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:19">Yer 4:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:21">37:21</ref>. </char></note> nimugira muti: Ngaaha, nitwija kwegiira omu nsi ya Misri, ei tutarireeba ngamba, n'obu kwakuba okuhurira eiraka ry'enzamba, nari okubura eby'okurya, kandi okwo niyo turituura, <verse eid="JER 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 42:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 44:12-14">Yer 44:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 17:16">Bir 17:16</ref>. </char></note> mbwenu nimuhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA, imwe abatsigaire omuri Yuda. Oku nikwo MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: KU muraate amaisho aha kuza Misri, mwaza kutuurayo, <verse eid="JER 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 42:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:8">Ezk 11:8</ref>. </char></note> mumanye ngu rurara ei murikutiina neija kubahambiza omu nsi ya Misri, kandi n'enjara ei murikutiina neija kugyenda ebeezingiriire, okuhitsya obu murihikayo; kandi okwo niyo murigwa. <verse eid="JER 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 42:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 2:22">Tonz 2:22</ref>. </char></note> Abantu boona abataire amaisho aha kuza Misri kutuurayo nibaija kwitirwayo rurara n'enjara n'orufu; kandi tihariho n'omwe omuribo orihonokaho nari oritsigaraho, akakira akabi aku ndibareetaho.<verse eid="JER 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 42:18" />Ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Nk'okuguubwa kubi kwangye n'ekiniga kyangye oku byashukirwe aha batuuzi ba Yerusaalemu, nikwo naimwe murishukwaho ekiniga kyangye mwahika Misri. Kandi muryaba ekirikwamaganwa, ekirikutiinisa, eky'okukyeenwa n'eky'okushekyererwa; kandi timurigaruka kureeba ogu mwanya bundi. <verse eid="JER 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 42:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:5">Ezk 2:5</ref>. </char></note> Imwe abatsigaire omuri Yuda, MUKAMA abagizire ati: Mutaza Misri. Mukimanyire kimwe ku naabeehanangiriza eri izooba, <verse eid="JER 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 42:20" />ku mutashemereire kuhaba mukafa, ahabw'okuba mukantuma ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, nimugira muti: Tushabire ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu; kandi kyona eki MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu araagambe, okitugambire, naitwe nitwija kukikora. <verse eid="JER 42:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 42:21" />Mbwenu eri izooba naakibagambira, kwonka timwayorobera iraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu omuri byona ebi abantumireho. <verse eid="JER 42:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 42:22" />N'ahabw'ekyo mumanyire kimwe, ku rurara n'enjara n'orufu birikwija kubaitira, ei murikwenda kuza kutuura.<verse eid="JER 42:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="JER 43" />
  <para style="s1">Yohanaani okugomera ekigambo kya MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 43:1" />Yeremia ku yaaherize kugambira abantu boona ebigambo bya MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo byona, ebi MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo amubatumireho, <verse eid="JER 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 43:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 86:14">Zab 86:14</ref>. </char></note> Azaria mwene Hoshaaya na Yohanaani mwene Karea n'abanyarubwa boona baagira Yeremia bati: Noobeiha; MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu takutumire kugira oti: Mutaza Misri kutuurayo; <verse eid="JER 43:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 43:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 37:13">Yer 37:13</ref>. </char></note> kureka Baruki mwene Neria niwe atuteeraine naiwe kutuhayo omu mikono y'Abakaludaaya kutwita nari okututwara Babulooni turi enkwatwa. <verse eid="JER 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 43:4" />Atyo Yohanaani mwene Karea n'abakuru b'amahe boona n'abantu boona baayanga kuhurira eiraka rya MUKAMA kuguma omu nsi ya Yuda, <verse eid="JER 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 43:5" />kureka Yohanaani mwene karea n'abakuru b'amahe boona baatwara Abayuda boona abaabaire bagarukire kutuura omu nsi ya Yuda, barugire omu mahanga goona ei baabaire babingiirwe, <verse eid="JER 43:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 43:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 44:20">Yer 44:20</ref>. </char></note> abashaija, abakazi, abaana, bahara b'omugabe, na buri muntu weena ou Nebuzaradaani omukuru w'abarinzi yaabaire akwatsize Gedalia mwene Ahikaamu, mwijukuru wa Shafani, hamwe na nabi Yeremia na Baruki mwene Neria. <verse eid="JER 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 43:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:16">Yer 2:16</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:1">44:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 46:14">46:14</ref>. </char></note> Batyo baaza omu nsi ya Misri, ahabw'okuba bakanga kuhurira eiraka rya MUKAMA. Bwanyima baahika Tahapenesi.<verse eid="JER 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 43:8" />Kandi ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija ahari Yeremia ari Tahapenesi, nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 43:9" />Twara amabaare mahango omu ngaro, ogasherekye omu budongo ahansi y'amabaare agaariire aha irembo ry'ekikaari kya Faraho omuri Tahapenesi, Abayuda boona nibakureeba; <verse eid="JER 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 43:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:15">Yer 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:9">25:9</ref>. </char></note> obagire oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, ndyayohereza omwiru wangye Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni, ate ekitebe kye ky'obugabe ahari aga mabaare agu naashereka, kandi ateere eihema rye ry'obugabe ahaiguru yaago. <verse eid="JER 43:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 43:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:2">Yer 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:13">44:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 46:13">46:13</ref>. </char></note> Aryaija ateere ensi ya Misri, aheyo ab'okwitwa rufu ebaite, ab'okutwarwa omu bukwatwa batwarwe, n'ab'okwitwa rurara ebaite. <verse eid="JER 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 43:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:27">Yer 17:27</ref>; <ref loc="JER 46:25">46:25</ref>; <ref loc="JER 48:7">48:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 30:13">Ezk 30:13</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:12">Kur 12:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 19:1">Isa 19:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:18">49:18</ref>. </char></note> Kandi aryatweka omuriro omuri hekalu za baaruhanga ba Misri, abootsye, abatware bari enkwatwa, ashemeze ensi ya Misri, nk'oku omuriisa ashemeza ekijwaro kye, akakimaramu enda. Bwanyima arugyeyo n'obusingye. <verse eid="JER 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 43:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:45">Kut 41:45</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:24">Kur 23:24</ref>. </char></note> Aryasheenyagura enyomyo z'amabaare Beti-shemeshi ey'omu nsi ya Misri, kandi na hekalu za baaruhanga ba Misri aryazootsya n'omuriro.<verse eid="JER 43:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="JER 44" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia okuteisa Abayuda ahabw'okuramya ebishushani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 44:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 43:7-9">Yer 43:7-9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 46:14">46:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima ekigambo kikaija ahari Yeremia nikigamba aha Bayudaaya boona abaabaire batwire omuri Misri, Migidooli, Tahapenesi, Noofu n'omu nsi ya Pasiroosi, nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JER 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 44:2" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Mukareeba akabi koona aku naareetsire ahari Yerusaalemu n'aha ndembo zoona eza Yuda. Hati n'amatongo; tihaine ozitwiremu, <verse eid="JER 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 44:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:16">Yer 1:16</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:18">7:18</ref>, <ref loc="JER 7:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:14">Bir 6:14</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'obubi bw'ebi baakozire nibangwisa kubi, obu baaza kwotera obubaane, bakaheereza baaruhanga abandi abu batakamanyaga, bo naimwe na baashwenkuriimwe. <verse eid="JER 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 44:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:15">2 Bus 36:15</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka nkaguma nimbatumaho abaheereza bangye baanabi boona, ningira nti: Nyaabura 'mwe, murekye kukora ebirikunugwa ebyo ebi ndikwanga. <verse eid="JER 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 44:5" />Kwonka tibaahurira n'obu kwakuba okutega amatu, kuhinduka kureka obubi bwabo, n'okutooterera baaruhanga abandi obubaane. <verse eid="JER 44:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 44:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:11">Yer 9:11</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo okuguubwa kubi kwangye n'ekiniga kyangye byashukiirwe, bikabuguma omu ndembo za Yuda n'omu nguuto za Yerusaalemu, zikahinduka amatongo n'eihamba, nk'oku ziri hati. <verse eid="JER 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 44:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:38">Kub 16:38</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 2:11">Tonz 2:11</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Ahabw'enki nimukora akabi kahango kati aha magara gaanyu, mukeemaraho omushaija n'omukazi, omwana muto n'omwereere ou mwatsigaza? <verse eid="JER 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 44:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:16">Yer 1:16</ref>; <ref loc="JER 42:18">42:18</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'enki nimuunyitsa ekiniga n'ebi murikukora n'emikono yaanyu, mukooterera baaruhanga abandi obubaane omu nsi ya Misri, ei mwaizire kutuuramu, ngu mucuubwe, mube eky'okukyeenwa n'eky'okushekyererwa omu mahanga goona ag'omu nsi? <verse eid="JER 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 44:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 44:15">Yer 44:15</ref>, <ref loc="JER 44:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:1">1 Bag 11:1</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 11:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 15:13">15:13</ref>. </char></note> Mwebirwe obubi bwa baashwenkuriimwe n'obw'abagabe ba Yuda, obw'abakazi baabo, obwanyu n'obw'abakazi baanyu, obw'ebi baakoreire omu ndembo za Yuda n'omu nguuto za Yerusaalemu? <verse eid="JER 44:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 44:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 28:14">Enf 28:14</ref>. </char></note> Nangwa n'okuhitsya hati tibakeecureize, n'obu kwakuba okutiina, kandi tibakagyendeire mu biragiro byangye n'omu byatairweho, ebi naataire omu maisho gaanyu n'aga baashwenkuriimwe.<verse eid="JER 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 44:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 21:10">Yer 21:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugirira ati: Reeba, niinyija kubata omu kaso, mbakore kubi, mmareho Abayuda boona. <verse eid="JER 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 44:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 18:16">Yer 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="JER 42:15">42:15</ref>, <ref loc="JER 42:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Abayuda abaatsigaireho abamaririire kwija omuri Misri kutuuramu, ndyabatwara, bamarweho; omuri egi nsi ya Misri nimwo barigwa, bakamarwaho rurara n'enjara; okuruga aha muto okuhika aha mukuru baryaitwa rurara n'enjara, kandi baryaba ekirikwamaganwa, ekirikutiinisa, eky'okukyeenwa n'eky'okushekyererwa. <verse eid="JER 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 44:13" />Ndyafubira abatwire omu nsi ya Misri, nk'oku naafubiire Yerusaalemu, mbaitse rurara n'enjara n'orufu, <verse eid="JER 44:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 44:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:27">Yer 22:27</ref>; <ref loc="JER 42:17">42:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:2">44:2</ref>. </char></note> habure n'omwe omu Bayuda abaatsigaireho abagiire omu nsi ya Misri kutuurayo owaahonokaho nari owaatsigaraho, nari owaagaruka omu nsi ya Yuda ei barikwetenga kugaruka kutuuramu; ahabw'okuba tihaine barigarukayo, kureka bakye abaacwire.<verse eid="JER 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 44:15" />Bwanyima abashaija boona, abaabaire nibamanya ngu abakazi baabo nibooterera baaruhanga abandi obubaane, kandi n'abakazi boona abaabaire beemereire aho, bari omutwe muhango munonga, n'abantu boona abaabaire batwire Pasiroosi omu nsi ya Misri, baagarukamu Yeremia nibagira bati: <verse eid="JER 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 44:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:16">Yer 6:16</ref>; <ref loc="JER 42:13">42:13</ref>. </char></note> Titurikwija kukuhurira omuri ekyo kigambo ki otugambiire omu iziina rya MUKAMA, <verse eid="JER 44:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 44:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:18">Yer 7:18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 19:13">19:13</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:33">1 Bag 11:33</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 21:3">2 Bag 21:3</ref>. </char></note> kureka nitwija kuhikiiriza ekigambo kyona eki twagambire nituhiga, okwoterera omugabekazi w'omu iguru obubaane, n'okumushukira empongano z'eby'okunywa, nk'oku twabaire tukora, itwe na baatatenkuriitwe n'abagabe baitu n'abanyiginya baitu, tukiri omu ndembo za Yuda n'omu nguuto za Yerusaalemu; ahabw'okuba omuri obwo bunaku tukaba twine eby'okurya bingi, turi gye, tutaine kabi karikutuhikaho. <verse eid="JER 44:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 44:18" />Kwonka okwiha obu twarereera kwoterera omugabekazi w'omu iguru obubaane n'okumushukira empongano z'eby'okunywa, tukabura byona, twamarwaho rurara n'enjara. <verse eid="JER 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 44:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 30:6">Kub 30:6</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 30:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abo bakazi baagira bati: Obu twabaire twoterera omugabekazi w'omu iguru obubaane, tukamushukira empongano z'eby'okunywa, noogira ngu tukaba tumukorera otukeeki tumuramya, tumushukira empongano z'eby'okunya, abashaija baitu batarikubisiima?<verse eid="JER 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 44:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 43:6">Yer 43:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Yeremia yaabuuza abantu boona, abashaija n'abakazi abaamugarukiremu batyo ati: <verse eid="JER 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 44:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 8:10">Ezk 8:10</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 8:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 21:24">21:24</ref>. </char></note> Beitu obubaane obu mwayotereire omu ndembo za Yuda n'omu nguuto za Yerusaalemu, imwe na baashwenkuriimwe, abagabe baanyu n'abanyiginya baanyu, n'abantu b'omuri egyo nsi, MUKAMA tarabiijukire, bikamuhika aha mutima? <verse eid="JER 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 44:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:9">Yer 5:9</ref>, <ref loc="JER 5:29">29</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA akaba atakibaasa kugumisiririza bibi byanyu n'ebihagaro ebi mwabaire nimukora; nikyo ensi yaanyu yaahindukiire amatongo n'eihamba n'eky'okukyeenwa, etagire owaagituuramu, nk'oku kiri na hati. <verse eid="JER 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 44:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:29">Bir 31:29</ref>. </char></note> Ekyabareeteire kuhikwaho akabi aka koona, nk'oku kiri hati, n'ahabw'okuba mukootera obubaane, mwacumura ahari MUKAMA, timwayorobera iraka rye, n'obu kwakuba okugyendera omu biragiro bye, n'omu byatairweho, n'omu bi yaahamize.<verse eid="JER 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 44:24" />Bwanyima Yeremia yaagaruka yaagambira abantu boona n'abakazi boona ati: Imwe Bayuda 'mwe mwena abari omu nsi ya Misri, nimuhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA. <verse eid="JER 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 44:25" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Imwe n'abakazi baanyu mukeegambira n'endimi zaanyu, mwabihikiiriza n'emikono yaanyu, nimugira muti: Tituribura kuhikiiriza ebi twagambire nituhiga, kwoterera omugabekazi w'omu iguru obubaane, n'okumushukira empongano z'eby'okunywa. Mpaho nimwirooko mugumizemu n'okuhiga kwanyu, kandi mukuhikiirize. <verse eid="JER 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 44:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:5">Yer 22:5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:39">Ezk 20:39</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka imwe Bayuda 'mwe mwena abatwire omu nsi ya Misri, muhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA. Reeba, ndahiire eiziina ryangye erikuru, ku eiziina ryangye ritarigaruka kurahirwa muntu wa Yuda weena ori omu nsi ya Misri naagira ati: Nindahira MUKAMA ohuriire; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 44:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:28">Yer 31:28</ref>; <ref loc="JER 42:16">42:16</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, mbataireho abiri kubakora kubi, ti kubakora gye. Abayuda boona abari omu nsi ya Misri baryamarwaho rurara n'enjara, okuhitsya obu barihweraho kimwe. <verse eid="JER 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 44:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 44:17">Yer 44:17</ref>, <ref loc="JER 44:25">25</ref>, <ref loc="JER 44:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 27:13">Isa 27:13</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 6:8">Ezk 6:8</ref>. </char></note> N'abarihonoka ahari rurara baryaruga omu nsi ya Misri, bagarukye omu nsi ya Yuda bari mbarwa; kandi Abayuda boona abatsigaireho abaizire omu nsi ya Misri kutuuramu baryamanya ou ekigambo kye kirigumaho, yaaba kyangye nari kyabo. <verse eid="JER 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 44:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 19:21">Enf 19:21</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA naagira ati: Aka niko karibabeera akamanyiso, ku ndibafubirira omuri ogu mwanya, mukabona kumanya ku ebigambo byangye biriguma biri eby'amazima, bikabareetaho akabi. <verse eid="JER 44:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 44:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:5">Yer 30:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 46:26">46:26</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 29:2-5">Ezk 29:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 30:21-24">30:21-24</ref>. </char></note> Kandi oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, niinyija kuhayo Faraho Hofura omugabe wa Misri omu mikono y'abazigu be n'abarikumuhiiga kumwita, nk'oku naahaireyo Zedekia omugabe wa Yuda omu mikono ya Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni, owaabaire ari omuzigu we, kandi naamuhiiga kumwita.<verse eid="JER 44:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="JER 45" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia okuhanuurira Baruki eby'obusingye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 45:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 32:12">Yer 32:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 36:1">36:1</ref>, <ref loc="JER 36:4">4</ref>, <ref loc="JER 36:18">18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eki n'ekigambo eki nabi Yeremia yaagambiire Baruki mwene Neria, obu yaahandiika ebigambo ebi omu kitabo, naabigambirwa Yeremia omu mwaka gwa kana ogw'omu busingye bwa Yehoyakimu mwene Yosia omugabe wa Yuda, naagira ati: <verse eid="JER 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 45:2" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikukugira, iwe Baruki, ati: <verse eid="JER 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 45:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:26">Yer 36:26</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 6:6">Zab 6:6</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 1:3">Tonz 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 5:5">5:5</ref>. </char></note> Okagira oti: Ai bambe! Eshi ndeebire, ahabw'okuba MUKAMA ayongyeire enaku aha busaasi bwangye; okutsinda kwankabya, tiinyine buhuumure. <verse eid="JER 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 45:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:5">Isa 5:5</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu omugire oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, eki naayombekire, ninkisheenya; kandi eki naabyaire, ninkikuura; kandi niinyija kukikora omu nsi yoona. <verse eid="JER 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 45:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:9">Yer 21:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:26">25:26</ref>, <ref loc="JER 25:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="JER 39:18">39:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 131:1">Zab 131:1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 131:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:16">Rom 12:16</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu nooyesherurira ebikuru? Otabisherura. Ahabw'okuba reeba, naaza kureeta akabi aha bantu boona; kwonka iwe ndyakutimbuura omu rugamba n'engabirano, nigo magara gaawe, omu myanya yoona ei orizamu; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 45:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="JER 46" />
  <para style="s1">Yeremia okuhanuura aha kabi akariba aha mahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 46:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 1:5">Yer 1:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eki n'ekigambo ekyaizire ahari nabi Yeremia, nikigamba aha mahanga.<verse eid="JER 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 46:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 25:1">Yer 25:1</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:29">2 Bag 23:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebya Misri. Eby'eihe rya Faraho-Neeko omugabe wa Misri, eryabaire riri Kakemishi aha mugyera Furaati, eri Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni yaasingwire omu mwaka gwa kana ogw'omu busingye bwa Yehoyakimu mwene Yosia omugabe wa Yuda.<verse eid="JER 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 46:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:11">Yer 51:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimuteekateekye engabo nkye n'empango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:3">Muze aha rugamba.<verse eid="JER 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 46:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NAM 3:2">Nah 3:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mutandiikye embaraasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:4">Muzitembe, imwe abazigyenderaho!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:4">Muze omu myanya yaanyu mujwaire enkofiira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:4">Mweze amacumu gaanyu, mujware ebijwaro by'ebyoma.<verse eid="JER 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 46:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:25">Yer 6:25</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 1:19">2 Sam 1:19</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 1:25">25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu naaba naakireebera ki?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">Bahahaize emitima, baagaruka enyima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">N'amamanzi gaabo gasingwirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">Gairuka nigahunga, gatarikureeba nyima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">Ebirikutiinisa biri embaju zoona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 46:6" />Empaya-maguru tizirikubaasa kuhunga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:6">N'amamanzi tigarikubaasa kukira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:6">Bateire entsibo, baagwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:6">Aha mugyera Furaati aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho.<verse eid="JER 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 46:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 47:2">Yer 47:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:7">Isa 8:7</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 8:8">8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ogu n'oha, orikwijura nk'omugyera Nailo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:7">Nk'emigyera ei amaizi gaayo garikuboroogota?<verse eid="JER 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 46:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 32:2">Ezk 32:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Misri neijura nka Nailo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:8">Nk'emigyera ei amaizi gaayo garikuboroogota,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:8">Neegira eti: Ndyaijura, nshwekye ensi yoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:8">Ncwekyereze endembo n'abazitwiremu.<verse eid="JER 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 46:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 5:22">Bar 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 27:10">Ezk 27:10</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 3:2">Nah 3:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimuhurure, imwe mbaraasi 'mwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:9">Naimwe bigaari 'mwe, nimurigite!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:9">K'amamanzi gashohore,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:9">Abanyesiopia n'Abapuuti enkwata-ngabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:9">N'Abaluudi baarugambwa enkwata-mata.<verse eid="JER 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 46:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 50:15">Yer 50:15</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 1:15">Yoel 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:24">Isa 1:24</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 34:5">34:5</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 34:6">6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba eryo izooba n'eizooba rya MUKAMA Ruhanga ow'amahe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">Eizooba ry'okuhooreraho abazigu be enzigu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">Rurara eryarya, ehaagye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">Enywe eshagama yaabo, eigute;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA, Ruhanga ow'amahe, naatambira ebitambo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">Aha mugyera Furaati aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho.<verse eid="JER 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 46:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 8:22">Yer 8:22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 30:21">Ezk 30:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Inamuka, oze Gileadi, oiheyo omubazi gw'okwomoora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:11">Iwe Misri 'we, omwishiki oshugaine!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:11">Emibazi mingi ei otuura nookoresa n'eya busha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:11">Tori w'okukira.<verse eid="JER 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 46:12" />Amahanga gahuriire okuhemuka kwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:12">N'ensi eijwire okuborooga kwawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:12">Ahabw'okuba emanzi ebandaine n'endiijo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:12">Zombi zaagwera hamwe.<verse eid="JER 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 46:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 43:10">Yer 43:10</ref>, <ref loc="JER 43:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:30">44:30</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 29:10">Ezk 29:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 19:4">Isa 19:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eki n'ekigambo eki MUKAMA yaagambiire nabi Yeremia, nikigamba aha kuhurura kwa Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni kuteera ensi ya Misri.<verse eid="JER 46:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 46:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 44:1">Yer 44:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Murangye omuri Misri, mumanyise omuri Migidooli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:14">Murangye omuri Noofa na Tahapenesi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:14">Nimugira muti: Yemerera, kandi oyeteekateekye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:14">Ahabw'okuba rurara neija kumaraho embaju zaawe zoona.<verse eid="JER 46:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 46:15" />Ahabw'enki <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">46:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Apisi n'enimi ya Misri eramibwa, eri nka ruhanga waayo. </char></note>Apisi ehungire?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:15">Ahabw'enki enimi yaawe tegumireho eyemereire?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:15">Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA niwe agiteire ahansi.<verse eid="JER 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 46:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 26:37">Lev 26:37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ateerize baingi entsibo, baagwa batungamiraine;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:16">Bwanyima baagira bati: Ka twimukye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:16">Tugarukye omuri beene waitu omu nsi ei twazaarirwemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:16">Tuhungye rurara y'orikuhata.<verse eid="JER 46:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 46:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 30:7">Isa 30:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mukubye Faraho omugabe wa Misri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:17">Mumwete Ruyomba oteeta ha bunaku obutairweho.<verse eid="JER 46:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 46:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 48:15">Yer 48:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:57">51:57</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 4:6">Bar 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 18:42">1 Bag 18:42</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 18:44">44</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mukama, ou eiziina rye riri MUKAMA ow'amahe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:18">Naagira ati: Niinyerahira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:18">Ku hariija orikushusha nk'oku Tabora eri omu nshozi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:18">Kandi nk'oku Karumeeli eri aha rubaju rw'enyanja.<verse eid="JER 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 46:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 12:3">Ezk 12:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe abatwire omuri Misri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:19">Mukome ebintu byanyu, mweteekateekyere okutwarwa omu bukwatwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:19">Ahabw'okuba Noofu eryahinduka amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:19">Eyokibwe, habure owaagituuramu.<verse eid="JER 46:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 46:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 1:13">Yer 1:13</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 10:11">Hos 10:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Misri n'enyana enyamibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:20">Kwonka enkuriikizi erugire omu bukiizi-bwa-bumosho yaagigwaho.<verse eid="JER 46:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 46:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 50:27">Yer 50:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nangwa n'abaserukare abarikukorera ebihembo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">Ni nk'enyana ezigomokire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">Eego, bahindukire, boona baahunga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">Tibaayemerera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">Ahakuba eizooba ryabo ry'okugwererwaho akagwe riizire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">Nibwo bunaku bw'okufubirwa kwabo.<verse eid="JER 46:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 46:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:34">Isa 10:34</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 14:8">14:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:4">29:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eiraka ryayo ni nk'ery'enjoka erikusherebuza neehunga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:22">Ahabw'okuba abazigu baayo nibaija n'amaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:22">Kugirwanisa n'empango</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:22">Nk'ez'abarikwatsa enku.<verse eid="JER 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 46:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 6:5">Bar 6:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryatema ekibira kyayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:23">N'obu kiraabe kitarikwogwamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:23">Ahabw'okuba ni baingi okukira enzigye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:23">Tibarikubarwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:23">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 46:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 46:24" />Misri eryakwatwa enshoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:24">Eheebweyo omu mikono y'abantu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:24">Abarikuruga aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho.<verse eid="JER 46:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 46:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 43:12">Yer 43:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 30:14-16">Ezk 30:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 3:8">Nah 3:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, agizire ati: Niinyija kufubira Amoni owa Tebesi, Faraho, Misri, baaruhanga baayo, abagabe baayo n'abarikwesiga Faraho boona. <verse eid="JER 46:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 46:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 44:30">Yer 44:30</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 29:13">Ezk 29:13</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 30:4">30:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:11">32:11</ref>. </char></note> Ndyabahayo omu mikono y'abarikubahiiga, omu mikono ya Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni n'omu y'abakuru b'engabo ze. Bwanyima Misri eryatuurwamu nk'omu biro bya ira; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 46:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 46:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 30:10">Yer 30:10</ref>, <ref loc="JER 30:11">11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka otatiina, iwe Yakobo mwiru wangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">Kandi otahahaaza omutima, iwe Israeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">Ahabw'okuba ndyakujuna, nkwihe hare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">N'oruzaaro rwawe ndwihe omu nsi ei baatwairwemu bari enkwatwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">Yakobo aryagaruka atuuze, agaramisiriize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">Kandi tiharigira waamutiinisa.<verse eid="JER 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 46:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 10:24">Yer 10:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati: Otatiina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">Iwe Yakobo mwiru wangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">Ahabw'okuba ndi hamwe naiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">Ndyamariraho kimwe amahanga goona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">Agu naakubingiiremu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">Kwonka iwe tindikumariraho kimwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">Ndyakuhana ninkubarira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">Kandi buzimazima tindireka kukufubira.<verse eid="JER 46:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="JER 47" />
  <para style="s1">Akabi akarihika aha Bafilistia n'aba Tuuro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 47:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 25:20">Yer 25:20</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:15">Ezk 25:15</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 25:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:6">Amo 1:6</ref>, <ref loc="AMO 1:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:4">Zef 2:4</ref>, <ref loc="ZEP 2:5">5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eki n'ekigambo kya MUKAMA ekyaizire ahari nabi Yeremia nikigamba aha Bafilistia, Faraho atakasingwire Gaaza.<verse eid="JER 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 47:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:7">Isa 8:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">Reeba, reeba amaizi maingi nigaijura omu bukiizi-bwa-bumosho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">Kandi garyarugwamu omwegyemure gw'amaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">Gushandaare omu nsi egi, gushwekye ebirimu byona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">N'orurembo n'abarutwiremu boona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">Abashaija baryateera enduuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">N'abatwire omu nsi boona baboroogye.<verse eid="JER 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 47:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 46:5">Yer 46:5</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 3:2">Nah 3:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi emitsindo y'ebyara by'embaraasi ze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:3">N'endigito y'enziga z'ebigaari bye ebirikwiruka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:3">Biryareetera abazaire kuhunga batareebire nyima kureeba abaana baabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:3">Ahabw'emikono yaabo okutenteburwa,<verse eid="JER 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 47:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 25:22">Yer 25:22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 23:1">Isa 23:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 23:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4">Yoel 3:4</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:8">Amo 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 9:7">9:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eizooba eri Abafilistia boona baricwekyererezibwaho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:4">Kumara omuri Tuuro na Sidoni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:4">Omuhwezi weena oriba atsigairemu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:4">Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA aryacwekyereza Abafilistia</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:4">Abaatsigaire aha baarugire omu kirwa Kafutoori.<verse eid="JER 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 47:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 48:37">Yer 48:37</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 1:18">Bar 1:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Gaaza egizire oruhara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:5">Ashikelooni ehwerekyereire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:5">Yeimwe Abaanaki abatsigaireho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:5">Muryahitsya hi okwesharashara.<verse eid="JER 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 47:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:41">Bir 32:41</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai bambe, iwe rurara ya MUKAMA 'we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:6">Oryatuuza ryari?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:6">Yegarure omu kyobati kyawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:6">Tuuza, oteetengyetsa.<verse eid="JER 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 47:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 14:17">Ezk 14:17</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:9">Mik 6:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Neebaasa eta kutuuza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:7">MUKAMA agiragiire kukora?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:7">Agitaireho kurwanisa Ashikelooni n'orubaju rw'enyanja.<verse eid="JER 47:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="JER 48" />
  <para style="s1">Akabi akarihika aha Bamoabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 48:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 25:21">Yer 25:21</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 32:37">Kub 32:37</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 13:19">Yos 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:2">2 Bag 24:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 15:1-9">Isa 15:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 16:1-14">16:1-14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebya Moabu. Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:1">Neebo eryakareeba, ahabw'okuhindurwa amatongo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:1">Kiryasaimu ehemwirwe, yaakwatwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:1">Ekigo kyayo kihemwirwe,<verse eid="JER 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 48:2" />Okurangaanwa kwa Moabu tikwakiriho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:2">Omuri Heshibooni bamugiriire enaama mbi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:2">Nibagira bati: Nimwije, tumumareho, arekye kuba eihanga!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:2">Naiwe oryahunamibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:2">Kandi rurara eryakuhiiga.<verse eid="JER 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 48:3" />Nimuhurire! Hariho okuborooga nikwema Horonaimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:3">Nikugira kuti: Okweshobera n'okucwekyerera kuhango!<verse eid="JER 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 48:4" />Moabu ecwekyereziibwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:4">Okuborooga nikuhurirwa kuhika Zoari,<verse eid="JER 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 48:5" />Ahakuba aharikwinamuka Luhiisi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:5">Nibainamuka nibarira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:5">Kandi aharikushuumirwa Horonaimu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:5">Bahuriire okuborooga kw'abarikucwekyerezibwa.<verse eid="JER 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 48:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 17:6">Yer 17:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muhungye, mukize amagara gaanyu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:6">Mube nk'enturegye y'omu ihamba!<verse eid="JER 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 48:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 49:3">Yer 49:3</ref>, <ref loc="JER 49:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 21:29">Kub 21:29</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 46:2">Isa 46:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okwesiga ebigo byawe ebigumire n'eitungo ryawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:7">Naiwe oryakwatwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:7">Na Kemoshi eryatwarwa omu bukwatwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:7">Hamwe n'abanyamurwa n'abanyiginya baayo.<verse eid="JER 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 48:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 13:9">Yos 13:9</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 13:17-21">17-21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuhwerekyerezi aryagwa aha ndembo zoona kitaraariire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:8">Tihariho rurembo na rumwe orurikira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:8">Oruhanga ruryahwerekyerera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:8">N'oruhita ruryacwekyerezibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:8">Nk'oku MUKAMA agizire.<verse eid="JER 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 48:9" />Ha Moabu amapapa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:9">Agurukye, ahungye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:9">Endembo ze zihindukye amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:9">Zibure owaazituuramu.<verse eid="JER 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 48:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 15:3">1 Sam 15:3</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 15:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 20:42">1 Bag 20:42</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:58">1 Kor 15:58</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orikukora omurimo gwa MUKAMA n'obweremwanaakakyeenwe! N'orikuzibira rurara ye kusheesha eshagama nawe naakakyeenwe!<verse eid="JER 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 48:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEP 1:12">Zef 1:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Moabu akagogyera okuruga omu buto bwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:11">Yaateeka nka viinyo y'omurera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:11">Tarashukanwirwe mu zindi nyungu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:11">N'obu kwakuba okuza omu bukwatwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:11">Nikyo agumiire n'obunuzi bwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:11">N'omugaju gwe tigukahindukire.<verse eid="JER 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 48:12" />MUKAMA naagira ati: N'ahabw'ekyo reeba obunaku buryahika, obu ndimwoherereza ab'okumushuka, ebiri omu nyungu ze bakabimaramu, n'enywero ze bakazaatagura. <verse eid="JER 48:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 48:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:29">1 Bag 12:29</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 16:14">Isa 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 10:6">Hos 10:6</ref>. </char></note> Haza obwo Moabu aryakwatwa enshoni ahabwa Kemoshi, nk'oku enju ya Israeli yaakwatsirwe enshoni ahabwa Beseeli, eyaabaire eri obwesigye bwabo.<verse eid="JER 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 48:14" />Nimubaasa muta kugira muti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:14">turi amamanzi kandi abashaija, rugambwa aha rugamba?<verse eid="JER 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 48:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 46:18">Yer 46:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuhwerekyerezi wa Moabu n'endembo ze aizire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:15">Abatsigazi be entoore bashuumire kwitwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:15">Nikwo Mukama, ou eiziina rye riri MUKAMA ow'amahe, arikugira.<verse eid="JER 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 48:16" />Akabi akaza kuhika ahari Moabu kari haihi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:16">Okubonabona kwe nikwiruka.<verse eid="JER 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 48:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:4">Isa 9:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe abamwehinguriririize mwena, mumucurire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:17">Naimwe mwena abarikumanya eiziina rye mugire muti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:17">Eshi enkoni y'amaani ey'obugabe ehendekire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:17">Enkoni ey'ekitiinisa.<verse eid="JER 48:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 48:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 21:30">Kub 21:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe mutuuzi wa Diboni 'we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:18">Shuuma orugye omu kitiinisa kyawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:18">Oshutame aha nsi ekarangataine!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:18">Ahabw'okuba omuhwerekyerezi wa Moabu aizire kukurwanisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:18">Aherize kucwekyereza ebigo byawe.<verse eid="JER 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 48:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 2:36">Bir 2:36</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 4:13">1 Sam 4:13</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 4:16">16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yemerera aha rubaju rw'omuhanda, oreebe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:19">Iwe mutuuzi wa Aroeri!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:19">Obuuze omushaija ocwire n'omukazi ohungire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:19">Oti: Biri bita?<verse eid="JER 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 48:20" />Moabu ehemwirwe ahabw'okusheenywa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:20">Mucure, muboroogye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:20">Mugambire aha mugyera Arunooni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:20">Muti: Moabu egizirwe amatongo.<verse eid="JER 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 48:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 21:23">Kub 21:23</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 13:18">Yos 13:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orubanja ruhikire aha nsi z'empita, Horoni, Yahaza, Mefaasi, <verse eid="JER 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 48:22" />Diboni, Neebo, Besidibulaimu, <verse eid="JER 48:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 48:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 13:17">Yos 13:17</ref>. </char></note> Kiryasaimu, Besigamuli, Besi-meoni, <verse eid="JER 48:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 48:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:13">Yer 49:13</ref>, <ref loc="JER 49:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:1">Isa 63:1</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 2:2">Amo 2:2</ref>. </char></note> Keriosi, Bozira, n'endembo zoona ez'omu nsi ya Moabu eza hare n'eza haihi. <verse eid="JER 48:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 48:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 75:10">Zab 75:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 30:21">Ezk 30:21</ref>. </char></note> Eihembe rya Moabu ricwirweho, n'omukono gwe guhendekire; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 48:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 48:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:27">Yer 25:27</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:39">51:39</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 19:14">Isa 19:14</ref>. </char></note> Mumusinze, ayekuringye omu bitanaki bye, nawe ashekyererwe, ahabw'okuba ayekurize ahari MUKAMA. <verse eid="JER 48:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 48:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 64:8">Zab 64:8</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 2:15">Tonz 2:15</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:8">Ezk 25:8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:8">Zef 2:8</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:39">Mat 27:39</ref>. </char></note> Israeli okaba omushekyerera, omuzongoreza omutwe, obu waabaire omugambaho, nk'okwatiirwe omu bashuma.<verse eid="JER 48:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 48:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 55:6">Zab 55:6</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 55:7">7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe abatwire Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:28">Murugye omu ndembo, mutuure omu nyanga z'amabaare!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:28">Mube nk'enkombe eyarika aha rubaju rw'omunwa gw'orusa.<verse eid="JER 48:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 48:29" />Tuhuriire amaryo ga Moabu-</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:29">Aine amaryo maingi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:29">Emyemanyo n'emyehimbiso ye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:29">Kandi n'emyekuniko y'omu mutima gwe.<verse eid="JER 48:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 48:30" />MUKAMA naagira ati: Nimmanya orubwa rwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:30">Ebi arikwehimbisizaho ti by'amazima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:30">Kandi n'ebi arikukora n'eby'ebishuba.<verse eid="JER 48:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 48:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 3:25">2 Bag 3:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo ndiririra Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:31">Nkaboroogyera Moabu yoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:31">Nkacurira abashaija ba Kiriheresi.<verse eid="JER 48:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 48:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 80:11">Zab 80:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe muzaabibu gwa Sibuma 'we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:32">Ndyakucurira okukira oku naacuriire Yazeri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:32">Amataagi gaawe gakambuka enyanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:32">Gaahika Yazeri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:32">Omuhwerekyerezi ayetwire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:32">omu myaka yaawe y'ekyanda n'omu mizaabibu yaawe.<verse eid="JER 48:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 48:33" />Okwesiima n'okushemererwa biihirwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:33">Omu nsi ya Moabu erikweza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:33">Nkabuza viinyo omu manyuukiro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:33">Tihariho orikunyuuka naateera akaari;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:33">Kandi n'obu bariteera akaari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:33">Tikariba k'okushemererwa.<verse eid="JER 48:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 48:34" />Heshibooni na Eleale nibataka; eiraka ry'okutaka kwabo nirihuririrwa Yahazi, okuruga Zoari okuhika Horonaimu na Egulaati-shelishiya. Ahabw'okuba amaizi ga Nimuriimu gatsigirweho. <verse eid="JER 48:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 48:35" />Kandi ndyamariraho kimwe omuntu weena otambira ebitambo omu myanya mikuru ey'omuri Moabu, akooterera ruhanga we obubaane; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 48:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 48:36" />Nikyo omutima gwangye gurikuboroogyerera Moabu nk'eiraka ry'esheegu; kandi gukaboroogyera gutyo abashaija ba kiriheresi; kandi nikyo eitungo eri baabaire baine rihwereireho.<verse eid="JER 48:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 48:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 4:8">Yer 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 2:10">Tonz 2:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Buri mutwe gwona n'enkomborora, na buri bireju bimweirwe; emikono yoona esharashazirwe, kandi beezirikire ebiguniya. <verse eid="JER 48:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 48:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:28">Yer 22:28</ref>. </char></note> Aha mitwe y'amaju ga Moabu goona n'omu nteeraniro z'emihanda zoona tihariyo kindi kureka okutonzya; ahabw'okuba nyatagwire Moabu nk'enyungu etarikweteebwaho; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 48:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 48:39" />Yeimwe, eshi ehendekire! Eshi nibaborooga! Eshi Moabu eteire abazigu omugongo, yaahemuka! Okwo nikwo ebaire eky'okushekyererwa n'ekirikutiinisa ahari boona abagyehinguriririize.<verse eid="JER 48:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 48:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:40: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 49:22">Yer 49:22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:49">Bir 28:49</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:8">Isa 8:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 17:3">Ezk 17:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:40">Reeba, haryagira owaaguruka nk'eishamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:40">amapapa ge agashashaanure kurwanisa Moabu;<verse eid="JER 48:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 48:41" />Endembo zikubuurwe, n'ebigo bikwatwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:41">Kandi eryo izooba emitima y'amamanzi ga Moabu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:41">Eryaba nk'ogw'omukazi orikurumwa kuzaara.<verse eid="JER 48:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 48:42" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:42: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 7:8">Isa 7:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Moabu eryacwekyerezibwa, terigaruka kuba ihanga obundi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:42">Ahabw'okuba ekeekuza ahari MUKAMA.<verse eid="JER 48:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 48:43" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:43: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 24:17">Isa 24:17</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 24:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 3:47">Tonz 3:47</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe mutuuzi wa Moabu 'we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:43">Ekirikutiinisa, ekiina, n'omutego</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:43">Bikuri omu maisho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:43">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 48:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 48:44" />Orihunga ekirikutiinisa aryagwa omu kiina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:44">N'oriruga omu kiina aryagwa omu mutego;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:44">Ahabw'okuba ebyo byona ndyabireeta ahari Moabu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:44">Omu mwaka gw'okufubirwa kwabo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:44">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 48:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 48:45" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:45: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 24:17">Kub 24:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu kicuucu kya Heshibooni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:45">Abacwire beemereire, bataine maani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:45">Ahabw'okuba omuriro gurugire Heshibooni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:45">N'ekirimi kyagwo kyaruga omu nju ya Sihooni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:45">Gwacwekyereza obuso bwa Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:45">Ekirunga ky'aha mutwe gw'abarikujagarara.<verse eid="JER 48:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 48:46" />Eshi waakareeba, Moabu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:46">Abantu ba Kemoshi beeshobeire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:46">Ahabw'okuba batabani baawe bakwatsirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:46">Na bahara baawe banyagirwe.<verse eid="JER 48:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JER 48:47" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:47: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 46:27">Yer 46:27</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:39">49:39</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka omu biro by'aha muheru</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:47">Ndyagarura Abamoabu abaatwairwe omu bukwatwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:47">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:47">Aha niho orubanja rwa Moabu rwagarukira.<verse eid="JER 48:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="JER 49" />
  <para style="s1">Akabi akarihika aha Baamoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 49:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 25:21">Yer 25:21</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:5">1 Bag 11:5</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 11:33">33</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 21:28">Ezk 21:28</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:13">Amo 1:13</ref>, <ref loc="AMO 1:14">14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eby'Abaamoni. Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:1">Beitu Israeli tagira batabani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:1">Tagira w'okumuhungurira?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:1">Mbwenu ahabw'enki Milikomu abingire oruganda rwa Gaadi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:1">Abantu be bakakubuura endembo zaarwo, bakazituuramu?<verse eid="JER 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 49:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 21:20">Ezk 21:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati: Reeba, obunaku nibwija,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">Obu ndireetera enduuru y'okuhuruza kuhurirwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">Abarirwanisa Rabba ey'Abaamoni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">Kandi eryahinduka emituumo y'ebisheenyirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">Ebirorero byayo byokibwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">Bwanyima Israeli eryakubuura abaagikubwire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 49:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 48:7">Yer 48:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 8:28">Yos 8:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Borooga, iwe Heshibooni, ahakuba Ai ehindwirwe amatongo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:3">Imwe bahara ba Rabba, nimucure,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:3">Mwezirikye ebiguniya, mutonzye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:3">Nimukora oku n'oku omu ngo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:3">Ahabw'okuba Milikomu aryatwarwa omu bukwatwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:3">Hamwe n'abanyamurwa n'abanyiginya be.<verse eid="JER 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 49:4" />Ahabw'enki nooyehimbisa ahabw'empanga zaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:4">Iwe mwishiki orikugaruka enyima 'we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:4">Owaabaire naayesiga eitungo rye, naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:4">N'oha oriija kundwanisa?<verse eid="JER 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 49:5" />MUKAMA Ruhanga ow'amahe naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:5">Reeba, ndyakureetaho ekirikutiinisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:5">Kireetwe abakwehinguririize boona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:5">Kandi muryabingwa omu nsi, buri muntu atoore ogwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:5">Habure ow'okubagarura.<verse eid="JER 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 49:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 48:47">Yer 48:47</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:39">49:39</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka bwanyima ndyagarura Abaamoni abaatwairwe omu bukwatwa, nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akabi akarihika aha Banyedomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 49:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 34:5">Isa 34:5</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:11">Amo 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:1-21">Oba 1:1-21</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:2">Mal 1:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebya Edomu. Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:7">Beitu omuri Temani tihaakibamu bwengye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:7">Okuhabura kuhweire omu banyabwengye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:7">Obwengye bwabo buhwereireho kimwe?<verse eid="JER 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 49:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 46:21">Yer 46:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:30">49:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe batuuzi ba Dedani 'mwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:8">Muhungye, mugarukyeyo mutuure omu bicokoromi ahatarikuhikwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:8">Ahabw'okuba obunaku bw'okumufubira ku burihika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:8">Ndyamureetaho akabi ka Esau.<verse eid="JER 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 49:9" />Abashoromi b'emizaabibu ku baakwija owaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:9">Tibakaakutsigira eby'okuhumba?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:9">Abashuma ku baakwija nyekiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:9">Tibakaiba ebirikubahaazya byonka?<verse eid="JER 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 49:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:15">Yer 31:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:3">Mal 1:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka Esau nyowe mmumazireho ebi aine byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:10">Nshurwire obweshereko bwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:10">Takibaasa kweshereka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:10">Abaana be, beene ishe na bataahi be,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:10">Bacwekyereziibwe, kandi nawe takiriho.<verse eid="JER 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 49:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 10:14">Zab 10:14</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 10:18">18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tsiga efuuzi zaawe, nzoorore,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:11">N'abafakaazi baawe baanyesigye.<verse eid="JER 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 49:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 25:28">Yer 25:28</ref>, <ref loc="JER 25:29">29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Abaabaire batashemereire kunywa ekikopo, ku baraabe nibaragiirwa kukinywa, iwe oryagyenda otafubiirwe? Torigyenda otafubiirwe; oshemereire kukinywa. <verse eid="JER 49:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 49:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:5">Yer 22:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 24:9">24:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 48:24">48:24</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA naagira ati: Nyerahiire, ku Bozira eriba ekirikutiinisa, eky'okushekyererwa, amatongo n'eky'okukyeenwa; n'endembo zaayo zoona ziryaguma ziri amatongo ebiro byona.<verse eid="JER 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 49:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:4">Isa 13:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mpuriire amakuru agarugire ahari MUKAMA;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:14">Entumwa etumirwe aha mahanga neegira eti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:14">Mweteerane, muze kumurwanisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:14">Mwimukye, muze aha rugamba!<verse eid="JER 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 49:15" />Ahabw'okuba reeba, niinyija kukugira mukye omu mahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:15">Obe orikugaywa omu bantu.<verse eid="JER 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 49:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 48:28">Yer 48:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okutiinisa kwawe n'amaryo g'omu mutima gwawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:16">Bikubeihire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:16">Iwe otuura omu bicokoromi by'amabaare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:16">Okeegumira aha mutwe gw'ekibungo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:16">N'obu waakwarika ahaiguru nk'eishamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:16">Ndyakuhanurayo; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 49:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 35:3">Ezk 35:3</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 35:7">7</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 35:9">9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Edomu eryaba eky'okutangaarirwa; origirabaho weena aryatangaara, ayeshaanye ahabw'akagwe koona akagigwereire. <verse eid="JER 49:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 49:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:23">Bir 29:23</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:19">Isa 13:19</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku Sodoma na Gomora n'endembo ezaabaire ziherereine nazo zaakumbagaziibwe, nikwo hatarigira waatuurayo, n'obu yaakuba ow'okushuhuukirayo; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 49:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 49:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:19-21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:7">Yer 4:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 10:6">10:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 12:5">12:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 30:21">30:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:44-46">50:44-46</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 9:19">Yob 9:19</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, nk'oku entare ejumbuka omu kishaka kya Yorudani kuteera eka y'entaama egumire, nikwo ndibareetera okumuhunga kitaraariire, nkamuteeraho ou ndikwenda weena kumutegyeka. Mbwenu n'oha orikushushana naanye? N'oha owaakubaasa kunteeraho obunaku bw'okwiziramu? <verse eid="JER 49:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 49:20" />Ni muriisa ki owaakunza omu kaso? N'ahabw'ekyo muhurire enaama ei MUKAMA acumire kurwanisa Edomu, n'ebi amaririire kukora kurwanisa abatuuzi ba Temani. Buzimazima n'abaana b'entaama baryakururwa batwarwe, n'eka yaabo eshoberwe munonga ahabw'ebiribaho. <verse eid="JER 49:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 49:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 8:16">Yer 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:15">Ezk 26:15</ref>. </char></note> Ensi eryatengyetsibwa obwaku bw'okugwa kwabo, eiraka ry'okuborooga kwabo riryahuririrwa aha Nyanja erikutukura. <verse eid="JER 49:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 49:22" />Reeba, haryagira owaimuka agurukye naarahuka nk'eishamba, ashashaanure amapapa ge kuza kurwanisa Bozira; kandi ahari eryo izooba emitima y'amamanzi ga Edomu eryaba nk'ogw'omukazi orikurumwa kuzaara.<verse eid="JER 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akabi akarihika ahari Damasiko</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 49:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:65">1 Bag 8:65</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:34">2 Bag 18:34</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 17:1">Isa 17:1</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:3">Amo 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2">Zek 9:2</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 9:4">4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebya Damasiko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:23">Hamasi na Arupaadi bashobeirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:23">Ahabw'okuhurira enkuru mbi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:23">Emitima ebahweire omunda ahabw'okutiina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:23">nibarabanamu nk'enyanja etarikubaasa kucureera.<verse eid="JER 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 49:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 46:5">Yer 46:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Damasiko ehweire amaani, yaahinduka kuhunga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:24">Yaakwatwa obwoba bwingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:24">Obusaasi n'enaku byamugira</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:24">Nk'eby'omukazi orikwenda kuzaara.<verse eid="JER 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 49:25" />Orurembo rugambwa kandi orurikushemeza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:25">Ka rutsigirweho!<verse eid="JER 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 49:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 50:30">Yer 50:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo abatsigazi baarwo barigwera omu nteeraniro z'enguuto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:26">Kandi ahari eryo izooba abaserukare baarwo boona baryacwekyerezibwa;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JER 49:26">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 49:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 17:27">Yer 17:27</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 20:1">1 Bag 20:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ndyatweka omuriro omu rugo rwa Damasiko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:27">Gwokyeze kimwe zaanyaruju za Benihadadi.<verse eid="JER 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akabi akarihika ahari Kedari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 49:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 6:3">Bar 6:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:14">Isa 11:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 21:16">21:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:4">Ezk 25:4</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 25:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebya Kedari n'obugabe bwa Hazori, obu Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni yaasingwire.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 49:28">Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:28">Nimwimukye, mwinamukye muteere Kedari!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:28">Mucwekyereze abantu b'oburugwa-izooba!<verse eid="JER 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 49:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:25">Yer 6:25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 120:5">Zab 120:5</ref>; <ref loc="SNG 1:5">Kyesh 1:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amahema gaabo n'amasyo gaabo garyanyagwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:29">Hamwe n'emikingo yaabo n'ebintu byabo byona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:29">Engamira zaabo ziryabaakwa zitwarwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:29">Abantu baryabateerera enduuru nibagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:29">Reeba, eby'okutiinisa byabareetwa embaju zoona!<verse eid="JER 49:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 49:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:30, 31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 38:8">Ezk 38:8</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 38:11">11</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 38:12">12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe batuuzi ba Hazori 'mwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:30">Nimuhungye, muze hare, mutuure omu bicokoromi ahatarikuhikwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:30">Ahabw'okuba Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:30">Acumire enaama y'okubarwanisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:30">Kandi amaririire kubateera;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JER 49:30">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 49:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 49:31" />Mwimukye, muhurure, muteere eihanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:31">Erigaramisiriize kandi eritwire buhooro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:31">Eritaine marembo n'obu zaakuba empimbi z'okukingisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:31">Kandi eryetuuriire ryonka;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JER 49:31">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 49:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 49:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 9:26">Yer 9:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Engamira zaabo ziryatwarwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:32">N'amasyo gaabo g'ente ganyagwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:32">Abarikutega ebyeyera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:32">Ndyabataataanisiza embaju zoona ei emiyaga ereetwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:32">Mbareeteho akabi akaribareetwa embaju zoona;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JER 49:32">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 49:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 49:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 9:11">Yer 9:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Na Hazoori eryaba eikoobaaniro rya zaamuha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:33">Ebe amatongo ebiro byona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:33">Terituurwamu muntu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:33">Kandi tiharigira waagishuhuukiramu.<verse eid="JER 49:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akabi akarihika ahari Elamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 49:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 14:1">Kut 14:1</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:17">2 Bag 24:17</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 24:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 8:2">Dan 8:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:24">Ezk 32:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eki n'ekigambo kya MUKAMA ekyaizire ahari nabi Yeremia nikigamba ahari Elamu omu kutandika kw'obutegyeki bwa Zedekia omugabe wa Yuda.<verse eid="JER 49:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 49:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 22:10">Isa 22:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, ndyahenda obuta bwa Elamu, obu amaani gaabo gahamiraho. <verse eid="JER 49:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 49:36" />Ndyareeta emiyaga ena, ereetwe aha mbaju ina z'eiguru, eteere Elamu, mbataataanisize ei egyo miyaga yoona yaareetwa; kandi tiharibaho ihanga eri abaribingwa omuri Elamu batarizamu. <verse eid="JER 49:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 49:37" />Ndyatiinisiza Elamu omu maisho g'abazigu be n'omu maisho g'abarikumuhiiga. Ndyabareetaho akabi, nikyo kiniga kyangye ekingi; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. Kandi ndyabakuratsa rurara, okuhitsya obu ndibamaraho, <verse eid="JER 49:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 49:38" />bwanyima nte ekitebe kyangye ky'obukama omuri Elamu, ncwekyereze omugabe waabo n'abanyiginya baabo; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="JER 49:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 49:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 48:47">Yer 48:47</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka omu biro bya bwanyima ndyagarura aba Elamu abaatwairwe bari enkwatwa; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 49:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="JER 50" />
  <para style="s1">Akabi akarihika ahari Babulooni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 50:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:59">Yer 51:59</ref>, <ref loc="JER 51:60">60</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:1-14:27">Isa 13:1—14:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eki n'ekigambo eki MUKAMA yaagambire ahari Babulooni n'ahansi y'Abakaludaaya, naaraba omuri nabi Yeremia.<verse eid="JER 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 50:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 21:9">Isa 21:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 46:1">46:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mumanyise amahanga, murangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Mwimutsye orurango, murangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Murekye kukishereka, mugire muti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Babulooni ekwatsirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Beeli ehemwirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Na Merodaaki ehahaize omutima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Ebishushani bye bihemwirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Ebirikuramibwa bihahaize omutima;<verse eid="JER 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 50:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 1:14">Yer 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:29">51:29</ref>, <ref loc="JER 51:62">62</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 135:8">Zab 135:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho hareetsirweho eihanga kumuteera, niriija kuhindura ensi ye amatongo, kandi tihaine origituuramu; abantu n'amatungo byona biryahunga.<verse eid="JER 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 50:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 3:18">Yer 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:9">31:9</ref>, <ref loc="JER 31:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 3:5">Hos 3:5</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 8:21">Ezr 8:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati: Omu biro ebyo n'omu bunaku obwo Abaisraeli n'Abayuda baryaija kumwe, baije nibarira, kandi baryasherura MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo. <verse eid="JER 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 50:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:21">Yer 31:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:40">32:40</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 2:3">Isa 2:3</ref>. </char></note> Baryahabuza omuhanda ogurikuza Saayuuni, bataireyo amaisho, nibagira bati: Nimwije, twehitsye MUKAMA, turagaane nawe endagaano etarihwaho, kandi etaryeba.<verse eid="JER 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 50:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:6">Isa 53:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:10">65:10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 10:2">Zek 10:2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 15:4">Luk 15:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu bangye bakaba nk'entaama ezibuzire, abariisa baabo bakabahabya, baabahabisiza omu bibungo; baaruga omu bibungo, baaza omu kabungo, baayebwa eka yaabo. <verse eid="JER 50:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 50:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:8">Yer 14:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:23">31:23</ref>; <ref loc="JER 40:2">40:2</ref>, <ref loc="JER 40:3">3</ref>. </char></note> Abaabaire babashangayo baabashonshomera; abazigu baabo baagira bati: Titwine rubanja, ahabw'okuba bakacumura ahari MUKAMA, obutaaho bwabo obw'amazima, kandi amatsiko ga baishenkurubo.<verse eid="JER 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 50:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:6">Yer 51:6</ref>, <ref loc="JER 51:45">45</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:20">Isa 48:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimuhungye, murugye omuri Babulooni, murugye omu nsi y'Abakaludaaya, mube nk'empaya z'embuzi ezeebembeire obusyo; <verse eid="JER 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 50:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:14">Yer 25:14</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba reeba, niinyija kwimutsya omutwe gw'amahanga mahango, ngaihe omu nsi y'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, gateere Babulooni, bagitengyere orugamba, bakwatireyo abantu baayo, babatware. Emyambi yaabo ni nk'omurwani rugambwa otagaruka ngaro nsha. <verse eid="JER 50:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 50:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:12">Yer 25:12</ref>. </char></note> Bukaludaaya eryanyagwa; abariginyaga boona baryahaaga; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 50:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LAM 1:21">Tonz 1:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe banyagi b'obuhunguzi bwangye 'mwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:11">N'obu mwakushemererwa, n'obu mwakwesingiza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:11">N'obu mwakurinda nk'enyana erikwenda kwema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:11">Mukabubura nk'enimi,<verse eid="JER 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 50:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:43">Yer 51:43</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyokoimwe aryakwatirwa kimwe enshoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:12">Owaabazaire ahemukye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:12">Reeba, aryaba eihanga eririkuhereeruka enyima y'agandi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:12">Eihamba ryomire kandi ery'omusheenyi.<verse eid="JER 50:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 50:13" />Ahabw'ekiniga kya MUKAMA tarituurwamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:13">Kureka aryahindukira kimwe eihamba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:13">Buri muntu weena oriraba ahari Babulooni aryata engaro aha munwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:13">Ayeshaanye ahabw'ebibonabono byayo byona.<verse eid="JER 50:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 50:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 50:7">Yer 50:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:3">51:3</ref>, <ref loc="JER 51:11">11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mutengye orugamba, mwehinguririze Babulooni kugirwanisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:14">Imwe mwena abananuuzi b'amata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:14">mugirashe, mutatsigaza mwambi na gumwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:14">Ahabw'okuba ekacumura ahari MUKAMA.<verse eid="JER 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 50:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:6">Yer 5:6</ref>, <ref loc="JER 5:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 46:10">46:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:29">50:29</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:56">51:56</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mugiteerereho akaari embaju zoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:15">ahakuba yaabagomookyera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:15">Ebigo byayo bigwire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:15">Engo zaayo zikumbagaziibwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:15">Ahabw'okuba oku n'okuhoora enzigu kwa MUKAMA.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:15">Mumuhoore, mumugire nk'oku yaagizire.<verse eid="JER 50:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 50:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:9">Yer 51:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:14">Isa 13:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mumare omuri Babulooni omubibi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:16">N'orikukwata omusyo gw'engyesho omu igyesha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:16">Ahabwa rurara y'orikuhata</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:16">buri muntu aryagaruka omuri beene waabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:16">Kandi buri muntu aryahungira omu nsi ye.<verse eid="JER 50:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 50:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:15">Yer 2:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:34">51:34</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:6">2 Bag 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:13">18:13</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:10">24:10</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 24:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:1-11">25:1-11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Israeli entaama ehiigirwe, ebingirwe entare. Omugabe wa Asiria niwe yaabandize kumushonshomera, mbwenu aha muheru Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni yaamemena amagufa ge. <verse eid="JER 50:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 50:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:12">Isa 10:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 14:24">14:24</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 14:25">25</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugirira ati: Reeba, niinyija kufubira omugabe wa Babulooni n'ensi ye, nk'oku naafubiire omugabe wa Asiria. <verse eid="JER 50:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 50:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:13">Ezk 34:13</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 34:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:14">Mik 7:14</ref>. </char></note> Ndyagarura Israeli omu mariisizo ge, ariisize ahari Karumeeli n'omuri Bashani; kandi omutima gwe guryahaahaagirira aha bibungo bya Efuraimu n'omuri Gileadi. <verse eid="JER 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 50:20" />Omu biro ebyo n'omu bunaku obwo eby'okushiisha biryasherurwa omuri Israeli, bibure; kandi n'ekibi kiryasherurwa omuri Yuda, habure ekibi kyona ekyashangwamu; ahabw'okuba ndyasaasira abu nditsigamu abaatsigaireho; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 50:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 50:21" />Inamuka, oteere ensi ya Merasaimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:21">Oteere n'abatuuzi ba Pekodi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:21">Obaite; ku oriheza kubaita, ocwekyerereze kimwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:21">Okore byona ebi naakuragiire;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JER 50:21">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 50:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:54">Yer 51:54</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orwari rw'orugamba, n'okucwekyereza kwingi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:22">Biri omuri egyo nsi!<verse eid="JER 50:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 50:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:6">Isa 14:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:10">Kush 18:10</ref>, <ref loc="REV 18:21">21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enyondo y'ensi yoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:23">K'etemirwe, ekagutuka!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:23">Babulooni k'ehindukire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:23">Ekirikwitsa amahanga obwoba.<verse eid="JER 50:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 50:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:31">Yer 51:31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 5:30">Dan 5:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe Babulooni, nkakutega omutego, gwakukwata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:24">Kandi tiwaakimanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:24">okareebwa, kandi waakwatwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:24">Nooturwa okurwanisa MUKAMA.<verse eid="JER 50:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 50:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:5">Isa 13:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA aigwire eibiikiro ry'eby'okurwanisa bye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:25">Yaihamu eby'okurwanisa by'ekiniga kye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:25">Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA Ruhanga aine</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:25">Eki arikuza kukora omu nsi y'Abakaludaaya.<verse eid="JER 50:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 50:26" />Nimwije, mugiteere, nimugireetwa embaju zoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:26">Mwigure ebitara byayo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:26">Mugicwekyerereze kimwe, mutagira ekyayo eki mwatsigaho.<verse eid="JER 50:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 50:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:12">Zab 22:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 34:7">Isa 34:7</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 34:8">8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Murekye enimi zaayo zoona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:27">Zishuume omu ibaagiro, muziitireyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:27">Baryakareeba, ahabw'okuba obunaku bwabo buhikire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:27">Obunaku bw'okufubirwa kwabo.<verse eid="JER 50:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 50:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 52:13">Yer 52:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 64:9">Zab 64:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimuhurire eiraka ry'abarikuhunga, nibacwa kuruga omu nsi ya Babulooni, ngu babone kumanyisa omuri Saayuuni enzigu ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu arikuhoorera hekalu ye. <verse eid="JER 50:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 50:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:14">Yer 25:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 47:10">Isa 47:10</ref>. </char></note> Muhuruze abarasi boona, abananuuzi b'amata, bateere Babulooni. Mugyehinguririze ensiisira kugirwanisa; harekye kugira n'omwe owaacwa. Mugizimuurire ebirikwingana n'ebi yaakozire, mugigire nk'oku yaagizire kwona; ahabw'okuba ekagira amaryo, yaagaya MUKAMA, Orikwera wa Israeli. <verse eid="JER 50:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 50:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:26">Yer 49:26</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo abatsigazi barigwera omu nteeraniro z'enguuto zaayo; kandi ahari eryo izooba abaserukare baayo boona baryacwekyerezibwa; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 50:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 50:31" />Mukama RUHANGA ow'amahe naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:31">Reeba, naaba omuzigu waawe, iwe munyamaryo 'we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:31">Ahabw'okuba eizooba ryawe ryahika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:31">Obunaku obu ndikwija kukufubiriraho.<verse eid="JER 50:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 50:32" />Omunyamaryo aryateera entsibo, agwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:32">Abure owaamwimutsya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:32">Ndyatweka omuriro omu ndembo ze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:32">Gumarireho kimwe ebimwehinguriririize byona.<verse eid="JER 50:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 50:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:17">Isa 14:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Abaisraeli nibahatwa hamwe n'Abayuda; abaabatwaire omu bukwatwa babagumize, bangire kubarekura. <verse eid="JER 50:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 50:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:36">Yer 51:36</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:14">Isa 43:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 51:22">51:22</ref>. </char></note> Omucunguzi waabo n'ow'amaani; MUKAMA ow'amahe niryo iziina rye. Buzimazima aryabatonganira, abone kuha ensi obuhuumure, kwonka abatuuzi ba Babulooni abahe omurabanamu.<verse eid="JER 50:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 50:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:57">Yer 51:57</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 4:6">Dan 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 5:30">5:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:35">Rurara yaaza kwita Abakaludaaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:35">Abatuuzi ba Babulooni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:35">Abanyiginya n'abanyabwengye baayo.<verse eid="JER 50:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 50:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:57">Yer 51:57</ref>. </char>
    </note> Rurara yaaza kwita abafumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:36">Bahindukye ebifeera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:36">Yaaza kwita amamanzi gaayo, gacwekyerezibwe.<verse eid="JER 50:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 50:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 25:20">Yer 25:20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:30">51:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Rurara yaaza kwita embaraasi zaayo n'ebigaari byayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:37">N'abaserukare b'endugamahanga boona abagitwiremu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:37">Babe abakazi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:37">Rurara yaaza kugwa aha butungi bwayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:37">Abantu baayo banyagwe.<verse eid="JER 50:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 50:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:36">Yer 51:36</ref>, <ref loc="JER 51:47">47</ref>, <ref loc="JER 51:52">52</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omushana gwaza kwomya amaizi gaayo, goome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:38">Ahabw'okuba n'ensi y'ebishushani ebibaizirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:38">Kandi ebishushani ebirikuramibwa bibatwaire omutima.<verse eid="JER 50:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 50:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:21">Isa 13:21</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 13:22">22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo enyamaishwa mbi na zaamuha zirituurira Babulooni, na zaamaya zikatuurayo; terigira bantu ebiro byona, n'obu kwakuba okutuurwamu obusingye bwona. <verse eid="JER 50:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 50:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:25">Kut 19:25</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku Ruhanga yaacwekyereize Sodoma na Gomora n'endembo ezihereraine nazo, nikwo nayo etarituurwamu muntu, n'obu kwakuba okushuhuukirwamu omwana w'omuntu; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 50:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 50:41" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:41-43: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:22-24">Yer 6:22-24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, eihanga niriija, niriruga omu bukiizi-bwa-bumosho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:41">Eihanga ry'amaani n'abagabe baingi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:41">Nibaimuka nibaruga omu bicweka by'ensi ebirikuhereerukayo.<verse eid="JER 50:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 50:42" />Bakwaitse amata n'amacumu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">N'enshaarizi, tibaine saasi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">Orwari rwabo ni nk'enyanja erikuhoorera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">Nibagyendera aha mbaraasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">Bajwaire nk'omuntu orikuza aha rugamba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">Kukurwanisa, iwe Babulooni!<verse eid="JER 50:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 50:43" />Omugabe wa Babulooni ahuriire enkuru yaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:43">Emikono ye yaatentebuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:43">Yaakwatwa obusaasi bwingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:43">Nk'obw'omukazi orikurumwa kuzaara.<verse eid="JER 50:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 50:44" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:44-46: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 49:19-21">Yer 49:19-21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:11">51:11</ref>, <ref loc="JER 51:12">12</ref>, <ref loc="JER 51:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 14:24">Isa 14:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, nk'oku entare ejumbuka omu kishaka kya Yorudani kuteera eka y'entaama egumire, naanye nikwo ndibareetera kumuhunga ahonaaho, nkamureetera ou ndikwenda weena kumutegyeka. Mbwenu n'oha orikushushana naanye? N'oha owaakubaasa kunteeraho obunaku bw'okwiziramu? Ni muriisa ki owakunza omu kaso? <verse eid="JER 50:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 50:45" />N'ahabw'ekyo nimuhurire enaama ei MUKAMA acumire kurwanisa Babulooni, n'ebi amaririire kukora kurwansia ensi y'Abakaludaaya. Buzimazima abaana b'entaama zaabo baryakururwa batwarwe, n'eka yaabo eshoberwe munonga ahabw'ebiribabaho. <verse eid="JER 50:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 50:46" />Ensi eryatetemesibwa obwaku bw'okukwatwa kwa Babulooni, eiraka ry'okuborooga kwayo rihuririrwe omu mahanga.<verse eid="JER 50:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="JER 51" />
  <para style="s1">Omuheru gwa Babulooni</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 51:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 21:1">Isa 21:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:1">Reeba naaza kwimukiza Babulooni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:1">N'abatwire Bukaludaaya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:1">Omuyaga ogurikuhwerekyereza;<verse eid="JER 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 51:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 15:7">Yer 15:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:12">Mat 3:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyoherereze Babulooni abaheheezi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:2">Bagiheheeze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:2">Ebyanga byayo babitsigyemu busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:2">Ku bariija kugirwanisa aha izooba ry'enaku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:2">Bagiturukire embaju zoona.<verse eid="JER 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 51:3" />Omurasi arekye kunanuura obuta bwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:3">Arekye kwimuka kuhurura, ajwaire ekijwaro kye ky'ekyoma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:3">Mutarisaasira abatsigazi baayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:3">Mucwekyerereze kimwe eihe ryayo ryona;<verse eid="JER 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 51:4" />emitumbi yaayo eryarambirirana omu nsi y'Abakaludaaya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:4">N'emputa zirambirirane omu nguuto zaayo.<verse eid="JER 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 51:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 54:5-7">Isa 54:5-7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba Abaisraeli n'Abayuda tibatsigirweho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:5">Ruhanga waabo, MUKAMA ow'amahe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:5">Ensi yaabo yoona n'obu eraabe eine orubanja</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:5">Ahari Orikwera wa Israeli.<verse eid="JER 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 51:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 19:15">Kut 19:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimuhungye murugye omuri Babulooni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:6">Buri muntu akize amagara ge!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:6">Mutacwekyererezibwa omu kufubirwa kwayo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:6">Ahabw'okuba obu n'obunaku bwa MUKAMA bw'okuhoora enzigu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:6">Naagizimuurira ebi yaakozire.<verse eid="JER 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 51:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 25:15">Yer 25:15</ref>, <ref loc="JER 25:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 75:8">Zab 75:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14:8">Kush 14:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 17:4">17:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Babulooni ekaba eri ekikopo ky'ezaabu omu ngaro za MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:7">Neesinza ensi yoona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:7">Amahanga gakanywa aha maarwa gaayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:7">Nikyo gashariire.<verse eid="JER 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 51:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 21:9">Isa 21:9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:5">Kush 18:5</ref>, <ref loc="REV 18:9">9</ref>, <ref loc="REV 18:11">11</ref>, <ref loc="REV 18:19">19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu Babulooni egwire kitaraariire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:8">Yaahendeka. Nimugicurire!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:8">Musherure omubazi gw'okugitambira obusaasi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:8">Obundi ekaakira.<verse eid="JER 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 51:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:14">Isa 13:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tukaabaire twatambiire Babulooni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:9">Kwonka teratambiirwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:9">Nimugitsigyeho, tugyende,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:9">Buri muntu agarukye owaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:9">Ahabw'okuba orubanja rwayo ruhikire omu iguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:9">Rwahika ahaiguru omu mwanya.<verse eid="JER 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 51:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 23:6">Yer 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 37:6">Zab 37:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA ayorekire ku tutaine rubanja;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:10">Mwije tumanyise omuri Saayuuni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:10">Omurimo gwa MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu.<verse eid="JER 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 51:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 46:4">Yer 46:4</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:6">2 Bag 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:17">Isa 13:17</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 5:31">Dan 5:31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimutyaze emyambi, mukwate engabo!</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JER 51:11">MUKAMA aimukize emitima y'abagabe b'Abameedi, ahabw'enaama ye ei aine ahari Babulooni n'okugicwekyereza; kandi egyo niyo nzigu ya MUKAMA ei arikuhoorera hekalu ye.<verse eid="JER 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 51:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NAM 2:1">Nah 2:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mwimutsye orurango aha ngo za Babulooni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:12">muteho abarinzi b'amaani</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:12">Ab'okurinda n'ab'okugwera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:12">Ahabw'okuba enaama y'ebi MUKAMA yaagambire aha batuuzi ba Babulooni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:12">Mbwenu agihikize.<verse eid="JER 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 51:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 17:1">Kush 17:1</ref>, <ref loc="REV 17:15">15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe abatwire aha maizi maingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:13">Abaine eitungo ringi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:13">Omuheru gwanyu gwahika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:13">Akagoye k'amagara gaanyu kaacweka.<verse eid="JER 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 51:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 22:5">Yer 22:5</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 1:4">Yoel 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:25">2:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA ow'amahe naayerahira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:14">Buzimazima ndyakwijuzamu abantu baingi nk'enzigye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:14">Bakuteerereho akaari k'obusinguzi.<verse eid="JER 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 51:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:15-19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 10:12-16">Yer 10:12-16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niwe yaahangire ensi n'obushoboroozi bwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:15">Akagihamya n'obwengye bwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:15">N'okwetegyereza kwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:15">Nikwo yaabambiise eiguru.<verse eid="JER 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 51:16" />Ku agamba n'eiraka rye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:16">Omu iguru habamu okuhoorera kw'amaizi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:16">Ainamura oruho okuruga aha muheru gw'ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:16">Ataho emirabyo kugwisa enjura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:16">Kandi aiha omuyaga omu mabiikiro ge.<verse eid="JER 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 51:17" />Buri muntu ni nk'enyamaishwa, taine bwengye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:17">Buri muheesi w'ezaabu ahemwirwe ebishushani bye ebirikuramibwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:17">Ahabw'okuba ebishushani bye n'eby'ebishuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:17">Tibiine mwitsyo.<verse eid="JER 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 51:18" />Tibiine mugasho, n'omurimo gw'okubeihabeiha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:18">Omu biro by'okufubirwa kwabyo biryahwerekyerera.<verse eid="JER 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 51:19" />Ogwo ori omugabo gwa Yakobo ti nkabyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:19">Ahabw'okuba niwe yaahangire ebintu byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:19">Kandi Israeli n'oruganda rw'obuhunguzi bwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:19">MUKAMA ow'amahe niryo iziina rye.<verse eid="JER 51:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 51:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:7">Dan 7:7</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 7:19">19</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 7:23">23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ori enyondo yangye kandi eky'okurwanisa kyangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:20">Niiwe nsheenyaguza amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:20">Kandi niiwe ncwekyerezesa ensi z'abagabe;<verse eid="JER 51:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 51:21" />Niiwe ncwagacwaguza embaraasi n'ogitembire;<verse eid="JER 51:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 51:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 36:17">2 Bus 36:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:16">Isa 13:16</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 13:18">18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niiwe nsheenyaguza ekigaari ky'orugamba n'omuvugi waakyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:22">Niiwe ncwagacwaguza abashaija n'abakazi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:22">Niiwe ncwagacwaguza abagurusi n'abatsigazi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:22">Niiwe ncwagacwaguza abatsigazi n'empangare;<verse eid="JER 51:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 51:23" />Niiwe ncwagacwaguza omuriisa n'obusyo bwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:23">niiwe ncwagacwaguza omuhingi n'ente ze ezi arikuhingisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:23">Kandi niiwe ncwagacwaguza abategyeki n'abakuru b'engabo.<verse eid="JER 51:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 51:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 137:8">Zab 137:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyazimuurira Babulooni n'abatwire Bukaludaaya boona, mbahoorere omu maisho gaanyu, nimbatura obubi bwona obu bakoreire omuri Saayuuni; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 51:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 51:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 18:8">Kush 18:8</ref>, <ref loc="REV 18:9">9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe rushozi rurikuhwerekyereza 'we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:25">Reeba, naaba omuzigu waawe;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JER 51:25">nikwo MUKAMA orikucwekyereza ensi yoona arikugira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:25">Ndyagorora omukono gwangye, nkukwate,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:25">Nkwihe aha mutwe gw'ebibaare, nkukumbagaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:25">Nkuhindure orushozi rwokiibwe.<verse eid="JER 51:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 51:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 25:12">Yer 25:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Toriihwamu ibaare na rimwe ry'okwombekyesa enshonda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:26">N'obu gaakuba amabaare g'emisingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:26">Kureka oryaguma ori amatongo ebiro byona;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JER 51:26">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 51:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 51:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 8:4">Kut 8:4</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 10:3">10:3</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 19:37">2 Bag 19:37</ref>; <ref loc="JER 4:5">Yer 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:14">25:14</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 3:17">Nah 3:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mwimutsye orurango omu nsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:27">muteere enzamba omu mahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:27">Muhateekateekyere amahanga g'okuhateera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:27">Muhuruze ensi z'abagabe kuharwanisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:27">Araraati, Mini na Ashikenazi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:27">muhateekateekyere omwebembezi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:27">Muhateeze embaraasi eziri nk'ebitootera by'enzigye.<verse eid="JER 51:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 51:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 34:1">Yer 34:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muhateekateekyere amahanga g'okuhateera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:28">Abagabe b'Abameedi hamwe n'abategyeki baabo n'abatsigire baabo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:28">Na buri ihanga eriri omu butegyeki bwabo.<verse eid="JER 51:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 51:29" />Mbwenu ensi neetetema, neeshamba ahabw'obusaasi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:29">Ahabw'okuba enaama, ei MUKAMA acumiire Babulooni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:29">Ey'okuhindura ensi yaayo amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:29">Ekabura ow'okugituuramu, ehamire.<verse eid="JER 51:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 51:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 19:16">Isa 19:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 47:14">47:14</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 3:13">Nah 3:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abarwani ba Babulooni barekyeire aho okurwana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:30">Baaguma omu bigo byabo ebigumire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:30">Eishaija ribahweire, baaba nk'abakazi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:30">Amaka gaabo nigasya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:30">Emikingo yaabo ehendagwirwe.<verse eid="JER 51:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 51:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 30:6">2 Bus 30:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Entumwa y'amaguru neiruka kubugana endiijo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:31">N'omubiki nairuka kubugana mugyenzi we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:31">kubikira omugabe wa Babulooni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:31">Ku orurembo rwe rukwatsirwe embaju zoona.<verse eid="JER 51:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 51:32" />Enyambukiro zikwatsirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:32">Orufunjo barwokize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:32">N'abarwani baine obwoba bwingi, barimbagiriirwe.<verse eid="JER 51:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 51:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 17:5">Isa 17:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 21:10">21:10</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:13">Yoel 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14:15">Kush 14:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, Arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:33">Babulooni ni nk'eihuuriro omu bunaku bw'okuhuura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:33">Hatsigaire omwanya mukye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:33">Obunaku bw'okushaaruurwa kwayo bukahika.<verse eid="JER 51:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 51:34" />Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni akanshonshomera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:34">Yampendagura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:34">Akangira nk'orunywero orurimu busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:34">Yammira nk'omugoye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:34">Enda ye yaagiijuza ebyangye ebinuzire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:34">Yammunyunguza.<verse eid="JER 51:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 51:35" />K'omutuuzi wa Saayuuni agire ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:35">Obubisha obu naagiriirwe na beene waitu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:35">Nibukagirirwe Babulooni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:35">Kandi owa Yerusaalemu agire ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:35">Eshagama yangye etukurire abatwire Bukaludaaya.<verse eid="JER 51:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 51:36" />Nikyo MUKAMA arikugirira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:36">Reeba, naaza kukutonganira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:36">Kandi nkuhoorere.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:36">Ndyayomya enyanja yaayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:36">n'enshuro zaayo nzikarangatanise.<verse eid="JER 51:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 51:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:22">Isa 13:22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 25:2">25:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Babulooni ehindukye emituumo y'amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:37">Eikoobaaniro rya zaamuha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:37">Eky'okutiinisa n'eky'okweshaanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:37">Ebure owaagituuramu.<verse eid="JER 51:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 51:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 3:4">Amo 3:4</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 2:11">Nah 2:11</ref>, <ref loc="NAM 2:12">12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryatsindira hamwe nk'entare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:38">Barurume nk'emigunju yaazo.<verse eid="JER 51:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 51:39" />Ku bariba bakiine ekiniga, ndyabateekyera obugyenyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:39">Mbasiinze, bashemererwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:39">Bagwejegyere obutasisiimuka;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JER 51:39">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira;<verse eid="JER 51:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 51:40" />Ndyabashuumya omu ibaagiro nk'abaana b'entaama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:40">Nk'empaya z'entaama n'ez'embuzi.<verse eid="JER 51:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 51:41" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:41: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 25:26">Yer 25:26</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:19">Isa 13:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eshi Babulooni enyagirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:41">Yaakwatwa, haza yaabaire eri rurangaanwa omu nsi yoona!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:41">Eshi ebaire ekirikutiinisa omu mahanga!<verse eid="JER 51:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 51:42" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:42: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:7">Isa 8:7</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 8:8">8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enyanja yaagihikaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:42">Yaashwekwa ebingonzi byayo ebirikwimukirira;<verse eid="JER 51:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 51:43" />Endembo zaayo zihindukire ekirikutiinisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:43">Yaaba ensi y'omushana mwingi n'eihamba ry'omusheenyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:43">Ensi etatuurwamu muntu weena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:43">N'obu kwakuba okurabwamu omwana w'omuntu.<verse eid="JER 51:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 51:44" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:44: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:12">Yer 31:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 1:7">Ezr 1:7</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 1:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 46:1">Isa 46:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ndyafubirira Beeli omuri Babulooni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:44">Ngitanatsye eki yaamizire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:44">N'amahanga tigarigaruka kuhimintika nigagiijaho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:44">Orugo rwa Babulooni rugwire.<verse eid="JER 51:44" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 51:45" />Imwe bantu bangye 'mwe, nimugirugyemu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:45">Buri muntu ahungye ekiniga kya MUKAMA ekingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:45">Akize amagara ge.<verse eid="JER 51:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 51:46" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:46: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 37:7">Isa 37:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:6">Mat 24:6</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:7">7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Emitima yaanyu erekye kufoobeera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:46">N'obu kwakuba okutiina enkuru ezirikuhurirwa omu nsi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:46">Ahabw'okuba omu mwaka gumwe haija enkuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:46">N'omu gundi hakurataho ezindi nkuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:46">Obubisha buba omu nsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:46">n'omutegyeki arwana n'ondiijo.<verse eid="JER 51:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JER 51:47" />N'ahabw'ekyo obunaku nibwija kuhika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:47">Obu ndifubira ebishushani bya Babulooni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:47">Ensi yaayo yoona ekakwatwa enshoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:47">Emitumbi y'abantu baayo ekagirambiriranamu.<verse eid="JER 51:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JER 51:48" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:48: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 18:20">Kush 18:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo eiguru n'ensi n'ebirimu byona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:48">Biryayeshongora nibyesiimirana Babulooni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:48">Ahabw'okuba abahwerekyerezi baryagiteera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:48">Nibareetwa aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:48">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 51:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JER 51:49" />Babulooni eshemereire kwitwa, ekaturwa Abaisraeli abaitsirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:49">Nk'oku ab'omu nsi yoona abaitsirwe baitsirwe ahabwayo.<verse eid="JER 51:49" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JER 51:50" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:50: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 44:28">Yer 44:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe abahonokire ahari rurara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:50">Nimugyende, murekye kuguma mwemereire!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:50">Mwijukye MUKAMA mukiri hare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:50">Kandi muteekateekye ahari Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="JER 51:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JER 51:51" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:51: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 44:15">Zab 44:15</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 44:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 1:10">Tonz 1:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tukwatsirwe enshoni ahabw'okuhurira ebijumo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:51">Enshoni zitubumbire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:51">Ahabw'okuba abanyamahanga batabaire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:51">Emyanya erikwera ey'enju ya MUKAMA.<verse eid="JER 51:51" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JER 51:52" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:52: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 26:15">Ezk 26:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:52">Mbwenu reeba, obunaku nibwija,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:52">Obu ndifubira ebishushani byayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:52">emputa zikatsindira omu nsi yaayo yoona.<verse eid="JER 51:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JER 51:53" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:53: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 49:16">Yer 49:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 14:13">Isa 14:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu Babulooni yaakutunguuka, ekahika omu iguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:53">Kandi n'obu yaakwombeka engo zaayo ndaingwa ez'amaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:53">Hoona ndyayohereza abahwerekyerezi bagiteere;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JER 51:53">nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="JER 51:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JER 51:54" />Nimuhurire! Okutaka nikuruga Babulooni!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:54">Eiraka ry'okucwekyerera kuhango</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:54">Niriruga omu nsi y'Abakaludaaya!<verse eid="JER 51:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JER 51:55" />Ahakuba MUKAMA naahindura Babulooni amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:55">Naahunamya eiraka ryayo ery'amaani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:55">Ebingonzi byabo nibihoorera nk'amaizi maingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:55">Orwari rwabo ruri ahaiguru;<verse eid="JER 51:55" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JER 51:56" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:56: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:18">Isa 59:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba omuhwerekyerezi ahikire Babulooni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:56">Amamanzi gaayo gaakwatwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:56">Amata gaayo gaahendagurwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:56">Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA ni Ruhanga ozimuura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:56">Buzimazima aryahoora.<verse eid="JER 51:56" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JER 51:57" />Ndyasinza abanyiginya baayo, abanyabwengye baayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:57">Abategyeki, abakuru b'engabo n'abarwani baayo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:57">Baryagwejegyera obutasisiimuka;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JER 51:57">nikwo MUKAMA ou eiziina rye riba MUKAMA ow'amahe, arikugira.<verse eid="JER 51:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JER 51:58" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:58: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 2:12">Hab 2:12</ref>, <ref loc="HAB 2:13">13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:58">Orugo ruhango rwa Babulooni ruryasheenyerwa kimwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:58">N'amarembo gaayo maraingwa gookibwe.<verse eid="JER 51:58" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia okuhandiika ebi yaahanwire ahari Babulooni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JER 51:59" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:59: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 28:1">Yer 28:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:12">32:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eki n'ekigambo eki nabi Yeremia yaaragiire Seraaya mwene Neria, mwijukuru wa Maaseya, obu yaatwarwa Babulooni na Zedekia omugabe wa Yuda omu mwaka gwa kana ogw'omu butegyeki bwe. Seraaya ogwo akaba ari omukuru w'amabiikiro. <verse eid="JER 51:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="JER 51:60" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:60: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:2">Yer 36:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:1-46">50:1-46</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:1-58">51:1-58</ref>. </char></note> Yeremia yaahandiika omu kitabo akabi koona akarihika ahari Babulooni, ebyo bigambo byona ebyahandiikirwe nibigamba ahari Babulooni. <verse eid="JER 51:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JER 51:61" />Yeremia yaagira Seraaya ati: Ku oraahikye Babulooni, otabura kushoma ebyo bigambo byona, <verse eid="JER 51:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JER 51:62" />kandi ogire oti: Ai bambe MUKAMA, ogambire akabi aha mwanya ogu kuguhwerekyereza, ngu hatagira owaagutuuramu, yaaba bantu nari amatungo, kureka gube amatongo ebiro byona. <verse eid="JER 51:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JER 51:63" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:63: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 19:10">Yer 19:10</ref>, <ref loc="JER 19:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:21">Kush 18:21</ref>. </char></note> Ku oriheza kushoma ekitabo eki, okikomeho eibaare, okinagye omu mugyera Furaati, <verse eid="JER 51:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JER 51:64" />kandi ogire oti: Oku nikwo Babulooni erimirwa, etagarukye kutuuhuuka bundi ahabw'akabi aku ndigireetaho.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 51:64">Ogu nigwo muheru gw'ebigambo bya Yeremia.<verse eid="JER 51:64" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="JER 52" />
  <para style="s1">Okusingurwa kwa Yerusaalemu n'okukwatwa kwa Zedekia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 52:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:1-27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 24:18-20">2 Bag 24:18-20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Zedekia akatandika kutegyeka aine emyaka makumi abiri na gumwe; yaategyekyera Yerusaalemu emyaka ikumi na gumwe. Nyina akaba naayetwa Hamutaali muhara wa Yeremia owa Libuna. <verse eid="JER 52:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 52:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:13-17">Yer 22:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:37">2 Bag 23:37</ref>. </char></note> Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, nk'ebi Yehoyakimu yaakozire byona. <verse eid="JER 52:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 52:3" />Buzimazima ebyo byagwisa kubi MUKAMA; kandi hoona ebyo eby'omuri Yerusaalemu na Yuda byayeyongyera kuba kubi, okuhitsya obu MUKAMA yaababingire omu maisho ge.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 52:3">Bwanyima Zedekia yaagomera omugabe wa Babulooni. <verse eid="JER 52:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 52:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:4-16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 39:1-10">Yer 39:1-10</ref>. </char></note> Omu mwaka gwa mwenda ogw'omu butegyeki bwe, omu kwezi kwa ikumi aha kiro kyakwo kya ikumi, Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni yaija n'eihe rye ryona kuteera Yerusaalemu, bwanyima baagigota, baagyombekaho eby'okugitemberaho embaju zoona. <verse eid="JER 52:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 52:5" />Rutyo orurembo rwagotwa okuhitsya omu mwaka gwa ikumi na gumwe ogw'omu butegyeki bw'omugabe Zedia. <verse eid="JER 52:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 52:6" />Aha kiro kya mwenda eky'omu kwezi kwa kana, enjara yaaba nyingi omu rurembo, yaahebesereza, abantu b'omuri egyo nsi baabura eby'okurya. <verse eid="JER 52:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 52:7" />Bwanyima orugo rw'orurembo rwasheenywaho ah'okuraba, abarwani boona baacwa, baashohora nyekiro, baahunga, baaraba omu irembo ry'ahagati y'engo zombi, eriri aha musiri gw'omugabe, baatoora ogurikuza Araba; obwo Abakaludaaya bagotsire orurembo. <verse eid="JER 52:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 52:8" />Kwonka eihe ry'Abakaludaaya ryaza omugabe Zedekia omu kirari, ryamukwatira omu ruhita rwa Yeriko, engabo ze zoona zaamuhungaho, zaataataana. <verse eid="JER 52:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 52:9" />Batyo baakwata omugabe Zedekia, baamutwara aha mugabe wa Babulooni Ribula omu nsi ya Hamasi, yaamucwera orubanja. <verse eid="JER 52:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 52:10" />Omugabe wa Babulooni yaamwitira abatabani omu maisho, n'abanyiginya ba Yuda boona yaabaitira Ribula. <verse eid="JER 52:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 52:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:13">Ezk 12:13</ref>. </char></note> Yaihamu Zedekia amaisho, yaamubohesa emihama, yaamutwara Babulooni, yaamuta omu kihome, okuhitsya aha izooba eri yaafeereireho.<verse eid="JER 52:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nebukadeneeza okunyaga ebintu by'omu nju ya MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 52:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 1:3">Yer 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 37:36">Kut 37:36</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:8">2 Bag 25:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omu kwezi kwa kataano aha kiro kyakwo kya ikumi na mwenda, nigwo mwaka gwa Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni ogwa ikumi na mwenda, Nebuzaradaani omukuru w'abarinzi, owaabaire ari omuheereza w'omugabe wa Babulooni, yaataaha omuri Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="JER 52:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 52:13" />Yaayotsya enju ya MUKAMA, na nyaruju y'omugabe, n'amaju ga Yerusaalemu goona; eyetwa enju mpango yoona yaagyotsya. <verse eid="JER 52:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 52:14" />Eihe ryona ery'Abakaludaaya, eri ogwo mukuru w'abarinzi yaabaire aine, ryasheenya engo zoona ezaabaire zeehinguriririize Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="JER 52:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 52:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 37:13">Yer 37:13</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Nebuzaradaani ogwo, omukuru w'abarinzi, yaatwara bamwe aha barikukira abandi boona kuba abooro bari enkwatwa, n'ababaaire batsigaire omu rurembo, n'abaabaire beehongyeire omugabe wa Babulooni, hamwe n'abanyamyoga abaabaire batsigaire. <verse eid="JER 52:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 52:16" />Kwonka Nebuzaradaani ogwo omukuru w'abarinzi yaatsigamu abandi abarikukiza abandi obworo kuba ab'okurinda emizaabibu n'ab'okuhinga.<verse eid="JER 52:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 52:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 27:19">Yer 27:19</ref>, <ref loc="JER 27:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:29">Kur 25:29</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 37:16">37:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 4:1-15">2 Bus 4:1-15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Abakaludaaya baasheenyagura enyomyo z'emiringa ezaabaire ziri omu nju ya MUKAMA, n'ebitebe by'ebinaabiro, n'ekitanka ky'emiringa, ebyabaire biri omu nju ya MUKAMA, baatwara emiringa yaabyo yoona Babulooni. <verse eid="JER 52:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 52:18" />Baatwara enyungu n'ebyoma eby'okuyooza eiju, na makansi, n'enyabya, n'enyabya z'obubaane, n'ebindi bintu by'emiringa byona ebyabaire bikoresibwa omu murimo gwa hekalu; <verse eid="JER 52:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 52:19" />kandi n'enyabya nkye, n'eby'okuguhisa omuriro, n'enyabya mpango, n'enyungu, n'ebikondo by'etabaaza, n'eby'okutamu obubaane, n'enyabya z'empongano ez'ebirikushukwa. Ebintu ebyabaire bikozirwe omu zaabu, omukuru w'abarinzi yaabitwara biri ezaabu, n'eby'efeeza yaabitwara biri efeeza. <verse eid="JER 52:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 52:20" />Enyomyo ziri zombi, n'ekitanka, n'enimi z'emiringa ikumi na ibiri, ezi ekyo kitanka kyabaire kitairweho, n'ebitebe by'ebinaabiro, ebi omugabe Sulemaani yaakozire kukoresa omu nju ya MUKAMA, emiringa yaabyo yoona ekaba etarikubaasa kupimwa. <verse eid="JER 52:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 52:21" />Eby'ezo nyomyo, oburaingwa bw'emwe bukaba buri mikono ikumi na munaana, obuhango bwayo okugyehinguririza mikono ikumi n'ebiri, n'omuzimba gwayo enkumu ina, kandi omunda eri omurangara. <verse eid="JER 52:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 52:22" />Aha mutwe gwayo ekaba eine omutwe gw'omuringa; oburaingwa bwagwo omikono etaano; hashobeekaineho ebiri nk'akatimba n'amakomamahanga, byona biri emiringa, okugwehinguririza. Enyomyo ya kabiri nayo ekaba eine ebirikushusha bityo hamwe n'amakomamahanga. <verse eid="JER 52:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 52:23" />Omu mbaju zaayo hakaba harimu amakomamahanga makumi mwenda na mukaaga; n'amakomamahanga goona agaabaire gari ahari ako katimba gakaba gari igana.<verse eid="JER 52:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 52:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 29:25">Yer 29:25</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 6:14">1 Bus 6:14</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 6:15">15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Nebuzaradaani omukuru w'abarinzi yaatwara Seraaya omunyamurwa omukuru na Zefania omunyamurwa wa kabiri n'abakumiirizi b'aha irembo; <verse eid="JER 52:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 52:25" />kandi omu rurembo yaihamu omukuru w'engabo owaabaire naategyeka abaserukare, n'abashaija mushanju b'omu ishengyero ry'omugabe, abashangirwe omu rurembo, n'omuhandiiki w'omukuru w'eihe owaabaire ahandiika abantu b'omuri egyo nsi, kandi n'abashaija makumi mukaaga b'omuri egyo nsi abashangirwe omu rurembo. <verse eid="JER 52:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 52:26" />Yaabatwara, yaabahitsya omugabe wa Babulooni omuri Ribula. <verse eid="JER 52:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 52:27" />Omugabe wa Babulooni yaabateera, yaabaitira Ribula omu nsi ya Hamasi. Batyo Abayuda baihwa omu nsi yaabo, baatwarwa bari enkwata. <verse eid="JER 52:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 52:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:12">2 Bag 24:12</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 24:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Ogu nigwo mubaro gw'abantu abu Nebukadeneeza yaatwaire bari enkwatwa; omu mwaka gwa mushanju akatwara Abayudaaya enkumi ishatu na makumi abiri na bashatu; <verse eid="JER 52:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 52:29" />omu mwaka gwa ikumi na munaana yaiha omuri Yerusaalemu abantu magana munaana na makumi ashatu na babiri, yaabatwara bari enkwatwa; <verse eid="JER 52:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 52:30" />n'omu mwaka gwa makumi abiri n'eshatu ogw'omu busingye bwa Nebukadeneza, Nebuzaradaani omukuru w'abarinzi yaatwara Abayudaaya magana mushanju na makumi ana na bataano; abantu boona abaatwairwe bakahika enkumi ina na magana mukaaga.<verse eid="JER 52:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehoyakiini okwihwa omu kihome n'okugarurirwa ekitiinisa kye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 52:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:31-34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 22:24-30">Yer 22:24-30</ref>; <ref loc="JER 27:3">27:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:1">37:1</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:27-30">2 Bag 25:27-30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yehoyakiini omugabe wa Yuda ku yaabaire amazire emyaka makumi ashatu na mushanju ari omu bukwatwa, omu kwezi kwa ikumi n'abiri, aha kiro kyakwo ekya makumi abiri na bitaano, omu mwaka ogwo ogu Evili-merodaaki omugabe wa Babulooni yaatandikiiremu kutegyeka, yaiha Yehoyakiini omu kihome, yaamukuza; <verse eid="JER 52:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 52:32" />yaagamba gye nawe, yaamuha ekitebe ekirikukira eby'abandi bagabe abaabaire bari hamwe nawe Babulooni. <verse eid="JER 52:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 52:33" />Atyo Yehoyakiini yaajuura ebijwaro bye by'ekihome. Okuruga aho yaaguma naariira aha meeza y'omugabe ebiro byona ebi yaamazire. <verse eid="JER 52:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 52:34" />Kandi eby'okumutunga omugabe yaaguma naamuha omugabo ogutarikurugaho, nk'okwetenga kwe okwa buri izooba oku kwabaire kuri, ebiro byona ebi yaamazire okuhitsya obu yaafiire.<verse eid="JER 52:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 52" />
</usx>